INSERT INTO `itinerary_days` VALUES (1,1,'Arrival & Jaipur City Tour','Arrive in Jaipur and check into hotel. Visit Hawa Mahal, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar. Spend the evening shopping at Bapu Bazaar and Johari Bazaar.',1),(2,1,'Arrival & Jaipur City Tour','Arrive in Jaipur and check into hotel. Visit Hawa Mahal, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar. Spend the evening shopping at Bapu Bazaar and Johari Bazaar.',2),(3,1,'Arrival & Jaipur City Tour','Arrive in Jaipur and check into hotel. Visit Hawa Mahal, City Palace, and Jantar Mantar. Spend the evening shopping at Bapu Bazaar and Johari Bazaar.',3),(4,1,'Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok - Pickup','Approx Distance: 125 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 5 hrs\r\n\r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Gangtok\r\n\r\n ',4),(5,2,'Gangtok to Lachung - Drive with on the way Sightseeing','Approx Distance: 130 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 9 hrs\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check out from hotel with limited luggage and proceed to Lachung (8,738 Ft.) in North Sikkim. On the way enjoy some beautiful spots. On arrival at Lachung, check into your hotel. Dinner and Overnight stay at Lachung.\r\n\r\nNote: Travelers planning to visit such remote regions should be prepared for a more rustic and basic experience, with a focus on simplicity and cleanliness rather than luxury amenities. Even best hotels are equivalent to basic 3* here. It\'s essential for guests to manage their expectations and plan accordingly, taking into account the specific conditions and limitations of this area. Also note that Innova/Crysta vehicles are not suitable for North Sikkim due Low ground clearance. We recommend opting for SUVs like Scorpio / Xylo/ Similar for a safe and comfortable journey.\r\n\r\n ',4),(6,3,' Lachung - Yumthang Valley Excursion','Approx Distance: 60 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 2 hrs 50 mins\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast proceed to Yumthang Valley, which is known as Valley of Flowers (12,000 ft.). Yumthang is the summer grazing ground of the yaks and winter playgrounds of yetis. Back to the hotel in the afternoon. After lunch free for individual activities, Dinner and Overnight stay at Lachung.\r\n\r\nNote: Due to winter season (heavy snow) vehicle will be able to drive till Snow point on the way to Yumthang Valley.\r\n\r\n ',4),(7,4,' Lachung to Gangtok - Transfer','Approx Distance: 130 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 6 hrs\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival, check-in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Gangtok.\r\n\r\n ',4),(8,5,'Gangtok to Nathula, Tsomgo Lake & New Baba Mandir - Excursion','Approx Distance: 120 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hrs\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to New Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake) then Nathula pass. Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok.\r\nNote: The Permission for Nathula Pass is completely subject to availability of permit & road condition. We can not give you any guarantee for Nathula pass but we will try.\r\n\r\nIn case of Land slide or any other reason Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provided alternate sightseeing. Due to winter season (heavy snow) vehicle will be able to drive till Snow point on the way to Tsomgo Lake and New Baba Mandir.\r\n\r\n ',4),(9,6,'Gangtok to Pelling - Transfer Via Namchi and Ravangla','Approx Distance: 200 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hrs\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Pelling (6,300 Ft.) via Ravangla (8,000 Ft.), and Namchi. First visit Buddha Park at Ravangla. Further drive to Namchi (5,500 Ft.) to visit Siddheshwar Dham (Chardham) and Sai Temple. On arrival check-in to your hotel. Overnight stay at Pelling.',4),(10,7,' Pelling - Fullday Sightseeing with sky walk','Est. Travel Time: 6 hrs\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast start for a full day sightseeing tour. In first half, Rimbi waterfalls, Khecheopalri Lake (Wishfulling Lake) and Khangchendzongha waterfalls. In the second half cover the Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk). Evening free for leisure. Overnight stay at Pelling.\r\n\r\n ',4),(11,8,' Pelling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop','Approx Distance: 160 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 6 hrs\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check out from the hotel and take departure transfer to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey',4),(12,1,'Hanoi Arrival - PVT Transfer','Arrival to Hanoi, pick up and transfer to Hanoi downtown, check in hotel (Early Check-in is NOT included - check-in time from 2:00pm onward). Short relax after flight',5),(13,1,'1st Day (Wed 10th June) : Siliguri to Darjeeling - Bagdogra Airport â€“ Darjeeling Hotel','Approx Distance: 75 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hrs\r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.',6),(14,2,'2nd Day (Thu 11th June) : Darjeeling - Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill','Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit / Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling',6),(15,3,'3rd Day (Fri 12th June) : Darjeeling - Day Excusion to Lamahatta & Tinchuley','After breakfast proceed for a day excursion to Tinchuley, visit Gumbadara view point. Later visit Peshok Tea Garden, Lamahatta Eco Park. Later return to the hotel. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.',6),(16,4,'4th Day (Sat 13th June) : Darjeeling - Bagdogra Airport Drop via Mirik','After breakfast check out of the hotel & transfer to IXB Airport / NJP Station. Enroute visit Mirik (4,902 Ft.), which is a small picturesque hill station with a beautiful lake surrounded by forested hills on all sides with the back drop of Mt Kanchenjunga. Enroute visit Pasupati Market which is situated in Indo-Nepal border (Extra vehicle charges will be applicable for Nepal Border to Pasupati Market on direct payment basis). Further, drive to Mirik runs through some fascinating tea gardens (Estates), Cardamom plantations and pine forests. ',6),(17,1,'Arrival & North Goa Beaches','Begin your Goa trip with a relaxing arrival experience and explore the vibrant beaches of North Goa. Spend the day enjoying the scenic beauty of Calangute and Baga Beach, trying local Goan cuisine, and soaking in the lively beach atmosphere. In the evening, enjoy a peaceful sunset by the shore followed by dinner at a beachside cafÃ© and a glimpse of Goaâ€™s famous nightlife.',7),(18,2,'Leisure, Shopping, and Departure','On the final day, enjoy a calm and refreshing morning before preparing for departure. Visit nearby local markets for souvenir shopping and experience the laid-back charm of Goa one last time. Spend some quiet moments at the beach or enjoy a traditional Goan meal before heading to the airport or railway station with memorable memories of the trip.',7),(19,1,' Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok ','Pickup from Gangtok ',8),(20,2,' Gangtok to Lachung',' Drive with on the way Sightseeing\r\n',8),(22,1,'Hanoi Arrival - PVT Transfer','Arrival to Hanoi, pick up and transfer to Hanoi downtown, check in hotel (Early Check-in is NOT included - check-in time from 2:00pm onward). Short relax after flight',10),(33,1,'(Thu 11th June) : Hanoi Arrival - PVT Transfer','Arrival to Hanoi, pick up and transfer to Hanoi downtown, check in hotel . Short relax after flight. Today is your free day. Enjoy on your own.\r\n\r\n',9),(34,2,'(Fri 12th June) :  Halong Bay 4* Day Cruise without Kayak - SIC (Standard Transfer)','Today we leave Hanoi to Halong bay, \"Dragon Descending to the Sea. Ha long Bay has twice been recognized by UNESCO as a World Natural Heritage Area for its exceptional scenic beauty and one of the worldâ€™s greatest natural wonders. Upon arrival, we will embark to a Day Cruise.\r\n\r\nHaving Lunch on board while cruising and exploring Halong Bay in 5-6 hours journey, passing through thousands of limestone islets; Arrive at Bo Hon archipelago, tour guide escorts you to visit Surprising (Sung Sot) Cave to see a lot of stalagmites and stalactites with different shapes of rock formation, then go for optional kayaking or bamboo boat rowing in Luon Cave to discover a beautiful lagoon (optional choice/own expense). Visit Titov Island, relax on the sandy beach or climb up to Titov island peak for a panoramic view of the Bay. After enjoying Halong Bay, return to boat station and transfer back to Hanoi.',9),(35,3,'3rd Day (Sat 13th June) : Hanoi Departure - PVT Transfer , Danang Arrival - PVT Transfer','Arrival to Danang, pick up and transfer to Da Nang Hotel, check in hotel . Short relax after flight\r\n\r\n: Da Nang Half Day City Tour - PVT\r\nWe will start to visit Marble Mountain which is a group of five limestone peaks situated seven kilometers from downtown Da Nang. The mountain is dotted with hundreds of caves, shrines, statues, and pagodas and you will also get bird view of the city from the mountain. Continue to cross Dragon Bridge, the icon bridge of Da Nang city, you can walk along the bridge for a while.\r\n\r\nThe next place Linh Ung Son Tra Pagoda is the largest pagoda in Da Nang. This pagoda is also the harmony between the sea and the mountain in a quiet space, along with the murmur of the sea; simultaneously, the pagoda is also the special place linking Heaven and Earth.\r\n\r\nThe last place is visiting local market, free for shopping around about half an hour before going back to hotel. Overnight in Danang.\r\n\r\n: Marble Mountain Ticket - Ticket',9),(36,4,'(Sun 14th June) : BaNa Hill - No Lunch - SIC','Morning, departure to Ba Na Hills, pass the sea-shore on Nguyen Tat Thanh Street, one of the most beautiful roads of Da Nang City and Red Beach.\r\n\r\nUpon arrival, enjoy the first leg Cable car, which achieves two Guinness World Records in 2009, longest and highest non-stop cable car. First, step on Golden Bridge which stands 1,400m above sea level in the Ba Na hills. Visit Ling Ung Pagoda with 27m high Buddha status. Visit the top of mountain and see the remain of old villas, conquer the Peak of Chua Mountain at the height of 1,487m. Then visit the trail of Dreaming Stream, Rainbow Waterfall, Suspension Bridge, Golden Valley, and ruined Opera House.\r\n\r\nEnjoy 105 free games at Fantasy Park & Jurassic Park. (Note: Not including the fee for visiting Wax Museum, Wine Cellar Debay, cotton animal game, bonus games and carnival skills at Fantasy Park) Return to Cable car station at foot of Ba Na Mountain then transfer to Danang. Overnight in Danang.',9),(37,5,'(Mon 15th June) : Danang Departure - PVT Transfer, Phu Quoc Arrival Duong Dong - PVT Transfer','Arrival to Phu Quoc, our driver will pick up and transfer to the city center & check in hotel. Short relax after flight.\r\n\r\n: Grand World Half Day - PVT Tour\r\n: Venice Watertaxi Ticket',9),(38,6,'(Tue 16th June) : Vinpearl Safari + Vin Wonder - Pvt Transfer','After breakfast, transfer to visit Phu Quoc Safari, Vietnam\'s largest wildlife conservation park, one of the most Safari in Southeast Asia, the park has the area of 500 hectares and is home to around 150 species of rare wild animals (about 3,000 units for all of those species), some of which are white lion, black-and-white ruffed lemur, Bengal tiger, Arabian oryx, and white tiger. More than that, this is also where the largest number of endangered species, like rhinoceros, flamingos, and giraffe are being preserved.\r\n\r\nAfternoon, enjoy Vin Wonder Vietnamâ€™s biggest theme park, the multi-experience playground suitable for all ages. which means you will have plenty of time to indulge yourself in all of the incredible shows and attractions: Fantasy World; Adventure world; Ocean World; Show Onceâ€¦.Return to hotel and overnight in Phu Quoc.\r\n\r\n: Combo Vinwonders & Safari Ticket (1 Day)',9),(39,7,'(Wed 17th June) : Discovery 4 Island with Cable Car - SIC','8:00 am: You will be picked up at the hotel and start the journey.\r\n09:30 AM: Arrive at the port and board a speedboat to explore the various large and small islands of the An Thoi archipelago in the south.\r\n09:30-10:00 AM: Coconut islet/Roi islet- Visit the â€œOcean Worldâ€ Sea sports entertainment center.\r\nCoral Park: Have experience at sea walking activity (self-funded). 10:30-12:15 PM\r\nStop at 3 islets in An Thoi archipelago:\r\nSightseeing Gam Ghi islet/Buom islet: Enjoy snorkeling.\r\nSightseeing May Rut NgoÃ i islet: Enjoy snorkeling. 12:30-02:30 PM\r\nLunch in the Restaurant.\r\nSightseeing May Rut Trong islet/Mong Tay islet: chilling and sea bathing.\r\nThere are more water sports at the island for you to experience such as flyboard, jet skiing and parasailing (self-funded).\r\nSUP or Flycam Video\r\n2:30 PM â€“ 3:00 PM: Speedboat transfer to Hon Thom Island\r\n3:00 PM â€“ 4:30 PM: Enjoy Aquatopia Water Park at Hon Thom and experience the worldâ€™s longest three-wire sea-crossing cable car\r\n5:00 PM: Transfer back to the hotel. End of the tour experience\"\"\"',9),(40,8,'(Thu 18th June) :  Phu Quoc Departure Duong Dong - PVT Transfer, Ho Chi Minh Arrival - PVT Transfer','Pick up and transfer to the city center & check in hotel . Short relax after flight. Today is your free day. Enjoy on your own.',9),(41,9,'(Fri 19th June) : Cu Chi Tunnel + Mekong Delta - SIC','Today morning, we will drive overland to Cu Chi Tunnels, an incredible underground network constructed by Vietnamese guerrillas to protect the region against the American attacks during the Vietnam War. The tunnels were used by Viet Cong soldiers as hiding spots during combat, as well as serving as communication and supply routes, hospitals, food and weapon caches and living quarters for numerous North Vietnamese fighters. We can even crawl a part inside the tunnel, visit their infirmary, kitchen, .... to discover how people had survived hereby. Then we depart for My Tho, the town lies on the left side of the Mekong River.\r\n\r\nMekong delta is known as The Nine Dragon River delta since it is formed by nine rivers. The background of this area is the largest site of endless paddy fields, coconut farms, tropical gardens. Upon arrival Cruising through Mekong River, passing a fishing village, and some small islets as Turtle, Dragon, Phoenix Island, ... under a green canopy of water coconut trees. Walking through some villages to a fruit garden. Taste tropical fruits, while having live traditional music. Have honey tea. Short rowing boat ride, enjoy the nice boat ride through natural island and canals in Ben Tre under the shadow of the water coconut trees. Return and Overnight in Ho Chi Minh city. \"â€¢ Lunch with basic local food, follow as SIC tour\r\n\r\n',9),(42,10,'(Sat 20th June) : Ho Chi Minh Departure - PVT Transfer','Breakfast at Hotel. Driver will pick you up and transfer to the airport for your departure',9),(43,1,'Delhi Arrival','Arrival at the Delhi Airport and transfer to the booked hotel (on you own)',11),(44,2,'Delhi','Stay at Delhi',11),(45,3,'Delhi - Dharamshala','Transfer from Delhi Hotel to Delhi Airport (on your own) for the flight to Dharamshala. Arrival at Dharamshala Airport and transfer to the booked hotel and sightseeing',11),(46,4,'Dharamshala Sightseeing','Proceed for Dharamshala Sightseeing',11),(47,1,'Delhi Arrival','Arrival at the Delhi Airport and transfer to the booked hotel (on you own)',12),(48,5,'Dharamshala - McLeod Ganj','Check-out from Dharamshala Hotel and transfer to McLeod Ganj Hotel and sightseeing',11),(49,2,'Delhi','Stay at Delhi',12),(50,6,'Dharamshala - Leh','Check-out from the McLeod Ganj Hotel and transfer to Dharamshala Airport for your journey towards Leh. Arrive Leh and transfer to the hotel. Full day for complete rest for acclimatization to the high altitude of Leh. Overnight stay at the Leh hotel.',11),(51,3,'Delhi - Dharamshala','Transfer from Delhi Hotel to Delhi Airport (on your own) for the flight to Dharamshala. Arrival at Dharamshala Airport and transfer to the booked hotel and sightseeing',12),(52,7,'Leh Sightseeing','Breakfast at hotel. After breakfast, drive to shyam valley and you\'ll be awestruck with the sight of the Indus & Zanskar river Sangam, drive along the Indus river visiting Pathar Sahib Gurdwara and Magnetic Hill (where the cars defy gravity) and further on to Leh Hall of Fame (which has a museum of the Kargil War memorabilia). Later return to Leh for visit Shanti Stupa, Leh Palace and Leh Market. Overnight stay at the Leh hotel.\r\n\r\n ',11),(53,4,'Dharamshala Sightseeing','Proceed for Dharamshala Sightseeing',12),(54,8,'Leh - Nubra Valley','(160 Kms / 5 Hrs): After Breakfast drive to Nubra Valley via Khardungla (Highest Motorable road in the World, 18,380 ft). Arrive at Hundar by Afternoon. Rest of the day free to explore Deskit, Hunder Villages and camel Safari in Sand Dunes between Deskit and Hundar Village. One can go for camel rides (own cost). Overnight stay at Nubra Valley.',11),(55,5,'Dharamshala - McLeod Ganj','Check-out from Dharamshala Hotel and transfer to McLeod Ganj Hotel and sightseeing',12),(56,9,'Nubra','Drive 70 Kms one way 3/4 hrs via various villages to Turtuk. It is the last village from Indian side. Have a look forward on Bunkers and last Indian post. Later in afternoon return to Nubra valley. Overnight stay at Nubra Valley.',11),(57,10,'Nubra - Pangong','Have early breakfast and proceed to Pangong via Shayok, retrace the route down for Pangong Lake through Shayok 17,350 ft., it is the third highest motorable road in the world. Arrive Pangong and enjoy the beauty of the lake on the Banks of Pangong Lake while appreciating the changing Colors and fascinating high altitude of the Lake. Overnight stay at Pangong.',11),(58,6,'Dharamshala - Leh','Check-out from the McLeod Ganj Hotel and transfer to Dharamshala Airport for your journey towards Leh. Arrive Leh and transfer to the hotel. Full day for complete rest for acclimatization to the high altitude of Leh. Overnight stay at the Leh hotel.',12),(59,11,'Pangong','Breakfast at hotel. Visit pangong lake. Overnight stay at Pangong.',11),(60,7,'Leh Sightseeing','Breakfast at hotel. After breakfast, drive to shyam valley and you\'ll be awestruck with the sight of the Indus & Zanskar river Sangam, drive along the Indus river visiting Pathar Sahib Gurdwara and Magnetic Hill (where the cars defy gravity) and further on to Leh Hall of Fame (which has a museum of the Kargil War memorabilia). Later return to Leh for visit Shanti Stupa, Leh Palace and Leh Market. Overnight stay at the Leh hotel.\r\n\r\n ',12),(61,12,'Pangong - Leh','After breakfast drive back to Leh via Changla pass. Later in the evening guest can walk to Local Bazaar. Overnight stay at Leh.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n',11),(62,8,'Leh - Nubra Valley','(160 Kms / 5 Hrs): After Breakfast drive to Nubra Valley via Khardungla (Highest Motorable road in the World, 18,380 ft). Arrive at Hundar by Afternoon. Rest of the day free to explore Deskit, Hunder Villages and camel Safari in Sand Dunes between Deskit and Hundar Village. One can go for camel rides (own cost). Overnight stay at Nubra Valley.',12),(63,13,'LEH - KARGIL - SRINAGAR','Breakfast at hotel. Later check out and transfer to Srinagar en route visit  Kargil War Memorial, Drass valley and Sonmarg upon arrival check in Srinagar hotel. Overnight stay at Srinagar hotel.\r\n\r\n',11),(64,9,'Nubra','Drive 70 Kms one way 3/4 hrs via various villages to Turtuk. It is the last village from Indian side. Have a look forward on Bunkers and last Indian post. Later in afternoon return to Nubra valley. Overnight stay at Nubra Valley.',12),(65,14,'SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING',' Breakfast at hotel. After that proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.',11),(66,10,'Nubra - Pangong','Have early breakfast and proceed to Pangong via Shayok, retrace the route down for Pangong Lake through Shayok 17,350 ft., it is the third highest motorable road in the world. Arrive Pangong and enjoy the beauty of the lake on the Banks of Pangong Lake while appreciating the changing Colors and fascinating high altitude of the Lake. Overnight stay at Pangong.',12),(67,11,'Pangong','Breakfast at hotel. Visit pangong lake. Overnight stay at Pangong.',12),(68,15,'DOODHPATHRI DAY TRIP FROM SRINAGAR','After breakfast leave from hotel and  proceed to Doodhpathri - valley of milk, located in Budgam district, lies in bowl shaped valley in Pir Panjal Range. Its an alpine valley covered with snow clad mountains. Not a lot of tourists come to this place, since the road conditions are not favourable. After some quiet and peaceful time at Doodhpathri drive back for overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                          ',11),(69,12,'Pangong - Leh','After breakfast drive back to Leh via Changla pass. Later in the evening guest can walk to Local Bazaar. Overnight stay at Leh.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n',12),(70,16,' SRINAGAR - GULMARG ','After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.                                    ',11),(71,13,'LEH - KARGIL - SRINAGAR','Breakfast at hotel. Later check out and transfer to Srinagar en route visit  Kargil War Memorial, Drass valley and Sonmarg upon arrival check in Srinagar hotel. Overnight stay at Srinagar hotel.\r\n\r\n',12),(72,17,'GULMARG - PAHALGAM ',' After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. Day at leisure. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.                                     ',11),(73,14,'SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING',' Breakfast at hotel. After that proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.',12),(74,18,' PAHALGAM','After breakfast one can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.         ',11),(75,15,'DOODHPATHRI DAY TRIP FROM SRINAGAR','After breakfast leave from hotel and  proceed to Doodhpathri - valley of milk, located in Budgam district, lies in bowl shaped valley in Pir Panjal Range. Its an alpine valley covered with snow clad mountains. Not a lot of tourists come to this place, since the road conditions are not favourable. After some quiet and peaceful time at Doodhpathri drive back for overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                          ',12),(76,19,'CHECK-OUT AT PAHALGAM HOTEL','After breakfast check-out from Pahalgam hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.   ',11),(77,16,' SRINAGAR - GULMARG ','After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.                                    ',12),(78,17,'GULMARG - PAHALGAM ',' After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. Day at leisure. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.                                     ',12),(79,18,' PAHALGAM','After breakfast one can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.         ',12),(80,19,'CHECK-OUT AT PAHALGAM HOTEL','After breakfast check-out from Pahalgam hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.   ',12),(81,1,'Day 1 : Arrival in Srinagar & Local Sightseeing ','Upon arrival at Srinagar Airport, meet our representative and proceed to your hotel. After check-in and relaxation, visit the famous Mughal Gardens including Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden, and Chashme Shahi. Enjoy views of Dal Lake and explore the local markets before returning to the hotel for dinner and an overnight stay. ',13),(82,2,'Day 2 : Srinagar â€“ Sonmarg â€“ Srinagar ','After breakfast, drive to Sonmarg, the Meadow of Gold. Enjoy the scenic beauty of rivers, mountains, and lush landscapes. Spend quality time exploring the area and enjoying the fresh mountain air before returning to Srinagar in the evening for dinner and overnight stay. ',13),(83,3,'Day 3 : Srinagar â€“ Pahalgam â€“ Srinagar ','After breakfast, proceed to Pahalgam. En route, witness beautiful saffron fields and countryside views. Explore the natural beauty of Pahalgam and enjoy the peaceful surroundings. Return to Srinagar by evening for dinner and overnight stay. ',13),(84,4,'Day 4 : Departure ','After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport for your onward journey with wonderful memories of Kashmir. ',13),(104,1,'ARRIVE LEH','Arrive Leh and transfer to the hotel. Full day for complete rest for acclimatization to the high altitude of Leh. Overnight stay at the Leh hotel.',14),(105,2,'LEH Sightseeing','Breakfast at hotel. After breakfast, drive to shyam valley and you\'ll be awestruck with the sight of the Indus & Zanskar river Sangam, drive along the Indus river visiting Pathar Sahib Gurdwara and Magnetic Hill (where the cars defy gravity) and further on to Leh Hall of Fame (which has a museum of the Kargil War memorabilia). Later return to Leh for visit Shanti Stupa, Leh Palace and Leh Market. Overnight stay at the Leh hotel.',14),(106,3,'LEH-NUBRA','(160 Kms / 5 Hrs) : After Breakfast drive to Nubra Valley via Khardungla (Highest Motorable road in the World, 18,380 ft). Arrive at Hundar by Afternoon. Rest of the day free to explore Deskit, Hunder Villages and camel Safari i