o his response.',15991,'2023-05-31 16:51:07','2023-05-31 16:51:07'),(17675,676,'2023-05-31 20:00:00','Updated quotation sent with one more day in singapore and universal studios ','2023-06-01 18:00:00','will follow up ',15991,'2023-05-31 20:01:57','2023-05-31 20:01:57'),(17676,683,'2023-05-31 19:00:00','After sharing the quoation, had a telephonice discussion with the client. There are changes requested. ','2023-07-01 12:00:00','There are following amendments are needed in quotation. Please take this up with Tourish and get the updated quotation out. \r\n\r\n1) Flight Timmings to be changed. Its too early to leave and return flight needed little late. \r\n2) Flight fare to be mentioned seperately. Please check the system fare and smartly position the flight fare. \r\n3) 5th night not needed in houseboat but need but standard good hotel near dal lake. \r\n4) Shikara Ride needs to be added seperately.\r\n5) Chandanwari, Betab Valley and Aru Valley cost needs to be added in the quotation. \r\n6) Hotel Availability needs to be checked as if client confirms then we will have to issue the flights.  \r\n\r\nPlease get this ready asap. ',1,'2023-05-31 20:17:00','2023-05-31 20:17:00'),(17677,572,'2023-05-31 12:00:00','Discussed internally today. ','2023-05-31 21:00:00','System reminder set to the client. Waiting for revert. Namita to followup once else will close this query tomorrow. ',1,'2023-05-31 21:26:24','2023-05-31 21:26:24'),(17678,615,'2023-05-31 12:00:00','Discussed internally today. ','2023-06-01 18:00:00','Not sure about voucher sending status and visa query clarification. Need to close everything asap. ',1,'2023-05-31 21:27:42','2023-05-31 21:27:42'),(17679,638,'2023-05-31 12:00:00','Discussed today. ','2023-06-01 18:00:00','Sachin to ensure quotation is shared with the guest. This is pending for one month now. We will close this query if quotation is not sent to the client. ',1,'2023-05-31 21:28:53','2023-05-31 21:28:53'),(17680,646,'2023-05-31 19:00:00','Shortfall documents received from Riya. ','2023-05-31 13:00:00','Please confirm about the document completeness and also the payment to be transferred to Riya. Cant delay this after tomorrow. ',1,'2023-05-31 21:29:55','2023-05-31 21:29:55'),(17681,683,'2023-06-01 15:00:00','Had a discussion on call with Mr. Abhishek and acction to be taken on quotation asap. ','2023-06-01 15:30:00','Please take the following action asap and revert. \r\n1) If no standard hotel is available near Dal lake then consider giving hotel in close proximity of Dal not. If not 1 km then may be 2 or 3 kms. Earlier hotel is on highway but need this close to dal lake. Consider the nearest possible one.\r\n\r\n2) Get the hotel availability. \r\n\r\n3) Abhishek is back to back checking the dpaul cost on portal. Please check that also for inclusions. \r\n\r\n4) Need activities cost also for the aru valley and others as discussed. \r\n\r\nThese activites are included in dpauls quotation. \r\n\r\nHope everything is clear and do take action asap and share the quotation back with me in another 30 min. ',1,'2023-06-01 14:39:49','2023-06-01 14:39:49'),(17682,682,'2023-06-01 17:00:00','I have sent the following message to the guest along with the quotation :-\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Vijyeshz\r\n\r\nWhat i am sharing right now is the most economical package group tour for europe. Let me put some assumptions on this. \r\n\r\n1) Group is not confirmed yet as for September , supplier has provided the package with dates but dates are not 100% confirmed yet. It may change marginally for departure.\r\n2) Pricing mentioned is indicative. It may change at the time of confirmation. \r\n\r\nI will alternatively share more activities based another itinerary and once you confirm the itinerary and inclusions then will work on the exact pricing and quotation. \r\n\r\nOpen to discuss. \r\n\r\nThanks','2023-06-02 17:00:00','Going to ping client for further discusssion if i dont hear anything back from him today. ',1,'2023-06-01 16:53:05','2023-06-01 16:53:05'),(17685,683,'2023-06-01 20:00:00','Had a telephonic discussion with Sonia and got the updated quotation late. Abhishek pinged back. ','2023-06-01 21:00:00','Sent to the client. Waiting to discuss further. Will keep you all posted. ',1,'2023-06-01 20:59:34','2023-06-01 20:59:34'),(17686,682,'2023-06-01 20:00:00','Visa country was wrong as this should be routed through Italy now so italy applicable.','2023-06-01 21:00:00','Quotation corrected and shared with the guest. Will check tomorrow for an update. ',1,'2023-06-01 21:00:36','2023-06-01 21:00:36'),(17687,677,'2023-06-01 21:00:00','Sent the following message to the guest:-\r\n\r\n*************\r\nHello Mr. Suraj\r\n\r\nI didn\'t hear anything from you and assuming your plan is changed or alternate arrangements were made. No worries. Its good that we got connected. If you are still looking and interested in the plan, do let me know, we can work out or else please do not hesitate in contacting us in future. Will be looking forward.\r\n\r\nI am closing your query in our system.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nSushil Chugh\r\n*************','2023-06-01 21:00:00','Closing the deal in the system and will look back in future. ',1,'2023-06-01 21:12:21','2023-06-01 21:12:21'),(17693,680,'2023-06-02 19:00:00','Called him up. he said he will tell me after reading the document thoroughly','2023-06-03 17:00:00','Will call him up if he doesn\'t call me back',15991,'2023-06-02 18:36:16','2023-06-02 18:36:16'),(17694,681,'2023-06-02 18:30:00','Called his daughter but she didn\'t pick up the call. she msgd me that she will call me later','2023-06-03 17:00:00','Will drop her a msg in the morning if she doesn\'t call me back.',15991,'2023-06-02 18:45:29','2023-06-02 18:45:29'),(17695,678,'2023-06-02 18:30:00','He didn\'t pick up the call. ','2023-06-03 18:00:00','Will call him up again',15991,'2023-06-02 18:47:12','2023-06-02 18:47:12'),(17696,674,'2023-06-02 13:00:00','Called her to confirm the status but she said her husba