INSERT INTO `udn_ldp_service_line` VALUES (31,510,230,15518,2,0,0,'2020-12-23','2020-12-29',NULL,'6 N 7 D','FIT','					 					 					 Transport :-\r\nDate Destination Program Vehicle\r\n23 Dec 2020 Mararikulam Arrival Transfer ( Cochin - Mararikulam arrival transfer )\r\n24 Dec 2020 Mararikulam Sightseeing Day 02 ( Mararikulam Sight seeing Day2 )\r\n25 Dec 2020 Mararikulam Sightseeing Day 03 ( Mararikulam Sight seeing Day3 )\r\n26 Dec 2020 Munnar Transfers ( Mararikulam to Munnar )\r\n27 Dec 2020 Munnar Sightseeing Day 02 ( Sightseeing Munnar DAY 02 )\r\n28 Dec 2020 Munnar Sightseeing Day 03 ( Sightseeing Munnar DAY 03 )\r\n29 Dec 2020 Cochin Departure Transfer ( Munnar to Cochin Departure )\r\n\r\nActivities :-\r\nDate Destination Activity\r\n24 Dec 2020 Alleppey Day Cruise With Lunch\r\n\r\nMeal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\nï‚· Accommodation on Twin Sharing Basis\r\nï‚· All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from\r\n8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\nï‚· All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n					\r\n					\r\n					',61000,0,NULL,'						 						 All those which are not mentioned above\r\nï‚· Visa charges\r\nï‚· Travel insurance\r\nï‚· Entry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\nï‚· Porterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\nï‚· All Items Of Personal Nature\r\nï‚· Any Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\nï‚· Any Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\nï‚· Ayurveda Charges\r\nï‚· Only Non Ac Rooms Are Provided In Munnar And Thekkady As They Are Hill Stations\r\nï‚· Mandatory X- Mas / New Year Eve Supplementary Charges , That Should Be Paid By The Guest\r\nDirectly To The Hotels Concerned.\r\n						\r\n						\r\n						','						 						 â€¢  Cancellation within 30 Days prior to the arrival date of the tour packages / Hotel Booking / Transportation: No retention charge \r\nâ€¢  Cancellation within 15 Days prior to the arrival date of the tour packages / Hotel Booking / Transportation :50 % retention \r\nâ€¢  Cancellation within 10 Days prior to the arrival date of the tour packages / Hotel Booking / Transportation or Non Utilization of the same : 100 % Retention \r\n\r\n						\r\n						\r\n						',39,'					 \r\n					',66,0,'2020-12-23 02:03:03','2021-02-09 01:39:00'),(32,549,246,349,2,0,0,'2022-12-15','2022-12-21',NULL,'Amazing Dubai',NULL,'Amazing Dubai 6 N 7 Days',31000,10000,'ACCOMODATION AS PER OPTION SELECTED. \r\nRETURN AIRPORT TRANSFERS - PVT TRANSFER\r\nDubai CITY ORIENTATION TOUR - SIC TRANSFER \r\nDESERT SAFARI BBQ DINNER  - SIC TRANSFER\r\nMARINA DHOW CRUISE WITH DINNER  - SIC TRANSFER\r\nBURJ KHALIFA 124TH LEVEL NP - SIC TRANSFER\r\nABU DHABI CITY TOUR - SIC TRANSFER\r\n','- Tourism Dirham is not included in above quotation and shall be directly payable by the guest.\r\n- OTB Charges if applicable.\r\n- Anything not mentioned in inclusions. ','',0,'',0,0,'2022-11-28 19:22:34','2022-11-28 19:22:34'),(33,559,251,15518,4,1,0,'2023-03-30','2023-04-03',NULL,'Scenic Kerala','0','2 Nights Alappuzha - 2 Nights Mararikkulam\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (30 Mar 2023 - Thursday) Cochin to Alleppey Arrival\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Cochin to Alleppey Arrival\r\nArrival at Airport / Railway station and leave for Alleppey, Allappuza famous for its backwaters. Visit Alleppey beach, sunset and enjoy shopping if staying in Alleppey. Visit Alleppey Beach and Backwaters and enjoy shopping if staying in Alleppey. Enjoy all the amenities of this hotel/resort for a day which includes fishing in the backwaters (depends on the hotel/resort selected) Overnight stay at same hotel/resort\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Punnamada Backwater Resort (Option 1) (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 2 (31 Mar 2023 - Friday) Alleppey Day 02\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Punnamada Backwater Resort\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Alleppey Day 02\r\nAfter Breakfast Proceed to Sightseeing in Alleppey. Visit Crystal Museum, Alleppey Beach and Jain Temple. Overnight stay at Alleppey.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Punnamada Backwater Resort (Option 1) (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3 (01 Apr 2023 - Saturday) Alleppey - Mararikulam\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Punnamada Backwater Resort\r\nTransfers - Alleppey - Mararikulam\r\nAfter breakfast checkout from hotel and transferred to Mararikulam. Reach Mararikulam and relax. A full day of leisure at Marari Beach.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel MARARI BEACH RESORT (Option 1) (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 4 (02 Apr 2023 - Sunday) Mararikulam Sight seeing Day2\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - MARARI BEACH RESORT\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Mararikulam Sight seeing Day2\r\nAfter break fast sight seeing attractions : Relaxing on beach After sight seeing back to hotel\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel MARARI BEACH RESORT (Option 1) (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 5 (03 Apr 2023 - Monday) Cochin to Cochin Departure\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - MARARI BEACH RESORT\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Cochin to Cochin Departure\r\nMorning have breakfast at the resort later check out from the Hotel and drive to Airport / Railway Station for departure',121200,5000,'Stay in the above mentioned hotels/resorts\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nReturn Airport transfers\r\nAll sightseeing as per itinerary\r\nAC Innova Car\r\nAll toll, parking, driver bata and fuel cost,Delhi-Kochi-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\nStay in the above mentioned hotels/resorts\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nReturn Airport transfers\r\nAll sightseeing as per itinerary\r\nAC Innova Car\r\nAll toll, parking, driver bata and fuel cost\r\n\r\n\r\n','All those which are not mentioned in Inclusions\r\nEntry fees to monuments and tourist places\r\nPorterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\nAll Items Of Personal Nature\r\nAny Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\nAny Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\nAyurveda Charges\r\n','',0,'The rates are dynamic due to limited availability of rooms. Airfare is dynamic.',0,0,'2023-03-28 16:22:36','2023-03-30 11:12:02'),(34,564,254,6,3,0,0,'2023-04-21','2023-04-24',NULL,'Golden Triangle','Group','1N Jaipur - 1N Agra - 1N Delhi\r\n\r\nDay 1: Delhi-Jaipur\r\nOn Arrival, pick-up from the airport and drive to Jaipur. Check-in at the hotel and Explore historical places like Amer Fort, Hawa Mahal, Jal Mahal and Jantar-Mantar. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2: Jaipur-Agra\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to Agra. Check-in at the hotel and visit Taj Mahal, Red Fort and Fatehpur Sikri. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Agra-Delhi\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive back to Delhi. Check-in at the hotel. As per time availability, choose any 2 or 3 places to visit out of Red Fort, Jama Masjid, Connaught Place, and Humayun Tomb followed by shopping at Janpath and Palika Bazaar.\r\n\r\nDay 4: After breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to airport. Trip ends here with beautiful memories. ',23000,11800,'* Hotel accommodation at Delhi, Jaipur and Agra.\r\n* Daily breakfast\r\n* Innova Crysta for all transfers and sightseeing. \r\n* Parking and Toll Charges\r\n','* Guide Charges\r\n* Any other meal other than mentioned above.\r\n* Any type of personal expenses. \r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions. ','',0,'The rates are valid till 12th April, 2023.\r\n',66,0,'2023-04-10 18:36:51','2023-05-02 22:18:03'),(35,569,261,281,4,0,0,'2023-05-24','2023-05-26',NULL,'Jaipur, Ranthambore and Agra Diaries','FIT','1N Agra- 1N Ranthambore - 1N Jaipur\r\n\r\nDay 1: bangalore -Agra\r\nPick-up from the airport. Explore historical places like Taj Mahal and Red Fort. Check-in at the hotel  and Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2: Agra-Ranthambore\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to Ranthambore. Check-in at the hotel and Going for Open Private Jeep Safari. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Ranthambore-Jaipur\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to Jaipur and Explore historical places like Amer Fort, Hawa Mahal, Jal Mahal and Jantar-Mantar and After Exploring drive to airport. Trip ends here with beautiful memories.',33900,31200,'* Hotel accommodation at Ranthambore and Agra.\r\n* Daily breakfast and Lunch/Dinner\r\n* Innova Crysta for all transfers and sightseeing.\r\n* Parking and Toll Charges\r\n* Safari Charges','* Guide Charges\r\n* Any other meal other than mentioned above.\r\n* Any type of personal expenses.\r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions.','',0,'The airfare is dynamic and subject to change and guide and monuments tickets will be directly purchased from respective monuments.',66,0,'2023-05-22 13:55:31','2023-06-05 13:39:12'),(36,578,267,16002,4,0,0,'2023-06-15','2023-06-21',NULL,'Bali-Indonesia',NULL,'6 Nights Bali Stay with transfers and sightseeing.\r\nHotel: 5 nights In Grand Ixora/ 1 Night in Ayana Resort\r\n\r\nTentative Itinerary:\r\n \r\n15th June - Arrival\r\n16th June - Bali safari & Marine park with Jungle hopper on pvt\r\n17th June - Garuda Wisnu Kencana Cultural Park + Bird Park on pvt \r\n18th June - Kintamani  Tour with ubud on pvt\r\n19th June - Mengiat Beach +  Bali Hai Cruise on pvt \r\n20th June -  Full Day Tour Tanjung Glass bottom with Turtle Island with Tanah Lot on pvt basis\r\n21st June - Check out\r\n\r\n',0,0,'Delhi-Bali-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n06 Nights Accommodation on BB Basis\r\n06 Dinners in an Indian Restaurant\r\nMeet & Greet assistance at the airport\r\nReturn Airport & Inter Hotel transfer by Pvt Basis\r\nTransfers with air-conditioned vehicle\r\nEnglish-speaking driver cum guide assistance\r\nTanah lot temple\r\nBali safari & Marine park with Jungle hopper\r\nFull Day Tour Tanjung Glass bottom with Turtle Island\r\nGaruda Wisnu Kencana Cultural Park\r\nBali Hai Cruise\r\nBird park \r\nKintamani with Ubud tour\r\nMengiat Beach\r\nTravel Insurance','Toll tax not included in the package cost - Mandara Toll Road to Nusa Dua\r\nAny meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny surcharge at the hotel (Mini bar, Visiter fee ect.)\r\nOther personal expenses\r\nSurcharge for peak season if any (Upon booking) \r\nExpenditure of a personal nature such as drinks, souvenirs and laundry\r\nAny cost not mentioned in the â€˜Cost Includesâ€™ section\"\r\nTCS','',0,'The rates are valid till 15th April, 2023. Airfare is dynamic.',0,0,'2023-06-03 17:28:47','2023-06-03 17:28:47'),(37,609,291,126,2,0,0,'2023-11-18','2023-11-23',NULL,'Jaipur-Jodhpur-Udaipur',NULL,'\r\nDaywise Itinerary\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n1st Day (18th Nov Saturday) : Jaipur - Arrival\r\n\r\nÂ·         Upon arrival at airport, meet our representative and take a transfer to the hotel.\r\n\r\nÂ·        Jaipur is the capital of Rajasthan. It was painted in pink shading a century back to pay tribute to a meeting sovereign. This city is 260 years of age and was built by Maharaja Jai Singh.\r\n\r\nÂ·        Upon your arrival, complete your check-in process.\r\n\r\nÂ·        Get relaxed & take rest at the hotel.\r\n\r\nÂ·        After getting a rest visit Albert Hall followed by Birla Temple.\r\n\r\nÂ·        Head back to the hotel in evening for rest OR you can spend the evening shopping for antiques and crafts in nearby market. Take a stroll through the streets and enjoy the vivid, rich beauty of the city on your own.\r\n\r\nDinner and overnight stay at Jaipur\r\n\r\n2nd Day (19th Nov Sunday) : Jaipur - Sightseeing\r\n\r\nEarly Morning After breakfast, head out for a guided Jaipur City Tour, visit the Amber Fort First. Also, visit the Jal Mahal & Jantar Mantar. Toward the evening, go for a touring voyage through Jaipur. Also visit Maharajaâ€™s City Palace. Drive past the Hawa Mahal. Dinner & Overnight at Jaipur Hotel.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n3rd Day (20th Nov Monday) : Jaipur to Jodhpur - Transfer\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel. Then transfer to the Jodhpur. After Arrival Complete your easy check-in processes and relax in your bed. Jodhpur is a beautiful city that displays the rich crafts and culture of Rajasthan.Visit Jaswant Thada. This is a marble cenotaph built in 1899, in remembrance of Maharaja Jaswant Singh II. And then head to Mehrangarh Fort. Rising opposite and secure from a slope which is 125 meters over Jodhpurâ€™s horizon is the Mehrangarh Fort. This memorable fortification is a standout amongst the most well known in India and is stuffed with history and legends. Mehrangarh Fort still bears the engravings of cannonball assaults used by the armed forces of Jaipur on its second entryway.(If time permits) Evening is free for leisure. Overnight stay at Jodhpur Hotel.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n4th Day (21st Nov Tuesday) : Jodhpur to Udaipur - Sightseeing and Transfer\r\n\r\nAfter Breakfast check-out from the hotel . Later drive to Udaipur. Upon your arrival, complete your check-in process. Get Relaxed. Head back to the hotel for the night. Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n5th Day (22nd Nov Wednesday) : Udaipur - Sightseeing\r\n\r\nBegin your day with breakfast at the hotel and then start your city tour. Visit the City Palace which is the biggest castle complex in Rajasthan. Partake in the boat ride on the tranquil waters of Lake Pichola. Also visit Sahelion ki Bari or Garden of the Maids of Honor, Jagdish sanctuary. Local Market Visit. Later in the evening Fateh Sagar Lake, Shilpgram.Once sightseeing is over, head back to the hotel. Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n6th Day (23rd Nov Thursday) : Udaipur - Departure\r\n\r\nAfter Breakfast check-out from the Hotel Visit MAHARANA PRATAP MEMORIAL with local market visit and take a transfer to Udaipur Airport as you will be heading back to your home with the good memory.',157000,93136,'Delhi-Jaipur and Udaipur-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n5 nights accommodation at above mentioned hotels\r\nDaily breakfast\r\nAll transfers and sightseeing with an AC vehicle (Innova Crysta)\r\nToll Tax, Parking and Driver allowances\r\nGST','Anything which is not mentioned in Inclusions','',0,'The airfare is dynamic and hence  subject to vary.\r\nThe rooms are subject to availability. \r\nThis quotation does not represent any booking. ',0,0,'2023-09-23 00:11:30','2023-09-23 00:11:30'),(38,612,292,38,4,0,0,'2023-09-30','2023-10-05',NULL,'Thailand Adventure',NULL,'2N Phuket\r\n1N Krabi\r\n2N Bangkok\r\n\r\n\r\nDay-wise Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (30th Sept): HKT airport pickup and hotel drop. Fantasea Show transfer and sightseeing in the evening. (3 Pax)\r\nDay 2 (1st Oct): Phi Phi Island Tour with pickup and lunch. Evening drop at hotel. (3 Pax)\r\nDay 3 (2nd Oct): Morning pickup from hotel and transfer to HKT airport (3 pax). The guests will receive their daughter from airport then transfer from HKT airport to KBV hotel. (4 Pax)\r\nDay 4 (3rd Oct): Pickup from hotel and drop at KBV airport. BKK airport to BKK hotel. Evening Chaopraya Princess Dinner Cruise (4 pax)\r\nDay 5 (4th Oct): Full day Safari World + Marine Park with Lunch\r\nDay 6 (5th Oct): Pickup from Hotel and visit to local market and drop at airport around 3:30 pm.\r\n\r\n',57496,33360,'* Delhi-Phuket, Krabi-Bangkok & Bangkok-Delhi economy class airfare\r\n* 5 nights accommodation in the mentioned hotels\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Tours and sightseeing \r\n* Phi Phi Island Tour by Big Boat with Local Lunch (Excl. National Marine Park Fee) SIC - Pickup time 0700 am)\r\n* Phuket Fantasea Show + Dinner SIC â€“ (pickup time between 0500 â€“ 0530 pm)\r\n* Full Day Safari World + Marine Park with Lunch SIC (pickup at 0800 am)\r\n* Evening Chaopraya Princess Dinner Cruise SIC - (pickup at 0430 pm)\r\n* Hkt apt to hkt htl to Hkt apt (3 pax) / Hkt apt to Krabi htl / Krabi htl to Krabi apt/ Bkk apt to htl to Bkk apt (4 pax) on PVT\r\n* Travel Insurance','Any meal, sightseeing and transfers other than the mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal expenses.\r\nAnything which is not mentioned in the Inclusions.\r\nVisa Charges\r\nTCS (5%)','',0,'Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms are subject to availability. ',0,0,'2023-09-29 22:46:55','2023-09-29 22:46:55'),(39,616,294,6,4,0,0,'2023-12-21','2023-12-22',NULL,'Delhi Diaries',NULL,'Suggested Places to be visited: \r\n\r\n1. Lotus Temple\r\n2. India Gate\r\n3. Raj Ghat\r\n4. AkshardhamÂ Temple\r\n5. Qutub Minar (If time permits)',3500,0,'* Innova Crysta for sightseeing.\r\n* Breakfast.\r\n* 1 night stay in the selected hotel.','','',0,'',0,0,'2023-09-29 23:02:40','2023-09-29 23:02:40'),(40,617,295,15595,3,0,0,'2023-09-27','2023-10-01',NULL,'Sri Lanka Diaries',NULL,'Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 01\r\n\r\nPick up from BIA & transfer to Batticoloa\r\nCheck in at the hotel\r\nVehicle on disposal (80KM)\r\nOvernight stay in Batticaloa\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDay 02\r\n\r\nBrerakfast at the hotel\r\nProceed to Nuwara Eliya\r\nVisit Ashok Vatika & Seetha Amman Temple\r\nOvernight stay in Nuwara Eliya\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 03\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the hotel\r\nProceed to Kandy\r\nEn-route visit Hanuman Ji Temple & Ramboda Water fall\r\nVisit Tea Factory\r\nCheck in the hotel\r\nEvening City tour of Kandy\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDay 04\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the hotel\r\nTransfer to Colombo\r\nEn-route visit Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage\r\nCity tour of Colombo\r\nDeparture transfer to Airport',65500,4000,'* Accommodation at the above mentioned hotels or similar\r\n* Meet & Assist at the airport\r\n* City tours & sightseeing as per the above itinerary\r\n* Meals as stated above.\r\n* An air-conditioned vehicle with an English speaking driver throughout the tour\r\n* All applicable Gov. Taxes\r\n* Map of Sri Lanka\r\n* Room upgrade on availability\r\n* 02 X 500 ML water bottle per person per day.\r\n* Welcome at the airport with Garlands\r\n* Express way charges wherever applicable.\r\n','* Airfare & VISA charges\r\n* Entrance fees to any sites not mentioned above\r\n* Tips & portages\r\n* Any meals not mentioned above\r\n* Any other services not mentioned above\r\n* Early check in & Late check out','',0,'',0,0,'2023-10-03 17:56:21','2023-10-03 17:56:21'),(41,627,302,2326,2,0,0,'2023-12-01','2023-12-04',NULL,'Shimla Package',NULL,'Day 1 : Shimla pick up and transfer to hotel! After proceed for Mall Road, Christ church, gaiety theatre, scandal point, ridge \r\n\r\nDAY 2: SHIMLA LOCAL : Advance Study Sankat Mochan Temple in (1885),Jakhu Temple, Tara Devi temple, at SHIMLA. \r\n\r\nDay 3: SHIMLA KUFRI TOUR:- After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride (Extra cost) and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri, Shimla \r\n\r\nDay 4: Shimla volvo stand drop!',13000,3000,'3 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nAll transfers and sightseeing by a Sedan Car\r\nAll taxes and parking charges','Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions','',0,'',0,0,'2023-11-23 15:57:49','2023-11-23 15:57:49'),(42,633,305,419,2,0,0,'2023-12-09','2023-12-11',NULL,'Srinagar Package',NULL,'Day 1 : ARRIVE SRINAGAR - EVENING BOATRIDE\r\n\r\nYou will be met by our representative at the Srinagar airport. He will assist and transfer you to the hotel/deluxe houseboat. In the afternoon you take a Shikara ride on Dal Lake, where you visit the floating vegetable gardens. While riding the Shikaraâ€™s there are plenty of opportunities for bird watching with plentiful species including Kingfisher, Little Bittern, Common Pariah Kites, Grebe etc. Dinner and Overnight in hotel / deluxe houseboats.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : DAY TRIP TO PAHALGAM\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast drive to Pahalgam (The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 96 kms, will be covered in about 3 hours. En-route, visiting the saffron fields of pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), and enjoy the beautiful countryside.Drive throught the pine forests. Arrive at Pahalgam and enjoy Lidder stream. Later walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains.Drive back to Srinagar. Overnight in hotel / deluxe houseboat.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : DEPARTURE FROM SRINAGAR HOTEL TO SRINAGAR AIRPORT\r\n\r\nMorning sightseeing of the Mughal Gardens, visiting Nishat Bagh built by Asaf Khan, the brother -in- law of Jehangir in 1632 AD, and Shalimar Bagh built by Jehangir for his wife empress Nur Jahan. All the gardens are situated on the banks of the Dal Lake with the Zabarwan hills in the background. Afternoon will be at your leisure for individual activities In evening Srinagar airport for onward flight..',21000,5617,'Delhi-Srinagar-Delhi Economy Class Airfare\r\nMeal Plan: MAPAI (Room + Breakfast + Dinner )\r\n01 Shikara Ride.\r\nSightseeing as per the itinerary.\r\nAll Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.\r\nAll present applicable taxes as on date.\r\nAny future taxes levies will be charged extra.','Any Medical/rescue evacuation due to mishaps.\r\nAny personal nature items like Laundry, bar bills, table bills, camera fee, tips or any other item.\r\nMineral water / Soft or hard drinks / Starters.                                                                                                 Entrance Free\r\nRoom Heating Charges in Houseboats\r\nGST Not included \r\nHorse Riding\r\nSightseeing of Chandanwadi, Aru and Baisaran in Pahalgam.\r\nGondola Ride in Gulmarg\r\nAny other things that is not included in the Package','',0,'',0,0,'2023-11-28 18:16:53','2023-11-28 18:16:53'),(43,642,311,6,2,0,0,'2024-02-12','2024-02-15',NULL,'Delhi-Agra-Jaipur Diaries',NULL,'Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n12th Feb : Delhi to Agra. Hotel Check-in and local sightseeing \r\n\r\n13th Feb: Check-out and move to Jaipur for 2 nights. Local sightseeing \r\n\r\n14th Feb: Local sightseeing \r\n\r\n15th Feb: After Check-out Jaipur to Delhi. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',11500,950,'* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Sedan Car\r\n','* Any meal other than mentioned above\r\n* Any type of personal expenses\r\n','',0,'',0,0,'2024-02-01 17:47:39','2024-02-01 17:47:39'),(44,650,318,15518,4,0,0,'2024-02-07','2024-02-12',NULL,'Kerala Diaries ',NULL,'Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nMunnar: 2 Nights, Thekkady: 1 Nights, Alleppey: 1 Nights, Trivandrum: 1 Nights \r\n\r\nDay 1 (08 Feb 2024 - Thrusday) Cochin - Munnar(Arrival) \r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Cochin - Munnar(Arrival)\r\nOn arrival at the Cochin airport/railway station, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and afterwards to transfer you to your already booked hotel in Munnar Proceed to Munnar. Visit Cheeyapara and Valara water falls on the way to Munnar. Through out the journey enjoy beautiful streams small waterfalls, Rubber, Pepper cardamom and Tea plantations and thick forests; God has blessed his own country with incomparable beauty on arrival at Munnar check in to Hotel. At leisure.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel The Munnar Queen (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 2 (09 Feb 2024 - Friday) Munnar Sightseeing DAY 02 \r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - The Munnar Queen\r\nMorning after breakfast proceed to enjoy full day sight seeing tour of Munnar. Rose Garden, Tea Garden, Photo Point, Madupetty Dam/Lake, Echo Point & Kundala Dam/Lake.  \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel The Munnar Queen (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3 (10 Feb 2024 - Saturday) Munnar - Thekkady \r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - The Munnar Queen\r\nTransfers - Munnar - Thekkady\r\nMorning after breakfast check out from the hotel and transfer to Thekkady .Thekkady is a world famous wildlife sanctuary and it is also called as Periyar. On arrival check in at Hotel. Afternoon visit wildlife sanctuary & enjoy the boating ( tickets charges are extra and subject to availability ). Visit spice plantations. Apart from being enjoyable these plantation tours gives tourists an insight into the growing, harvesting and processing of spices. Evening will be free for Cultural show ( Kathakali & Kalaripayattu on direct payment ) & local shopping. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Spices Lap Thekkady  (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 4 (11 Feb 2024 - Sunday) Thekkady to Alleppey \r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Spices Lap Thekkady \r\nTransfers - Thekkady to Alleppey\r\nMorning after breakfast leave for Alleppey, Allappuza famous for its backwaters. Visit Alleppey beach, sunset and enjoy shopping if staying in Alleppey. Visit Alleppey Beach and Backwaters. \r\nOvernight Stay at HouseBoat  (Meal Plan - APAI)\r\n\r\nDay 5 (12 Feb 2024 - Monday) Alleppey to Trivandrum\r\nBreakfast at the HouseBoat \r\nTransfers - Alleppey to Trivandrum\r\nMorning after breakfast Checkout from Hotel and Transferred to Cochin. Proceed for Cochin sightseeing. Visit the Dutch Palace-built by the Portuguese in 1557 and subsequently renovated by the Dutch after 1663. The murals are perhaps the best in India. Jewish Synagogue - built in 1568 and the oldest Synagogue in the Commonwealth are at Mattancherry. St. Francis Church - built in 1510 and the oldest European church in India, Chinese Fishing Nets- introduced by the court of Kublai Khan can be seen in Fort Cochin. Fort Cochin Beach etc. \r\nOvernight Stay at Forte Manor (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 6 (13 Feb 2024 - Tuesday) Trivandrum to Trivandrum Departure \r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Forte Manor\r\nDeparture Transfer - Trivandrum to Trivandrum Departure\r\nMorning have breakfast at resort later check out from the Hotel and drive to Airport / Railway Station for departure.',85700,22000,'* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary \r\n* All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost ','  All those which are not mentioned above\r\n  Visa charges\r\n  Travel insurance\r\n  Entry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\n  Porterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\n  All Items Of Personal Nature\r\n  Any Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\n  Any Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\n  Ayurveda Charges\r\n  Only Non Ac Rooms Are Provided In Munnar And Thekkady As They Are Hill Stations\r\n  Mandatory X- Mas / New Year Eve Supplementary Charges , That Should Be Paid By The Guest Directly To The Hotels Concerned.','',0,'Airfare is Dynamic.',0,0,'2024-03-01 07:59:22','2024-03-01 07:59:22'),(45,660,322,355,2,0,0,'2024-04-26','2024-04-30',NULL,'Varanasi Diaries','FIT','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay -01  Arrive  Varanasi  \r\nArrive Airport  transfer to Hotel and evening proceed ganga aarti by boat ( Boat charges included)  , over night stay in the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay-02  Varanasi \r\nEarly in the morning on the second day. You will be taken on an early morning boat ride (optional charges ). This boat ride is the best way to enjoy top ghats and rituals performed in each ghat. You can find many people bathing in the river. . After the boat ride, you will be taken on a temple tour to enjoy the morning rituals in famous temples like, Kashi Vishwanath temple, Annapurna temple, and others. Later, you will be taken back to the hotel for breakfast and later proceed SankatMochan Hanuman temple , ManasMandir , BHU etc\r\n\r\nAfternoon you will be taken on a road trip to Sarnath. Sarnath is the spot where Lord Buddha delivered his sermon after getting enlightenment. Top attractions visited in Sarnath are archeological museum, Buddha temples, stupas and others. etc.\r\n\r\nDay-03  Varanasi to Ayodhya [ 250km / 5 hrs approx. ]\r\nArrival at Ayodhya Airport and proceed for hotel and check-in in the hotel.\r\nLater in the evening, we will go for a ghat walk at ram ki paidi with a glimpse of old temples. After that will proceed for attending the Saryu Aarti & laser light show at Ram ki Paidi.\r\n \r\nOvernight stay in hotel.\r\n \r\nDay 04 - In morning, after breakfast will go to temple tour - Ramjanambhoomi, Hanumangarhi, kanak Bhawan & Dashrath Mahal.\r\n \r\nAfter lunch, We will go for Guptarghat, Nandigram. Later on will go for Surya kund. After Surya kund will come back to hotel. \r\n \r\nOvernight stay in hotel.\r\n \r\nDay 05 - Departure.\r\nAfter breakfast, you can proceed for airport. \r\nYour spiritual tour will end here with new memories.',0,19867,'* Economy Class airfare.\r\n* Accommodation on the above mentioned hotels or similar.\r\n* Breakfast. \r\n* Meal Plan as per above in Hotels / Resorts.\r\n* Transfers & sightseeing by above vehicle (Vehicle Service from 08:00 Am to 08:00 PM) after that additional cost will be applicable ).\r\n* Toll, Parking, Driver Allowance.\r\n* All Applicable Tax.\r\n* Evening Aarti by BOAT in Varanasi \r\n* Guide included in Varanasi \r\n','â€¢	Expenses of personal nature such as drinks, telephone, and laundry bills etc \r\nâ€¢	Tips and porter charges\r\n\r\n','',0,'Airfare is dynamic.',66,0,'2024-03-14 18:50:23','2024-04-30 23:55:58'),(46,663,324,419,6,0,0,'2024-03-17','2024-03-21',NULL,'Kashmir Diaries',NULL,'Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL +  (CHECK-IN HOUSEBOAT) + SONMARG DAY TRIP	\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your houseboat. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.	\r\n	\r\nDay 2 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.	\r\n\r\nDay 3 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOTEL 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. In evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	\r\n	\r\nDay 4 - GULMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR	\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	\r\n	\r\nDay 5 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOTEL 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.	',138000,90426,'â€¢	Economy Class airfare.\r\nâ€¢	Meal Plan: MAPAI (Room + Breakfast + Dinner )\r\nâ€¢	01 Shikara Ride.\r\nâ€¢	Sightseeing as per the itinerary.\r\nâ€¢	Pickup & Drop: SXR Airport\r\nâ€¢	Vehicle: Innova (NON AC)','â€¢	Any personal nature items like Laundry, bar bills, table bills, camera fee, tips or any other item.\r\nâ€¢	Mineral water / Soft or hard drinks / Starters.                                                                                                 \r\nâ€¢	Entrance Free\r\nâ€¢	Room Heating Charges in Houseboats\r\nâ€¢	Horse Riding\r\nâ€¢	Sightseeing of Chandanwadi, Aru and Baisaran in Pahalgam.\r\nâ€¢	Gondola Ride in Gulmarg\r\nâ€¢	Any other things that is not included in the Package\r\n','',0,'Airfare is dynamic.',0,0,'2024-03-14 19:08:29','2024-03-14 19:08:29'),(47,679,337,6,4,0,2,'2024-07-15','2024-07-19',NULL,'Delhi-Agra-Jaipur Diaries','FIT','Itinerary :-\r\n\r\nDay 1 (15 Jul) : Check in at the booked hotel. Then u can proceed for the excursions including Qutub Minar, Lotus Temple, Humayun Tomb, Jama Masjid, Rajghat, Red Fort, Chandni Chowk, Khari Baoli. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2 (16 Jul) : After breakfast proceed for your onward journey towards Agra. En-route visit Iskcon Vrindavan, Janm Bhumi Temple Mathura, Agra Fort. Check in at the booked hotel and relax. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3 (17 Jul) : Early in the morning, visit Taj Mahal and Baby Taj Mahal and back to hotel. After breakfast, check out from hotel and proceed to Kinnari Bazaar, Fatehpur Sikri. Proceed for your journey towards Jaipur. Check in at the booked hotel and relax. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 4 (18 Jul) : After breakfast visit Panna Meena Ka Kund, Amber Palace, Jal Mahal, Hawa Mahal, City Fort and Jantar Mantar, Albert Hall Museum, Patrika Gate. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 5 (19 July) : Morning after breakfast drive towards the Jaipur Airport for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',0,0,'* 2 night stay in the mentioned hotel with breakfast\r\n* Vehicle Innova Crysta with driver.\r\n* Fuel, Toll, Parking and Driver charges.\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense.\r\n* Any meals other than the mentioned above.','',0,'',66,0,'2024-05-02 17:46:29','2024-10-23 13:38:42'),(48,683,339,15511,2,0,0,'2024-08-06',