y Flight and transfer to the hotel\r\nEnjoy a welcome drink at hotel. In the late afternoon drive to the city for an orientation walk in the marketsâ€š followed by a visit to Shanti Stupaâ€š Leh palace. Dinner and overnight in hotel.\r\n \r\nDAY 02: LEH - EXCURSION TO SHAM VALLEY (65 KMS / 04 HRS â€“ ONE WAY)       \r\n \r\n* HALL OF FAME\r\n* MAGNETIC HILL\r\n* CONFLENCE OF THE ZANSKAR\r\n* GURUDWARA PATHAR SAHIB\r\n* ALCHI GOMPA\r\n\r\nDAY 03: LEHâ€“NUBRA VALLEY VIA KHARDUNG LA 18,390 FT. (120 KMS / 4 â€“ 5 HRS)\r\nDAY 04: NUBRA VALLEY TO PANGONG LAKE (150 KMS / 5 HRS)\r\nDAY 05: PANGONG LAKE TO LEH VIA CHANGLA (140 KMS / 6 HRS)\r\nDAY 06: DEPART LEH (FLY OUT)\r\n','','Ã„  Delhi â€“ Leh â€“ Delhi (Air tickets in economy class)\r\nÃ„  Assistance upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport,\r\nÃ„  Traditional welcome in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival\r\nÃ„  05-night accommodation twin/triple sharing basis as per the itinerary.\r\nÃ„  05 Breakfast + 05 Dinner\r\nÃ„  Return airport and round-trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary\r\nÃ„  Wildlife fee & Red Cross fee\r\nÃ„  All toll taxes / parking fee / driver allowance\r\nÃ„  Ladakh Entry Fee\r\nÃ„  Ladakh Ecological Development Fee\r\nÃ„  One Mid-Sized Oxygen Cylinder during Nubra Valley and Pangong Lake visit','Ã„  Any Kind of Personal Expenses or Optional Tours / Extra Meals Ordered\r\nÃ„  Anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\nÃ„  The Services of Vehicle is not included on leisure days & after finishing the sightseeing tour as per the Itinerary\r\nÃ„  Guide fee, Camera fee & any monument Entrances\r\nÃ„  Medical & Travel insurance\r\nÃ„  Any changes you may choose to make during your tour\r\nÃ„  Additional costs due to flight cancellation, roadblocks etc','SUPPLEMENTS FOR OTHER OPTIONS:-\r\n1.       Professional Tourist Guide:                                                                         Rs. 2500 per Day. \r\n2.       River Rafting on Indus | Zanskar:                                                               Rs. 1800 Per Person to Rs. 2000 Per Person\r\n3.       Transport Till Rafting Point from Sangam                                                 Rs. 1000 per vehicle\r\n4.       Motorbike hire for full day:                                                                         Rs. 2000 Per Bike (350/500 CC) + Fuel Charges Extra\r\n5.       Pedal down the highest motorable road on a cycle:                               Rs. 1500 per pax including transport (min 4 pax)\r\n6.       Double hump Camel Ride at Nubra Valley at Sand Dunes:                     Rs. 500 to Rs. 1000 (as per the duration)\r\n7.       Cultural Dance Program:                                                                              Rs. 11000 Per Program\r\n8.       Oxygen Cylinder (Medium size)                                                                  Rs. 1000 per day + 200 Per Mask \r\n9.       ATV Ride                                                                                                         Rs. 1200 to 1500 per person\r\n10.    Hall of Fame sound & light show                                                                 Rs. 1700 per vehicle\r\n\r\n \r\nCANCELLATION POLICY:\r\nÃ„  Prior to 45 days or more - 30% of tour cost\r\nÃ„  Between 44 and 31 days of departure - 50% of tour cost\r\nÃ„  Between 30 and 20 days of departure - 50% of tour cost\r\nÃ„  Between 20 days and 10 prior to the date of departure - 75%\r\nÃ„  Between 10 days and In case of no show - 100%\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE: Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report of 96 hours prior to arrival date\r\n \r\nPlease note that COVID RT-PCR negative report is compulsory to enter Leh-Ladakh\r\n\r\nCOVID rapid test is not acceptable and in case you fail to provide RT-PCR Report, you will be quarantined for 7 days.\r\n \r\nTravelers who have had both vaccination and 15 days have passed since last dose are not required to furnish negative report. They can come with the hard copy of the vaccination certificate.\r\n \r\n ','2022-05-22','2022-05-27',1,0,0,'2022-03-20 22:49:37','2022-03-26 01:36:24'),(52,217,15567,11,0,0,289300,30000,'Amazing Nepal','07 Night 08 Days Kathmandu, Pokhara & Chitwan Tour Package\r\n\r\nNumber of Pax:		11 Adults \r\n\r\nNationality:		Indian\r\n\r\nNumber of Room:		05 Double & 01 Extra Bed Room\r\n\r\nArrival Date:		14 April 2022\r\n\r\nDeparture Date:		21 April 2022\r\n\r\nVehicle:		A/C Totyta Hiace\r\n\r\nHotel Category		Four Star\r\n\r\nHotel:			Hotel Ramada (Similar), Kathmandu 3 Nights (MAP Plan)\r\n\r\n			Hotel Bodhi Suites & SPA (Similar) , Pokhara 2 Nights (MAP Plan\r\n\r\n                        Hotel Park Safari (Similar), Chitwan,  2 Nights  (AP Plan)\r\n\r\nPackage itinerary\r\n\r\n14 April 2022:\r\n\r\n Pickup from Kathmandu International Airport and drop at hotel.\r\n\r\n Welcome soft drink at hotel.\r\n\r\n Dinner at hotel.\r\n\r\n Overnight stay at hotel in Kathmandu.\r\n\r\n15 April 2022:\r\n\r\n Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n\r\n Full day sightseeing at Kathmandu covering Pashupatinath Temple, Bauddhanath Stupa, Swyambhunath Stupa (Monkey Temple) & Kathmandu Durbar Square.\r\n\r\n Dinner at hotel.\r\n\r\n Overnight stay at hotel in Kathmandu.\r\n\r\n16 April 2022:\r\n\r\n Morning breakfast at hotel\r\n\r\n Drive from Kathmandu to Chitwan & drop hotel. 165 KM (4-5 Hours)\r\n\r\n Welcome soft drink at hotel.\r\n\r\n Lunch at hotel.\r\n\r\n Village Tour & Tharu Culture Dance Program.\r\n\r\n Dinner at hotel.\r\n\r\n Overnight stay at hotel in Chitwan.\r\n\r\n\r\n17 April 2022:\r\n\r\n Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n\r\n Bird Watching, Jungle Walk,  Elephant/Jeep Safari, Elephent Breeding Centre & Canoeing\r\n\r\n Lunch & Dinner at hotel.\r\n\r\n Overnight stay at hotel in Chitwan.\r\n\r\n18 April 2022:\r\n\r\n Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n\r\n Drive from Chitwan to Pokhara via Manakamana Temple darshan  (