 destination on the Corbett Jungle holiday. Winsome Resort is newly constructed Resort of Mukut hotel and Resort (p) Ltd Group of Hotels â€“ A Name to reckon with in North India.\r\n\r\nJim Corbett National Park is part of the Corbett Tiger Reserve in the Nainital district of the picturesque Uttarakhand state. The awe-struck beauty of the Corbett National Park is multiplied by its richness of tigers that roam around still as freely in their hinterland. The Jim Corbett National park is the oldest and one of the most recognized National parks in India.','','ï‚· Welcome Drink on arrival (Non-alcoholic). \r\nï‚· Stay at well-appointed rooms\r\nï‚· Lavish Buffet Meals (03 Breakfast, 02 Lunch & 03 Dinners). \r\nï‚· Daily Evening Hi Tea with Cookies & Snacks.\r\nï‚· Chaat Counters on 15th April \r\nï‚· DJ on 15th April\r\nï‚· Karaoke Live Singing with fun activities on other evenings\r\nï‚· Fun activities during the day organized by resort for all age groups\r\nï‚· Complimentary use of Swimming Pool (costumes mandatory)\r\nï‚· Complimentary use of Gym\r\nï‚· Complimentary use of Indoor/Outdoor games - Table Tennis, Carrom, Cricket, Badminton, Ludo, \r\nChess, etc.\r\nï‚· Use of Adventure activities - Net Crossing, Commando Bridge, Ladle Bridge, Tyre Net & Bamboo \r\nbridge & Pool Table (on very reasonable charges)\r\nï‚· Complimentary use of Wi-Fi facility.\r\nï‚· Use of Spa Facilities (additional cost)\r\n\r\n','','','2022-04-14','2022-04-17',0,0,0,'2022-03-23 19:29:46','2022-03-23 19:53:48'),(55,228,15534,4,0,0,126000,15000,'Leh-Ladakh','Day wise Itinerary :-\r\n \r\nDAY 01: ARRIVE LEH by Flight and transfer to the hotel\r\nEnjoy a welcome drink at hotel. In the late afternoon drive to the city for an orientation walk in the marketsâ€š followed by a visit to Shanti Stupaâ€š Leh palace. Dinner and overnight in hotel.\r\n \r\nDAY 02: LEH - EXCURSION TO SHAM VALLEY (65 KMS / 04 HRS â€“ ONE WAY)       \r\n \r\n* HALL OF FAME\r\n* MAGNETIC HILL\r\n* CONFLENCE OF THE ZANSKAR\r\n* GURUDWARA PATHAR SAHIB\r\n* ALCHI GOMPA\r\n\r\nDAY 03: LEHâ€“NUBRA VALLEY VIA KHARDUNG LA 18,390 FT. (120 KMS / 4 â€“ 5 HRS)\r\nDAY 04: NUBRA VALLEY TO PANGONG LAKE (150 KMS / 5 HRS)\r\nDAY 05: PANGONG LAKE TO LEH VIA CHANGLA (140 KMS / 6 HRS)\r\nDAY 06: DEPART LEH (FLY OUT)\r\n','','Ã„  Delhi â€“ Leh â€“ Delhi (Air tickets in economy class)\r\nÃ„  Assistance upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport,\r\nÃ„  Traditional welcome in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival\r\nÃ„  05-night accommodation twin/triple sharing basis as per the itinerary.\r\nÃ„  05 Breakfast + 05 Dinner\r\nÃ„  Return airport and round-trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary\r\nÃ„  Wildlife fee & Red Cross fee\r\nÃ„  All toll taxes / parking fee / driver allowance\r\nÃ„  Ladakh Entry Fee\r\nÃ„  Ladakh Ecological Development Fee\r\nÃ„  One Mid-Sized Oxygen Cylinder during Nubra Valley and Pangong Lake visit','Ã„  Any Kind of Personal Expenses or Optional Tours / Extra Meals Ordered\r\nÃ„  Anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\nÃ„  The Services of Vehicle is not included on leisure days & after finishing the sightseeing tour as per the Itinerary\r\nÃ„  Guide fee, Camera fee & any monument Entrances\r\nÃ„  Medical & Travel insurance\r\nÃ„  Any changes you may choose to make during your tour\r\nÃ„  Additional costs due to flight cancellation, roadblocks etc','SUPPLEMENTS FOR OTHER OPTIONS:-\r\n1.       Professional Tourist Guide:                                                                         Rs. 2700 per Day. \r\n2.       River Rafting on Indus | Zanskar:                                                               Rs. 2000 Per Person to Rs. 2200 Per Person\r\n3.       Transport Till Rafting Point from Sangam                                                 Rs. 1200 per vehicle\r\n4.       Motorbike hire for full day:                                                    