\r\n\r\nâ€¢ 4 nights stay in One Bedroom Villa at Aston Sunset Beach Resort Gili\r\n\r\nâ€¢ 5 nights stay in One Bedroom Pool Villa at The Bali Dream Villa Seminyak \r\n\r\nâ€¢ Daily breakfast at the hotel (Excluding Arrival Breakfast)\r\n\r\nâ€¢ One Way Transfer from Airport to Ubud On Private Basis\r\n\r\nâ€¢ One Way Transfer from Ubud to Gili by Fast Boat + Cidomo (horse cart) on SIC basis.\r\n\r\nâ€¢ One Way Transfer from Gili to Seminyak by Fast Boat + Cidomo (horse cart) on SIC basis.\r\n\r\nâ€¢ One Way Transfer from Seminyak to Airport On Private Basis\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Full Day Kintamani Volcano Tour with Ubud Village on Private Basis Includes : Kintamani Volcano, \r\n Ubud Monkey Forest\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Half Day Tanah Lot Temple Tour on Private Basis Includes : Tanah Lot Temple Tour\r\n\r\nâ€¢ 1 Romantic Candle light Dinner With Private Transfer.\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Sunset Dinner Cruise by Sea Safari on Private basis \r\n\r\nâ€¢ Full day Nusa Lembongan Island Cruise Beach Club by Bali Hai on Private basis \r\n\r\nâ€¢ Floating Breakfast at  The Bali Dream Villa\r\n\r\nâ€¢ VAT in Indonesia and all other taxes\r\n','Tips\r\n\r\nEnglish Speaking Guide\r\n\r\nAnything which is not included in inclusions\r\n','OPtionional activities\r\n\r\n\r\nINR 1600 Per Pax for Parasailing & INR 1600 Per pax for Snorkeling at Tanjung benoa beach','2022-06-17','2022-06-30',1,0,0,'2022-04-14 18:31:28','2022-04-28 17:09:41'),(63,263,419,2,0,0,56700,13000,'Amazing Kashmir','\r\n03N Srinagar Downtown Srinagar\r\n\r\n01N Sonmarg Sultan Resort\r\n\r\n01N Houseboat Wangnoo Sheraton\r\n\r\nShikara Ride\r\n\r\nMap plan\r\n\r\nEtios\r\n\r\nDay 1\r\n\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 3\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Pahalgam, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 4\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Sonmarg hotel, (Meadows of Gold), it has sheer scenic splendour. The very way-a metalled road snakes through massive mountains laden with forests and firs. After a breath-taking journey from Srinagar you come across River Sindh that is abounded with trout & Mahseer. Onwards the valley opens up to a meadow. After Check-in  Ponies can be hired for a trip up to Thajiwas glacier ; a major attraction during the summer months. Sonamarg\'s importance lies in the fact that it is the last halt on the Kashmir side for the drive from Srinagar to Leh. You will be fascinated to see Snowy Mountains against a cerulean sky against its backdrop. Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg.\r\n\r\nDay 5\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 6\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat .After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.','','Accommodation on twin/double/triple sharing basis\r\n\r\nâœ” Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n\r\nâœ” Airport/station pick-up and drop facility as confirmed by the travelers. \r\n\r\nâœ” Sightseeing by non-AC Swift Dzire/Etios/Tavera/Innova Tempo as per the package selected. \r\n\r\nâœ” Cost of Shikara Ride.\r\n\r\nâœ” Driver Allowances.\r\n\r\nâœ” Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n\r\nâœ” Hotel Taxes\r\n','âœ” Any Air/Train/Bus fare or travel insurance.\r\n\r\nâœ” 5% GST on total package cost.\r\n\r\nâœ” Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n\r\nâœ” Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€. \r\n\r\nâœ” Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n\r\nâœ” Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances. \r\n\r\nâœ” Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n\r\nâœ”Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n\r\nâœ” Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc. \r\n\r\nâœ” Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc. \r\n\r\nâœ” The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow. \r\n\r\n','','2022-04-25','2022-04-30',1,0,0,'2022-04-20 11:57:21','2022-04-20 11:57:21'),(64,265,419,2,0,0,42000,13000,'Amazing Kashmir','\r\n\r\n03N Srinagar Golden Bees\r\n\r\n01N Sonmarg Mount View\r\n\r\n01N Hous