K \r\nAfter breakfast full day excursion to Yumthang Valley , Hot Spring and Zero Poent (11800 ft / 02 hrs). After lunch, transfer to Gangtok (124 kms / 06 hrs). Over night at Hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 05             GANGTOK- PELLING\r\nAfter breakfast transfer to Pelling (5500 ft / 135 kms / 5Â½ hrs).afternoon visit. Pemayangtse Monastery, Rabdentse Ruins, New Helipad & View Tower.Evening free for leisure. Over night at Hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 06       PELLING- DARJEELING\r\nAfter breakfast transfer to Darjeeling (7100 ft/115 kms /4Â½ hrs)arrival check in Hotel . Evening free for leisure. Overnight at Hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 07    DARJEELING \r\nEarly Morning at 0400 AM visit Tiger Hill ,famous for sunrise over Mt. Kanchendzonga back to Hotel. After breakfast proceed for visit Mix points, covering The Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, PNZ Zoological Park (closed on Thursday) Tenzing Rock, Tibetans Refuge Centre (closed on Sunday), Tea Garden (outer view), Rope way, Japanese Temple, Ava Art Gallary & Peace pagoda. Overnight stay at hotel\r\n\r\nDAY 08           MIRIK EXCURSION \r\nAfter Breakfast proceed for Mirik Lake Excursion (Boating & Horse Riding is available on direct payment basis) en-route visit Pashupati Market (Indo-Nepal Border). Evening come back to Darjeeling and overnight stay at Hotel. \r\n\r\nDAY 09     DARJELLING â€“ NJP RAILWAY STATION / IXB AIRPORT\r\nAfter breakfast leave Darjeeling and proceed towards â€“ NJP railway station / Bagdogra Airport (110 kms / 03 hrs) for your onward journey.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','PACKKAGE COST INCLUDES- HOTEL ACCOMODATION IN TWO DOUBLE ROOM WITH TWO EXTRA BED AND TWO CHILD WITHOUT BED ON MAPAI PLAN,ONLY LACHUNG ONE NIGHT ON APAI PLAN AND ALL TRANSFER BY TWO A/C INNOVA/ZYLO.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n,','','','2022-05-18','2022-05-26',0,0,0,'2022-05-02 20:01:59','2022-05-02 20:34:46'),(68,271,3511,5,3,0,351800,63400,'Amazing Nort east,Amazing North East',' No. of Adults : 05\r\n\r\nNo of Child : 3\r\n\r\nMeal Plan : 