ng after breakfast check out and proceed to Calicut. The central Kozhikode/Calicut Beach, overlooked by an old lighthouse, is a popular spot for watching the sunset. Inland, tree-lined Mananchira Square, with its musical fountain, surrounds the massive Mananchira Tank, an artificial pond. The Stone Memorial for Vasco de Gama stands tall in honor of the Portuguese explorer who \r\nlanded on Indian soil. Overnight stay at hotel/resort.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 9: Pick-up from the venue (mentioned by the client) followed by visit to Baypore Beach, Kappad beach, Kozhikode beach, Mittayi Theruvu, Krishna Menon art gallery and museum. Drop at Calicut Airport. (The calicut sightseeing can be done as per time availability)\r\n\r\n','','1. Delhi to Trivandrum and Calicut to Delhi Airfare\r\n2. 7 Nights stay in above-mentioned hotels/resorts.\r\n3. Extra bed is also included in all properties\r\n4. Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary (Breakfast and Dinner)\r\n5. All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\n6. All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost included.\r\n7. Etios car will be available for excursions.','Anything that is not mentioned in the inclusions.','','2022-11-26','2022-12-04',1,0,0,'2022-10-29 18:56:34','2022-10-29 19:07:39'),(185,505,349,2,0,0,0,0,'Dubai Adventure','4 Nights trip to Dubai\r\n\r\n','','* RETURN AIRPORT TRANSFERS PVT\r\n* 4-NIGHT STAY IN THE MENTIONED HOTEL\r\n* DAILY BREAKFAST\r\n* CITY TOUR HALF DAY SIC\r\n* MARINA DHOW CRUISE SIC\r\n* DESERT SAFARI SIC\r\n* BURJ KHALIFA 124TH NON-PRIME SIC\r\n* ABU DHABI CITY TOUR SIC','ANYTHING THAT IS NOT MENTIONED IN THE INCLUSIONS','','2022-11-16','2022-11-20',1,0,0,'2022-11-01 15:45:58','2022-11-01 15:45:58'),(186,506,15520,22,0,0,45000,4500,'Nainital Adventure','1 night stay in Nainital with all sightseeing.','','* 1 Night stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Meals as per the agreed Meal Plan\r\n* Transfers for Noida-Nainital-Noida\r\n* All sightseeing','Anything t