ach etc. Overnight stay at Cochin\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6: Breakfast at the Hotel - Broad Bean Hotel\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Cochin to Cochin Departure\r\n\r\n','','* Delhi to Kochi and Kochi to Delhi Flight Fare\r\n* Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\n* Accommodation on Twin Sharing Basis\r\n* All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n','Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions. ','','2022-11-26','2022-12-01',1,0,0,'2022-11-07 15:50:27','2022-11-07 15:54:27'),(188,511,349,2,0,0,154000,20000,'Dubai Adventure','4Nights Dubai - 1Night Abu Dhabi\r\n\r\nDAY 1: Dubai\r\nArrival, Meet and Greet, Transfer to HOTEL (Normal check-in time is 1400 Hrs).1845-1900 PickupfromHotel Lobby for Marina Dhow Cruise with onboard entertainment. Drop back at the hotel. Overnight at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 2: Dubai\r\nBreakfast at Hotel.09:00-09:30 Pick up from Hotel Lobby for a Dubai city tour covering the scenic beauty of Dubai. Drop back at the hotel. Overnight at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 3: Dubai\r\nBreakfast at Hotel.\r\n14:00-14:30 Pick up from Hotel Lobby for Desert Safari includes Dune Bashing, Arabic dates, Camel\r\nRiding, Henna for Ladies, Belly Dancing, and Tanura Dance with BBQ dinner. Drop back at the hotel. Overnight at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 4: Dubai\r\nBreakfast at Hotel. Day free for leisure.\r\nOvernight at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 5: Dubai-Abu Dhabi\r\nBreakfast at Hotel. Check out from the hotel and transfer to Abu Dhabi check in the Hotel. Enjoy ThemeParkFerrari Word.\r\nOvernight at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 6: Departure from Abu Dhabi\r\nBreakfast at Hotel.\r\n10:30 Check out from Hotel (Standard check out time 1100Hrs) Enjoy Yas Water World or WarnerBrothers.\r\nPick up from Hotel and Drop at Abu Dhabi Airport\r\n','','* Economy Class Return Airfare \r\n* 4 Nights Accommodation in Dubai with Breakfast\r\n* 1 Night Accommodation in Abu Dhabi \r\n* 2 Theme Park Tickets (Ferrari World & Yas Water W