00 KM)â€”26 Dec\r\nWelcome to Awesome Assam. Meet and be assisted by our representative at the airport/Railway Station. Proceed to Maa Kamakhya Temple-one of the most prominent shakti pitas of India. then proceed to Shillong. also called \'Scotland of the East\". Reach the majestic Umium Lake (Barapani). You may do the water sports here (Optional). On arrival at Shillong, check in at your hotel. Evening you can visit Police Bazaar which the biggest local market. Overnight stay in Shillong.  \r\n\r\nDay 02: Shillong- Cherrapunji-Shillong (65 KM)-27 Dec\r\nGet up early today to enjoy the mesmerizing mornings of Shillong. After early breakfast drive to Cherrapunji, this is the wettest place in the world. Visit  Eco Park, Nohkalikai Falls, Nohsngithiang Falls (Seven Sisters Falls), Mawsmai Cave, Evening return to Shillong. Visit Elephant Falls and Shillong Peak for some breath-taking views. Overnight stay in Shillong.  \r\n\r\nDay 03: Shillong-Guwahati-28 Dec\r\nMorning after breakfast drive to Guwahati.Visit Shankardeva Kalakhetra-the heritage centre of Assam, evening you can enjoy a river cruise at river Brahmaputra (Direct payment).Stay overnight at Guwahati.\r\n\r\nDay 04: Guwahati-Departure-29 Dec\r\nToday we have to say goodbye to beautiful North East.You will be dropped at Guwahati airport for onward journey to your hometown. If time permits visit Balaji temple. Tour concludes with memories.\r\n','before 21 Days from Tour Start Date - 50% refund\r\n21- 14 Days from Tour Start Date - 25% refund\r\nWithin 14 days from Tour Start Date - No Refund\r\n','Accommodation on double/Twin Sharing Pick up and drop off as per the itinerary from the respective Airport // Train Station.  \r\nDaily Breakfast and Dinner\r\nVehicle on point-to-point basis as per the itinerary\r\nService of an Experience Driver for Entire Tour            \r\nDriver allowances, toll, parking, fuel etc.\r\n','Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone, tips, gratuity, Food and drinks .\r\nAdditional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary.\r\nCamera fees, Guide / tour escort charges & Entrance Fees \r\nAny cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances, etc (to be borne by the client, which is directly payable on the spot) .\r\nAny increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure \r\nInsurance.\r\nAnything which is not include in the inclusion // itinerary\r\n','','2022-12-26','2022-12-29',1,0,0,'2022-12-06 14:41:27','2022-12-06 14:41:27'),(209,557,15783,6,2,0,103500,19000,'Rajasthan Adventure','2N Jaisalmer - 1N Jaisalmer Camp - 1N Jodhpur\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrive Jaisalmer \r\nArrive Jaisalmer, late evening. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Jaisalmer \r\nAfter breakfast visit Gadisar Lake & Vyas Chhatri, Salim Singh ki Haveli, Badal Vilas and Wood Fossil Parkshopping etc. Overnight at Hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 03 : Jaisalmer â€“ Sand Dunes Camp \r\nAfter breakfast check out, drive to Jaisalmer Sam dunes & enjoy the camel cart ride to the Sunset Point and Sam sand dunes. Take the camel safari and explore the true life and delights of the desert. Immerse in the spirit of Rajasthan all through the night by staying in the Tents, meeting warm rustic people of Rajasthan and have a touch of their culture with their haunting music, folk dance and singing performances and other cultural programs. Overnight stay at the Tents on SAM Sandunes in Jaisalmer.\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Jaisalmer - Jodhpur \r\nToday morning after breakfast check out & drive to Jodhpur, you can enjoy the glimmering Sunrise of Jodhpur that is incredibly famous. You will be given a healthy breakfast that will provide you with the energy you need to last a complete day of exploration and expedition. In the 2nd day tour, you will have a lot of places to visit and a lot of new things and experiences that you must have. Jodhpur is also regarded as the Sun City along with Blue City because the people of Jodhpur enjoy sunny and bright weather. You can have a few hours of rest before you begin to explore the Sun City and the Marvel of the Sun City like Mehrangarh Fort visit Mehrangarh fort  and After that you may visit Jaswant Thada The memorial is made out of milky-white marble that sits on the top of a small lake which is located 1km northeast of Mehrangarh Fort. The cenotaph was built back in 1899 is comprised of beautifully carved-marble lattice jails, and there are also many portraits of the Rathore rulers that dates back to the 13th Century. Stay at Jodhpur.\r\n\r\nDay 05 : Tour Ends - drop\r\nAfter breakfast, check out from the Hotel & you will be transferred to the airport/railway station so that you can catch your flight to onward destinationâ€¦ TOUR END!!!','','Ã¼ Accommodation using on Twin sharing basis \r\nÃ¼ Daily breakfast\r\nÃ¼ Breakfast and dinner in Jaisalmer Camp\r\nÃ¼ Sightseeing as per the itinerary\r\nÃ¼ All transfer and sightseeing by AC vehicle 09 Seater Tempo Traveller\r\nÃ¼ All interstate taxes, permits, parking, road taxes, toll taxes, fuel charges, etc\r\nÃ¼ GST included','Ã¼  All kinds of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills, and beverages.\r\nÃ¼  Monument entry fees\r\nÃ¼  It also does not include any meals other than the mentioned ones in the inclusions. \r\nÃ¼  Optional suggested or unspecified activities.\r\nÃ¼  Camera fee (still or movie)','The rates are valid till 14th December, 2022.','2023-01-07','2023-01-11',0,0,0,'2022-12-12 15:40:40','2022-12-12 15:40:40'),(210,558,15510,2,0,0,50200,17500,'Thailand Adventure','2N Krabi - 3N Phuket\r\n\r\n','','* Delhi - Phuket and Phuket - Delhi Airfare\r\n* 02 Nights Stay Krabi\r\n* 03 Nights Stay Phuket\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Transfers from Phuket Airport to Krabi Hotel â€“ PVT\r\n* Transfers from Krabi Hotel to Phuket Hotel â€“ PVT\r\n* Transfers from Phuket Hotel to Phuket Airport â€“ PVT\r\n* Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat + Picnic Lunch â€“ SIC (Excl. the National Park Admission Fee THB 400 PP)\r\n* Half-Day Phuket City Tour â€“ SIC\r\n* Full Day Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat with Local Lunch on SIC (Excl. National Marine Park Fee THB 400 PP)\r\n* Insurance','* Entry fee to any monument \r\n* Meals other than those mentioned above\r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions','The rates are valid till 16th December, 2022.','2023-02-11','2023-02-16',1,0,0,'2022-12-13 22:38:41','2022-12-14 08:48:11'),(211,562,349,2,0,0,0,0,'Dubai Adventure','5N/6D stay in Dubai ','','* Delhi-Dubai and Dubai-Delhi Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Pick and drop for airport\r\n* 5 nights accommodation in the mentioned hotel/resort\r\n* Daily breakfast\r\n* Burj Khalifa SIC\r\n* Desert  safari SIC\r\n* Marina dhow cruise SIC\r\n* Abu  Dhabi city tour SIC\r\n* Dubai city tour SIC\r\n* All transfers on the above-mentioned basis\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Guide Fee\r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in inclusions','The rates are valid till 18th December, 2022','2023-02-11','2023-02-16',1,0,0,'2022-12-15 14:12:22','2022-12-15 14:19:35'),(212,563,349,2,1,0,0,0,'Dubai Adventure','6N/7D stay in Dubai ','','* Delhi-Dubai and Dubai-Delhi Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Pick and drop for airport\r\n* 6 nights accommodation in the mentioned hotel/resort\r\n* Daily breakfast\r\n* Burj Khalifa SIC\r\n* Desert  safari SIC\r\n* Marina dhow cruise SIC\r\n* Abu  Dhabi city tour SIC\r\n* Dubai city tour SIC\r\n* All transfers on the above-mentioned basis\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Guide Fee\r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in inclusions','The rates are valid till 18th December, 2022','2023-02-18','2023-02-24',1,0,0,'2022-12-15 16:28:51','2022-12-15 16:28:51'),(213,564,16002,2,0,0,0,0,'Marvellous Bali','4N/5D stay in Bali - 3N Kuta and 2N Ubud\r\n\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary,\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 1: Bali - Kuta\r\nWelcome to Indonesia. Arrive at Denpasar airport and transfer to hotel for check in at hotel. Rest of the evening is free for leisure. Overnight stay in Kuta.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2: Kuta - Benoa beach watersports - Tanah Lot Temple Tour\r\nAfter breakfast, proceed for Benoa beach tour including 1 x round of Banana boat, Parasailing, and Jet Ski (subject to weather condition). Later proceed to visit Tanah Lot temple. It is most popular and photographed temple on the island. Tanah lot temple is in rock formation, quite appropriate considering its spectacular setting on top of an impressive rock overlooking the sea. Overnight stay in Kuta.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 3: Kuta - Leisure\r\nOne can enjoy full day visit to Bali safari & Marine Park with Jungle Hopper pass with Private transfers at an additional cost (Approx. INR 5800 per person)\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 4: Kuta - Full day Kintamani Volcano Tour with Ubud Village Tour - Ubud\r\nAfter breakfast check out from the hotel & proceed for full day Kintamani volcano tour. The highlight of this tour is the magnificent view of Mount & Lake Batur with the smoky Agung Volcano in the background, enroute stops at Singapadu village to see the Barong & Keris dance performance, celuk the center of gold and silver works, Mas the center of woodcarving, Ubud the center of Balinese painting, Goa Gajah (Elephant Cave) and the holy springs of Tirtha Empul at tampaksiring. Later check in at hotel in Ubud. Overnight stay in Ubud.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5: Ubud - 02 Hours of Authentic Balinese Massage - Uluwatu sunset temple Tour with Kecak dance\r\nToday morning after breakfast proceed to indulge in authentic Balinese massage. You will get to try the taste of natural traditional Balinese treatment. Later in the evening proceed to Uluwatu Sunset Tour. The beautiful Uluwatu temple, built on the top of a cliff about 825 feet high facing the vast deep blue Indian Ocean, and catch a wonderful view of sunset, Post sunset witness the Kecak and Fire Dance - Completely dramatic. Originally from Ramayana this show depicts the famous â€˜Lanka Dahanâ€™ episode wherein Hanuman sets fire to the kingdom of Ravana. The enthralling â€˜kecak, kecakâ€™ chant is the USP. Overnight stay in Ubud.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6: Ubud - Departure\r\nAfter breakfast itâ€™s time to check out. Transfer to the airport for your onward flight or back home. ','','* Airfare and taxes\r\n* 3 Nights accommodation in Kuta Bali \r\n* 2 Nights accommodation in Ubud Bali\r\n* Meals: Breakfast\r\n* Benoa water sports including 1 x round of Banana boat, Parasailing, and Jet ski followed by Tanah lot temple tour \r\n* Full-day Kintamani Volcano Tour with Ubud Village\r\n* 02 Hours of Authentic Balinese Massage followed by Uluwatu sunset temple Tour including Kecak dance\r\n* Return airport transfers\r\n* All sightseeing & transfers on a private basis\r\n* Travel Insurance','* Visa charges\r\n* Any up gradation in the hotel room category\r\n* Any meals other than those specified above\r\n* Any sightseeing other than that mentioned above\r\n* Any Entrance fees or Fees for video or camera permit\r\n* Any item of personal nature like tips, laundry, telephone calls, etc.','The rates are valid till 21st December, 2022','2023-02-14','2023-02-19',1,0,0,'2022-12-16 15:41:25','2022-12-17 14:25:56'),(214,565,349,2,1,0,0,0,'Dubai Adventure','5N/6D stay in Dubai ','','* Delhi-Dubai and Dubai-Delhi Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Pick and drop for airport\r\n* 5 nights accommodation in the mentioned hotel/resort\r\n* Daily breakfast\r\n* Burj Khalifa124th non- prime + DUBAI AQUARIUM AND UNDERWATER ZOO SIC\r\n* Desert  safari with BBQ dinner on SIC\r\n* Marina dhow cruise with Dinner on SIC\r\n* Dubai City tour on SIC\r\n* Dubai Frame SIC\r\n* Abu Dhabi Tour on SIC\r\n* Ferrari World on SIC\r\n* All transfers on the above-mentioned basis\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Guide Fee\r\n* Anything that is not mentio