dhpur reach Jodhpur check to the hotel and Visit market in the evening. Overnight stay at Jodhpur\r\n\r\nDay 6th â€“ 23 March 2023 - Jodhpur Sightseeing - Osian\r\nWake up to a beautiful morning and enjoy your breakfast. Checkout from the hotel and Start your day visit to Suncity from the gigantic Mehrangarh Fort and Jaswant Thada, \r\nMehrangarh Fort is one of the biggest Forts in India which depicts the Bravery, culture and artistic finesse of Kings of Jodhpur. \r\nJaswant Thada is a cenotaph which was built by King Sardar Singh in the memory of King Jaswant Singh.\r\nIn the afternoon, you\'ll head out towards the Sand Dunes where youâ€™ll check into a Tent. Enjoy Camel Ride overlooking a spectacular sunset. You can then enjoy folk performances.\r\nOvernight stay at the Osian tent.\r\n\r\nDay 7th â€“ 24 March 2023- Jodhpur - Drop\r\nHave breakfast & later drive to the Airport with sweet memories of Rajasthan Tour.\r\n','','Accomodation as per details shared.\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nDinner in Osian only. \r\nTransfers and Sight Seeing \r\nDriver\r\n','Parking','','2023-03-18','2023-03-24',0,0,0,'2023-03-09 18:17:24','2023-03-09 18:38:29'),(237,617,1105,3,0,1,27200,4000,'Amazing Rajasthan','Day 1st -18 March 2023- Udaipur Airport to Udaipur - Pickup\r\nArrive at Udaipur. Your driver will meet you and transfer to hotel .Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\nDay 2nd â€“ 19 March 2023- Udaipur - Full Day Sightseeing-\r\nTreat yourself with the Sunrise at the Udaipur and Get ready for the city tour of Lake City â€œUdaipurâ€. Start the day from City Palace which is the great example of Mewar architecture and Embrace the Royalty of the Palace. You can visit the Bagore Ki Haveli which is very ancient and heritage haveli. Visit the Saheliyon ki Bari and Gulab Bagh. Visit the Pichola Lake which is nearby the City Palace. Evening visits the Monsoon Palace to view the panoramic view of a city. You can also visit the Sajjangarh Wildlife Reserve. Seek Blessings at Jagdish Temple. Ove