3 - Thursday): Arrival Chennai - Tirupathi\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Arrival Chennai - Tirupathi\r\nOn arrival at the Chennai airport/railway station, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and afterwards to transfer you to Tirupati. Tirupati is a city in the Indian state of Andhra Pradesh. Its Sri Venkateswara Temple sits atop one of the the 7 peaks of Tirumala Hills, attracting scores of Hindu pilgrims. Sri Venkateswara National Park, home to the temple, also contains the Sri Venkateswara Zoological Park with lions and primates. Nearby, next to a waterfall and cave believed to be sacred, Sri Kapileswara Swamy Temple is dedicated to Lord Shiva. Check in at the hotel and the rest of the day is free at leisure. During your free time, you can walk out to explore the surroundings, interact with locals, visit local markets or stay back in hotel to take pleasure of its modern amenities. Overnight stay at resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 2(28 Apr 2023 - Friday): Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nMorning after breakfast local sightseeing of temples in Tirupati including Sri Govindarajaswami Temple, Kapila Theertham, Padmavati Temple, Trimala (Tirupati Balaji) Temple Akash Ganga & Paap Vinashni Temple. Overnight at the Resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3(29 Apr 2023 - Saturday): Chennai Departure\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Chennai Departure\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Chennai international Airport/Railway station for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories.','','Delhi-Tirupati-Delhi Airfare\r\nMeal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\nAccommodation on Twin