terfall and cave believed to be sacred, Sri Kapileswara Swamy Temple is dedicated to Lord Shiva. Check in at the hotel and the rest of the day is free at leisure. During your free time, you can walk out to explore the surroundings, interact with locals, visit local markets or stay back in hotel to take pleasure of its modern amenities. Overnight stay at resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 2(28 Apr 2023 - Friday): Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nMorning after breakfast local sightseeing of temples in Tirupati including Sri Govindarajaswami Temple, Kapila Theertham, Padmavati Temple, Trimala (Tirupati Balaji) Temple Akash Ganga & Paap Vinashni Temple. Overnight at the Resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3(29 Apr 2023 - Saturday): Chennai Departure\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Tirupati Departure\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Tirupati Airport/Railway station for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories.','','Delhi-Tirupati-Delhi Airfare\r\nMeal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\nAccommodation on Twin Sharing Basis\r\nAll Inclusion and sightseeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\nAll Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\nAbove Rate is Inclusive of GST 5%','All those which are not mentioned above\r\nEntry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\nPorterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\nAll Items Of Personal Nature\r\nAny Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\nAny Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\nAyurveda Charges','The rates are valid till 30th March, 2023. Airfare is dynamic.','2023-04-27','2023-04-29',1,0,0,'2023-03-30 19:11:53','2023-03-30 20:04:50'),(257,649,6,3,0,0,24000,7700,'Golden Triangle','1N Jaipur - 1N Agra - 1N Delhi\r\n\r\nDay 1: Delhi-Jaipur\r\nOn Arrival, pick-up from the airport and drive to Jaipur. Check-in at the hotel and Explore historical places like Amer Fort, Hawa Mahal, Jal Mahal and Jantar-Mantar. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2: Jaipur-Agra\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to Agra. Check-in at the hotel and visit Taj Mahal, Red Fort and Fatehpur Sikri. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Agra-Delhi\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive back to Delhi. Check-in at the hotel. As per time availability, choose any 2 or 3 places to visit out of Red Fort, Jama Masjid, Connaught Place, and Humayun Tomb followed by shopping at Janpath and Palika Bazaar.\r\n\r\nDay 4: After breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to airport. Trip ends here with beautiful memories. ','','* Hotel accommodation at Delhi, Jaipur and Agra.\r\n* Daily breakfast\r\n* Sedan Car (Swift Dezire) for all transfers and sightseeing. \r\n* Parking and Toll Charges\r\n','* Guide Charges\r\n* Any other meal other than mentioned above.\r\n* Any type of personal expenses. \r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions. ','The rates are valid till 25th March, 2023\r\nCar can be upgraded to Innova/Ertiga for Rs. 10500.','2023-04-21','2023-04-24',0,0,0,'2023-04-06 17:36:10','2023-04-06 22:57:25'),(258,650,15498,4,0,0,0,0,'Delhi-Malaysia-Delhi','3 nights stay in Kualalumpur with transfers and sightseeing.','','Delhi-Kualalumpur-Delhi Economy Class Airfare.\r\n03 Nights Accomodation with Breakfast\r\nReturn Kul airport transfers on pvt \r\nKul half day City Tour on pvt \r\nFull Day Genting Highland Day Trip Enroute Batu Caves + 02 Way Cable car Ride on pvt \r\nAll Tours and transfers on pvt basis \r\nTravel Insurance \r\nVisa Charges\r\n\r\n','Any meal other than mention above\r\nAny t