hild\r\n* Sentosa Attractions Ticket (Combo 4 - Cable Car + Sea Aquarium + WOT)\r\n\r\n5th Day (4 Jun)\r\n* Singapore - Airport Departure Transfer (1 PRIVATE COMBI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 4 Nights stay in 4 Star hotels mentioned above\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* All sightseeing and transfers on Pvt/SIC as mentioned above\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa Charges','* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Any type of personal expense like laundary, grooming, souvenir, etc.\r\n* Visa Courier Charges','The rates are valid till 27th April, 2023.','2023-05-31','2023-06-04',0,0,0,'2023-04-25 12:23:46','2023-04-25 12:30:40'),(279,675,117,7,1,0,0,0,'Africa Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n20th Sep: On arrival, meet and greet our representative at the JKIA Airport, short safari briefing and transfer to hotel for overnight stay. \r\n\r\n21st Sep: Breakfast and depart for Aberdare national park, approx 3-4 hrs drive. Arrive at the base hotel in time for lunch, after lunch transfer to the Ark lodge, enjoy an afternoon game drive or view wildlife from the hotel as animals drink from the water hole. \r\n\r\n22nd Sep:  After breakfast, check out and depart to Lake Elementaita, approx 4hrs drive. Lunch on arrival, afternoon at leisure , dinner and overnight stay. \r\n\r\n23rd Sep : Morning tea/coffee, check out and depart for the Masai Mara game reserve, approx 4-5 hrs drive. Enjoy lunch on arrival and later head out for an afternoon game drive at the park, dinner and overnight at the lodge. \r\n\r\n24th & 25th Sep:  Full day game drive at the Masai Mara, dinner and overnight at the park. \r\n\r\n26th Sep:  Breakfast, check out and depart for Nairobi, approx. 6hrs drive. On arrival, transfer to the JKIA Airport in time for your outbound flight. ','','Accommodation as stipulated in the itinerary or similar\r\nPrivate transportation in  4x4 Safari Land Cruiser with pop-up roof for easy game viewing & photography\r\nGame drives as indicated in the itinerary\r\nServices of experienced English-speaking driver-guides\r\nAll Government taxes, parks entrance fees and levies as per itinerary\r\nBottled drinking water while on safari \r\nTransfer to and from the Airport','Activities not mentioned above\r\nTravel & Personal accident insurance\r\nExcursions not detailed in above program\r\nTips & personal expenses such as telephone calls etc.\r\nVisas, travel/baggage insurance, laundry, beverages, tips\r\nOther item(s) not stated as included above','The rates are valid till 2nd May, 2023. Rooms are subject to availability. \r\n\r\n','2023-09-20','2023-09-26',0,0,0,'2023-04-26 00:43:04','2023-04-28 15:09:47'),(280,676,15500,6,1,0,1093000,130000,'Switzerland Diaries','7N Switzerland Stay in 3 star hotel with daily breakfast\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nFrom â€“ To-Lucerne - Interlaken - Zermatt - Zurich or Geneva- Duration : 08 Days\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Swiss Border or Airport â€“ Lucerne\r\n* Travel from any Swiss Border or Airport to the fabulous and quaint city of Lucerne. \r\n* Early afternoon proceed for an excursion to the famous dragon mountain, the Mt. Pilatus. \r\n* In the evening enjoy 1 hour Panoramic Yacht Cruise on Lake Lucerne (Saphir Cruise). \r\n* Overnight in Lucerne.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Lucerne\r\n* Morning proceed to Engelberg and then for an excursion to Mt. Titlis including the Ice flyer c \r\n  chairlift. \r\n* Evening is free at leisure to explore the city on your own. \r\n* Overnight in Lucerne.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Lucerne â€“ Interlaken\r\n* Travel to Interlaken on the Interlaken-Lucerne Express. \r\n* Afternoon visit the Mt. Schilthorn to enjoy the panoramic view of the James Bond Mountain. You may \r\n  enjoy a coffee at the famous revolving restaurant (on own expense). \r\n* Overnight in Interlaken.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : Interlaken\r\n* Today morning walk down to the Interlaken Ost station for an exciting excursion of Jungfraujoch â€“ \r\n  Top of Europe. It is one of the highest peaks in Europe, here you may spend the whole day with \r\n  different activities. \r\n* Overnight in Interlaken.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Interlaken â€“ Zermatt\r\n* Travel to Zermatt by train. \r\n* Rest of the day is free at leisure to explore this car free town by foot or by horse carriage. \r\n* Overnight in Zermatt.\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Zermatt\r\n* Take a trip to the Matterhorn Glacier Paradise. \r\n* Overnight in Zermatt.\r\n\r\nDay 7 : Zermatt â€“ Zurich or Geneva\r\n* Travel by train from Zermatt to Zurich or Geneva. \r\n* The rest of the afternoon is free to explore the city on your own using the Swiss Pass or proceed \r\n  for an optional half day city tour. \r\n* Overnight in Zurich or Geneva\r\n\r\nDay 8 : Depart Zurich or Geneva\r\n* Depart Zurich or Geneva to any Swiss Border or Airport for your train or flight to the next destination.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHotel Used : 3 Star\r\n\r\nLucerne:    Ambassador or Drei Konige or Similar; \r\nInterlaken: Chalet Swiss or Central Continental or Crystal or Similar; \r\nZermatt:    Adonis Hotel or Similar; \r\nZurich:     Hotel Bristol Zurich or Ibis Zurich City West or similar\r\nGeneva:     Hotel Kipling or Hotel Bernina Geneva or Similar\r\n','Cancellation policy will be advised at the time of booking. ','* 02 Nights Accommodation in Lucerne\r\n* 02 Nights Accommodation in Interlaken\r\n* 02 Nights Accommodation in Zermatt\r\n* 01 Night Accommodation in Zurich or Geneva\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Swiss Travel Pass (08 days â€“ 02nd Class)\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n','* Jungfraujoch â€“ Top of Europe\r\n* Mt. Titlis incl iceflyer chairlift ride + glacier park\r\n* Mt. Pilatus\r\n* Matterhorn Glacier Paradise or Gornergrat\r\n* Mt. Schilthorn â€“ Piz Gloria\r\n* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Any type of personal expense like laundary, grooming, souvenir, etc.\r\n* Visa Courier Charges\r\n','The rates are valid till 30th April, 2023. Rates are subject to change without prior notice and subject to availability. Rates are not valid during fair periods & blockout dates, when supplement costs will be applicable on the package. ','2023-06-18','2023-06-24',0,0,0,'2023-04-26 12:47:00','2023-04-26 15:48:36'),(281,677,6,1,0,0,12200,5000,'Delhi and Agra Diaries','Day 1: Delhi-Agra\r\nPick-up from the Hotel and drive to Agra and visit Taj Mahal and Red Fort.\r\nDrive back to in the evening.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Delhi-Gurugram \r\nPick-up from the Hotel and drive to TATTVA Wellness and Spa Center (Gurugram).\r\n\r\nSpa Details:\r\n\r\nDeep Tissue Massage\r\nDate:2023-05-01\r\nTime:12:00 PM-1:00 PM\r\nDuration:60','','* Honda Amaze or Hyundai Accent for all transfers and sightseeing.\r\n* Parking and Toll Charges\r\n* Massage Therapies','* Guide Charges\r\n* Any type of personal expenses.\r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions.','','2023-04-29','2023-05-01',0,0,0,'2023-04-26 18:16:26','2023-04-26 18:28:16'),(282,678,329,4,0,0,0,0,'Kuala Lumpur Diaries','04 Nights Stay â€“ Kuala Lumpur â€“ 01 June to 05 June 2023 ','','04 Nights Stay in KUL \r\nDaily Breakfast \r\nReturn Airport Transfers â€“ PVT \r\nHalf Day Kul City Tour + KL Tower â€“ SIC \r\nGenting Highland Tour + 02 Ways Cable Car + Batu Caves (Photo Stop) â€“ SIC \r\nSunway Lagoon Theme Park + SIC Transfers \r\nTravel Insurance\r\nVisa Charges','* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Any type of personal expense like laundary, grooming, souvenir, etc.\r\n* TCS','The rates are valid till 30th April, 2023. The air fare is dynamic','2023-05-31','2023-06-05',1,0,0,'2023-04-27 18:18:28','2023-04-27 18:36:34'),(283,679,16002,4,0,0,0,0,'Bali-Indonesia','6 Nights Bali Stay with transfers and sightseeing.\r\nHotel: 5 nights In Grand Ixora/ 1 Night in Ayana Resort\r\n\r\nTentative Itinerary:\r\n \r\n15th June - Arrival\r\n16th June - Bali safari & Marine park with Jungle hopper on pvt\r\n17th June - Garuda Wisnu Kencana Cultural Park + Bird Park on pvt \r\n18th June - Kintamani  Tour with ubud on pvt\r\n19th June - Mengiat Beach +  Bali Hai Cruise on pvt \r\n20th June -  Full Day Tour Tanjung Glass bottom with Turtle Island with Tanah Lot on pvt basis\r\n21st June - Check out\r\n\r\n','','Delhi-Bali-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n06 Nights Accommodation on BB Basis\r\n06 Dinners in an Indian Restaurant\r\nMeet & Greet assistance at the airport\r\nReturn Airport & Inter Hotel transfer by Pvt Basis\r\nTransfers with air-conditioned vehicle\r\nEnglish-speaking driver cum guide assistance\r\nTanah lot temple\r\nBali safari & Marine park with Jungle hopper\r\nFull Day Tour Tanjung Glass bottom with Turtle Island\r\nGaruda Wisnu Kencana Cultural Park\r\nBali Hai Cruise\r\nBird park \r\nKintamani with Ubud tour\r\nMengiat Beach\r\nTravel Insurance','Toll tax not included in the package cost - Mandara Toll Road to Nusa Dua\r\nAny meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny surcharge at the hotel (Mini bar, Visiter fee ect.)\r\nOther personal expenses\r\nSurcharge for peak season if any (Upon booking) \r\nExpenditure of a personal nature such as drinks, souvenirs and laundry\r\nAny cost not mentioned in the â€˜Cost Includesâ€™ section\"\r\nTCS','The rates are valid till 15th April, 2023. Airfare is dynamic.','2023-06-15','2023-06-21',1,0,0,'2023-04-28 08:45:22','2023-04-28 08:45:22'),(284,682,15518,2,1,0,0,0,'Kerala Diaries ','5N/6D Kerala Stay in 3/4 star hotel with daily breakfast and dinner\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (23 May 2023 - Tuesday) Cochin - Munnar(Arrival)\r\n\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Cochin - Munnar(Arrival)\r\nOn arrival at the Cochin airport/railway station, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and afterwards to transfer you to your already booked hotel in Munnar Proceed to Munnar. Visit Cheeyapara and Valara water falls on the way to Munnar. Through out the journey enjoy beautiful streams small waterfalls, Rubber, Pepper cardamom and Tea plantations and thick forests; God has blessed his own country with incomparable beauty on arrival at Munnar check in to Hotel.\r\n \r\nOvernight stay in Hotel/resort.\r\nThe Whispering Meadows (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\nAmuse Vista Resorts and Spa (Option 2) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2 (24 May 2023 - Wednesday) Munnar Sightseeing \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Amuse Vista Resorts and Spa/The Whispering Meadows\r\nMorning after breakfast proceed to enjoy full day sight seeing tour of Munnar. Rose Garden, Tea Garden, Photo Point, Madupetty Dam/Lake, Echo Point & Kundala Dam/Lake.\r\n \r\nOvernight stay in Hotel/resort.\r\nThe Whispering Meadows (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\nAmuse Vista Resorts and Spa (Option 2) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 3 (25 May 2023 - Thursday) Munnar - Thekkady\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Amuse Vista Resorts and Spa/The Whispering Meadows\r\nTransfers - Munnar - Thekkady\r\nMorning after breakfast check out from the hotel and transfer to Thekkady .Thekkady is a world famous wildlife sanctuary and it is also called as Periyar. On arrival check in at Hotel. Afternoon visit wildlife sanctuary & enjoy the boating ( tickets charges are extra and subject to availability ). Visit spice plantations. Apart from being enjoyable these plantation tours gives tourists an insight into the growing, harvesting and processing of spices. Evening will be free for Cultural show ( Kathakali & Kalaripayattu on direct payment ) & local shopping.Overnight stay at Thekkady.\r\n\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel \r\nPeriyar Meadows Leisure Hotels (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\nSpicegrove (Option 2) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 4 (26 May 2023 - Friday) Thekkady to Alleppey\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Spicegrove/Periyar Meadows Leisure Hotels\r\nTransfers - Thekkady to Alleppey\r\nMorning after breakfast leave for Alleppey, Allappuza famous for its backwaters. Visit Alleppey beach, sunset and enjoy shopping if staying in Alleppey. Visit Alleppey Beach and Backwaters. Enjoy all the amenities of this hotel/resort for a day which includes fishing in the backwaters (depends on the hotel/resort selected) Overnight stay at same hotel/resort\"\r\n\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel \r\nPagoda Resort (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\nOxygen Resort Alleppey (Option 2) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 (27 May 2023 - Saturday) Alleppey Day 02\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Oxygen Resort Alleppey/Pagoda Resort\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Alleppey Day 02\r\nAfter Breakfast Proceed to Sight seeing in Alleppey.Visit Crystal Museum, Alleppey Beach and Jain Temple. Overnight stay at Alleppey.\r\n\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel\r\nPagoda Resort (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\nOxygen Resort Alleppey (Option 2) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6 (28 May 2023 - Sunday) Alleppey -Cochin departure transfer\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Oxygen Resort Alleppey/Pagoda Resort\r\nDeparture Transfer - Alleppey -Cochin departure transfer\r\nAfter breakfast check out from the hotel and Transferred to Cochin Airport / Railway station for the for the departure.\r\n\r\n','','* Delhi-Cochin-Delhi Economy Class airfare\r\n* 5 Nights stay in 3/4 Star hotels/resorts mentioned above\r\n* Daily Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* All sightseeings and transfers\r\n* All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n\r\n','* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Any type of personal expense like laundary, grooming, souvenir, etc.\r\n* Entry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\n* Any Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\n* Only Non Ac Rooms Are Provided In Munnar And Thekkady As They Are Hill Stations\r\n* Any Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\n\r\n','The rates are valid till 7th May, 2023. The air fare is dynamic','2023-05-23','2023-05-28',1,0,0,'2023-05-04 12:30:13','2023-05-04 18:44:04'),(285,683,126,4,0,0,19400,17600,'Jaipur and Agra Diaries','1N Jaipur - 1N Agra\r\n\