Flag certified â€œRadha Nagar Beachâ€ for swim and relaxation.\r\n* Do not forget to carry changing cloths and towel\r\n* Itâ€™s not permitted to board vehicle with wet cloths, please cooperate.\r\n* Make your own choiceâ€¦. You can opt for Scuba Diving/ Kayaking/ Candid Photography at additional cost, booking in advance is recommended though our local representative also can assist you.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Havelock â€“ Elephenta Beach\r\nHavelock Island\r\n* Morning, Breakfast and proceed for â€œElephenta Beachâ€ also known as Coral Beach.\r\n* Elephenta beach is popular for Snorkelling and other water-based activities such as Jet Ski ride,\r\nBanana Ride, Sea Walk.\r\n* Usually boat operators provide a 5-minute snorkelling experience complimentary, however the\r\nsame cannot be guaranteed\r\n* You reach Elephenta beach via small 11 pax capacity sharing basis boat board at jetty\r\n* You will be allotted a time for boat a day before and you need to get ready accordingly\r\n* Do not forget to carry a water bottle, snacks and changing cloths.\r\n* Important: In case Elephenta Beach is not operational due to weather conditions OR COVID-19 reasons, we will provide a trip to â€œKala Patthar Beachâ€ OR We can refund the applicable amount.\r\n\r\nDay 4: Havelock â€“ Port Blair- Day at leisure\r\nPort Blair\r\n* Breakfast, check out and proceed for jetty and onward journey to Port Blair\r\n* Arrival in Port Blair, Transfer to your booked hotel, Day free for shopping/ leisure.\r\n* Other places like Corbinâ€™s Cove Beach/ Chidiya Tapu/ Wandoor Beach/ Museums & Parks can be\r\ncovered at additional cost subject to time and availability (Optional)\r\n\r\nDay 5: Port Blair-North Bay (Coral Island) â€“ Ross Island\r\nPort Blair\r\n* Morning Breakfast, Pickup to water sports complex and board the speed boat\r\n* The historic Ross Island will take you through the era of Japanese and British period\r\n* An entry amount of Rs. 50 for adult and Rs. 25 for child is directly payable at the Island\r\n* North Bay Island is also known as Coral Beach is popular for water-based adventure activities\r\nsuch as Scuba Diving, Snorkelling, Para Sailings, Dolphin Glass Bottom Boat ride, Coral SafariSemi submarine etc.\r\n* In case â€œRoss & Northâ€ not operational due to bad weather conditions or Covid-19 reason, we shall arrange alternative sightseeing, or we will process applicable refund amount\r\n* Evening, you can (Optional- Direct Payment basis) plan Corbinâ€™s Cove Beach, you can experience enthralling Sea Kart boat ride first time in India.\r\n\r\nTour Ends But Sweet Memories Remains Always','','* Mumbai-Port Blair-Mumbai Economy class airfare\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Sightseeing as per itinerary\r\n* All Monuments, Museums, Cultural Events, and activities fees as per itinerary\r\n* Return airport/ jetty Transfers in AC vehicle as per itinerary\r\n* All Transportation for local sight-seeing tours by AC Vehicle as per itinerary.\r\n* Cruise transfers Port Blair â€“Neil Island - Havelock â€“ Port Blair by private ferry Subject to\r\navailability (base category)','* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Expenditure of a personal nature such as drinks, souvenirs and laundry\r\n* Other personal expenses','The airfare is dynamic and subject to change.','2023-06-06','2023-06-11',1,0,0,'2023-05-18 14:45:05','2023-05-18 19:04:34'),(295,697,2841,2,1,0,0,0,'Port Blair Diaries','5 Nights / 6 Days | 3 Nights Port Blair/ 2 Nights Havelock Island\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Arrival â€“ Port Blair â€“ Cellular Jail - Light & Sound Show\r\nPort Blair\r\n* Arrival, Meet-Greet with our airport representative and Transfer to your booked hotel/ resort\r\n* Evening, visit to historic Cellular Jail followed by Light & Sound Show\r\n* Please note, we will drop guest at parking area near jail and guest must walk around 200 metre\r\nand return after completion of L&S show.\r\n* Guest has to come out after visiting jail and re-enter for L&S show, Guests