ast, check out and proceed for jetty and onward journey to Port Blair\r\n* Arrival in Port Blair, Transfer to your booked hotel, Day free for shopping/ leisure.\r\n* Other places like Corbinâ€™s Cove Beach/ Chidiya Tapu/ Wandoor Beach/ Museums & Parks can be\r\ncovered at additional cost subject to time and availability (Optional)\r\n\r\nDay 5: Port Blair-North Bay (Coral Island) â€“ Ross Island\r\nPort Blair\r\n* Morning Breakfast, Pickup to water sports complex and board the speed boat\r\n* The historic Ross Island will take you through the era of Japanese and British period\r\n* An entry amount of Rs. 50 for adult and Rs. 25 for child is directly payable at the Island\r\n* North Bay Island is also known as Coral Beach is popular for water-based adventure activities\r\nsuch as Scuba Diving, Snorkelling, Para Sailings, Dolphin Glass Bottom Boat ride, Coral SafariSemi submarine etc.\r\n* In case â€œRoss & Northâ€ not operational due to bad weather conditions or Covid-19 reason, we shall arrange alternative sightseeing, or we will process applicable refund amount\r\n* Evening, you can (Optional- Direct Payment basis) plan Corbinâ€™s Cove Beach, you can experience enthralling Sea Kart boat ride first time in India.\r\n\r\nTour Ends But Sweet Memories Remains Always','','* Delhi-Port Blair-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Sightseeing as per itinerary\r\n* All Monuments, Museums, Cultural Events, and activities fees as per itinerary\r\n* Return airport/ jetty Transfers in AC vehicle as per itinerary\r\n* All Transportation for local sight-seeing tours by AC Vehicle as per itinerary.\r\n* Cruise transfers Port Blair â€“Neil Island - Havelock â€“ Port Blair by private ferry Subject to\r\navailability (base category)\r\n\r\n','* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Expenditure of a personal nature such as drinks, souvenirs and laundry\r\n* Other personal expenses','The airfare is dynamic and subject to change.','2023-06-25','2023-06-30',1,0,0,'2023-05-18 16:00:18','2023-05-18 16:00:40'),(297,698,15526,2,0,0,0,0,'Kashmir Diaries','6 Nights / 7 Days | 4N Srinagar / 2N Pahalgam\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDAY 1  ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDAY 2  SONMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDAY 3  GULMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDAY 4  CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (2 NIGHTS STAY)\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. Day at leisure. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam. \r\n\r\nDAY 5 EXPLORING CHANDANWARI, BETAB VALLEY, AND ARU VALLEY\r\nAfter a satisfying breakfast, enjoy a leisurely day at your own pace. Take the time to relax and indulge in various activities of your choice. Later, return to your comfortable hotel in Pahalgam for an overnight stay.\r\n\r\nRecommendation (At own cost)) :-     \r\n* Visit Chandanwari, Betab Valley, and Aru Valley \r\n* These destinations offer picturesque meadows and stunning scenery\r\n* They serve as starting points for treks to Liddarwat, Kolahoi Glacier, and Tarsar Lake\r\n* Overnight stay at a hotel in Pahalgam\r\n\r\nDAY 6  CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. You can enjoy Shikara Ride on  lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDAY 7  CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.\r\n\r\nTour Ends But Sweet Memories Remains Always','','* 06 Nights sty in above mentioned hotel \r\n* Daily Breakfast & dinner at hotel.\r\n* Shikara ride.\r\n* Airport/station pick-up and drop facility as confirmed by the travelers. \r\n* Sightseeing by AC Etios (the AC will not operate in hill area)\r\n* Driver Allowances.\r\n* Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n* Hotel Taxes\r\n','* Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n* Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n* Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances. \r\n* Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n* Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n* Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc. \r\n* The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of \r\n  heavy snow. \r\n* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Expenditure of a personal nature such as drinks, souvenirs and laundry\r\n* Other personal expenses','The airfare is dynamic and subject to change.','2023-06-24','2023-06-30',1,0,0,'2023-05-18 16:38:46','2023-05-19 21:42:17'),(299,701,33,3,0,0,0,0,'Hong Kong Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (26 Jun 2023 - Monday)\r\n\r\nArrive Hong Kong. Meet and Greet at Airport\r\nTransfer to Hotel and check in ( 1400 hrs - subject to availability)\r\nProceed for Sightseeing of Hong Kong - Visit to Stanley beach and Repluse Bay.  Repulse Bay is a bay in the southern part of Hong Kong Island. It is one of the most expensive residential areas in Hong Kong. \r\nVisit The Peak - with one way peak tram ride. Visit the Sky Terrace and Madame Tussauds. Enjoy panoramic view of Hong Kong from the highest point.  Proceed to TST clock tower to view Symphony of the lights show\r\nGuide Service for Sightseeing\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 2 (27 Jun 2023 - Tuesday)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at Hotel\r\n2 Way Transfers to Disneyland ( Open on 27 June due to public holidays)\r\nEntry Ticket to Disneyland- day 01 of 2 day pass\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 3 (28 Jun 2023 - Wednesday)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at Hotel\r\n2 Way Transfers to Disneyland \r\nEntry Ticket to Disneyland- day 02 of 2 day pass\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 4 (29 Jun 2023 - Thrusday)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at Hotel\r\n2 Way Transfers to Ocean Park\r\nEntry Ticket to ocean park\r\n2 Way Standard Cabin Ticket\r\nOvernight stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 5 (30 Jun 2023 - Friday)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at Hotel\r\nLantau Island with 2 Way CC Ride at Ngong Ping 360 Tour\r\n2 Way Standard Cabin Ticket\r\nOvernight stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 6 (01 Jul 2023 - Saturday)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at Hotel\r\nTransfers from Hong Kong Hotel to Airport','','* Economy class return airfare\r\n* 05 nights hotel accommodation in Hong Kong as listed above with Buffet Breakfast\r\n* All transfers and Sightseeing by Van on private basis\r\n* Hong Kong City tour Sightseeing will be accompanied by Local English speaking guide.\r\n* All Entrance fees for all attractions as per itinerary.\r\n* Travel Insurance','* Guaranteed early check in or late check out.\r\n* Tips and porter-age\r\n* Meals other than specified in the itinerary.  \r\n* Sightseeing tours are not included\r\n* Any expenses of personal nature\r\n* Any services not mentioned in the inclusions list\r\n* Visa\r\n','The rates are subject to change','2023-06-25','2023-07-01',1,0,0,'2023-05-19 18:29:16','2023-05-26 14:35:38'),(300,704,680,3,0,0,0,0,'Mysore Diaries','Mysore: 1 Nights, Coorg: 2 Nights, Ooty: 2 Nights, Kodaikanal: 2 Nights, Madurai: 1 Nights, Rameswaram: 2 Nights, Kanyakumari: 1 Nights (11 N/ 12 D)\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (14 Jun 2023 - Wednesday): Bangalore Arrival to Mysore\r\n* Meet & Assist on arrival at Bangalore Airport.\r\n* Transfer from Bangalore to Mysore.\r\n* Check into Hotel Rio Meridian in Mysore.\r\n* Explore attractions such as Mysore Palace, Devaraja Market, Chamundeshwari Temple, Lalitha Mahal Palace, etc.\r\n* Visit Mysore Zoo, Jaganmohan Palace, Melody World Wax Museum, and Chamundi Hills.\r\n* Don\'t miss a visit to the beautiful Brindavan Gardens.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Rio Meridian.\r\n\r\nDay 2 (15 Jun 2023 - Thursday): Mysore to Coorg\r\n* Enjoy breakfast at Hotel Rio Meridian.\r\n* Transfer from Mysore to Coorg.\r\n* Check into Hotel Ministers kourt Coorg.\r\n* Explore the stunning hill views and natural beauty of Coorg.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Ministers kourt Coorg.\r\n\r\nDay 3 (16 Jun 2023 - Friday): Coorg Sightseeing Day 1\r\n* Have breakfast at Hotel Ministers kourt Coorg.\r\n* Go sightseeing in Kodagu (Coorg).\r\n* Visit Madikeri Fort, Omkareshwara Temple, Raja\'s Tomb, and Abbi Falls.\r\n* Enjoy your time in Kodagu.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Ministers kourt Coorg.\r\n\r\nDay 4 (17 Jun 2023 - Saturday): Coorg to Ooty\r\n* Enjoy breakfast at Hotel Ministers kourt Coorg.\r\n* Check out from the hotel and proceed to Ooty.\r\n* On arrival, check into Hotel Vinayaga Inn by Poppys.\r\n* In the afternoon, visit Ooty Lake and Botanical Garden.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Vinayaga Inn by Poppys.\r\n\r\nDay 5 (18 Jun 2023 - Sunday): Ooty Sightseeing Day 2\r\n* Have breakfast at Hotel Vinayaga Inn by Poppys.\r\n* Proceed to Coonoor for sightseeing.\r\n* Visit Sim\'s Park, Lam\'s Rock, Dolphin Nose, Tea Factory, and Doddabetta Peak.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Vinayaga Inn by Poppys.\r\n\r\nDay 6 (19 Jun 2023 - Monday): Ooty to Kodaikanal\r\n* Enjoy breakfast at Hotel Vinayaga Inn by Poppys.\r\n* Check out from the hotel and proceed to Kodaikanal.\r\n* Visit Green Valley View, Pillar Rocks, Dolphin\'s Nose, Murugan Temple, and Pillar Rocks in Kodaikanal.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Apple Valley, Kodaikanal.\r\n\r\nDay 7 (20 Jun 2023 - Tuesday): Kodaikanal Sightseeing Day 2\r\n* Have breakfast at Hotel Apple Valley, Kodaikanal.\r\n* Go sightseeing in Kodaikanal.\r\n* Visit attractions like Pillar Rocks, Bear-Shola Falls, Bryant Park, and Kodai Lake.\r\n* Enjoy the beautiful sights and serene surroundings.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Apple Valley, Kodaikanal.\r\n\r\nDay 8 (21 Jun 2023 - Wednesday): Kodaikanal to Madurai\r\n* Enjoy breakfast at Hotel Apple Valley, Kodaikanal.\r\n* Check out from the hotel and drive to Madurai.\r\n* On arrival, check into Hotel President Madurai.\r\n* In the afternoon, visit Meenakshi Temple and Tirumalai Nayak Palace.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel President Madurai.\r\n\r\nDay 9 (22 Jun 2023 - Thursday): Madurai to Rameshwaram via Dhanushkodi\r\n* Have breakfast at Hotel President Madurai.\r\n* Check out from the hotel and proceed towards Rameshwaram via Dhanushkodi.\r\n* Enjoy leisure time and explore the town.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Vinayaga by Poppys.\r\n\r\nDay 10 (23 Jun 2023 - Friday): Rameshwaram Day 2\r\n* Enjoy breakfast at Hotel Vinayaga by Poppys.\r\n* Visit Rameshwaram, a sacred temple town.\r\n* Explore the Ramanathaswamy Temple and other attractions.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel Vinayaga by Poppys.\r\n\r\nDay 11 (24 Jun 2023 - Saturday): Rameshwaram to Kanyakumari\r\n* Have breakfast at Hotel Vinayaga by Poppys.\r\n* Check out from the hotel and proceed to Kanyakumari.\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel The Gopinivas Grand.\r\n\r\nDay 12 (25 Jun 2023 - Sunday):\r\n* Enjoy breakfast at Hotel The Gopinivas Grand.\r\n* Transfer from Kanyakumari to Trivandrum Airport/Railway station for departure.','','* Ahmedabad-Mysore-Ahmedabad Economy class airfare\r\n* Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\n* Accommodation on Twin Sharing Basis\r\n* All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n','* All those which are not mentioned above\r\n* Entry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\n* Porterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\n* All Items Of Personal Nature\r\n* Ayurveda Charges\r\n* All those which are not mentioned above\r\n','The airfare is dynamic and subject to change.','2023-06-14','2023-06-25',1,0,0,'2023-05-20 13:29:54','2023-05-20 15:59:49'),(301,706,15530,2,0,0,0,0,'Port Blair Diaries','5 Nights / 6 Days | 3 Nights Port Blair/ 2 Nights Havelock Island\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Arrival â€“ Port Blair â€“ Cellular Jail - Light & Sound Show\r\nPort Blair\r\n* Arrival, Meet-Greet with our airport representative and Transfer to your booked hotel/ resort\r\n* Evening, visit to historic Cellular Jail followed by Light & Sound Show\r\n* Please note, we will drop guest at parking area near jail and guest must walk around 200 me