y as confirmed by the travelers. \r\n* Sightseeing by Non â€“ Ac Innova\r\n* Cost of Shikara Ride.\r\n* Driver Allowances.\r\n* Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry fee at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n* Hotel Taxes\r\n','* Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n* Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n* Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\n* Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n* Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n* Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\n* The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.','','2023-06-25','2023-06-30',1,0,0,'2023-05-26 15:21:41','2023-05-26 15:41:47'),(313,721,33,3,0,0,169000,43050,'Hong Kong Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (26 Jun 2023 - Monday)\r\n* Transfer from Airport to Ferry\r\n* Ferry to Macau\r\n* Transfer to Hotel\r\n* Overnight Stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 2 (27 Jun 2023 - Tuesday)\r\n\r\n* Macau City Tour - ( Ama Temple, Ruins of St Paul Church, Senado Square, Coach View of Macau Tower & Kun Lam Statue) - Max4 Hours\r\n* Overnight Stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 3 (28 Jun 2023 - Wednesday)\r\n\r\n* Transfer to Pier\r\n* Ferry to Hong Kong\r\n* Pickup and Proceed for Victoria Peak, One Way Peak Tram Ride + Old Clock Tower, Victoria Harbour, Night Market - Max 5 Hours\r\n* Overnight Stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 4 (29 Jun 2023 - Thrusday)\r\n\r\n* Ocean park with Return Transfers & entry Ticket\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 5 (30 Jun 2023 - Friday)\r\n\r\n* Disneyland 1-Day Tour with Return Transfers\r\n* Overnight stay at Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 6 (01 Jul 2023 - Saturday)\r\n\r\n* Transfers from Hong Kong Hotel to Airport','','* Economy class return airfare\r\n* Hotel accommodation in Hong Kong and Macua as listed above with Breakfast\r\n* All transfers and Sightseeing\r\n* 