hist site housing a relic of Lord Buddha\'s tooth. Explore the beautiful Royal Botanical Gardens.\r\n\r\nDay 06: Kandy\r\nEnjoy a day of leisure in Kandy. You can visit local markets, relax in scenic spots, or indulge in optional activities like a traditional Ayurvedic spa treatment.\r\n\r\nDay 07: Bentota - Leisure by the Beach / Water Sports Activities\r\nTravel to Bentota, a coastal town known for its pristine beaches. Spend the day relaxing on the beach or engaging in thrilling water sports activities like jet skiing or banana boat rides.\r\n\r\nDay 08: Bentota - Leisure by the Beach / Water Sports Activities\r\nContinue to enjoy the beach and water sports activities in Bentota.\r\n\r\nDay 09: Bentota - Turtle Hatchery / Madu River Boat Ride\r\nVisit a turtle hatchery to learn about conservation efforts and see adorable baby turtles. Take a scenic boat ride along the Madu River.\r\n\r\nDay 10: Bentota - Leisure\r\nRelax and enjoy your last day in Bentota at your own pace.\r\n\r\n\r\nSupplement Costs:\r\n                    \r\n\r\nPinnawala Elephant Orphanage (US $12 net Rate per person)\r\nTemple of the Tooth Relic (US $10 net Rate per person)\r\nRoyal Botanical Gardens (US $14 net Rate per person)\r\nTurtle Hatchery (US $05 net Rate per person)\r\nMadu River Boat Ride (US $09 net Rate per person)\r\n03 Activity Water sports in Bentota (US $22 net Rate per person)\r\n','','* Accommodation at the above mentioned hotels or similar \r\n* Daily breakfast & dinner at the hotel \r\n* Meet & Assist at the airport \r\n* City tours in Colombo, Kandy & Bentota \r\n* Shopping tour in Colombo \r\n* Drop off to Casino in Colombo.\r\n* An air-conditioned vehicle with an English speaking driver throughout the tour\r\n* All applicable Gov. Taxes   \r\n','* Entrance fees to any sites not mentioned above\r\n* Tips & portages \r\n* Any meals not mentioned above\r\n* Any other services not mentioned above\r\n* Early check in & Late check out\r\n','The rates are subject to change.','2023-07-18','2023-07-29',1,0,0,'2023-05-26 18:02:14','2023-05-27 13:05:35'),(316,724,16159,2,0,0,52100,22000,'Bali-Indonesia','3N Kuta - 2N Seminyak\r\n\r\n\r\nTours includes in Bali :-\r\n* Rafting LONG 12KM with local lunch (Ayung river) with private transfers\r\n* Kintamani tour with Ubud Village + Swing by Pioneer with private transfers\r\n* Nusa Penida tour with transfer and ferry ( 1 point snorkelling day trip) on SIC basis  (Hotel - Bali Port - Hotel - with private transfers)                                                                                                                                            Destination : Broken Beach, Angel Billabong, Klingking Clif & Crystal Bay (1 point Snorkeling)    - Boat start at 08.00 AM and back at 04.00 PM.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              Tour Include : Car for tour island, Driver as Guide, Local Lunch (Vegetarian Only), Return Boat Free entrance all destination, only Snorkeling Equipment, Life Jacket                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 Tour Exclude : Retribution fee to Island Nusa Penida IDR 25.000,-/person.\r\n* Ulundanu Temple of Bedugul Followed by Tanah lot temple tour with private transfers','','Ahmedabad - Bali - Ahmedabad Return airfare\r\n05 Nightsâ€™ Accommodation\r\nBB Basis\r\nMeet & Greet assistance at the airport\r\nReturn Airport & inter hotel transfer by Pvt Basis\r\nTransfers with air-conditioned vehicle\r\nEnglish spea