Venice to Lucerne in 2nd Class \r\n06 days Swiss Pass in 2nd Class \r\nZurich to Paris in 2nd Class \r\n \r\nTransfers: \r\nRome airport to hotel on pvrt basis \r\nParis station to hotel on pvt basis \r\nParis hotel to airport on pvt basis ','* TCS\r\n* Any Optional Tour','','2023-09-19','2023-10-03',1,0,0,'2023-06-01 18:09:19','2023-06-01 20:48:02'),(333,747,15526,4,0,0,68800,24000,'Kashmir Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)	 	\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	 	\r\n			\r\nDay 2 - SONMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR	 	\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	 	\r\n			\r\nDay 3 - GULMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR	 	\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	 	\r\n			\r\nDay 4 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)	 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.	 	\r\n						\r\nDay 5 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR Hotel\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in hotel. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.	 	\r\n				\r\nDay 6 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR Hotel\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.	 	','','Economy class return airfare\r\nAccommodation  as above.\r\nBreakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\nAirport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis. \r\nSightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\nShikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\nDriver Allowances\r\nVehicle: Innova (NON AC)\r\nToll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\nHotel Taxes\r\n','Supplement Cost\r\nABC Valley â€“ INR 3600 by Tavera\r\nShikara Ride â€“ INR 600 per boat\r\n\r\n* Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n* Extra Meals\r\n* Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n* Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances. \r\n* Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n* Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n* Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc. \r\n','Hotel Options will be searched after confirmation. \r\n\r\n03 nights SXR â€“ Hotel: Valley Orchid/Six Season/Regal Palace/Similar\r\n01 night Pahalgam â€“ Hotel: Himalayan Hill/Queens Park/Similar\r\n01 night SXR â€“ Hotel: Duke/Similar\r\n\r\n\r\nThe rates are subject to change','2023-06-19','2023-06-24',1,0,0,'2023-06-01 19:45:51','2023-06-01 20:32:08'),(334,748,507,2,0,0,0,0,'Kathmandu Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n06 June 2023:\r\n* Pickup from Kathmandu International Airport & drop at hotel.\r\n* Welcome drink at hotel.\r\n* Half day sightseeing tour in Kathmandu covering Swayambhunath Stupa (Monkey Temple) & Kathmandu * * Durbar Square (Kumari Temple).\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Kathmandu.\r\n\r\n07 June 2023:\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Half day sightseeing tour in Kathmandu covering Pashupatinath Temple & Boudhanath Stupa.\r\n* Drive from Kathmandu to Pokhara & drop at hotel. 210 KM  (6-7 Hours)  \r\n* Welcome soft drink at hotel.\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Pokhara.\r\n\r\n08 June 2023:\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Full day sightseeing tour in Pokhara covering Bindabashini Temple, Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave, Deviâ€™s * Fall, Seti River Gorge, Fewa Lake & Peace Pagoda (Shanti Stupa).\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Pokhara.\r\n\r\n09 June 2023:\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Drive from Pokhara to Kathmandu via Manakamana Temple darshan (by Cable Car) & drop at hotel. 210KM  (6-7 Hours)\r\n* Welcome soft drink at hotel.\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Kathmandu.\r\n\r\n10 June 2023:\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Drive from hotel to Kathmandu International airport.','','* Welcome soft drink.\r\n* Airport pickup & drop with a/c Sedan Car.\r\n* 02 nightâ€™s accommodation at respective hotel in Kathmandu. \r\n* 02 nightâ€™s accommodation at respective hotel in Pokhara. \r\n* Kathmandu two half day sightseeing.\r\n* Pokhara one full day sightseeing.\r\n','* Monuments and museum entrance fees for above sightseeing places.\r\n* Manakamana Cable Car ticket cost.\r\n* Fewa Lake boating charge.\r\n* Extra meal cost : INR. 6100 Per Person (Standard)\r\n* Extra meal cost : INR. 8100 Per Person (Deluxe)','Airfare is dynamic.','2023-06-06','2023-06-10',1,0,0,'2023-06-02 12:32:08','2023-06-02 12:36:49'),(335,749,15526,2,0,1,37000,5000,'Kashmir Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)	 	\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	 	\r\n			\r\nDay 2 - SONMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR	 	\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	 	\r\n				\r\nDay 3 - CHECK-IN AT GULMARG (1 NIGHT STAY)	 	\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, whi