snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at a hotel in Gulmarg.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay  4 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breathtaking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay 5 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in the evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay 6 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.\r\n \r\n ','','âœ” Delhi-Srinagar-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\nâœ” accommodation  as above.\r\nâœ” Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\nâœ” Airport - pick-up and drop facility on a pvt basis.\r\nâœ” Sightseeing by a non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\nâœ” Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in the same houseboat\r\nâœ” Driver Allowances.\r\nâœ” Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry fee at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\nâœ” Hotel Taxes','âœ” Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\nâœ” Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifica