op at hotel.\r\n* Welcome drink at hotel.\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Pokhara.\r\n\r\n08 Sep. 2023:â€‹\r\n* Early morning drive to Sarangkot for Sunrise & Annapurna Himalayan\r\nrange view.\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Half day sightseeing tour in Pokhara covering Bindabashini Temple,\r\nGupteshwor Mahadev Cave, Deviâ€™s Fall & Seti River Gorge\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Pokhara.\r\n\r\n09 Sep. 2023:\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Drive from hotel to Pokhara airport.	Flight to Kathmandu.\r\n* Pickup from Kathmandu domestic airport via Patan Durbar Square\r\n& .Swayambhunath Stupa (Monkey Temple)	& drop at hotel.\r\n* Welcome soft drink at hotel.\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Kathmandu..\r\n\r\n10 Sep. 2023:\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Half day sightseeing tour in Pokhara covering Pashupatinath Temple & Baudhanath Stupa.\r\n* Drive from hotel to Kathmandu International airport.','','* Delhi-Kathmandu-Delhi economy class airfare \r\n* Welcome soft	drink.\r\n* Airport pickup & drop with a/c Scorpio.\r\n* 02 nightâ€™s accommodation at respective hotel in Pokhara with CP Plan.\r\n* 01 nightâ€™s accommodation at respective hotel in Kathmandu with CP Plan.\r\n* Pokhara one half day sightseeing & visit to Sarangkot.\r\n* Kathmandu two half day sightseeing.\r\n* Kathmandu-Pokhara-Kathmandu by flight.','* Any meal or sightseeing other than the mentioned above. \r\n* Monuments and museum entrance fees for above sightseeing places.\r\n* Any service which is not mentioned in Inclusions.\r\n* Charges for Tour guide\r\n','The rooms are subject to availability\r\n','2023-09-07','2023-09-10',1,0,0,'2023-08-07 17:49:22','2023-08-07 17:49:22'),(394,852,54,2,0,0,162000,20000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 01 - Arrive Kuala Lumpur- Dinner (D)\r\n\r\nArrive Kuala Lumpur, meet with our representative and transfer to hotel.\r\nDay at leisure.\r\nDinner at indian restaurant.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 02- Kuala Lumpur- Genting Highland visit-Dinner (B,D)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at hotel.\r\nPick up from hotel lobby and proceed to Genting Highland day tour , enjoy cable car ride.\r\nReturn to Kuala Lumpur in evening.\r\nDinner at indian restaurant.\r\nOvernight at hotel.	\r\n\r\nDay 03- Kuala Lumpur â€“ KL night tour with KL Tower ticket-Dinner (B,D)\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, day is at leisure to explore city and do some shopping.\r\nIn evening pick up from hotel lobby ,admire the stunning views of the great landmarks of the Kuala Lumpur city and get enthralled with its beauty throughout the tour along with KL Tower.\r\nDinner at indian restaurant.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 04-Kuala Lumpur -Singapore- Gardens by the bay + Marina bay sands sky park visit+ Dinner (B,D)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at hotel.\r\nCheck out and transfer to airport for flight to Singapore\r\nOn arrival pick up from airport and transfer to hotel.\r\nAround 1700 hrs:Pick up from hotel lobby and proceed to Gardens by the bay tour ( Flower dome+ Supertree observatory).\r\nVisit observation deck- Marina Bay Sands Sky Park-Soak in panoramic views of Singapore\'s iconic skyline at the Marina Bay Sands Skypark Observation Deck\r\nDinner at indian restaurant.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 05 - Singapore â€“ City tour (B)\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast at Hotel, pick up from hotel lobby and proceed for Singapore city tour- visit Central district Orchard road, visit at Chinese temple in China town, Merlion park at marina bay (photo stop only).\r\nRest day at leisure to explore this beautiful city on your own.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 06- Singapore -Sentosa Island tour- Dinner (B,D)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at Hotel.\r\nAround 1130 hrs: Proceed to Sentosa Island tour.Sentosa offers a variety of attractions to provide variety of experiences,recreation & entertainment to visitors. Sky ride - a chair lift which offers bird eye view of Sentosa island. Luge ride - features a self steering, gravity driven three wheel cart, Cable car, 4D Adventure, SEA Aquarium, Wings of time.\r\nDinner at indian restaurant.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 07-Singapore -Universal Studio tour-Dinner-Departure (B,D)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at hotel.\r\nCheckout from hotel leave luggage at hotel lobby.\r\nAround 1030 hrs: Pick up from Hotel and proceed to Universal Studios- Singapore is Southeast Asia\'s first and only movie theme park, features thrilling attractions, rides and entertainment for everyone.\r\nDinner at Indian restaurant.\r\nReturn to hotel to collect luggage.\r\nPick up from hotel lobby & transfer to airport for flight to Mumbai.','','* Economy class return airfare\r\n* 03 Nights accommodation in Singapore\r\n* 03 Nights accommodation in Kuala Lumpur\r\n* 06 Breakfast at hotel buffet\r\n* 06 Dinners at indian restaurant(outside hotel) with transfers\r\n\r\n* Singapore\r\n  * Gardens by the bay tour (Admission to flower dome + Super tree observatory+ Marina Bay Sands sky park\r\n    -observation deck)\r\n  * Sentosa island tour with wings of the time, sky ride, luge ride, 4D adventure, 2 way cable car, SEA \r\n    Aquarium\r\n  * City tour-03 hrs approx\r\n  * Universal Studio tour\r\n\r\n* Kuala Lumpur  \r\n  * Kuala Lumpur night tour with KL Tower entrance ticket \r\n  * Genting highland tour with 2 way cable car ride\r\n\r\n* All tour and transfer on shared / joint basis\r\n* Airport taxes as per the routing of the tour.\r\n* Singapore and Malaysia Visa\r\n* One time pick up & delivery is included. Any additional visit will incur Rs 500 per visit\r\n* GST\r\n\r\n* Return airport transfers\r\n* Visa Charges\r\n* Travel Insurance										\r\n* All Tours and transfers on seat-in-coach basis										\r\n','Any type of personal expense\r\nAny meal other than mentioned above\r\nMalaysia Tourism Tax\r\nTCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2023-08-26','2023-09-01',1,0,0,'2023-08-09 11:11:43','2023-08-09 14:05:31'),(395,855,349,2,0,0,26700,15000,'Dubai Diaries','Day wise Itinerary â€“\r\n\r\n14 janâ€“ Arrival transfers + Dhow cruise Marina With Dinner\r\n15 jan â€“Dubai Half Day City Tour + Burj Khalifa Evening slot\r\n16 jan -Desert Safari with bbq dinner\r\n17 jan -Day at leisure.\r\n18 jan -Departure Transfers\r\n','','* 4 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Dubai half day city tour on sic\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sic\r\n* Burj khalifa 124 floor non prime ticket on sic\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','TCS','','2024-01-14','2024-01-18',1,0,0,'2023-08-09 12:33:13','2023-08-10 12:43:40'),(396,853,15512,2,0,0,178650,26000,'Vietnam Package','Duration: 08 Days / 07 Nights\r\nHighlights: Hanoi (2 nights), Halong (1 night), Danang (2 nights), Ho Chi Minh city (2 nights) \r\n\r\n\r\nDay 1: Arrive Hanoi, check-in & leisure. (B)\r\nArrival at Noi Bai airport, transfer to downtown for early check-in. Free time to explore. Overnight in Hanoi.\r\n\r\nDay 2: Hanoi - Heritage & Old Quarter by cyclo. (B)\r\nVisit Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum, Temple of Literature, Dong Xuan market, cyclo ride in Old Quarter. Overnight in Hanoi.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Hanoi to Ha Long Bay, cruise welcome. (B,L,D)\r\nDepart to Ha Long Bay, board cruise, explore Bai Tu Long Bay, swim, cave visit, sunset view. Overnight on the cruise.\r\n\r\nDay 4: Explore Bai Tu Long Bay, flight to Danang. (B,BR)\r\nSunrise view, rowboat experience, return to Hanoi, flight to Danang. Check-in at Danang hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 5: Ba Na Hills - Golden Bridge. (B)\r\nVisit Ba Na Hills, Golden Bridge, enjoy games at Fantasy Park. Overnight in Danang.\r\n\r\nDay 6: Hoi An Ancient Town, fly to Ho Chi Minh City. (B)\r\nExplore Hoi An\'s attractions, shopping, fly to HCMC, check-in & relax.\r\n\r\nDay 7: Cu Chi Tunnels & HCMC city tour. (B)\r\nVisit Cu Chi Tunnels, half-day city tour in HCMC.\r\n\r\nDay 8: Departure from HCMC. (B)\r\nBreakfast at hotel, free time for shopping. Private transfer to the airport for your flight home. Goodbye and safe travels!\r\n','','Delhi-Vietnam-Delhi 