ss\r\n\r\nVisit Lake Breinz with Swiss pass\r\n','* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any transfer or sightseeing other than mentioned above\r\n* TCS (5%)\r\n','- Rates & Availability Is Subject To Change At The Time Of Booking.\r\n- City & Government Tax To Be Paid Locally On Spot.\r\n- For The Above Said Tour, There Is No Pick Up And Drop Off From The Hotel, So Client Will Have To Reach At Departure Points And Back To Hotel Also At Their Own Arrangement.\r\n- Above Mentioned Excursions Are Unescorted.\r\n- Rate Is Subject To Change If There Are Changes On Number Of Pax, Number Of Nights Or Change Of Travelling Date.\r\n- No Booking Has Been Made Yet\r\n_ Train fare and seats are subject to availability.','2023-09-18','2023-10-08',0,0,0,'2023-08-26 14:10:22','2023-08-26 16:45:41'),(418,884,349,3,0,0,37500,10000,'Dubai Diaries','Day wise Itinerary â€“\r\n\r\n08 Sepâ€“ Arrival transfers \r\n09 Sep â€“Dubai Half Day City Tour on sic.\r\n10 Sep -Desert Safari with bbq dinner on sic.\r\n11 Sep -Dhow cruise Creek With Dinner on sic.\r\n12 Sep -Departure Transfers\r\n\r\n','','* 4 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Dubai half day city tour on sic\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sic\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Airport Transfers on Pvt.\r\n* Visa','TCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2023-09-08','2023-09-12',1,0,0,'2023-08-28 13:53:27','2023-08-28 14:09:18'),(419,885,419,8,0,0,205600,30000,'Kashmir Files','02 nights Srinagar\r\n\r\n02 nights Pahalgam\r\n\r\n01 night Srinagar\r\n\r\nITINERARY\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDay 2 - GULMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 3 & 4 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (2 NIGHTS STAY)\r\n\r\nDay 3- After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. Day at leisure. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n\r\n \r\nDay 4- After breakfast one can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.\r\n\r\n','','âœ” DEL-SXR-DEL economy class airfare\r\n\r\nâœ” accommodation  as above.\r\n\r\nâœ” Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n\r\nâœ” Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\n\r\nâœ” Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n\r\nâœ” Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\n\r\nâœ” Driver Allowances.\r\n\r\nâœ” Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n\r\nâœ” Hotel Taxes','âœ” Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n\r\nâœ” Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\n\r\nâœ” Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n\r\nâœ” Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\n\r\nâœ” Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n\r\nâœ”Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n\r\nâœ” Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\n\r\nâœ” Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\n\r\nâœ” The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.','','2023-10-07','2023-10-12',1,0,0,'2023-08-28 15:59:44','2023-08-31 12:24:08'),(420,890,349,3,1,0,87000,15000,'Dubai Diaries','Day wise Itinerary â€“\r\n\r\n20 Sep â€“Arrival transfers + Dhow cruise Marina With Dinner\r\n21 Sep â€“Dubai Half Day City Tour + Burj Khalifa Evening slot\r\n22 Sep -Desert Safari with bbq dinner\r\n23 Sep -Abu Dhabi grand mosque + farari world on sic\r\n24 Sep -Day at leisure\r\n25 Sep -Departure Transfers','','* Dubai half day city tour on sic\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sic\r\n* Burj khalifa 124 floor non prime ticket on sic\r\n* Abu Dhabi grand mosque + farari world