 Bari, and Folk Art Museum.\r\nOptionally, visit Sajjangarh (Monsoon Palace) for panoramic views.\r\nFree time for shopping and leisure.\r\nOvernight stay in Udaipur.\r\n\r\nDay 6: Udaipur Departure\r\n\r\nCheck out from the hotel and head to the sightseeing if left any. \r\nIn evening (around 5:30), drop at airport. \r\nFlight from Udaipur to Delhi\r\n','','Delhi-Jaipur and Udaipur-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n5 nights accommodation at above mentioned hotels\r\nDaily breakfast\r\nAll transfers and sightseeing with an AC vehicle (Innova Crysta)\r\nToll Tax, Parking and Driver allowances\r\nGST','Anything which is not mentioned in Inclusions','The airfare is dynamic and hence  subject to vary.\r\nThe rooms are subject to availability. \r\nThis quotation does not represent any booking. ','2023-11-18','2023-11-23',1,0,0,'2023-09-01 17:51:49','2023-09-01 17:51:49'),(425,894,349,2,2,0,81500,10000,'Dubai Diaries','16 Nov â€“Arrival transfers + Dhow cruise Marina With Dinner\r\n17 Nov â€“Dubai Half Day City Tour + Burj Khalifa Evening slot\r\n18 Nov -Desert Safari with bbq dinner\r\n19 Nov -Day at leisure\r\n20 Nov -Departure Transfers\r\n','','* 4 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Dubai half day city tour on sic\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sic\r\n* Burj khalifa 124 floor non prime ticket on sic\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n\r\n','','','2023-11-16','2023-11-20',1,0,0,'2023-09-02 16:16:50','2023-09-02 17:08:25'),(426,895,15510,4,0,0,0,0,'Thailand Diaries','23 Sep â€“1-PRIVATE COMBI (KL) \r\n24 Sep â€“Half Day KL City Tour + KL Tower - SIC\r\n25 Sep -Genting Highland Tour (Enroute Batu Caves )- SIC\r\n26 Sep -Day at leisure\r\n27 Sep -\r\n28 Sep -\r\n29 Sep -\r\n30 Sep -Departure Transfers','','','','','2023-09-23','2023-09-30',0,0,0,'2023-09-02 16:18:20','2023-09-02 16:18:20'),(427,896,15510,2,0,0,36650,14000,'Thailand Adventure','','','* Economy Class airafare.\r\n* 5 nights stay\r\n* D