els\r\nDaily breakfast\r\nAll transfers and sightseeing with an AC vehicle (Innova Crysta)\r\nToll Tax, Parking and Driver allowances\r\nGST','Anything which is not mentioned in Inclusions','The airfare is dynamic and hence  subject to vary.\r\nThe rooms are subject to availability. \r\nThis quotation does not represent any booking. ','2023-11-18','2023-11-23',1,0,0,'2023-09-06 09:05:21','2023-09-06 09:05:21'),(433,903,126,2,0,0,0,0,'Jaipur-Jodhpur-Udaipur','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Arrival in Jaipur\r\nFlight from Delhi to Jaipur\r\nArrive in Jaipur and check into your hotel.\r\nVisit Hawa Mahal and explore the City Palace.\r\nEvening stroll in local markets like Johari Bazaar.\r\nOvernight stay in Jaipur.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2: Jaipur Sightseeing\r\n\r\nBreakfast at hotel.\r\nMorning visit to Amber Fort and Jal Mahal.\r\nExplore Jantar Mantar and Albert Hall Museum.\r\nEvening free for leisure or more shopping.\r\nOvernight stay in Jaipur.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Jaipur to Jodhpur (via Ajmer)\r\n\r\nEarly morning breakfast and Check out from Jaipur hotel and travel to Jodhpur.\r\nVisit Ajmer Sharif Dargah en route.\r\nArrive in Jodhpur, check in, and visit Mehrangarh Fort.\r\nOvernight stay in Jodhpur.\r\n\r\nDay 4: Jodhpur to Udaipur (via Ranakpur)\r\n\r\nEarly morning breakfast and Check out from Jodhpur hotel and depart for Udaipur.\r\nVisit Ranakpur Jain Temple on the way.\r\nReach Udaipur, check in, and enjoy a boat ride on Lake Pichola.\r\nOvernight stay in Udaipur.\r\n\r\nDay 5: Udaipur Sightseeing\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from hotel and leave for Taj Lake Palace. Process the check-in. \r\nExplore City Palace, Saheliyon Ki Bari, and Folk Art Museum.\r\nOptionally, visit Sajjangarh (Monsoon Palace) for panoramic views.\r\nFree time for shopping and leisure.\r\nOvernight stay in Udaipur.\r\n\r\nDay 6: Udaipur Departure\r\n\r\nCheck out from the hotel and head to the sightseeing if left any. \r\nIn evening (around 5:30), drop at airport. \r\nFlight from Ud