rn amenities. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Starlit Suites Tirupati(Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 2 (24 Jan 2024 - Wednesday) Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02 \r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Starlit Suites Tirupati\r\nMorning after breakfast local sightseeing of temples in Tirupati including Sri Govindarajaswami Temple, Kapila Theertham, Padmavati Temple, Trimala (Tirupati Balaji) Temple Akash Ganga & Paap Vinashni Temple.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Starlit Suites Tirupati (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3 (25 Jan 2024 - Thursday)  Tirupathi  Day 03 \r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Starlit Suites Tirupati\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Starlit Suites Tirupati (Option 1) (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 4 (26 Jan 2024 - Friday) Chennai Departure \r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Starlit Suites Tirupati\r\nDeparture Transfer - Chennai Departure\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Chennai international Airport/Railway station for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories. ','','* Economy class airfare.\r\n* Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary \r\n* Tirumala Special Darshan\r\n* All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM \r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost \r\n\r\n','* All those which are not mentioned above\r\n* Entry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\n* Porterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\n* All Items Of Personal Nature\r\n* Any Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-01-23','2024-01-26',1,0,0,'2023-12-19 17:50:30','2023-12-19 18:22:58'),(493,990,1616,4,1,0,68000,13000,'Tirupati Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (23 Jan 2024 - Tuesday) Arrival Chennai - Tirupathi \r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Arrival Chennai - Tirupathi\r\nOn arrival at the Chennai airport/railway station, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and af