g breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Drive from Kathmandu to Pokhara via half day sightseeing in Kathmandu covering Pashupatinath Temple & Boudhanath Stupa & drop hotel. 	210 KM  (6-7 hours)\r\n* Welcome soft drink at hotel.\r\n* Dinner at hotel.\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Pokhara.\r\n\r\n01 April 2024:\r\n\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Full day sightseeing in Pokhara covering Bindabashini Temple, Gupteshor Mahadev Cave, Deviâ€™s Fall, Seti Gorge River, Fewa Lake & Peace Pagoda (Shanti Stupa).\r\n* Dinner at hotel.\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Pokhara.\r\n\r\n02 April 2024:\r\n\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Drive from hotel to Pokhara to Kathmandu via Manakamana temple darshan (by Cable Car) & drop hotel.\r\n* Welcome soft drink at hotel.\r\n* Overnight stay at hotel in Kathmandu\r\n\r\n03 April 2024:\r\n\r\n* Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n* Drive from hotel to Kathmandu International airport.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy class airfare.\r\n* Welcome soft drink.\r\n* Airport pickup & drop with A/C Sedan Car.\r\n* 02 nightâ€™s accommodation at respective hotel in Kathmandu with CP Plan.\r\n* 02 nightâ€™s accommodation at respective hotel in Pokhara with CP Plan.\r\n* Kathmandu two half day sightseeing.\r\n* Pokhara one full day sightseeing.\r\n','* Monuments and museum entrance fees for above sightseeing places.\r\n* Manakamana Temple Cable Car Ticket\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-03-30','2024-04-03',1,0,0,'2024-02-12 12:58:44','2024-02-12 13:45:33'),(517,1036,54,3,1,0,305000,40000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 :   (20 Mar)  \r\n* Singapore - Airport Arrival Transfer 	( 1-PRIVATE COMBI (SG) )\r\n* Sands Sky Park + Gardens By The Bay Combo Transfer and Ticket \r\n\r\n Day 2 : (21 Mar)\r\n* Singapore Zoo + Night Safari Transfer and Ticket \r\n\r\nDay 3 : (22 Mar)\r\n * Hotel to Cruise Transfer on PVT\r\n* Overnight stay in Cruise\r\n\r\nDay 4 : (23 Mar)\r\n* Stay in Cruise\r\n \r\nDay 5 : (24 Mar)\r\n* Cruise to hotel tr