 Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and highest golf course with 18 holes. If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region, also enjoy cable car (Gondola) for mountain ride upto khilangmarg. In the evening drive back to Srinagar. Overnight in hotel .\r\n\r\nDay 5 : DAY TRIP TO SONMARG\r\n\r\nMorning proceed for Sonmarg (Meadow of Gold). The distance of about 83 kms, will be covered in about 3 hrs. Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude Himalayan Lakes. In the evening drive back from Sonmarg. Dinner and overnight in deluxe hotel .\r\n\r\nDay 6 : DEPARTURE FROM SRINAGAR HOTEL TO SRINAGAR AIRPORT\r\n','','*      Economy class airfare.\r\nâ€¢      Meal Plan: MAPAI (Room + Breakfast + Dinner )\r\nâ€¢	01 Shikara Ride.\r\nâ€¢	Sightseeing as per the itinerary.\r\nâ€¢	All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.\r\nâ€¢	1  Non Ac SUV (PVT) TAVERA\r\n','â€¢	Horse Riding\r\nâ€¢	Room Heating Charges in Houseboats','* Airfare is dynamic.','2024-03-22','2024-03-27',1,0,0,'2024-02-19 13:19:36','2024-02-19 20:14:21'),(523,1044,16260,4,0,0,496000,120000,'Europe Diaries','Rail /Bus / Pass : (Sector Ticket subject to change at the time of issuance; Actual rate applicable)\r\n\r\n2nd Class Sector Ticket from Munich to Innsbruck - (09:34-11:18) - Included\r\n2nd Class Sector Ticket from Innsbruck to Zurich - (09:47-13:20)- Included\r\n04 Days Consecutive Swiss Pass - 2nd Class\r\n\r\nUnlimited travelling within Switzerland on Public Transportation using Swiss Pass\r\n\r\nSightseeing:\r\nMunich: Hop-On Hop-Off Tour: 1-Day Ticket\r\nMunich: Neuschwanstein & Linderhof Castle Full-Day Trip on SIC (08:30-19:00) (Tickets not Included)\r\nInnsbruck: Swarovski Crystal Worlds Ticket Entrance + Shuttle Transfer from Innsbruck\r\nZurich: Visit Rhine Fall / FIFA World