AT\r\n0830 - 0900 Hrs	Abu Dhabi City Tour + Ferrari world general entry ticket on sharing basis\r\n\r\nDay 6 : 07-Apr SUN\r\nDeparture Transfer From Bur Dubai Hotel To Dubai International Airport On Private Basis ( Based On Flight Details ).','','* Airport Transfer On Private Basis.\r\n* Daily Breakfast.\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sharing basis\r\n* Dubai City Tour on sharing basis\r\n* Burj Khalifa (124th Floor Normal Time) + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo with private transfers\r\n* Trio Desert safari with BBQ dinner on sharing basis\r\n* Miracle garden + Global village combo entry tickets with sharing transfers.\r\n* Abu Dhabi City Tour + Ferrari world general entry ticket on sharing basis\r\n* Visa\r\n* Travel Insurance','* Tips / Gratitude\r\n* Any expense of Personal nature\r\n* Any meals / transfers / excursions not mentioned in the inclusion\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-04-02','2024-04-07',1,0,0,'2024-02-23 11:43:36','2024-02-23 11:51:43'),(528,1049,54,2,0,0,76250,18100,'Singapore Diaries','','','Economy Class airfare.\r\n04 Nights Accommodation at Singapore Hotel Traveltine or similar.\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nReturn Airport Transfers on PVT Basis\r\nGardens By The Bay (Both Domes)\r\nCity Orientation Tour + Sentosa Island Tour (01 Way Cable Car + SkyHelix Sentosa + Air Combat VR Experience + Wings of Time)\r\nNight Safari\r\nAll Tours on SIC Basis\r\nVisa\r\nTravel Insurance','TCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-03-10','2024-03-14',1,0,0,'2024-02-23 12:38:41','2024-02-23 12:56:16'),(529,1050,680,4,1,0,70700,15000,'Mysore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1  (26 Feb 2024 - Monday) Banglore Arrival to Mysore \r\n\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Banglore Arrival to Mysore\r\nArrival At Bangalore, Proceed to mysore.Mysore (or Mysuru), a city in India\'s southwestern Karnataka state, was the capital of the Kingdom of Mysore from 1399 to 1947. In its center is opulent Mysore Palace, seat of the former ruling Wodeyar dynasty. The palace blends Hindu, Islamic, Gothic and Rajput styles.  Visit Mysore Zoo. Overnight stay at hotel/resort. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Roopa Elite, Mysore (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2 (27 Feb 2024 - Tuesday) Mysore Sightseeing day 2 \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Roopa Elite, Mysore\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Mysore Sightseeing day 2\r\nvisit Lalitha Mahal Palace, Jaganmohan Palace Art and Gallery,  St. Philomena\'s Church & Brindavan Gardens. Overnight stay at hotel/resort. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Roopa Elite, Mysore (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 3 (28 Feb 2024 - Wednesday) Mysore to Coorg \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Roopa Elite, Mysore\r\nTransfers - Mysore to Coorg\r\nMorning after breakfast drive to Coorg, - which is a famous tourist destination of Karnataka known for its stunning hill views and abundant natural beauty.  Coorg, popularly known as the Scotland of India,It is one of the most beautiful hill stations of South India. With the temperature ranging between 15 degree Celsius and 20 degree Celsius throughout the year, Coorg is a year-round destination.Overnight stay at hotel/resort. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Palm Era Resorts (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 4 (29 Feb 2024 - Thursday) Coorg Sightseeing Day 2 \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Palm Era Resorts\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Coorg Sightseeing Day 2\r\nMorning after breakfast in the morning, Visit Rajah Seat, Madikeri Fort, Dubare Elephant Camp.visit the Golden temple nestled near Kushalnagar in the region of Coorg. It is one of the biggest Tibetan monasteries of India and allows visitors to learn in depth about Tibetan religion and culture. Overnight stay at hotel/resort. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Palm Era Resorts (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 (01 Mar 2024 - Friday) Coorg to Bangalore Drop \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Palm Era Resorts\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Coorg to Bangalore Drop\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Bangalore international Airport/Railway station for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories.','','* Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary \r\n* All Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM \r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n* Sight seeing By Innova.\r\n','* All those which are not mentioned above \r\n* Entry Fees To Monuments And Palaces ','','2024-02-26','2024-03-01',0,0,0,'2024-02-24 13:51:10','2024-02-24 13:51:10'),(531,1051,349,3,2,0,130600,20000,'Dubai Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 02-Apr TUE\r\nArrival transfer from Dubai International Airport to Deira/Bur Dubai Hotel on Private basis (Based On Flight Details).\r\n1830 - 1900 Hrs Budget (4*) Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sharing basis.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : 03-Apr WED\r\n0830 - 0900 Hrs	Dubai City Tour on sharing basis\r\n1600 - 1630 Hrs	Burj Khalifa (124th Floor Normal Time) + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo with private transfers.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : 04-Apr THR\r\n1430 - 1500 Hrs	Trio Desert safari with BBQ dinner on sharing basis.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : 05-Apr FRI\r\n1430 - 1500 Hrs	Miracle garden + Global village combo entry tickets with sharing transfers.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : 06-Apr SAT\r\n0830 - 0900 Hrs	Abu Dhabi City Tour + Ferrari world general entry ticket on sharing basis\r\n\r\nDay 6 : 07-Apr SUN\r\nDeparture Transfer From Bur Dubai Hotel To Dubai International Airport On Private Basis ( Based On Flight Details ).','','* Airport Transfer On Private Basis.\r\n* Daily Breakfast.\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sharing basis\r\n* Dubai City Tour on sharing basis\r\n* Burj Khalifa (124th Floor Normal Time) + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo with private transfers\r\n* Trio Desert safari with BBQ dinner on sharing basis\r\n* Miracle garden + Global village combo entry tickets with sharing transfers.\r\n* Abu Dhabi City Tour + Ferrari world general entry ticket on sharing basis\r\n* Visa\r\n* Travel Insurance','* Tips / Gratitude\r\n* Any expense of Personal nature\r\n* Any meals / transfers / excursions not mentioned in the inclusion\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-04-02','2024-04-07',1,0,0,'2024-02-25 13:09:56','2024-02-25 13:09:56'),(532,1053,16002,2,0,0,35300,10000,'Bali Diaries','','','Economy class airfare.\r\n04 Nights Accommodation\r\nBB Basis\r\nMeet & Greet assistance at the airport \r\nReturn Airport Hotel transfer by Pvt Basis\r\nTransfers with air-conditioned vehicle\r\nEnglish speaking driver cum guide assistance\r\nFull day Ulundanu Temple of Bedugul tour Followed by Tanah lot temple tour on private basis\r\nFull Day Tour with west Nusa Penida on pvt basis \r\nFull Day Tour with watersports with uluwatu on pvt basis\r\nTravel Insurance\r\n\r\n','Other personal expenses\r\nAny surcharge at the hotel (Mini bar, Visiter fee etc.)\r\nCompulsory dinner supplements incase of hotel surcharge\r\nTCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-03-28','2024-04-01',1,0,0,'2024-02-27 11:27:49','2024-02-27 11:29:21'),(533,1052,355,2,0,0,0,0,'Varanasi Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay -01  Arrive  Varanasi  \r\nArrive Airport  transfer to Hotel and evening proceed ganga aarti by boat ( Boat charges included)  , over night stay in the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay-02  Varanasi \r\nEarly in the morning on the second day. You will be taken on an early morning boat ride (optional charges ). This boat ride is the best way to enjoy top ghats and rituals performed in each ghat. You can find many people bathing in the river. . After the boat ride, you will be taken on a temple tour to enjoy the morning rituals in famous temples like, Kashi Vishwanath temple, Annapurna temple, and others. Later, you will be taken back to the hotel for breakfast and later proceed SankatMochan Hanuman temple , ManasMandir , BHU etc\r\n\r\nAfternoon you will be taken on a road trip to Sarnath. Sarnath is the spot where Lord Buddha delivered his sermon after getting enlightenment. Top attractions visited in Sarnath are archeological museum, Buddha temples, stupas and others. etc.\r\n\r\nDay-03  Varanasi to Ayodhya [ 250km / 5 hrs approx. ]\r\nArrival at Ayodhya Airport and proceed for hotel and check-in in the hotel.\r\nLater in the evening, we will go for a ghat walk at ram ki paidi with a glimpse of old temples. After that will proceed for attending the Saryu Aarti & laser light show at Ram ki Paidi.\r\n \r\nOvernight stay in hotel.\r\n \r\nDay 04 - In morning, after breakfast will go to temple tour - Ramjanambhoomi, Hanumangarhi, kanak Bhawan & Dashrath Mahal.\r\n \r\nAfter lunch, We will go for Guptarghat, Nandigram. Later on will go for Surya kund. After Surya kund will come back to hotel. \r\n \r\nOvernight stay in hotel.\r\n \r\nDay 05 - Departure.\r\nAfter breakfast, you can proceed for airport. \r\nYour spiritual tour will end here with new memories.','','* Economy Class airfare.\r\n* Accommodation on the above mentioned hotels or similar.\r\n* Breakfast. \r\n* Meal Plan as per above in Hotels / Resorts.\r\n* Transfers & sightseeing by above vehicle (Vehicle Service from 08:00 Am to 08:00 PM) after that additional cost will be applicable ).\r\n* Toll, Parking, Driver Allowance.\r\n* All Applicable Tax.\r\n* Evening Aarti by BOAT in Varanasi \r\n* Guide included in Varanasi \r\n','â€¢	Expenses of personal nature such as drinks, telephone, and laundry bills etc \r\nâ€¢	Tips and porter charges\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-04-26','2024-04-30',1,0,0,'2024-02-27 12:33:04','2024-02-27 17:07:55'),(534,1054,15494,2,0,0,4500,8000,'Goa Diaries','','','* Economy Class airfare.\r\n* Airport Pickup and Drop\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Vehicle - Swift Dzire.\r\n','','Airfare is Dynamic.','2024-03-05','2024-03-08',1,0,0,'2024-02-27 18:16:55','2024-02-27 18:21:59'),(535,1055,349,4,0,1,59200,21000,'Dubai Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: March 4th\r\n\r\nArrival at Dubai International Airport (DXB)\r\nPrivate transfer from DXB Airport to Bur Dubai Hotel (MPV PVT)\r\nTrio Marina Shared in Coach (SIC) - Marina Dhow Cruise\r\nOvernight stay at Bur Dubai Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 2: March 5th\r\n\r\nPRIVATE TOUR : EX DUBAI - Burj Khalifa Return Transfer  (MPV PVT)\r\nVisit Burj Khalifa - At The Top 124th Floor (Non-Prime)\r\nTrio Marina SIC - Dubai City Tour\r\nOvernight stay at Bur Dubai Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 3: March 6th\r\n\r\nTrio Marina SIC - Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner\r\nOvernight stay at Bur Dubai Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 4: March 7th\r\n\r\nSIC Tour - Abu Dhabi City Tour\r\nReturn to Dubai\r\nOvernight stay at Bur Dubai Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 5: March 8th\r\n\r\nCheck-out from the hotel\r\nPrivate transfer from Bur Dubai Hotel to Dubai International Airport (MPV PVT)\r\nDeparture from Dubai','','* Economy Class airfare.\r\n* Daily Breakfast.\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise \r\n* Burj Khalifa Ticket At The Top 124th Floor (Non- Prime) Ticket Only \r\n* Dubai City Tour \r\n* Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner\r\n* Abu Dhabi City Tour \r\n* Return airport transfers on pvt basis.\r\n* Travel Insurance.\r\n* All tours and sightseeing on sharing basis','Any meal other than mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal expense\r\nTCS','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms are subject to availability','2024-03-04','2024-03-08',0,0,0,'2024-02-28 12:29:50','2024-02-28 17:56:43'),(536,1057,349,3,0,0,45100,13000,'Dubai Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: March 4th\r\n\r\nArrival at Dubai International Airport (DXB)\r\nPrivate transfer from DXB Airport to Bur Dubai Hotel (MPV PVT)\r\nTrio Marina Shared in Coach (SIC) - Marina Dhow Cruise\r\nOvernight stay at Bur Dubai Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 2: March 5th\r\n\r\nPRIVATE TOUR : EX DUBAI - Burj Khalifa Return Transfer  (MPV PVT)\r\nVisit Burj Khalifa - At The Top 124th Floor (Non-Prime)\r\nTrio Marina SIC - Dubai City Tour\r\nOvernight stay at Bur Dubai Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 3: March 6th\r\n\r\nTrio Marina SIC - Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner\r\nOvernight stay at Bur Dubai Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 4: March 7th\r\n\r\nSIC Tour - Abu Dhabi City Tour\r\nReturn to Dubai\r\nOvernight stay at Bur Dubai Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 5: March 8th\r\n\r\nCheck-out from the hotel\r\nPrivate transfer from Bur Dubai Hotel to Dubai International Airport (MPV PVT)\r\nDeparture from Dubai','','* Economy Class airfare.\r\n* Daily Breakfast.\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise \r\n* Burj Khalifa Ticket At The Top 124th Floor (Non- Prime) Ticket Only \r\n* Dubai City Tour \r\n* Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner\r\n* Abu Dhabi City Tour \r\n* Return airport transfers on pvt basis.\r\n* Travel Insurance.\r\n* Visa\r\n* All tours and sightseeing on sharing basis','Any meal other than mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal expense\r\nTCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-04-02','2024-04-06',1,0,0,'2024-02-29 17:55:16','2024-02-29 17:55:16'),(537,1059,15518,2,0,0,35200,10050,'Kerala Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (06 Apr 2024 - Saturday) Cochin - Munnar(Arrival) \r\n\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Cochin - Munnar(Arrival)\r\nOn arrival at the Cochin airport/railway station, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and afterwards to transfer you to your already booked hotel in Munnar Proceed to Munnar. Visit Cheeyapara and Valara water falls on the way to Munnar. Through out the journey enjoy beautiful streams small waterfalls, Rubber, Pepper cardamom and Tea plantations and thick forests; God has blessed his own country with incomparable beauty on arrival at Munnar check in to Hotel. At leisure. Overnight stay in Hotel/resort. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Arbour Resort (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2 (07 Apr 2024 - Sunday) Munnar Sightseeing DAY 02 \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Arbour Resort\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Munnar Sightseeing DAY 02\r\nMorning after breakfast proceed to enjoy full day sight seeing tour of Munnar. Rose Garden, Tea Garden, Photo Point, Madupetty Dam/Lake, Echo Point & Kundala Dam/Lake. Overnight stay at hotel/resort. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Arbour Resort (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3 (08 Apr 2024 - Monday) Munnar - Thekkady \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Arbour Resort\r\nTransfers - Munnar - Thekkady\r\nMorning after breakfast check out from the hotel and transfer to Thekkady .Thekkady is a world famous wildlife sanctuary and it is also called as Periyar. On arrival check in at Hotel. Afternoon visit wildlife sanctuary & enjoy the boating ( tickets charges are extra and subject to availability ). Visit spice plantations. Apart from being enjoyable these plantation tours gives tourists an insight into the growing, harvesting and processing of spices. Evening will be free for Cultural show ( Kathakali & Kalaripayattu on direct payment ) & local shopping. Overnight stay at Thekkady. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Hotel Sandra Palace (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 4 (09 Apr 2024 - Tuesday) Thekkady to Alleppey (House Boat) \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Hotel Sandra Palace\r\nTransfers - Thekkady to Alleppey (House Boat)\r\nMorning after breakfast, check out and proceed to Alleppey (House Boat) Check in 12.00 noon and Enjoy the backwaters, scenery and different places in Kerala Style House boats from 12Noon. Observe the daily life of peoples who lives near the lake/canal while cruising. In the houseboat you will be greeted with welcome drink. Lunch, Dinner and breakfast will be provided as per the timming. Evening Tea/Coffee & snacks will be provided. Overnight stay in the houseboat.\" \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel  HouseBoat (Meal Plan - APAI)\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 (10 Apr 2024 - Wednesday) Alleppey -Cochin departure transfer \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel -  HouseBoat\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Alleppey -Cochin departure transfer\r\nAfter breakfast check out from the hotel and Transferred to Cochin Airport / Railway station for the for the departure.','','* Economy Class airfare.\r\n* Non Ac Rooms Are Provided In Munnar And Thekkady As They Are Hill Stations.\r\n* Sedan Ac Vehicle\r\n* Airport transfers on pvt basis\r\n* All tours and sightseeing on pvt basis.\r\n\r\n','','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-04-06','2024-04-10',1,0,0,'2024-03-01 17:17:38','2024-03-01 17:34:00'),(538,1060,355,2,0,0,0,6000,'Varanasi Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay -01  Arrive  Varanasi  \r\nArrive Airport  transfer to Hotel and evening proceed ganga aarti by boat ( Boat charges included)  , over night stay in the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay-02  Varanasi \r\nEarly in the morning on the second day. You will be taken on an early morning boat ride (optional charges ). This boat ride is the best way to enjoy top ghats and rituals performed in each ghat. You can find many people bathing in the river. . After the boat ride, you will be taken on a temple tour to enjoy the morning rituals in famous temples like, Kashi Vishwanath temple, Annapurna temple, and others. Later, you will be taken back to the hotel for breakfast and later proceed SankatMochan Hanuman temple , ManasMandir , BHU etc\r\n\r\nAfternoon you will be taken on a road trip to Sarnath. Sarnath is the spot where Lord Buddha delivered his sermon after getting enlightenment. Top attractions visited in Sarnath are archeological museum, Buddha temples, stupas and others. etc.\r\n\r\nDay-03  Varanasi to Ayodhya [ 250km / 5 hrs approx. ]\r\nArrival at Ayodhya Airport and proceed for hotel and check-in in the hotel.\r\nLater in the evening, we will go for a ghat walk at ram ki paidi with a glimpse of old temples. After that will proceed for attending the Saryu Aarti & laser light show at Ram ki Paidi.\r\n \r\nOvernight stay in hotel.\r\n \r\nDay 04 - In morning, after breakfast will go to temple tour - Ramjanambhoomi, Hanumangarhi, kanak Bhawan & Dashrath Mahal.\r\n \r\nAfter lunch, We will go for Guptarghat, Nandigram. Later on will go for Surya kund. After Surya kund will come back to hotel. \r\n \r\nOvernight stay in hotel.\r\n \r\nDay 05 - Departure.\r\nAfter breakfast, you can proceed for airport. \r\nYour spiritual tour will end here with new memories.','','* Economy Class airfare.\r\n* Accommodation on the above mentioned hotels or similar.\r\n* Breakfast. \r\n* Meal Plan as per above in Hotels / Resorts.\r\n* Transfers & sightseeing by above vehicle (Vehicle Service from 08:00 Am to 08:00 PM) after that additional cost will be applicable ).\r\n* Toll, Parking, Driver Allowance.\r\n* All Applicable Tax.\r\n* Evening Aarti by BOAT in Varanasi \r\n* Guide included in Varanasi \r\n','â€¢	Expenses of personal nature such as drinks, telephone, and laundry bills etc \r\nâ€¢	Tips and porter charges\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-04-26','2024-04-30',0,0,0,'2024-03-02 11:52:40','2024-03-02 20:29:18'),(539,1061,54,2,0,0,58000,16000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay1: Arrival and Night Safari\r\nDay 2: Full Day Sentosa Combo 1 ( 01 Way cable Car + Sea Aquarium + Skyhelix + Madame Tussauds 5-in-1 + WOT 1st Show)\r\nDay 3: Universal Studios\r\nDay 4: Birds Paradise & Gardens By the Bay (Flower Dome & Supertree) \r\nDay 5: Singapore Zoo\r\nDay 6: Day at leisure\r\nDay 7: Check out and departure transfer\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class airfare.\r\n* Daily Breakfast.\r\n* Return airport transfers on pvt.\r\n* All tours and Sightseeing are on Sic Basis.\r\n* Visa\r\n* Travel Insurance.','Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal expense\r\nTips and guides\r\nTCS','Airfare is Dynamic.\r\nRooms are subject to availability','2024-03-15','2024-03-21',1,0,0,'2024-03-02 18:01:41','2024-03-03 12:10:24'),(540,1067,349,4,2,0,155600,23700,'Dubai Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 02-Apr TUE\r\nArrival transfer from Dubai International Airport to Deira/Bur Dubai Hotel on Private basis (Based On Flight Details).\r\n1830 - 1900 Hrs Budget (4*) Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sharing basis.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : 03-Apr WED\r\n0830 - 0900 Hrs	Dubai City Tour on sharing basis\r\n1600 - 1630 Hrs	Burj Khalifa (124th Floor Normal Time) + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo with private transfers.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : 04-Apr THR\r\n1430 - 1500 Hrs	Trio Desert safari with BBQ dinner on sharing basis.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : 05-Apr FRI\r\n1430 - 1500 Hrs	Miracle garden + Global village combo entry tickets with sharing transfers.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : 06-Apr SAT\r\n0830 - 0900 Hrs	Abu Dhabi City Tour + Ferrari world general entry ticket on sharing basis\r\n\r\nDay 6 : 07-Apr SUN\r\nDeparture Transfer From Bur Dubai Hotel To Dubai International Airport On Private Basis ( Based On Flight Details ).','','* Airport Transfer On Private Basis.\r\n* Daily Breakfast.\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sharing basis\r\n* Dubai City Tour on sharing basis\r\n* Burj Khalifa (124th Floor Normal Time) + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo with private transfers\r\n* Trio Desert safari with BBQ dinner on sharing basis\r\n* Miracle garden + Global village combo entry tickets with sharing transfers.\r\n* Abu Dhabi City Tour + Ferrari world general entry ticket on sharing basis\r\n* Visa\r\n* Travel Insurance','* Tips / Gratitude\r\n* Any expense of Personal nature\r\n* Any meals / transfers / excursions not mentioned in the inclusion\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-04-02','2024-04-07',0,0,0,'2024-03-04 18:12:28','2024-03-04 19:00:54'),(541,1070,1105,4,2,0,141060,28040,'Udaipur Diaries','Day-wise itinerary:\r\n\r\n1st Day (Mon 18th March) : Udaipur - Arrival\r\nUpon arrival, meet our representative and take a transfer to the hotel,Complete your check-in process,Get Relaxed,Evening is free for leisure, you can head out to explore the little markets,You can spend time here shopping and enjoying the beautifully lit streets of Udaipur,(ON YOUR OWN) Or you can partake in the boat ride on the tranquil waters of Lake Pichola / Fateh Sagar Lake,(Ticket not included) Head back to the hotel for the night, Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\n2nd Day (Tue 19th March) : Udaipur - Sightseeing\r\nBegin your day with breakfast at the hotel and then start your city tour,Visit the City Palace which is the biggest castle complex in Rajasthan,Partake in the boat ride on the tranquil waters of Lake Pichola,Also visit Sahelion ki Bari or Garden of the Maids of Honor, Jagdish sanctuary,Local Market Visit,Later in the evening Fateh Sagar Lake, Shilpgram,Once sightseeing is over, head back to the hotel,Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n3rd Day (Wed 20th March) : Udaipur to Jodhpur - Transfer\r\nAfter Breakfast check-out from the Hotel and Drive to Jodhpur,Jodhpur is a beautiful city that displays the rich crafts and culture of Rajasthan.Overnight stay at Jodhpur Hotel.\r\n\r\n4th Day (Thu 21st March) : Jodhpur - Sightseeing\r\nAfter breakfast, head out for sightseeing at the popular forts and Lakes here,Visit Jaswant Thada,This is a marble cenotaph built in 1899, in remembrance of Maharaja Jaswant Singh II, And then head to Mehrangarh Fort,Rising opposite and secure from a slope which is 125 meters over Jodhpurâ€™s horizon is the Mehrangarh Fort,This memorable fortification is a standout amongst the most well known in India and is stuffed with history and legends,Mehrangarh Fort still bears the engravings of cannonball assaults used by the armed forces of Jaipur on its second entryway,Also visit Moti Mahal,Moti Mahal, as the name proposes, is the Pearl Hall where the illustrious families held their group of onlookers,The corridor is known to have glass windows and five niches that empowered the rulers to tune in to the procedures occurring in the Sringar Chowki, The Royal Throne of Jodhpur,Later get back to Hotel,Dinner & Overnight stay at Jodhpur Hotel.\r\n\r\n5th Day (Fri 22nd March) : Jodhpur to Jaipur - Transfer\r\nAfter breakfast & check out process visit Umaid Bhawan, Later take a transfer to the Jaipur hotel, Jaipur is the capital of Rajasthan, It was painted in pink shading a century back to pay tribute to a meeting sovereign, This city is 260 years old and was built by Maharaja Jai Singh, Get relaxed & take a rest at the hotel, After getting a rest, visit Albert Hall followed by Birla Temple, (IF TIME PERMITS) Dinner and overnight stay at Jaipur.\r\n\r\n6th Day (Sat 23rd March) : Jaipur - Sightseeing\r\nEarly Morning After breakfast, head out for the Amber Fort. Also, visit the Jai Garh, Jal Mahal, Hall of triumph, Sheesh Mahal & Jantar Mantar. Drive past the Hawa Mahal. While in Jaipur also visit Maharajaâ€™s City Palace and Ram Niwas Gardens.Dinner & Overnight at Jaipur Hotel.\r\n\r\n7th Day (Sun 24th March) : Jaipur - Departure\r\nAfter Breakfast you will be heading to the Jaipur Airport to board the flight on your way back home.','','â€¢	Welcome Drink on Arrival\r\nâ€¢	 Economy Class airfare.\r\nâ€¢	Accommodation in a well-appointed room in base category \r\nâ€¢	Meals as Mentioned in Hotel Section \r\nâ€¢	Hotel checks in & check out time as per the hotel policy \r\nâ€¢	All transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary \r\nâ€¢	All Toll taxes, One time Parking of Each Destination , State Tax & Driver allowance \r\nâ€¢	Vehicle will be provided 8:00 am to 8:00pm \r\nâ€¢	Camel ride at Sam Sand dunes. \r\n','â€¢	All personal expenses, optional tours and extra meal \r\nâ€¢	Any monument or sight-seeing Entry fee / Charges \r\nâ€¢	Extra bed/mattress as per the hotel policy for the additional guest \r\nâ€¢	Child above 11 years to consider as an adult \r\nâ€¢	Anything not in inclusions is excluded \r\nâ€¢	NOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded \r\n','','2024-03-18','2024-03-24',0,0,0,'2024-03-05 17:37:45','2024-03-05 18:49:02'),(542,1071,1559,4,2,0,145500,20200,'Gujrat Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (Mon 18th March) : Ahmedabad - Arrival & City Sightseeing\r\nApprox Distance: 300 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 6 hours \r\nArrivals at Ahmedabad, then proceed to Ahmedabad Hotel, check into hotel, then visit Sabarmati Gandhi Ji Ashram, Adalaj stepwell, Evening drive to Gandhinagar Visit Akshardham Temple (Closed on Monday), Evening visit Local market, Overnight at Ahmedabad\r\n\r\n2nd Day (Tue 19th March) : Ahmedabad to Gir - Transfer & Sightseeing\r\nApprox Distance: 400 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hours \r\nMorning Breakfast, check out from Hotel, Drive to Sasan Gir, check into Hotel then enjoy the Gir National Park to visit Asiatic Lion, Gir Jungle Trail (Jeep Safari) or Devaliya Safari (Bus Safari). Guest have book Online Permit on www.girlion.in. Dinner & Overnight Stay at Hotel. Note: Gir Jungle Safari is closed from 16th June to 15th Oct every year.\r\n\r\n3rd Day (Wed 20st March) : Gir to Somnath - Safari, Transfer & Sightseeing\r\nApprox Distance: 60 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 1 hour 20 minutes \r\nDrive to Somnath, Visit Gir Jungle trail, then drive Somnath Check in to hotel, and then visit Bhalka Tirth Temple, Attend Evening Aarti at Somnath Jyotirling (one of the first among the twelve Jyotirlings shrines of Shiva) Evening visit Light & Sound Show at Somnath Temple, Overnight stay at Hotel\r\n\r\n4th Day (Thu 21st March) : Somnath to Dwarka - Transfer via Porbandar & Sightseeing\r\nApprox Distance: 250 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 5 hours \r\nToday after breakfast drive to Dwarka, En-route visit Porbandar â€“ Kirti Mandir & Sudama Temple, then drive Dwarka Evening reach at Dwarka, Visit Dwarkadhish Temple, Overnight at Dwarka\r\n\r\n5th Day (Fri 22nd March) : Dwarka - Sightseeing\r\nApprox Distance: 150 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 2 hours 30 minutes \r\nAfter breakfast, starting you day at Devbhoomi by travelling to Bet Dwarika a journey by road and crossing the sea you reach at the beautiful place of lord Krishna. You also wonâ€™t miss out from the places like Nageshwar Mahadev Temple, Krishna everywhere in your environment. Later Return back to hotel and overnight stay at Dwarka.\r\n\r\n6th Day (Sat 23rd March) : Dwarka to Bhuj - Transfer Via Jamnagar & Sightseeing\r\nApprox Distance: 450 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 9 hours \r\nMorning Breakfast, check out from hotel, then proceed to Bhuj, En-route visit â€“ Lakhota Lake & Bala Hanuman, Then Drive to Bhuj, Evening reach at Bhuj Overnight at Bhuj\r\n\r\n7th Day (Sun 24th March) : Bhuj - White Rann - Bhuj\r\nApprox Distance: 300 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 6 hours 20 minutes \r\nDrive to Rann Utsav get ready to explore the Banni and Pachcham regions and the edge of the Great Rann of Kutch. Visit Dhordo village, Ludiya village and Khavda village. Later visit Kalo Dungar (Black Hill) and Dattatray Temple, which provides the view of the Great Rann & sunset. Evening come back to Bhuj, Overnight at Bhuj\r\n\r\n8th Day (Mon 25th March) : Bhuj to Rajkot - Drop\r\nApprox Distance: 250 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 4 hours 10 minutes \r\nAfter breakfast, Check out from hotel, Drive to Rajkot, Drop at Rajkot\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTransportation Used: 1-Ertiga Ac\r\n\r\nDay 	                                                                           Service \r\n1st Day (18 Mar)	                             Ahmedabad - Arrival & City Sightseeing \r\n2nd Day (19 Mar)	                             Ahmedabad to Gir - Transfer & Sightseeing \r\n3rd Day (20 Mar)	                             Gir to Somnath - Safari, Transfer & Sightseeing \r\n4th Day (21 Mar)	                             Somnath to Dwarka - Transfer via Porbandar & Sightseeing \r\n5th Day (22 Mar)	                             Dwarka - Sightseeing \r\n6th Day (23 Mar)	                             Dwarka to Bhuj - Transfer Via Jamnagar & Sightseeing \r\n7th Day (24 Mar)	                             Bhuj - White Rann - Bhuj \r\n8th Day (25 Mar)                       	     Bhuj to Rajkot - Drop \r\n','','â€¢         Economy Class airfare.\r\nâ€¢         Accommodation in well-appointed A/c rooms with satellite connection LCD TV and telephone \r\nâ€¢         Accommodation in Below Mention Hotel. \r\nâ€¢         Meals as Mentioned in Hotel Section \r\nâ€¢         Hotel checks in & check out time as per the hotel policy \r\nâ€¢         Two bottles of water replenished daily at Hotel only \r\nâ€¢         All transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary \r\nâ€¢ 