ies.','','* Welcome drinks on arrival.\r\n* Breakfast, Lunch/Dinner\r\n* Evening High Tea\r\n* Gala Dinner with light music.\r\n','','','2024-03-24','2024-03-26',0,0,0,'2024-03-12 14:29:17','2024-03-12 14:49:40'),(555,1088,7060,7,1,0,636200,65000,'Greece Diaries','Itinerary: Hotels given below or similar  \r\n\r\n21st to 23rd May Athens  - Hotel Panorama Project\r\n\r\n23rd to 26th May Mykonos - Paradison Hotel\r\n\r\n26th to 29th May Santorini-Epa Valis hotel  \r\n\r\n29ty to 30th May Athens- Panorama Project\r\n\r\n30th May to 1st June Cappadocia - Singnature Garden\r\n\r\n1st to 3rd June Istanbul- Sogut Hotel Old City','','* Athens Airport to hotel private transfer\r\n* Athens hotel to Ferry port private transfer\r\n* Athens to Mykonos Ferry ticket\r\n* Mykonos Ferry port to hotel private transfer\r\n* Mykonos city tour and Island tour\r\n* Mykonos to Santorini Ferry ticket\r\n* Mykonos hotel to Ferry port private transfer\r\n* Santorini Bus tour with Sunset in Oia - Full day\r\n* Santorini hotel to Ferry port private transfer\r\n* Santorini to athens Ferry ticket\r\n* Istanbul Airport to hotel transfer Pvt\r\n* Full Day Istanbul Tour with Topkapi Palace, Hagia Sophia Mosque, Blue Mosque, Hippodrome, Obelisk, Sultanahmet, Old Bazaar. Lunch atLocal Restaurant.\r\n* Transfer from Istanbul hotel to Keysari Airport Pvt\r\n* Keysari Airport to hotel pvt transfer\r\n* Full Day Cappadocia Red Tour with Zelve Open Air Museum, Dervent Valley, Pasabag, Avanos. Lunch at local Restaurant.\r\n*transfer to Kayseri Airport for flight to Istanbul to catch homebound flight\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any expense of personal nature\r\n* Any type of tip, tour guide charges. \r\n* TCS','Price is subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nQuote is valid for 5 Days ','2024-05-21','2024-06-03',0,0,0,'2024-03-12 16:01:11','2024-03-12 22:20:14'),(556,1091,419,6,0,0,138000,90426,'Kashmir Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL +  (CHECK-IN HOUSEBOAT) + SONMARG DAY TRIP	\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your houseboat. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.	\r\n	\r\nDay 2 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.	\r\n\r\nDay 3 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOTEL 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. In evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	\r\n	\r\nDay 4 - GULMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR	\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	\r\n	\r\nDay 5 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOTEL 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.	','','â€¢	Economy Class airfare.\r\nâ€¢	Meal Plan: MAPAI (Room + Breakfast + Dinner )\r\nâ€¢	01 Shikara Ride.\r\nâ€¢	Sightseeing as per the itinerary.\r\nâ€¢	Pickup & Drop: SXR Airport\r\nâ€¢	Vehicle: Innova (NON AC)','â€¢	Any personal nature items like Laundry, bar bills, table bills, camera fee, tips or any other item.\r\nâ€¢	Mineral water / Soft or hard drinks / Starters.                                                                                                 \r\nâ€¢	Entrance Free\r\nâ€¢	Room Heating Charges in Houseboats\r\nâ€¢	Horse Riding\r\nâ€¢	Sightseeing of Chandanwadi, Aru and Baisaran in Pahalgam.\r\nâ€¢	Gondola Ride in Gulmarg\r\nâ€¢	Any other things that is not included in the Package\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-03-17','2024-03-21',0,0,0,'2024-03-13 13:07:34','2024-03-14 15:37:23'),(557,1092,15542,22,0,0,169400,34000,'Rishikesh Diaries','Date 24th March :-\r\n\r\nBreakfast, Lunch & Dinner\r\n\r\n25th March:-\r\n\r\nBreakfast Lunch + Snacks\r\nSoft Drinks\r\nHoli celebration with organic colors\r\nDJ & Dinner\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner\r\n* Holi celebration with organic colors\r\n* DJ & Dinner\r\n* Soft Drinks','','','2024-03-24','2024-03-26',0,0,0,'2024-03-13 14:09:36','2024-03-13 16:06:17'),(558,1100,7060,7,1,0,600000,65000,'Greece Diaries','Itinerary: Hotels given below or similar  \r\n\r\n21st to 23rd May Athens  - Lotus Centre