clusions.\r\nPersonal Expenses like telephone , laundry etc.\r\nAnything not mentioned in Inclusions.\r\nTCS','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRooms are subject to availability\r\nThe rates are valid till 5th May, 2024\r\n1 pc baggage for DEL-KRK and 2 pc baggage for WAW-DEL','2024-05-23','2024-05-28',0,0,0,'2024-04-30 23:24:34','2024-04-30 23:30:13'),(585,1138,15526,8,0,0,207600,25000,'Kashmir Files','2N Srinagar - 1N Gulmarg - 1N Pahalgam\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 01: On arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in take rest. In evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                           \r\n\r\nDay 02: After breakfast leave from hotel  & proceed to Srinagar Old City Tour. Jamia Masjid is a mosque in Srinagar, situated at Nowhatta in the middle of the Old City. The Mosque was commissioned by Sultan Sikandar in 1394 CE and completed in 1402 CE, at the behest of Mir Mohammad Hamadani, son of Mir Sayyid Ali Hamadani. It is regarded as one of the most important mosques in Kashmir. After this, you can go The Hazratbal Shrine (\"Majestic Place\") is a Muslim shrine in Hazratbal, Srinagar. It contains a relic, the Moi-e-Muqqadas, believed by many Muslims of Kashmir to be Muhammad\'s hair. The name of the shrine comes from the Farsi word Hazrat, meaning \"respected\", and the Kashmiri word bal, meaning \"place\". Thus it means the place which is given high regards and is respected among the people.  Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                        \r\n\r\nDay 03: After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.                                              \r\n\r\nDay 04: After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.                                        \r\n\r\n\r\nDay 05: After breakfast check-out from Pahalgam hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.                                     \r\n\r\n','','âœ” accommodation  as above.\r\n\r\nâœ” Breakfast & Dinner in the hotel.\r\n\r\nâœ” Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\n\r\nâœ” Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n\r\nâœ” Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\n\r\nâœ” Driver Allowances.\r\n\r\nâœ” Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n\r\nâœ” Hotel Taxes       ','âœ” Any Air/Train/Bus fare or travel insurance.\r\n\r\nâœ” Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n\r\nâœ” Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\n\r\nâœ” Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n\r\nâœ” Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\n\r\nâœ” Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n\r\nâœ”Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n\r\nâœ” Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\n\r\nâœ” Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\n\r\nâœ” The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.','The rooms are subject to availability','2024-06-24','2024-06-28',0,0,0,'2024-05-01 18:23:10','2024-05-01 18:23:10'),(586,1139,15510,3,0,0,31200,3000,'Thailand Adventure','Day-Wise Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (13th Sept): TRANSFERS : EX PHUKET APT - Krabi Hotel ( Ao- Anang Area ) (PVT)\r\n\r\nDay 2 (14th Sept): Krabi 4 Island Tour By Long Tailed Boat + Lunch Box ( Exclude National Park Fee THB 200 ) On SIC\r\n\r\nDay 3 (15th Sept): TRANSFERS : EX KRABI HOTEL - Phuket Hotel \r\n\r\nDay 4 (16th Sept): Phuket Half Day City Tour - Big Buddha on SIC\r\n\r\nDay 5 (17th Sept): Phi Phi Island Tour By Big Boat with Local Lunch ( Excl. National Park Fee) on SIC\r\n\r\nDay 6 (18th Sept): TRANSFERS : EX PHUKET HOTEL - Phuket APT','','DEL-HKT-DEL economy class airfare\r\n5 night stay in above mentioned hotels with daily breakfast\r\nPhuket APT to Krabi hotel Transfer on private basis\r\nKrabi hotel to Phuket hotel transfer on private basis\r\nPhuket hotel to Phuket APT transfer on private basis\r\nKrabi 4 Island Tour By Long Tailed Boat + Lunch Box ( Exclude National Park Fee THB 200 ) On SIC\r\nPhuket Half Day City Tour - Big Buddha on SIC\r\nPhi Phi Island Tour By Big Boat with Local Lunch ( Excl. National Park Fee) on SIC\r\nInsurance charges\r\n','Visa Charges\r\nExpenses of personal nature, such as Laundry, telephone calls, mini-bar bills, etc. \r\nAny other tours apart from those listed under inclusions