e Hotel - Gokulam Grand Resorts & Spa Coorg\r\nTransfers - Coorg to Ooty\r\nAfter breakfast checkout and proceed to Ooty ,popularly known as the \'Queen of Hill Stations\' is nestled in the Nilgiri hills in Tamil Nadu. The lush green tea plantations, the vast meadows, the towering mountains, dense pine and eucalyptus trees, and serene lakes make Ooty a prominent part of any bucket. Overnight stay at Ooty. Visit Ooty lake, Botanical Garden. Overnight stay at Ooty. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel La Montana By TGI (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 4 (22 Jun 2024 - Saturday) Ooty Sightseeing Day 02 \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - La Montana By TGI\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Ooty Sightseeing Day 02\r\nAfter breakfast Proceed to Coonoor. Coonoor Sight seeing(Sim\'s Park, Lam\'s Rock, Dolphin Nose and Tea factory) and Doddabetta Peak. Overnight stay at Ooty. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel La Montana By TGI (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 (23 Jun 2024 - Sunday) Ooty to Bangalore \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - La Montana By TGI\r\nTransfers - Ooty to Bangalore\r\nAfter Breakfast proceed to Bangalore. Bangalore officially known as Bengaluru is the capital of Karnataka state of India. The city is famous for its ample of green spaces. It is blessed with many tourist destinations and attracts lot of tourists every year from across the globe. Check in at Hotel.overnight stay. \r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel AKSHAYA AURA (Meal Plan - CPAI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6 (24 Jun 2024 - Monday) Bangalore to BANGALORE - DEPARTURE \r\n\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - AKSHAYA AURA\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Bangalore to BANGALORE - DEPARTURE\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Bangalore international Airport/Railway station for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories. ','','Economy Class airfare\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nAll Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost \r\nAll Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 