airport transfer, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, breakfast, lunch, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Ba Na Hills & Golden Bridge (B)\r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Ba Na Hills (35km from Danang center). Take the Sunworld Cable Car to Ba Na hills station. Visit Vong Nguyet hills, Linh Ung Pagoda, and French Villas. Continue to Nui Chua Mountain, experiencing the hill climbing train and visiting the flower garden and pagoda. Walk across the Golden Bridge for panoramic views. Lunch at your leisure. Enjoy games at Fantasy Park. Return to hotel around 5pm. Overnight in Danang.\r\nInclusion :  Private transfer, guide, entrance fee, breakfast, hotel\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Da Nang to Ho Chi Minh (B)\r\nBreakfast at hotel. Transfer to Da Nang airport for flight to Ho Chi Minh City. Upon arrival, transfer to hotel for check-in. Overnight in HCMC.\r\nInclusion : Private airport transfer, breakfast, hotel\r\n\r\nDay 7 : Cu Chi Tunnels & Ho Chi Minh City Tour (B)\r\nStart at 8:30 AM from your hotel. Explore Cu Chi tunnels, experiencing life underground. Visit a rice paper workshop. In the afternoon, discover HCM City: Cho Lon market, a hidden Chinese pagoda, Notre Dame Cathedral, Central Post Office, and City Hall. Return to your hotel around 5:30 PM.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, guide, entrance fee, water, breakfast, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 8 : Departure from HCMC (B)\r\nBreakfast at hotel. Free time for shopping depending on your flight schedule. Transfer to the airport without guide for your departure flight. Goodbye, and hope to see you again soon!\r\nInclusion : Private airport transfer, breakfast.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Flight from Ha Noi to Da Nang\r\n* Flight from Da Nang to Ho Chi Minh\r\n* Accommodation based on twin/double sharing room\r\n* Private/SIC tours as mentioned in the itinerary.\r\n* Local English speaking guide as mentioned itinerary\r\n* Meals as mentioned (B = breakfast; L = lunch with set menu; D = dinner with set menu) with food only, drinks are not included. \r\n* Meals will be provided as mentioned in itinerary section.\r\n* Entrance fee to the mentioned itinerary\r\n* Bottled water for the touring day (500ml/bottle/pax/day) provide on the car/coach\r\n* Insurance\r\n','â€¢ Early check in/Late check out\r\nâ€¢ Personal expenses \r\nâ€¢ Surcharge in peak season (Christmas, New Year, Lunar New Year, etc.)\r\nâ€¢ Others not mentioned in the written details above\r\n* Tipping Policy: $US 3/pax/day (Mandatory)\r\n* Visa Charges\r\n* TCS','Airfare and schedule are subject to modification without prior notice from the airline\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-08-07','2024-08-15',1,0,0,'2024-05-31 18:15:59','2024-06-01 13:40:16'),(647,1216,54,2,0,0,41400,20000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n Day 1 : 20th Aug\r\nArrival at Singapore Airport, our representative will heartily greet you and transfer to the pre-reserved hotel in private transportation. Upon arrival, you will check-in at the hotel. In evening, leave for Night Safari on SIC. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\n Day 2: 21st Aug\r\nAfter Breakfast, leave for Singapore city orientation drive and afternoon Sentosa Island (Cable Car + Luge & Skyride + Wings of Time). Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\n Day 3: 22nd Aug\r\nAfter Breakfast, leave for Universal Studio (SIC). Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\n Day 4 : 23rd Aug\r\nAfter breakfast, enjoy some leisure time in the morning. In afternoon, leave for Gardens By The Bay (SIC). Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\n Day 5: 24th Aug\r\nAfter breakfast, enjoy the day at leisure and experience shopping in Singapore. \r\n\r\n Day 6 : 25th Aug\r\nAfter breakfast, departure for airport on private basis. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','',' * 5 nights accommodation at hotel with daily breakfast. 									\r\n * Return airport transfers on PVT Basis\r\n * All sightseeing on SIC basis. \r\n * Travel Insurance \r\n* Visa Charges\r\n\r\n \r\n				