in to Lucerne. Check-in at hotel and relax. In \r\n            evening, you can pay a visit to the Chapel Bridge or the Lion Monument. Shopaholics can here shop at near \r\n            by places. \r\n\r\nDay 4: After breakfast, leave for mesmerizing excursion to Mt. Titlis. After returning, relax at hotel. Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 5: After breakfast, leave for the Lucerne train station. Board the train to Zurich and enjoy the scenic beauty of \r\n            Switzerland on the way. Upon arrival, check-in at hotel. Get some rest and then pamper yourself with \r\n            shopping at local places. \r\n\r\nDay 6: After breakfast, leave for Rhine Falls Tour from Zurich (on your own)\r\n\r\nDay 7: After breakfast, check-out from hotel. It\'s time to bid Good Bye to your Switzerland trip. Leave for \r\n            airport.  Board the flight and fly back to Delhi. ','','Economy class airfare\r\n5N stay in the mentioned hotels with daily breakfast\r\nJungfraujoch Top of Europe Day Trip from Interlaken (with Swiss Pass)\r\nMount Titlis excursion from Engelberg incl. Ice Flyer (with Swiss Pass)\r\nRhine Falls Tour from Zurich (with Swiss Pass)\r\nTrain from Zurich to Interlaken (25th June) --with Swiss Pass\r\nTrain from Interlaken to Lucerne (27th June) -- with Swiss Pass\r\nTrain from Lucerne to Zurich (29th June) -- with Swiss Pass\r\n6 Days Consecutive Swiss Pass (2nd Class)\r\nZurich hotel to Zurich Airport transfer on Private\r\n\r\n','Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal and medical expense. \r\nRhine Falls ticket not included (to be purchased directly)\r\nSpecial train fare not included. \r\nTravel Insurance\r\nVisa Charges\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms and hotels are subject to availability. \r\nTrain fare is subject to change at the time of booking. \r\nThe Guests will have to manage on their own till the Pickup / Drop off point for SIC TOURS (can be covered with Swiss Pass in Switzerland)','2024-06-24','2024-06-30',1,0,0,'2024-06-02 12:26:21','2024-06-02 13:09:14'),(651,1220,54,2,1,0,58530,15000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 24 July\r\nArrival at Singapore Airport, our representative will heartily greet you and transfer to the pre-reserved hotel in private transportation. Upon arrival, you will check-in at the hotel. In evening, leave for Night Safari on SIC. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2: 25 July\r\nAfter Breakfast, leave for Singapore city orientation drive and afternoon Sentosa Island (Cable Car + Luge & Skyride + Wings of Time). Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: 26 july\r\nAfter Breakfast, leave for Universal Studio (SIC). Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 4 : 27 July\r\nAfter breakfast, enjoy some leisure time in the morning. In afternoon, leave for Gardens By The Bay (SIC). Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 5: 28 July\r\nAfter breakfast and proceed for check-out. Enjoy the day at leisure and experience shopping in Singapore.(Transfers to be arranged by the client).\r\nAfter that transfer to the Airport on PVT basis.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','',' * Economy Class Airfare \r\n * 4 nights accommodation at hotel with daily breakfast. 									\r\n * Return airport transfers on PVT Basis\r\n * All sightseeing on SIC basis. \r\n * Travel Insurance \r\n *  Visa Charges','Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal or medical expense\r\nTCS','Rooms are subject to availability.\r\nAirfare is dynamic.','2024-07-24','2024-07-28',1,0,0,'2024-06-03 12:26:51','2024-06-03 13:08:48'),(652,1222,15526,3,1,0,49350,15000,'Kashmir Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 16 june\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar. \r\n\r\nDay 2 : 17 june \r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.  \r\n\r\nDay 3 : 18 june \r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.   \r\n\r\nDay 4 : 19 june \r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar. \r\n\r\nDay 5 : 20 june \r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.                                                                     \r\n                                            \r\n                                      \r\n                                             \r\n                                             ','',' * Economy class airfare \r\n *  4 nights accommodation with breakfast.\r\n * Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\n * Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis.\r\n * Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat.\r\n * Driver Allowances.\r\n *  Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n\r\n','Any Air/Train/Bus fare or travel insurance.\r\nCost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\nExtra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\nCost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\nGuide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\nGuest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\nEntrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\nAny expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\nThe cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.\r\n \r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRooms are subject  to availability','2024-06-16','2024-06-20',1,0,0,'2024-06-04 12:05:44','2024-06-04 13:29:46'),(653,1221,15511,2,0,0,0,23050,'Spain Diaries','Day-wise Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 (02-12-2024): Ibiza Arrival - Check-in at the hotel and relax. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2 (03-12-2024): After breakfast,  leave for the Ibiza Beach Hopping Cruise with Paddle Boards and Snorkeling. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3 (04-12-2024): After breakfast,  leave for the Coves and Caves Excursion with Tapas and Premium Open Bar in Ibiza. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 4 (05-12-2024): After breakfast,  check-out from hotel. Leave for airport.  Board the flight and fly back to Madrid.\r\nMadrid Arrival - Check-in at the hotel and relax.\r\n\r\nDay 5 (06-12-2024) : After breakfast,  leave for the Madrid City Tour Hop-On Hop-Off Tour. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 6 (07-12-2024) : \r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from hotel.\r\nLeave for Madrid train station. Board the train to Barcelona. \r\nBarcelona Arrival.\r\nCheck-in at hotel and relax.\r\nleave for the Golden Sunset and Chill-Out - Eco Catamaran Cruise.\r\n\r\nDay 7 (08-12-2024) : \r\nAfter breakfast.\r\nleave for City Sightseeing Barcelona Hop-On Hop-Off Tour.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 8 (09-12-2024) : \r\nAfter breakfast.\r\nleave for Sagrada Familia Tour\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 9 (10-12-2024) : \r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from hotel. It\'s time to bid Good Bye to your Spain trip. Leave for airport.  Board the flight and fly back to Delhi.','','Economy class airfare\r\n8N stay in the mentioned hotels with daily breakfast\r\nSUP Adventure Ibiza (stand up paddle , snorkeling ,kayaking) VIP (Ibiza)\r\nCoves and Caves Excursion with Tapas and Premium Open Bar (Ibiza)\r\nGolden Sunset and Chill-Out - Eco Catamaran Cruise (Barcelona)\r\nCity Sightseeing Barcelona Hop-On Hop-Off Tour (Barcelona)\r\nSagrada Familia Tour (Barcelona)\r\nMadrid City Tour Hop-On Hop-Off Tour (Madrid)\r\nTrain from Madrid to Barcelona (07th December)\r\nTravel Insurance\r\nVisa Charges\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal and medical expense. \r\nAny transfers to departure points of sightseeing.\r\nAny transfer for airport pick-up and drop.\r\nTCS\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms and hotels are subject to availability. \r\nTrain fare is subject to change at the time of booking. ','2024-12-02','2024-12-10',1,0,0,'2024-06-04 13:48:17','2024-06-04 18:34:35'),(654,1223,54,2,0,0,50000,14000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :-\r\n\r\nDay 01 : (06 Aug) \r\nAirport to Hotel transfer (PVT)\r\nNight Safari with Tram Ride (pick up time 1715-1745 hrs) (SiC)\r\n\r\nDay 02 : (07 Aug)\r\nCity Orient