\n\r\n Day 6 : 22 June \r\nAfter breakfast at the hotel , then go for Private Peaceful Big Budha tour  2way Std Cable car tickets & Outlet mall shopping. Pick up-9 30 am. Return 3:30 pm. Relax in Hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 7 : 23 June \r\nIn the morning around 7 AM, pick up at the hotel lobby & private transfer to the Hong Kong airport for departure. (no Breakfast due to morning flight)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','',' * Economy Class Airfare \r\n * 2 nights in Macau without breakfast\r\n * 4 nights in Hong Kong with breakfast\r\n * All tours and sightseeing on pvt basis\r\n * All transfers on private basis\r\n * Honk Kong to Macau and Macau to Hong Kong ferry tickets\r\n * Insurance\r\n \r\n','Any expense of personal nature. \r\nAny type of transfer or meal other than mentioned above. \r\nAnything which is not mentioned under inclusions. \r\nTCS \r\nVisa\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nHotel/Rooms are subject to availability','2024-06-17','2024-06-23',1,0,0,'2024-06-06 13:16:16','2024-06-06 17:27:55'),(660,1228,15496,2,0,0,21500,0,'Kasol & Manali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n22nd June: Arrival and Drive to Kasol\r\n\r\n9:30 AM: Pick up from Ambala station.\r\nDrive from Ambala to Kasol (approx. 7 hours, including breaks).\r\nCheck-in at hotel in Kasol.\r\nRelax and explore the local area (if time allows)\r\n\r\n23rd June: Kasol Sightseeing (very less places are there for sightseeing)\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nExplore Kasol (visit Chalal village, walk along Parvati River).\r\nLunch at a local cafe at your own.\r\nVisit Manikaran Sahib Gurudwara and hot springs.\r\nLeisure time (shopping, relax at the cafÃ©).\r\nDinner (At your own) and relax at the hotel.\r\n\r\n24th June: Kasol to Manali\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nDrive from Kasol to Manali (approx. 3 hours).\r\nCheck-in at the hotel in Manali.\r\nLocal sightseeing (Hadimba Temple, Manu Temple, Vashisht Hot Water Springs) at your own.\r\nExplore Mall Road, shopping, and dinner at your own.\r\n\r\n25th June: Manali Sightseeing\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nFull day excursion to Solang Valley (adventure activities like paragliding, ropeway, etc.).\r\nReturn to Manali, rest at the hotel.\r\nVisit Old Manali (cafe hopping, shopping).\r\nDinner at your own and relax at the hotel.\r\n\r\n26th June: Manali Sightseeing\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nExcursion to Rohtang Pass (if open, advance permit required).\r\nLunch - Eat at a local eatery at your own.\r\nVisit Naggar Castle and Nicholas Roerich Art Gallery.\r\nReturn to Manali, free time for leisure.\r\nDinner at your own and relax at the hotel.\r\n\r\n27th June: Departure\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nDrive from Manali to Ambala station (approx. 8 hours).\r\nDrop at Ambala station for onward journey.\r\n','','Daily Breakfast.\r\n2 Nights stay in Kasol.\r\n3 Nights stay in Manali.\r\nRohtang Pass\r\nPrivate Transfers in Swift Dezire for 6 days.','Any other meal other than the mentioned one.\r\nAnything that is not mentioned in inclusions.','Hotel/rooms are subject to availability. ','2024-06-22','2024-06-27',1,0,0,'2024-06-08 16:37:13','2024-06-08 17:10:01'),(661,1229,15496,2,0,0,0,0,'Kasol & Manali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n22nd June: Arrival and Drive to Kasol\r\n\r\n9:30 AM: Pick up from Ambala station.\r\nDrive from Ambala to Kasol (approx. 7 hours, including breaks).\r\nCheck-in at hotel in Kasol.\r\nRelax and explore the local area (if time allows)\r\n\r\n23rd June: Kasol Sightseeing (very less places are there for sightseeing)\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nExplore Kasol (visit Chalal village, walk along Parvati River).\r\nLunch at a local cafe at your own.\r\nVisit Manikaran Sahib Gurudwara and hot springs.\r\nLeisure time (shopping, relax at the cafÃ©).\r\nDinner (At your own) and relax at the hotel.\r\n\r\n24th June: Kasol to Manali\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nDrive from Kasol to Manali (approx. 3 hours).\r\nCheck-in at the hotel in Manali.\r\nLocal sightseeing (Hadimba Temple, Manu Temple, Vashisht Hot Water Springs) at your own.\r\nExplore Mall Road, shopping, and dinner at your own.\r\n\r\n25th June: Manali Sightseeing\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nFull day excursion to Solang Valley (adventure activities like paragliding, ropeway, etc.).\r\nReturn to Manali, rest at the hotel.\r\nVisit Old Manali (cafe hopping, shopping).\r\nDinner at your own and relax at the hotel.\r\n\r\n26th June: Manali Sightseeing\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nExcursion to Rohtang Pass (if open, advance permit required).\r\nLunch - Eat at a local eatery at your own.\r\nVisit Naggar Castle and Nicholas Roerich Art Gallery.\r\nReturn to Manali, free time for leisure.\r\nDinner at your own and relax at the hotel.\r\n\r\n27th June: Departure\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nDrive from Manali to Ambala station (approx. 8 hours).\r\nDrop at Ambala station for onward journey.\r\n','','Daily Breakfast.\r\n2 Nights stay in Kasol.\r\n3 Nights stay in Manali.\r\nRohtang Pass\r\nPrivate Transfers in Swift Dezire for 6 days.','Any other meal other than the mentioned one.\r\nAnything that is not mentioned in inclusions.','Hotel/rooms are subject to availability. ','2024-06-22','2024-06-27',0,0,0,'2024-06-10 12:14:56','2024-06-10 14:09:44'),(662,1230,15500,2,0,0,149000,47000,'Swiss Paris','Day-wise Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Zurich Arrival and Train to Interlaken. \r\n            Upon arrival in Interlaken, check-in at the hotel and relax. In evening, explore near by places on your own. \r\n\r\nDay 2: After breakfast, leave for the day trip to Jungfraujoch -Top of the Europe. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: After breakfast, leave for Interlaken train station. Board the train to Lucerne. Check-in at hotel and relax. In \r\n            evening, you can pay a visit to the Chapel Bridge or the Lion Monument (on your own with swiss pass). \r\n            Shopaholics can here shop at near by places. \r\n\r\nDay 4: After breakfast, leave for mesmerizing excursion to Mt. Titlis. After returning, relax at hotel. Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 5: After breakfast, leave for the Lucerne train station. Board the train to Zurich and enjoy the scenic beauty of \r\n            Switzerland on the way. Upon arrival, check-in at hotel. Get some rest and then pamper yourself with \r\n            shopping at local places. \r\n\r\nDay 6: After breakfast, leave for Rhine Falls Tour from Zurich (on your own)\r\n\r\nDay 7: After breakfast, check-out from hotel. It\'s time to bid Good Bye to your Switzerland trip. Leave for \r\n            airport.  Board the flight and fly back to Delhi. ','','Economy class airfare\r\n5N stay in the mentioned hotels with daily breakfast\r\nJungfraujoch Top of Europe Day Trip from Interlaken (with Swiss Pass)\r\nMount Titlis half day tour from Lucerne (with Swiss Pass)\r\nRhine Falls Tour from Zurich (with Swiss Pass)\r\nTrain from Zurich to Interlaken (25th June) --with Swiss Pass\r\nTrain from Interlaken to Lucerne (27th June) -- with Swiss Pass\r\nTrain from Lucerne to Zurich (29th June) -- with Swiss Pass\r\n6 Days Consecutive Swiss Pass (2nd Class)\r\nZurich hotel to Zurich Airport transfer on Private\r\n\r\n','Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal and medical expense. \r\nRhine Falls ticket not included (to be purchased directly)\r\nSpecial train fare not included. \r\nTravel Insurance\r\nVisa Charges\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms and hotels are subject to availability. \r\nTrain fare is subject to change at the time of booking. \r\nThe Guests will have to manage on their own till the Pickup / Drop off point for SIC TOURS (can be covered with Swiss Pass in Switzerland)','2024-06-24','2024-07-01',1,0,0,'2024-06-11 09:02:42','2024-06-11 18:01:55'),(663,1231,54,3,1,0,105000,15000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :-\r\n\r\nDay 01 : (13th Nov)\r\nAirport to Hotel Transfer (PVT)\r\nNight Safari with Tram Ride (pickup time 17:15-17:45 hrs) (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 02 : (14th Nov)\r\nCity Orien