ast at the hotel.\r\nExcursion to Rohtang Pass (if open, advance permit required).\r\nLunch - Eat at a local eatery at your own.\r\nVisit Naggar Castle and Nicholas Roerich Art Gallery.\r\nReturn to Manali, free time for leisure.\r\nDinner at your own and relax at the hotel.\r\n\r\n27th June: Departure\r\nBreakfast at the hotel.\r\nDrive from Manali to Ambala station (approx. 8 hours).\r\nDrop at Ambala station for onward journey.\r\n','','Daily Breakfast.\r\n2 Nights stay in Kasol.\r\n3 Nights stay in Manali.\r\nRohtang Pass\r\nPrivate Transfers in Swift Dezire for 6 days.','Any other meal other than the mentioned one.\r\nAnything that is not mentioned in inclusions.','Hotel/rooms are subject to availability. ','2024-06-22','2024-06-27',0,0,0,'2024-06-15 00:49:25','2024-06-15 00:49:25'),(670,1244,54,2,0,0,43000,11000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 9 Aug\r\nArrival at Singapore Airport, our representative will heartily greet you and transfer to the pre-reserved hotel in private transportation. Upon arrival, you will check-in at the hotel. In evening, leave for Night Safari on SIC. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2:  10 Aug\r\nAfter Breakfast, leave for Singapore city orientation drive and afternoon Sentosa Island (Cable Car + Luge & Skyride + Wings of Time). Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: 11 Aug\r\nAfter Breakfast, leave for Universal Studio (SIC). Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 4 : 12 Aug\r\nAfter Breakfast, Enjoy the day at leisure and experience shopping in Singapore.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : 13 Aug \r\nAfter breakfast, enjoy some leisure time in the morning. In afternoon, leave for Gardens By The Bay (SIC). Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 6 : 14 Aug \r\nAfter breakfast and proceed for check-out. Transfers to Airport.\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare \r\n * 5 nights accommodation at hotel with daily breakfast. 									\r\n * Return airport transfers on PVT Basis\r\n * All sightseeing on SIC basis. \r\n * Travel Insurance \r\n *  Visa 