ned above\r\nAny type of personal or medical expense\r\nTCS','Hotels/Rooms are subject to availability.\r\nAirfare is dynamic.\r\n','2024-08-25','2024-08-30',1,0,0,'2024-06-24 16:07:52','2024-06-24 17:50:32'),(687,1264,15539,3,1,0,0,0,'Ooty Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 15 Aug   Coimbatore Arrival - Ooty \r\nArrive at Coimbatore and proceed to Ooty, popularly known as the \'Queen of Hill Stations\' is nestled in the Nilgiri hills in Tamil Nadu. The lush green tea plantations, the vast meadows, the towering mountains, dense pine and eucalyptus trees, and serene lakes make Ooty a prominent part of any bucket. Overnight stay at Ooty.  \r\n\r\nDay 2: 16 Aug  Ooty Sightseeing \r\nAfter breakfast Proceed to Coonoor. Coonoor Sight seeing(Sim\'s Park, Lam\'s Rock, Dolphin Nose and Tea factory). Overnight stay at Ooty. \r\n\r\nDay 3 : 17 Aug Ooty Sightseeing \r\nVisit Ooty lake and Botanical garden. Overnight stay at Ooty. \r\n\r\nDay 4 : 18 Aug  Coimbatore Departure Transfer \r\nAfter Breakfast Check out from hotel and proceed to Coimbatore for Departure \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy class Airfare\r\n* 3 Nights accomodation with breakfast \r\n* All transfers and sightseeing with pvt sedan AC Vehicle.\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost \r\n','Entry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\nAyurveda Charges \r\nEntry Fees To Monuments And Palaces  \r\nAny meal other than the mentioned above','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRooms are subject to availability','2024-08-15','2024-08-18',1,0,0,'2024-06-24 17:19:54','2024-07-18 10:49:51'),(690,1267,2326,3,0,0,0,0,'Himachal Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :-\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Chandigarh - SHIMLA: Pick up and drive to Shimla. \r\n\r\nDay 2 : SHIMLA with in the city ( Uptill Kufri ).\r\n\r\nDay 3 : SHIMLA- MANALI (265 Km Approx 8-10 Hrs) After breakfast check out from hotel and drive to Manali \r\n\r\nDay 4 : MANALI - LOCAL SIGHT SEEING: -Walk through town visiting newly constructed Buddhist Monastery. Hadimba Devi temple-It is small temple situated in the dense forest is very interesting. Hadimba is said to be the wife of Bhima from the epic of Mahabharata. Vashist, it is an extremely picturesque little place clinging to the steep hill side. On the way up to the village you come upon the Vashishat hot baths where a natural Sulphur spring is piped into a modern bathhouse \r\n\r\nDay 5 : MANALI: â€“ SOLANG VALLEY : Wake up to the sweet sound of nature and after breakfast head towards Solang Valley. This valley is famous for its adventure activities, and you can try your hand at Paragliding, Zorbing, ATV Rides, Horse-riding, Trail-rides and so much more at own expense.\r\n\r\nDAY 6 : Manali â€“ Dharamshala : Drive to Dharamshala by Cab reach in Dharamshala in the evening. On arrival at Dharamshala check in to the hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 07: Dharamshala â€“Local- Dharamshala. After Breakfast, drive to local sightseeing including official residence of Dalai lama in McLeod Ganj, St John church, Monasteries & Bhagsunath temple, the oldest temple in Dharamshala.\r\n\r\nDay 8: Dharmshala to Chandigarh drop.','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Pickup and drop as mentioned\r\n* Accommodation as mentioned hotels or similar\r\n* Daily Breakfast As per hotel policy( Buffet or Room Service)\r\n* Vehicle : Innova Crysta\r\n* Toll and taxes.\r\n* Parking charges.\r\n* Driver allowances.\r\n* Local Transfers & sightseeing by mentioned vehicle\r\n ','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-07-12','2024-07-19',1,0,0,'2024-06-25 11:56:35','2024-06-25 11:56:35'),(691,1269,2326,3,0,0,40000,8473,'Himachal Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :-\r\n\r\n12 July : Pickup from Chandigarh Airport and drop to Shimla\r\n12th, 13th and 14th July in Shimla for a wedding \r\n15 July : Drive from Shimla to Manali, visit local market (if time permits)\r\n16 July : Trip to Solang Valley and Rohtang pass\r\n17 July : Local sightseeing, which includes a visit to the Hadimba Temple, Manali Nature Park and Mall Road\r\n18 July : A drive to Manikaran for its hot springs and Gurudwara Sahib, followed by a visit to the Kullu Shawl Factory\r\n19 July : Departure from Manali to Chandigarh Airport\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Pickup and drop as mentioned\r\n* Accommodation as mentioned hotels or similar\r\n* Daily Breakfast As per hotel policy( Buffet or Room Service)\r\n* Vehicle : Innova Crysta & Swift Dezire\r\n* Toll and taxes.\r\n* Parking charges.\r\n* Driver allowances.\r\n* Local Transfers & sightseeing by mentioned vehicle Innova Crysta\r\n* Shimla to Chandigarh transfer for 1 pax by Swift Dezire\r\n ','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-07-12','2024-07-19',1,0,0,'2024-06-25 18:09:06','2024-06-29 12:35:30'),(692,1270,557,8,0,0,0,0,'Sri Lanka Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :-\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Upon arrival at Bandaranayake International Airport, meet and assist by airport representatives, then proceed to Colombo, check in at the hotel, and explore the nightlife independently. Overnight stay in Colombo.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : After breakfast at the hotel, proceed to Galle to visit the Dutch fort area and a Turtle Hatchery, followed by enjoying a Madu River boat ride. Optionally, engage in water sports in Bentota before returning to Colombo upon completion.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : After breakfast at the hotel, enjoy a city tour of Colombo followed by a shopping tour, explore the nightlife, and stay overnight in Colombo.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : After breakfast at the hotel, proceed with the departure transfer to the airport.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Daily breakfast at the booked hotel\r\n* Meet & Assist at the airport \r\n* City tour as per the itinerary\r\n* An air-conditioned vehicle with an English speaking driver throughout the tour\r\n* All applicable Gov. Taxes   \r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Visa Charges\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-08-15','2024-08-18',1,0,0,'2024-06-26 17:20:54','2024-06-27 15:14:35'),(693,1273,1105,3,0,0,18900,7000,'Udaipur Diaries','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival at airport and drop to the booked hotel\r\nVisit architectutal marvel - the City Palace\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Visit Fateh Sagar, Shiljpgram and more\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Visit Kumbhalgarh Fort on a full day Udaipur Tour\r\n\r\nDay 4 : Get on a historical excursion to Chittorgarh\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Transfer from the booked hotel to Airport for the return jorney','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Daily breakfast at the booked hotel\r\n* Sedan Car with driver\r\n* Tolltax and parking\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-07-03','2024-07-07',1,0,0,'2024-06-27 15:04:15','2024-06-27 15:48:34'),(694,1274,419,3,0,0,0,0,'Srinagar Diaries','ITINERARY DETAILS\r\n\r\nDay 01: On arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                              \r\n                                                                                           \r\nDay 02: After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                            \r\nDay 03: After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                                \r\n                                    \r\nDay 04: After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Pahalgam, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                              \r\n                                    \r\nDay 05: After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.                                               \r\n                                    \r\nDay 06: After breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.                                                                     ','','âœ” Economy Class airfare\r\nâœ” Accommodation  as above.\r\nâœ” Breakfast in the hotel.\r\nâœ” Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\nâœ” Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\nâœ” Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\nâœ” Driver Allowances.\r\nâœ” Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\nâœ” Hotel Taxes\r\n','âœ” Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\nâœ” Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\nâœ” Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\nâœ” Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\nâœ” Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\nâœ”Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\nâœ” Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\nâœ” The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms/hotels are subject to availability.','2024-07-03','2024-07-08',1,0,0,'2024-06-27 16:18:11','2024-06-27 17:32:47'),(695,1275,349,3,1,0,50000,12000,'Dubai Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 6th July \r\nArrival Transfers to Dubai Airport to Hotel Bur Dubai on PVT basis.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : 7th July\r\nIn the Morning, After the breakfast, explore the near by market and in the evening Marina Dhow Cruise with Dinner on SIC basis.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : 8th July\r\nIn the Morning, After the breakfast, Half Day Dubai City + Burj Khalifa 124th floor Normal Time on SIC basis.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : 9th July\r\nIn the Morning, After the breakfast, rest in the hotel and in the night enjoy at Dune Desert safari with BBQ Dinner on SIC basis.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : 10th July\r\nIn the Morning, After the breakfast, Departure to Dubai Airport on PVT basis ( According to your flight details)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','',' * 4 Night Accommodation in the Hotel with Breakfast.\r\n * All transfers on pvt basis.\r\n * All tours on SIC basis.\r\n ','TCS \r\n','Rooms are subject to availability.\r\n','2024-07-06','2024-07-10',0,0,0,'2024-06-29 19:56:09','2024-06-29 20:49:13'),(696,1276,419,2,1,0,49200,11000,'Srinagar Diaries','Suggested itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 18th July\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.  \r\n\r\nDay 2 : 19th July\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.       (or you can choose )\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and  proceed to Doodhpathri - valley of milk, located in Budgam district, lies in bowl shaped valley in Pir Panjal Range. Its an alpine valley covered with snow clad mountains. Not a lot of tourists come to this place, since the road conditions are not favorable. After some quiet and peaceful time at Doodhpathri drive back for overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.    \r\n\r\nDay 3 : 20th July\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.   \r\n\r\nDay 4 : 21st July\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Pahalgam, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.  \r\n\r\nDay 5 : 22nd July\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.                                               \r\n\r\nDay 6 : 23rd July\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.                                                                                             \r\n\r\n                                            \r\n                                             \r\n                                  \r\n\r\n\r\n                                           \r\n\r\n','',' * Economy class Airfare \r\n * 5 nights accommodation  and breakfast in the hotel.\r\n * Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\n * Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis (Sedan vehicle )\r\n * Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\n * Driver Allowances.\r\n * Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n\r\n','Any Air/Train/Bus fare or travel insurance.\r\nCost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\nExtra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\nCost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\nGuide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\nGuest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\nEntrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\nExpenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\nAny expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\nThe cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms are subject to availability.','2024-07-18','2024-07-23',1,0,0,'2024-07-01 13:17:57','2024-07-01 13:22:09'),(697,1277,54,2,0,0,79600,20000,'Singapore and Kuala Lumpur  Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : (14 Oct) : Arrival at the Singapore Airport and transfer to the pre-booked hotel (PVT)\r\nCity Orientation Drive + Afternoon Sentosa (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 02 : (15 Oct)\r\nNight Safari with Tram Ride (pick-up time 17:15 hrs-17:45 hrs) (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 03 : (16 Oct)\r\nUniversal Studio (Dynamic Price) (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 04 : (17 Oct) : Arrival at the Kuala Lumpur Airport and transfer to the pre-booked hotel (PVT)\r\nHalf Day City Tour With KI Tower (Observation Deck) (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 05 : (18 Oct)\r\nFull Day Sunway Lagoon Tour with 6 theme park tickets\r\n\r\nDay 06 : (19 Oct)\r\nGenting Full Day Tour Enroute Batu Caves + One Way Cable Car with Indore Theme Park\r\n\r\nDay 07 : (20 Oct)\r\nTransfer to the Airport for the homebound flight\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Daily breakfast at the booked hotel\r\n* Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* All the tours mentioned in the itinerary on SIC basis\r\n* Singapore Visa\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meals other than the mentioned abiove\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability','2024-10-14','2024-10-20',1,0,0,'2024-07-03 14:40:50','2024-07-03 17:24:07'),(698,1279,16002,2,0,0,47300,18000,'Bali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDAY 1 : Arrival in Bali and check-in at hotel. \r\n\r\nDAY 2 : After breakfast, enjoy Benoa water sports including 1 x round of Banana boat, flying fish and Jet skii  + Parasailing Adventure  followed by Uluwatu sunset temple Tour including Kecak dance with private transfers \r\n\r\nDAY 3 : After breakfast, enjoy West Nusa Penida tour with transfer and ferry ( 1 point snorkeling day trip) on private basis (Guest can upg Lunch at Local Indian Resto with USD 12 pp additional .. Restro Name : Delhi 66)                                    (Hotel - Bali Port - Hotel - with SIC transfers)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         Meeting Point Pelabuhan Sanur.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Destination : Broken Beach, Angel Billabong, Klingking Clif & Crystal Bay (1 point Snorkeling)                                                  Boat start at 08.00 AM and back at 04.00 PM. (SIC basis)\r\n                                                                                 