on if any (Upon booking)Â \r\nExpenditure of a personal nature such as drinks, souvenirs and laundry\r\nAny cost not mentioned in the â€˜Cost Includesâ€™ section\"\r\nTCS\r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRooms/hotels are subject to availability. ','2024-12-11','2024-12-16',1,0,0,'2024-07-03 16:37:18','2024-07-03 20:35:43'),(699,1282,355,5,1,0,0,0,'Ayodha diaries','Suggested itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : 18th sep   Varanasi Arrival \r\nArrival at Varanasi Station and proceed for hotel and check-in hotel .  Later in the evening enjoy Ganga aarti by boat ride (charges Included). Stay overnight in Hotel.     \r\n\r\nDay 2: 19th sep  Varanasi Temple Darshan\r\nAfter breakfast, early in the morning on the second day. You will be taken on an early morning boat ride (optional charges ). This boat ride is the best way to enjoy top ghats and rituals performed in each ghat. You can find many people bathing in the river. After the boat ride, you will be taken on a temple tour to enjoy the morning rituals in famous temples like, Kashi Vishwanath temple, Annapurna temple, and others. Later, you will be taken back to the hotel for breakfast and later proceed SankatMochan Hanuman temple , Manas Mandir , BHU. Then drive to Sarnath. Sarnath is the spot where Lord Buddha delivered his sermon after getting enlightenment. Top attractions visited in Sarnath are an archeological museums, Buddha temples, stupas. Stay overnight in Hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : 20th sep â€“ Varanasi to Ayodhya (transfer by Crysta)\r\nAfter breakfast drive to Ayodhya and proceed for hotel and check-in in the hotel.\r\nLater in the evening, we will go for a ghat walk at ram ki paidi with a glimpse of old temples. After that will proceed for attending the Saryu Aarti & laser light show at Ram ki Paidi. Overnight stay in hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : 21st sep \r\nIn morning, after breakfast will go to temple tour - Ramjanambhoomi, Hanumangarhi, kanak Bhawan & Dashrath Mahal. Guptarghat, Nandigram. And  drop at Ayodhya Airport /Railway station.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                         \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','',' * 3 nights accommodation in hotel.\r\n * Meal Plan as per above in Hotels.\r\n * Transfers & sightseeing by Ac Crysta  (Vehicle Service from 08:00 Am to 08:00 PM after that additional cost will be applicable )\r\n * Toll, Parking, Driver Allowance.\r\n * 1 Evening Aarti by motor boat with Guide in Varanasi(1:30 hours).\r\n * 1day Ayodhya Temple tour with Guide and 2 E-rickshaw .','Entrances fees\r\nGuide charge (where not mentioned)\r\nExpenses of personal nature such as drinks, telephone, and laundry bills etc\r\nTips and porter charges\r\nAny additional expenses incurred due to any flight delay or cancellation, weather conditions, political closures, technical faults etc\r\nAny other service/s not specified above \r\n','Rooms are subject to availability','2024-09-18','2024-09-21',0,0,0,'2024-07-04 13:31:39','2024-07-04 13:37:28'),(700,1280,15510,2,0,0,34700,15000,'Thailand Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n1st Day (11 Dec)	\r\nTRANSFERS : EX PHUKET APT - Krabi Hotel ( Ao- Anang Area ) 	1-PRIVATE CAR HKT (Max 2 + Luggage) \r\n\r\n2nd Day (12 Dec)	\r\nTOURS - EX KRABI - Private Land Transfer for Krabi 4 Island Tour Long Tailed ( Hotel - Pier - Hotel ) 	1-PRIVATE VAN (Max 10 ) \r\nKrabi 4 Island Tour  Krabi 4 Island Tour By Long Tailed Boat + Lunch Entrance ( Exclude NPF )  2 Adults \r\n\r\n3rd Day (13 Dec)	\r\nTRANSFERS : EX KRABI HOTEL - Phuket Hotel ( Patong Area ) 	1-PRIVATE CAR KBV (Max 2 + Luggage) \r\n\r\n4th Day (14 Dec)	\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Phuket Half Day City Tour - Big Buddha ( With Guide ) 	1-PRIVATE CAR HKT (Max 2 )\r\n \r\n5th Day (15 Dec)	\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Private Land Transfer for Phi Phi Island Tour Big Boat ( Hotel - Pier - Hotel ) 	1-PRIVATE CAR HKT (Max 2 )\r\nPhi Phi Island Tour 	Phi Phi Island Tour By Big Boat with Lunch Entrance ( Exclude NPF ) 2 Adults\r