0700-0830 Hrs Breakfast at hotel.\r\nDay Free to explore Pattaya on your own.\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Pattaya - Bangkok\r\n0700-0830 Hrs Breakfast at hotel.\r\n0930 Hrs Check out from the hotel and proceed for Bangkok on the way Bangkok city tour arrive Bangkok. Check In to The Bangkok Hotel\r\n1400-1430 Hrs Check in Bangkok hotel.\r\nEvening is free at leisure.\r\n\r\nDay 05 : Bangkok\r\n0700-0900 Hrs Breakfast at hotel.\r\nDay at leisure to explore city on your own.\r\n\r\nDay 06 : Bangkok - Departure\r\n0700-0900 Hrs Breakfast in hotel. Standard Check out time : 1100-1200 hrs.\r\nPick up from hotel get transfer to Airport to catch your flight back to Delh\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare Delhi - Bangkok- Delhi ( low cost airline, meals on additional cost ) \r\n* 03 Nights accommodation at Pattaya\r\n* 02 Nights accommodation at Bangkok\r\n* 05 Breakfast \r\n* Airport Hotel airport transfers\r\n* Pattaya - Bangkok transfers\r\n* Coral island tour by normal boat sharing basis\r\n* Bangkok city tour sharing basis \r\n* All transfers & tours on seat in coach/sharing basis\r\n* All hotel taxes and service charges \r\n* Airport taxes \r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Please note â€“ Standard hotel check in time starts between 1400-1600Hrs.\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-08-10','2024-08-15',1,0,0,'2024-07-06 15:49:47','2024-07-06 16:18:02'),(705,1287,15510,2,0,0,0,0,'Thailand Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival PATTAYA\r\nArrive Bangkok, the city of temples, spas, endless shopping sprees and a vivid nightlife. Please clear your Visa\r\non arrival formalities within 2 hours. After Clearing immigration and baggage collection proceed to meeting\r\npoint at Gate No. 10 (arrival floor/ 2nd Floor). Your sharing transfer is scheduled. Look out for hotel\r\nrepresentative holding a placard of Hotel Name Or your Name. Drive to Pattaya which is app