r airport.  Board the flight and fly back to Madrid.\r\nMadrid Arrival - Check-in at the hotel and relax.\r\n\r\nDay 5 (06-12-2024) : After breakfast,  leave for the Madrid City Tour Hop-On Hop-Off Tour. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 6 (07-12-2024) : \r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from hotel.\r\nLeave for Madrid train station. Board the train to Barcelona. \r\nBarcelona Arrival.\r\nCheck-in at hotel and relax.\r\nleave for the Golden Sunset and Chill-Out - Eco Catamaran Cruise.\r\n\r\nDay 7 (08-12-2024) : \r\nAfter breakfast.\r\nDay at leisure.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 8 (09-12-2024) : \r\nAfter breakfast.\r\nleave for Sagrada Familia: Guided Tour with Access to the Passion Tower\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 9 (10-12-2024) : \r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from hotel. It\'s time to bid Good Bye to your Spain trip. Leave for airport.  Board the flight and fly back to Delhi.','','â€¢	Economy class airfare\r\nâ€¢	Accommodation\r\nâ€¢	Daily Breakfast\r\nâ€¢	Ibiza - Transfer from Airport to Hotel on PVT basis\r\nâ€¢	All-Inclusive Boat Party with Clubs Admission Included (Oceanbeat Ibiza Boat Party 14:00)- Dep point: Vanilla Beach Ibiza ,Paseo Playa d\'en Bossa, Carrer de La Punta, 5, 07800 \r\nâ€¢	Excursion by boat to the coves and beaches in the north of Ibiza (Excursion by boat to the coves and beaches in the north of Ibiza 10:00) Dep. Point - Paella Restaurant Lagom Ibiza ,Puerto deportivo, 18, 07840 Santa EulÃ ria des Riu, Illes Balears\r\nâ€¢	Ibiza - Transfer from Hotel to Airport on PVT basis\r\nâ€¢	Madrid - Transfer from Airport to Hotel on PVT basis\r\nâ€¢	Big Bus Madrid Hop-on Hop-off Sightseeing Tour (Panoramic Loop by Open-top Bus )\r\nâ€¢	Madrid - Transfer from Hotel to Station on PVT basis\r\nâ€¢	Barcelona - Transfer from Station to Hotel on PVT basis\r\nâ€¢	Barcelona Sunset and Chillout Eco Catamaran cruise (Sunset Eco Cruise 20:00) Dep. Point - City Sailing Barcelona ,Moll de les Drassanes, Ciutat Vella, 08039 Barcelona, Spain\r\nâ€¢	Barcelona - Transfer from Hotel to Airport on PVT basis\r\nâ€¢	Sagrada Familia: Guided Tour with Access to the Passion Tower\r\nâ€¢	Train from Madrid to Barcelona (07th December)\r\nâ€¢	Travel Insurance\r\nâ€¢	Visa Charges\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal and medical expense. \r\nAny transfers to departure points of sightseeing.\r\nAny transfer for airport pick-up and drop.\r\nTCS\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms and hotels are subject to availability. \r\nTrain fare is subject to change at the time of booking. ','2024-12-02','2024-12-10',1,0,0,'2024-08-16 12:22:48','2024-08-16 12:22:48'),(753,1354,16002,5,1,0,0,0,'Bali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDAY 1 :\r\nArrival at the Airport and transfer to the hotel. Check-in and relax. Evening you can explore nearby places on your own \r\n\r\nDAY 2 : \r\nBenoa water sports including 1 x round of Banana boat, flying fish and Jet skii  + Parasailing Adventure followed by Uluwatu sunset temple Tour including Kecak dance with private transfers \r\n\r\nDAY 3 : \r\nWest Nusa Penida tour with transfer and ferry ( 1 point snorkelling day trip) on private basis                            \r\n(Guest can upg Lunch at Local Indian Resto with USD 10 pp additional .. Restro Name : Delhi 66)                                    (Hotel - Bali Port - Hotel - with SIC transfers)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         Meeting Point Pelabuhan Sanur.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Destination : Broken Beach, Angel Billabong, Klingking Clif & Crystal Bay (1 point Snorkeling)                                                  Boat start at 08.00 AM and back at 04.00 PM. (SIC basis)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              Tour Include : Car for tour island, Driver as Guide, Local Lunch (Vegetarian Only), Return Boat Free entrance all destination, only Snorkeling Equipment, Life Jacket                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 Tour Exclude : Retribution fee to Island Nusa Penida IDR 25.000,-/person.\r\n\r\nDAY 4 : \r\nUbud Village + (Tegalalang Rice Field / Tegenungan waterfall) + My SWING - (2 Single Swing, Fun Adrenaline Swing, Exciting Adrenaline Swing, Ultimate Swing,  Couple Swing, Romantice Bed Swing,  Family Bed Swing,  Chicken Nest,  Bird Nest,  Sweet Love Nest, Glass Floor) WITH TRANSFERS \r\n\r\nDAY 5 : \r\nCheck-out from the hotel and transfer to airport for departure flight\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 04 Nights Accommodation with Daily breakfast\r\n* Meet & Greet assistance with Welcome with Garland\r\n* Return Airport transfer by Pvt Basis\r\n* Transfers with air-conditioned vehicle & 1x 500ml Mineral Water every day  \r\n* English speaking driver cum guide assistance\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Visa Charges\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-01-21','2025-01-25',1,0,0,'2024-08-16 18:42:29','2024-08-17 15:13:11'),(754,1355,15512,5,1,0,248400,50000,'Vietnam Diaries','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\nDay 1 â€“ 21 Jan : Arrival Hanoi Vietnam â€“ morning city highlights \r\nUpon arriving at Noi Bai International Airport, meet your tour guide and transfer to the city center for a tour. Early check-in is not included (Hotel check-in: 2-3 PM). Visit the Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum (viewed from outside) and learn about Ho Chi Minh\'s life. Stop briefly at the One Pillar Pagoda, inspired by the lotus flower. Next, see the Temple of Literature, Vietnam\'s first university from the 11th century. Finish with a walk through the Hanoi Old Quarter to view French-colonial architecture and local vendors. Overnight in Hanoi.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, guide, entrance fee, hotel\r\n\r\nDay 2 â€“ 22 Jan : Hanoi â€“ Ha Long, welcome on the boat SIC (B,L,D)\r\nDepart from your hotel to Ha Long Bay around 8:00 AM in a private van (3.5 hours). Arrive at the port around noon, board the cruise, and settle into your cabin. Enjoy a fresh seafood lunch while exploring Bai Tu Long Bay. Swim, visit a cave, and relax on a secluded beach. Return to the boat to watch the sunset from the top deck and have a seafood dinner. Overnight on the cruise.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, all meals, permits.\r\n \r\nDay 3 â€“ 23 Jan : Explore Ha Long Bay â€“ Hanoi â€“ Flight to Da Nang (B,L/Br)\r\nEarly risers can enjoy the sunrise and stunning bay views. Breakfast is served around 8:00 AM, followed by a short rowboat trip with locals. Have brunch on the boat while cruising back to the pier.\r\nNote: The final itinerary may vary. Travel to the airport for your flight to Da Nang. Overnight in Da Nang.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, breakfast, brunch, hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 4 â€“ 24 Jan : Ba Na hill â€“ Golden Bridge (B)\r\nHave breakfast at your hotel. At 8:00 AM, transfer to Ba Na Hills (35 km from Da Nang) and ride the Sunworld Cable Car. Visit By Night Station, Vong Nguyet Hills, Linh Ung Pagoda, and the Old Villas. Continue to Nui Chua Mountain for views from Nghinh Phong, Le Nim Villas, and the Orchid Garden. Ride the hill-climbing train and explore Le Jardin D\'amour and Linh Ung Pagoda. Walk across the Golden Bridge and enjoy Fantasy Park (Note: Some attractions have additional costs). Return to your hotel around 4 PM. Overnight in Da Nang.\r\nInclusion :  Private transfer, guide, entrance fee, hotel\r\n\r\nDay 5 - 25 Jan : Da Nang - fly to Ho Chi Minh City, city highlights (B)\r\nHave breakfast at your hotel, then transfer to Da Nang airport for your flight to Ho Chi Minh City. Upon arrival, transfer to downtown Ho Chi Minh City. Visit Binh Tay Market, Thien Hau Temple, a lacquer workshop, and the Jade Emperor Pagoda. Explore Notre Dame Cathedral and the Central Post Office. Return to your hotel. Overnight in Ho Chi Minh City.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, guide, entrance fee, hotel\r\n\r\nDay 6 â€“ 26 Jan : Ho Chi Minh Departure (B)\r\nBreakfast at the hotel. Prepare on your own until our driver picks you up for airport transfer flight back home. (Hotel check out time: Noon 12PM)\r\nInclusion : Private transfer drops off airport.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5 nights accomodation as mentioned with breakfast\r\n* Internal sector flights \r\n* Private air-conditioned vehicle with private driver as mentioned itinerary\r\n* Local English speaking guide as mentioned itinerary\r\n* Meals as mentioned (B = breakfast; L = lunch with set menu; D = dinner with set menu)\r\n* Entrance fee to the mentioned itinerary\r\n* Bottled water for the touring day (500ml/bottle/pax/day) \r\n* Insurance\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Tips (3 USD/pax/day â€“ compulsory)\r\n* Surcharge in peak season (Christmas, New Year, Lunar New Year, etc.)\r\n* VIsa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-01-20','2025-01-26',1,0,0,'2024-08-17 14:54:56','2024-08-18 15:31:23'),(757,1358,54,2,2,0,0,0,'Singapore Diaries','Option 1 :  \r\n3 NIGHT PENANG CRUISE\r\nBrand: ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL\r\nShip: ANTHEM OF THE SEAS\r\n\r\nSailing Date: Monday, January 20, 2025\r\n\r\n20-Jan-2025 SINGAPORE - SINGAPORE  16:30:00 (Depart) EMBARK\r\n21-Jan-2025 PENANG - MALAYSIA 14:00:00 (Arrive) 23:00:00 (Depart) DOCKED\r\n22-Jan-2025 CRUISING CRUISING\r\n23-Jan-2025 SINGAPORE - SINGAPORE	07:00:00	(Arrive) DEBARK\r\n\r\nOption 2 :  \r\n4 NIGHT PENANG AND PHUKET CRUISE\r\nBrand: ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL\r\nShip: ANTHEM OF THE SEAS\r\n\r\nSailing Date: Thursday, January 16, 2025\r\n16-Jan-2025  SINGAPORE - SINGAPORE		16:30:00 (Depart)	EMBARK\r\n17-Jan-2025	  PENANG - MALAYSIA	14:00:00(Arrive)	21:00:00 (Depart)	DOCKED\r\n18-Jan-2025  PHUKET - THAILAND	08:00:00(Arrive)	20:00:00 (Depart)	TENDERED\r\n19-Jan-2025	CRUISING		CRUISING\r\n20-Jan-2025	SINGAPORE - SINGAPORE	07:00:00(Arrive)		DEBARK\r\n\r\n\r\nOption 3:\r\n4 NIGHT PENANG AND PHUKET CRUISE\r\nBrand: ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL\r\nShip: ANTHEM OF THE SEAS\r\n\r\nSailing Date: Thursday, January 23, 2025\r\n\r\n23-Jan-2025	SINGAPORE - SINGAPORE		16:30:00 (Depart)	EMBARK\r\n24-Jan-2025	PENANG - MALAYSIA	14:00:00 (Arrive)	21:00:00(Depart) DOCKED\r\n25-Jan-2025	PHUKET - THAILAND	08:00:00 (Arrive)	20:00:00 (Depart)	TENDERED\r\n26-Jan-2025	CRUISING			CRUISING\r\n27-Jan-2025	SINGAPORE - SINGAPORE	07:00:00(Arrive)		DEBARK\r\n','','Ocean View Balcony â€” Mid Quad Lower, 3D\r\nFull Meal','Airfare\r\nAny type of Transfer\r\nItems of a strictly personal nature, such as, shore excursions, bar beverages, dining in the specialty restaurants, laundry, telephone calls, photographs, medical services, casino chips, onboard shopping, or other items not specifically stated as included in the cruise fare. \r\