Dec\r\n08:15 AM: Departure for the Day Trip to Zaanse Schans, Edam, Volendam, and Marken.\r\nOvernight at hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 8: 19th Dec\r\nCheckout from Amsterdam Hotel & Train to Paris\r\nMorning: Checkout from your Amsterdam hotel.\r\nTake a scenic train ride to Paris.\r\nCheck in to your hotel and enjoy the Parisian ambiance in the evening at your own. \r\n\r\nDay 9: 20th Dec\r\nEiffel Tower (2nd floor), Louvre Museum, and Seine River Cruise. Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\n\r\nDay 10: 21st Dec\r\nDisneylandÂ® Paris Entrance Ticket\r\nFull day at DisneylandÂ® Paris. Enjoy rides, shows, and meet your favorite characters. Overnight at hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 11: 22nd Dec\r\nCheckout from Paris Hotel & Flight to Delhi\r\nMorning: Checkout from your hotel.\r\nFly back to Delhi.','','Economy Class airfare\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\n10 nights accommodation in the mentioned hotels.\r\nMt Titlis Glacier Paradise Tour & Lucerne\r\nJungfraujoch: Top of Europe Day Trip\r\nEiffel Tower, Louvre Museum, and Seine River Cruise\r\nDay Trip to Zaanse Schans, Edam, Volendam, and Marken (from Amsterdam)\r\nPrague Full Day City Tour Including Vltava River Cruise\r\nDisneylandÂ® Paris Entrance Ticket\r\nAmsterdam to Paris Train(11:10 am to 14:35 Pm)\r\nSwiss Travel Pass (3 Days)\r\nOne way airport transfer (Paris Hotel to Paris Airport)\r\nZurich airport to Zurich hotel transfer can be done with Swiss pass. \r\nTravel Insurance\r\nVisa Charges\r\n\r\n\r\n','Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\nAny type of personal expense. \r\nAirport and train station transfers other than the mentioned in Inclusions. \r\nTCS','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRooms and hotels are subject to availability.\r\nActivities rates are dynamic and are subject to availability. ','2024-12-10','2024-12-17',1,0,0,'2024-09-09 16:24:13','2024-09-11 12:50:56'),(768,1372,15512,6,0,0,346600,68000,'Vietnam Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :  \r\n\r\nDay 1 (5th Oct) : Arrival at Hanoi - Transfer to Overnight Cruise (L/D)\r\nDay 2 (6th Oc