ay (7 Oct) :\r\nTRANSFERS : EX BKK HTL - Bangkok BKK APT (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\nTRANSFERS : EX PHUKET APT - Phuket Hotel   (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\n\r\n4th Day (8 Oct) :\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Private Land Transfer for Phi Phi Island Tour Big Boat ( Hotel - Pier - Hotel )  (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\nPhi Phi Island Tour By Big Boat with Lunch Entrance ( Exclude NPF )\r\n\r\n5th Day (9 Oct) :\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Phuket Half Day City Tour - Big Buddha ( With Guide )  (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Phuket Tiger Kingdom  (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\nPhuket Tiger Kingdom Big Tiger\r\n\r\n6th Day (10 Oct) :\r\nTRANSFERS : EX PHUKET HOTEL - Phuket APT  (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Internal Flights BKK-HKT\r\n* 5N stay with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2024-10-05','2024-10-10',1,0,0,'2024-09-11 13:33:32','2024-09-12 12:52:15'),(770,1374,419,2,0,0,0,0,'Kashmir Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : On arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                             \r\n\r\n                                               \r\nDay 02 : After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg. Gulmarg is also known as â€œMeadow Of Flowers â€œ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                               \r\n\r\n                                   \r\nDay 03 : After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Pahalgam, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                             \r\n\r\n                                   \r\nDay 04 : After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.                                              \r\n\r\n                                               \r\nDay 05 : After breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.        \r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Accommodation  as above.\r\n* Breakfast in the hotel.\r\n* Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\n* Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n* Vehicle : Sedan\r\n* Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\n* Driver Allowances.\r\n* Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n* Hotel Taxes','* Any type of pesronal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n* Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\n* Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n* Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-11-21','2024-11-25',1,0,0,'2024-09-11 13:47:40','2024-09-11 13:47:40'),(771,1375,349,2,0,0,30960,7840,'Dubai Diaries','','','* Economy class Airfare\r\n* 6N stay with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport transfers on PVT\r\n* Half Day City Tour (SIC)\r\n* Desert Safari (SIC)\r\n* Dhow Cruise (SIC)\r\n* Burj Kalifa 124th + 125th floor Non-prime hours tickets (SIC)\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-09-26','2024-10-02',1,0,0,'2024-09-12 14:15:28','2024-09-12 14:41:55'),(772,1376,38,6,0,0,107800,38000,'Thailand Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (6th Oct) :\r\nTRANSFERS : EX PHUKET APT - Phuket Hotel ( Patong Area ) (1-PRIVATE VAN )\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Phuket Fantasea Show (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\nPhuket Fantasea Show Only\r\n\r\n2nd Day (7th Oct) :\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Private Land Transfer for Phi Phi Island Tour Big Boat ( Hotel - Pier - Hotel ) (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\nPhi Phi Island Tour By Big Boat with Lunch Entrance ( Exclude NPF )\r\n\r\n3rd Day (8th Oct) :\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Phuket Half Day City Tour - Big Buddha ( With Guide ) (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Phuket Tiger Kingdom   (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\n\r\n4th Day (9th Oct) :\r\nTRANSFERS : EX PHUKET HOTEL - Phuket APT  (1-PRIVATE VAN)\r\nTRANSFERS: EX BKK APT - Bangkok Ho