 to arrive / depart the tour start point on own.  \r\nâ€¢	Where only tickets are mentioned, clients will need to arrive / depart on own.\r\nâ€¢	For Seat in Coach tours, clients will need to call the service provider min 24-48 hrs prior to re-confirm the pick-up time and meeting point location.\r\nâ€¢	Since Seat in Coach Tours are operated on shared basis, there is a possibility of tour getting cancelled if the number of pax as per their requirement is not met. However, this happens rarely.  \r\n \r\nTransportation\r\nâ€¢	Baggage capacity for SUV: 4Big Bags, 2-3Hand Bags (3-4Pax)\r\nâ€¢	Baggage capacity for Intercity Bus : 1Carry On & 1 Checked Inn \r\nâ€¢	Tips & Gratuities to drivers, guides if any must be paid directly\r\nâ€¢	For Transfers between 12AM to 6AM, there will be a supplement charges of USD 50 per transfer. \r\nâ€¢	Meet & Greet for airport pick-ups are not included unless specified\r\n','','â€¢	Economy class airfare\r\nâ€¢	Daily Breakfast\r\nâ€¢	One way transfer from Mexico City Airport to Mexico City Hotel on private basis â€“ 23rd Dec  \r\nâ€¢	City Tour and Anthropology Museum on seat in coach basis â€“ 24th Dec \r\nâ€¢	Teotihuacan, Guadalupe Shrine & Tlatelolco Tour on seat in coach basis â€“ 25th Dec \r\nâ€¢	One way transfer from Mexico City Hotel to Mexico City Airport on private basis â€“ 26th Dec  \r\nâ€¢	One way transfer from Cancun Airport to Cancun Hotel on private basis â€“ 26th Dec \r\nâ€¢	Chichen Itza, Cenote Hubiku, Lunch and Valladolid Tour on seat in coach basis â€“ 27th Dec\r\nâ€¢	Xplor Park Tour with Transport on seat in coach basis â€“ 28th Dec \r\nâ€¢	Discover Tulum and Xel-Ha on seat in coach basis â€“ 29th Dec\r\nâ€¢	One way transfer from Cancun Hotel to Cancun Airport on private basis â€“ 31st Dec \r\n','â€¢	Resort Fee / City Tax / Utility Charges wherever applicable must be paid directly\r\nâ€¢	Any Meals like Lunch / Dinner unless specified in inclusions\r\nâ€¢	Bottled Water on coaches and in hotel rooms\r\nâ€¢	Tips to drivers and