ve breakfast at the hotel\r\nGardens By The Bay (Flower Dome + Supertree) (SiC)\r\n\r\nDay 06 (23rd Dec) :\r\nHave breakfast at the hotel\r\nSingapore Zoo (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 07 (24th Dec) :\r\nHave breakfast at the hotel\r\nCheck-out from hotel and transfer to SIN Airport for your departure flight (PVT)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 6N accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary on SIC basis\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meals other than the mentioned above\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2024-12-18','2024-12-24',1,0,0,'2024-11-18 13:46:40','2024-11-18 16:16:53'),(806,1418,419,2,0,0,53900,13000,'Travel Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 01: On arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in take rest. In evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                            \r\n                                      \r\nDay 02: After breakfast leave from hotel and  proceed to Doodhpathri - valley of milk, located in Budgam district, lies in bowl shaped valley in Pir Panjal Range. Its an alpine valley covered with snow clad mountains. Not a lot of tourists come to this place, since the road conditions are not favorable. After some quiet and peaceful time at Doodhpathri drive back for overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                      \r\n                                                \r\nDay 03: After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Pahalgam, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                              \r\n                                                                       \r\nDay 04: After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Sonmarg hotel, (Meadows of Gold), it has sheer scenic splendour. The very way-a metalled road snakes through massive mountains laden with forests and firs. After a breath-taking journey from Srinagar you come across River Sindh that is abounded with trout & Mahseer. Onwards the valley opens up to a meadow. After Check-in  Ponies can be hired for a trip up to Thajiwas glacier ; a major attraction during the summer months. Sonamarg\'s importance lies in the fact that it is the last halt on the Kashmir side for the drive from Srinagar to Leh. You will be fascinated to see Snowy Mountains against a cerulean sky against its backdrop. Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg.\r\n                                       \r\nDay 05: After breakfast check-out from Gulmarg hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.                                                              ','','âœ” Accommodation  as above.\r\nâœ” Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\nâœ” Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\nâœ” Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\nâœ” Shikara Ride (01 hour) \r\nâœ” Driver Allowances.\r\nâœ” Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\nâœ” Hotel Taxes\r\n','âœ” Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\nâœ” Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\nâœ” Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\nâœ” Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\nâœ” Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\nâœ”Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\nâœ” Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\nâœ” Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\nâœ” The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability. ','2024-11-30','2024-12-04',1,0,0,'2024-11-18 15:51:11','2024-11-18 16:55:36'),(807,1419,419,2,0,0,53900,13000,'Travel Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 01: On arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in take rest. In evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                            \r\n                                      \r\nDay 02: After breakfast leave from hotel and  proceed to Doodhpathri - valley of milk, located in Budgam district, lies in bowl shaped valley in Pir Panjal Range. Its an alpine valley covered with snow clad mountains. Not a lot of tourists come to this place, since the road conditions are not favorable. After some quiet and peaceful time at Doodhpathri drive back for overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                      \r\n                                                \r\nDay 03: After breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Pahalgam, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS â€œ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.                                              \r\n                                                                       \r\nDay 04: After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Sonmarg hotel, (Meadows of Gold), it has sheer scenic splendour. The very way-a metalled road snakes through massive mountains laden with forests and firs. After a breath-taking journey from Srinagar you come across River Sindh that is abounded with trout & Mahseer. Onwards the valley opens up to a meadow. After Check-in  Ponies can be hired for a trip up to Thajiwas glacier ; a major attraction during the summer months. Sonamarg\'s importance lies in the fact that it is the last halt on the Kashmir side for the drive from Srinagar to Leh. You will be fascinated to see Snowy Mountains against a cerulean sky against its backdrop. Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg.\r\n                                       \r\nDay 05: After breakfast check-out from Gulmarg hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.                                                              ','','âœ” Accommodation  as above.\r\nâœ” Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\nâœ” Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\nâœ” Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\nâœ” Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\nâœ” Driver Allowances.\r\nâœ” Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\nâœ” Hotel Taxes\r\n','âœ” Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\nâœ” Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head â€œPrices includedâ€.\r\nâœ” Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\nâœ” Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\nâœ” Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\nâœ”Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\nâœ” Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\nâœ” Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\nâœ” The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-11-30','2024-12-04',1,0,0,'2024-11-18 16:09:58','2024-11-18 16:09:58'),(808,1420,54,2,1,0,69100,17900,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (18th Dec) :\r\nArrival at the SIN Airport and transfer to the hotel on PVT basis\r\nCheck-in at the hotel and relax\r\n\r\nDay 02 (19th Dec) :\r\nHave breakfast at the hotel\r\nSIN City Orientation Drive + Afternoon Sentosa (SIC)\r\nSentosa Inclusion (Cable Car + Luge & Skyride + Wings of Time)\r\n\r\nDay 03 (20th Dec) :\r\nHave breakfast at the hotel\r\nUniversal Studio - Dynamic Price (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 04 (21st Dec) :\r\nHave breakfast at the hotel and relax or go for shopping on your own\r\nNight Safari with Tram Ride (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 05 (22nd Dec) :\r\nHave breakfast at the hotel\r\nGardens By The Bay (Flower Dome + Supertree) (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 06 (23rd Dec) :\r\nHave breakfast at the hotel\r\nSingapore Zoo (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 07 (24th Dec) :\r\nHave breakfast at the hotel\r\nCheck-out from the hotel and transfer to SIN Airport for departure flight on PVT basis\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 6N accommodation and daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the iti