nd Bet Dwarka. On the way back to Dwarka visit Rukmani Temple. Take the afternoon to explore coastal attractions including the lighthouse on the beach. Attend evening aarti at Dwarkadhish Temple followed by dinner and overnight stay.\r\n\r\nDay 04 (18th Dec) : Dwarka to Rajkot Drop (approx distance 230km)\r\nAfter having breakfast check out from the hotel and transfer to Rajkot Airport for your homebound flight\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 3N accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Vehicle - 1 Sedan Car\r\n* Driver Allowance, Toll Tax Parking','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nEarly check-in is subject to availability.','2024-12-15','2024-12-18',1,0,0,'2024-11-27 15:09:21','2024-11-27 16:45:58'),(814,1428,1105,3,1,0,0,0,'Rajasthan Trip','Day Wise Itinerary\r\n----------\r\n1st Day - Wednesday 25th December, 2024\r\n----\r\nUdaipur - Arrival\r\nUpon arrival, meet our representative and take a transfer to the hotel,Complete your check-in process,Get Relaxed,Evening is free for leisure, you can head out to explore the little markets,You can spend time here shopping and enjoying the beautifully lit streets of Udaipur,(ON YOUR OWN)  Or you can partake in the boat ride on the tranquil waters of Lake Pichola / Fateh Sagar Lake,(Ticket not included) Head back to the hotel for the night, Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n- Approx. Distance: 100 km\r\n\r\n----------\r\n2nd Day - Thursday 26th December, 2024\r\n----\r\nUdaipur - Sightseeing\r\nBegin your day with breakfast at the hotel and then start your city tour,Visit the City Palace which is the biggest castle complex in Rajasthan,Partake in the boat ride on the tranquil waters of Lake Pichola,Also visit Sahelion ki Bari or Garden of the Maids of Honor, Jagdish sanctuary,Local Market Visit,Later in the evening Fateh Sagar Lake, Shilpgram,Once sightseeing is over, head back to the hotel,Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n- Approx. Distance: 50 km\r\n\r\n----------\r\n3rd Day - Friday 27th December, 2024\r\n----\r\nUdaipur to Nathdwara - Day Trip\r\nAfter breakfast at hotel visit  Nathdwara and back to hotel. Overnight at hotel.\r\n\r\n----------\r\n4th Day - Saturday 28th December, 2024\r\n----\r\nUdaipur to Kumbhalgarh - Day Trip Via Haldighati\r\nAfter breakfast drive to Kumbhalgarh day trip visit kumbhalgarh fort after kumbhalgarh straight drive to Udaipur enroute visit Haldighati. after haldighati drive to Udaipur. Overnight in Udaipur.\r\n\r\n----------\r\n5th Day - Sunday 29th December, 2024\r\n----\r\nUdaipur - Shopping Tour\r\nMorning After breakfast, Full day is free for Shopping Activity, Visit the famous shopping places, Markets, Malls etc, Evening is free for leisure. You can spend it as per your own liking on your own, Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur Hotel.\r\n- Approx. Distance: 50 km\r\n\r\n----------\r\n6th Day - Monday 30th December, 2024\r\n----\r\nUdaipur - Departure\r\nAfter Breakfast check-out from the Hotel and take a transfer to Udaipur Airport as you will be heading back to your home with the memory of Udanchoo Tourism.\r\n- Approx. Distance:Â 50Â km\r\n\r\n?  Transportation\r\n-----------\r\n1st Day - Wed, 25th Dec\r\nâ€¢ Udaipur - Arrival (1-Sedan)\r\n\r\n2nd Day - Thu, 26th Dec\r\nâ€¢ Udaipur - Sightseeing (1-Sedan)\r\n\r\n3rd Day - Fri, 27th Dec\r\nâ€¢ Udaipur to Nathdwara - Day Trip (1-Sedan)\r\n\r\n4th Day - Sat, 28th Dec\r\nâ€¢ Udaipur to Kumbhalgarh - Day Trip Via Haldighati (1-Sedan)\r\n\r\n5th Day - Sun, 29th Dec\r\nâ€¢ Udaipur - Shopping Tour (1-Sedan)\r\n\r\n6th Day - Mon, 30th Dec\r\nâ€¢ Udaipur - Departure (1-Sedan)\r\n','','+ Economy class airafre.\r\n+ Welcome Drink on Arrival\r\n+ Accommodation in a well-appointed room in base category\r\n+ Meals as Mentioned in Hotel Section\r\n+ Hotel checks in & check out time as per the hotel policy\r\n+ All transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary\r\n+ All Toll taxes, One time Parking of Each Destination , State Tax & Driver allowance\r\n+ Vehicle will be provided 8:00 am to 8:00pm\r\n','- All personal expenses, optional tours and extra meal\r\n- Any monument or sight-seeing Entry fee / Charges\r\n- Anything not in inclusions is excluded\r\n','Airfare is dynamic.\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability. ','2024-12-25','2024-12-30',1,0,0,'2024-11-27 18:05:34','2024-11-27 19:55:09'),(815,1426,1105,6,3,0,65000,16000,'Rajasthan Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at Jaisalmer and check-in at the hotel and relax. In evening a visit to Gadisar lake, perfect for boating and photography during sunset and go for some shopping in local markets \r\n\r\nDay 02 : After having breakfast at the hotel, a visit to Jaisalmer Fort,, Patwon Ki haveli. In the afternoon, proceed to Sam Sand dunes.and take a camel ride to Thar desert and experience the haunting magic of the tale of Dhola Maru.\r\n\r\nDay 03 : After having breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to Mount Abu (approx. 9 hrs). Check-in at the hotel in Mount Abu and relax.  If the time permits, you can explore the nearby market.\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Have breakfast and visit the Dilwara temples known for its exquisite marble carvings and serene atmosphere. Head to a famous spot (Sunset Point) to witness a breathtaking sunset over the Aravalli Hills. A visit to Nakki Lake, if time permits.\r\n\r\nDay 05 : After having breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive towards Udaipur (approx. 3.5 hrs).  Check-in at the hotel and relax. In the evening a visit to Lake Pinchola and can explore nearby market.\r\n\r\nDay 06 :  Have breakfast at the hotel and then start your city tour, visit the city palace which is the biggest castle complex om Rajasthan. Also visit Sahelion ki Bari or Garden of the Maids of Honor. Later in the evening Fateh Sagar Lake, Shilpgram.\r\n\r\nDay 07 :  After having breakfast,go for a day trip to Nathdwara. Evening at leisure to relax or do shopping. \r\n\r\nDay 08 : After breakfast check-out from the hotel  and proceed towards your departure city.\r\n\r\n','','* A 12 seater tempo traveller \r\n* 7N accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Driver Allowance, Toll, parking','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.','2024-12-15','2024-12-22',1,0,0,'2024-11-27 18:39:17','2024-11-27 20:14:47'),(816,1430,241,2,1,0,49500,12500,'Gujarat Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (15th Dec) :\r\nArrival at the BDQ Airport and transfer to the pre-booked hotel.\r\nCheck-in at the hotel and relax\r\nLater in the evening drop to Lukshmi Palace (Vadodara Fort) for attending the marriage and return to hotel at night.\r\n\r\nDay 02 (16th Dec) : Vadodara to Somnath (approx distance 480km)\r\nAfter breakfast in Vadodara, check out and drive to Somnath town. After check-in formalities, attend evening aarti at Somnath Temple and later enjoy light and sound show in Somnath. Return to your hotel for an overnight stay in Somnath.\r\n\r\nDay 03 (17th Dec) : Somnath to Dwarka (approx distance 230km)\r\nAfter breakfast at the hotel drive to Dwarka. after reaching Dwarka start temple hopping in Dwarka. Visit Nageshwar Jyotirlinga Temple, Gopi Talav, and Bet Dwarka. On the way back to Dwarka visit Rukmani Temple. Take the afternoon to explore coastal attractions including the lighthouse on the beach. Attend evening aarti at Dwarkadhish Temple followed by dinner and overnight stay.\r\n\r\nDay 04 (18th Dec) : Dwarka to Rajkot Drop (approx distance 230km)\r\nAfter having breakfast check out from the hotel and transfer to Rajkot Airport for your homebound flight\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 3N accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Vehicle - 1 Sedan Car\r\n* Driver Allowance, Toll Tax Parking','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned ab