sfer from Bur Dubai Hotel to DXB AIRPORT [with Private transport)','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 8N accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* All the tours and transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Abu Dhabi Attractions (2 Day 2 Park Pass (Yas Water World / Ferrari / Warner Bros/Sea World) ) (Only Ticket)(03-Adults)\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.\r\nCharges for the luxury car (Limousine) is 10500 per hour.','2025-01-19','2025-01-27',1,0,0,'2024-12-11 17:42:28','2024-12-14 17:34:03'),(827,1450,18382,3,0,0,54600,12000,'Gujarat Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day - Wednesday 1st January, 2025\r\nDiu to Somnath - Transfer and Sightseeing\r\nUpon arriving at Diu Airport or Railway Station, you will be picked up and escorted to the hotel by our local tour representative via private transfer. drive to Somnath town. After check-in formalities, visit Bhalka Tirth and Triveni Sangam. Evening at leisure or you can explore nearby places. Dinner and overnight stay at Somnath hotel.\r\nApprox. Distance: 140 km\r\n\r\n2nd Day - Thursday 2nd January, 2025\r\nSomnath - local sightseeing\r\nAfter breakfast visit Geeta Mandir. Attend evening aarti at Somnath Temple and later enjoy light and sound show in Somnath. Return to your hotel for dinner and overnight stay at the Hotel in Somnath.\r\n\r\n3rd Day - Friday 3rd January, 2025\r\nSomnath to Dwarka - Transfer Via Porbandar\r\nAfter breakfast in Somnath, check out and drive to Dwarka. Stop by Porbandar along the way to visit Kirti Mandir where Mahatma Gandhi was born and visit Sudama Temple. Continue your holidays in Gujarat by proceeding to Dwarka. After a long drive from Somnath to Dwarka, check into the hotel with family and unwind. If time permits then attend evening Aarti at Dwarkadhish Temple. Dinner and overnight stay at Dwarka.\r\n*NOTE: Heavy Vehicles are not allowed in Porbandar city.*\r\n Approx. Distance: 250 km\r\n\r\n4th Day - Saturday 4th January, 2025\r\nDwarka - Fullday Sightseeing\r\nAfter breakfast at the hotel, take a holy dip in the Gomti River and then start temple hopping in Dwarka. Visit Nageshwar Jyotirlinga Temple, Gopi Talav, and Bet Dwarka. On the way back to Dwarka visit Rukmani Temple. Take the afternoon to explore coastal attractions including the lighthouse on the beach. Attend evening aarti at Dwarkadhish Temple followed by dinner and overnight stay.\r\n Approx. Distance: 100 km\r\n\r\n5th Day - Sunday 5th January, 2025\r\nDwarka to Rajkot - Drop\r\nAfter breakfast in Dwarka check out and drive to Rajkot and drop at Airport \r\n Approx. Distance: 230 km\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4 nights accommodation with daily breakfast and dinner\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle - 1 Sedan Car\r\n ','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-01-01','2025-01-05',1,0,0,'2024-12-19 12:33:20','2024-12-19 19:29:47'),(828,1451,15510,2,0,0,50000,14000,'Thailand Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day ( 17th January ) : TRANSFERS : EX PHUKET APT - Krabi Hotel ( Ao- Anang Area )\r\n \r\n2nd Day ( 18th January ) :: KRABI - Krabi 4 Island Tour By Long Tailed Boat + Lunch Box ( Exclude National Park Fee THB 200 ) On Pvt\r\n \r\n3rd Day ( 19th January ) : TRANSFERS : EX KRABI HOTEL - Phuket Hotel ( Patong Area )\r\n \r\n4th Day ( 20th January ) : PHUKET - Phi Phi Island Tour By Speed Boat + Khai Island + Lunch + Transfer ( Excl. National Park Fee) on Pvt\r\n \r\n5th Day ( 21st January ) : PHUKET - Phuket Half Day City Tour - Big Buddha on Pvt\r\nTOURS - EX Phuket - Phuket Tiger Kingdom (PVT)\r\nPhuket Tiger Kingdom - Phuket Tiger Kingdom Big Tiger\r\n \r\n6th Day ( 22nd January ) : TRANSFERS : EX PHUKET HOTEL - Phuket APT','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N accommodation