uture -Tickets (with Prvate transport)\r\n\r\nDay 9 (27th Jan) :\r\nTransfer from Bur Dubai Hotel to DXB AIRPORT [with Private transport)','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 8N accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* All the tours and transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Abu Dhabi Attractions (2 Day 2 Park Pass (Yas Water World / Ferrari / Warner Bros/Sea World) ) (Only Ticket)(03-Adults)\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.\r\nCharges for the luxury car (Limousine) is 10500 per hour.','2025-01-19','2025-01-27',1,0,0,'2024-12-23 11:47:55','2024-12-23 11:47:55'),(833,1459,15901,4,0,0,117200,25250,'Kedarnath Package','Transportation Itinerary:\r\n\r\n1st Day (10 May)	Dehradun to Guptkashi - Transfer \r\n2nd Day (11 May)	Guptkashi to Shri Kedarnath Ji - Transfer (19Kms Down Trek & 30kms/1hr by Road) \r\n3rd Day (12 May)	Shri Kedarnath Ji to Guptkashi - Transfer (19Kms Down Trek & 30kms/1hr by Road) \r\n4th Day (13 May)	Guptkashi to Rishikesh - Transfer & Local Sightseeing \r\n5th Day (14 May)	Rishikesh to Dehradun - Departure \r\n\r\n\r\nDay Wise Itinerary:\r\n\r\n1st Day (Sat 10th May) : Dehradun to Guptkashi - Transfer\r\nArrive Dehradun â€“ Guptkashi (205 Km / 7 to 8 Hours)- Meet our driver at Dehradun morning and drive to Guptkashi via Rudraprayag & Devprayag. En route you can see the beautiful river Ganga and Alaknanda River till Rudraprayag. The Mandakini river comes from Kedarnath, drive alongside the river to reach Guptakashi, visit Ardh Narishwar (Vishwanath) Temple in Guptakashi. Check into the hotel arrival in Guptakashi. Overnight stay at Guptakashi.\r\n\r\n2nd Day (Sun 11th May) : Guptkashi to Shri Kedarnath Ji - Transfer (19Kms Down Trek & 30kms/1hr by Road)\r\nMorning after breakfast departure for Kedarnath dham. Enjoy Kedarnath Darshan & back your hotel. Overnight stay at Kedarnath. By Helicopter: Morning our driver will transfer you your prebook Helipad. You can inform driver about your arrival time whether it will by helicopter or by trek, so that Driver will be there to pick you up. (note: helicopter ticket is not included in this package). By Trek: Morning our driver will drop you at Sonprayag then you have to take local jeep for Gaurikund & then your trek strat for Kedarnath Ji. After darshan, you follow same & back to Sonpraag. There is big parking issue so the driver will back tp another palace if his contact no. in not working then you have to arrange another taxi or wait for your driver. Kedarnath: The Kedarnath shrine, one of the 12 jyotirlingas of Lord Shiva, is a scenic spot situated, against the backdrop of the majestic Kedarnath range. Kedar is another name of Lord Shiva. According to legend, the Pandavas after having won over the Kaurava in the Kurukshetra war felt guilty of having killed their own brothers and sought the blessings of Lord Shiva for redemption. He eluded them repeatedly and while fleeing took refuge at Kedarnath in the form of a bull. On being followed he dived into the ground, leaving his hump on the surface.\r\nKedarnath Weather â€“ Due to its high altitude the weather in Kedarnath remains cold for the most part of the year. Summer here is cool and pleasant while winter is severe. During the summer season the temperature varies around 20Â°Celsius. Light woolen wear is recommended. The Winter season in Kedarnath is severe with the mercury falling to as low as 0Â°Celsius. During this time the place experiences snowfall as well. Due to the extreme climatic conditions, this time is usually avoided by tourists.\r\nDistance:- 30kms by road & 19kms Trek\r\n\r\n3rd Day (Mon 12th May) : Shri Kedarnath Ji to Guptkashi - Transfer (19Kms Down Trek & 30kms/1hr by Road)\r\nMorning after Pooja & breakfast, you can check out of Kedarnath hotel start your journey back to Sonprayag. Our driver will be there at a designated place which was discussed with you. Drive back to Guptkashi hotel for a night stay.\r\nDistance:- 19Kms Down Trek & 30kms/1hr by Road\r\n\r\n4th Day (Tue 13th May) : Guptkashi to Rishikesh - Transfer & Local Sightseeing\r\nMorning after breakfast, check out from hotel. On arrival, you are transferred to your Hotel. Take a rest at the hotel and you are free to visit the local market in the evening.\r\n\r\n5th Day (Wed 14th May) : Rishikesh to Dehradun - Departure\r\nRishikesh to Dehradun 1 hr (25 km) After breakfast check out from hotel, drive to Dehradun for onward destination.\r\n\r\n','','.â€¢	Economy Class airfare\r\nâ€¢	Accommodation in a well-appointed room in base category \r\nâ€¢	Meals as Mentioned in Hotels Section (As per hotel menu) \r\nâ€¢	All transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary. (AC will not function in hill area) \r\nâ€¢	All Toll taxes, One time Parking of Each Destination, State Tax & Driver allowance \r\nâ€¢	Hotel checks in & check out time as per the hotel. \r\nâ€¢	Vehicle- Innova Crysta.\r\nâ€¢	Vehicle will be provided as per tour itinerary. \r\n','â€¢	All personal expenses, optional tours and extra meals \r\nâ€¢	Camera fees, Any entry fee for Monument, alcoholic/non-alcoholic beverages and starters \r\nâ€¢	Vehicle service on leisure days for sightseeing not included in the itinerary Medical and travel insurance \r\nâ€¢	Ac room will not be provided in the hill area. \r\nâ€¢	A/C will not work on hills. \r\nâ€¢	Entry fee for any monument will be paid by the client directly. \r\nâ€¢	Tempo Traveller and large vehicles will not enter Nainital & Mussoorie. Guest will arrange local Sightseeing by Own \r\nâ€¢	Vehicle is as per itinerary and not on disposal. Additional sightseeing or transfer which are not mentioned in itinerary is payable to the driver directly \r\nâ€¢	Vehicle will run morning to till 7 PM in Hill area as per govt rule. kindly advise your client \r\nâ€¢	The above rate is a tentative basis. Please reconfirm the rates before confirmation. \r\nâ€¢	NOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded\r\n â€¢	GST\r\n','Airfare is dynamic','2025-05-10','2025-05-14',1,0,0,'2024-12-26 16:32:35','2024-12-26 17:47:37'),(834,1462,830,2,0,0,18000,11700,'Uttarakhand Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Arrival in Dehradun\r\nPick-up: Arrive at Jolly Grant Airport, Dehradun. Transfer to your hotel.\r\nCheck-in: Relax and freshen up.\r\nEvening: Leisure time at Paltan Bazaar for shopping and local snacks at your own. \r\nOvernight Stay: Dehradun hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2: Explore Dehradun\r\nBreakfast: At the hotel.\r\nSightseeing.\r\nOvernight Stay: Dehradun hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Transfer to Mussoorie\r\nBreakfast: Check out from the hotel.\r\nTransfer: Drive to Mussoorie (approx. 1.5 hours).\r\nLocal Sightseeing in evening.\r\nOvernight Stay: Mussoorie hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 4: Explore Mussoorie\r\nBreakfast: At the hotel.\r\nLocal Sightseeing.\r\n\r\nDay 5: Departure\r\nTransfer: Drive back to Jolly Grant Airport, Dehradun, for departure.','','Economy Class airfare\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nAirport pick-up and drop.\r\nLocal sightseeing as per the itinerary.\r\nHotel accommodations for 2 nights in Dehradun and 2 nights in Mussoorie.\r\nTransfers between Dehradun and Mussoorie.','Personal Expenses.\r\nEntry Fees & Activities.\r\nTaxes & Surcharges.\r\nGST','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRooms are subject to availability. ','2025-01-22','2025-01-26',1,0,0,'2024-12-27 16:09:19','2024-12-27 18:15:25'),(835,1463,15494,2,0,0,5000,4000,'Goa Diaries','','','Economy Class airfare\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nAirport pick-up and drop.\r\nHotel accommodations for 4 nights in Goa\r\n','Personal Expenses.\r\nTaxes & Surcharges.\r\nGST','Airfare is dynamic','2025-01-22','2025-01-26',1,0,0,'2024-12-27 16:24:58','2024-12-27 19:14:13'),(836,1464,15530,5,2,0,0,0,'Andaman Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (18 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair Arrival - Cellular Jail â€“ Light & Sound Show  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nCellular Jail - Light & Sound Show Tickets (5Ad. + 2Ch.)\r\n\r\n2nd Day (19 Jan)	