nd - Laxmanpura Beach, Bharatpura Beach & Natural Bridge  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nHavelock To Neil Island  Private Catamaran Ferry : Premium  (5Ad. + 2Ch.)\r\n\r\n6th Day (23 Jan)	\r\nNeil Island to Port Blair - Chidiya Tapu Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nNeil Island To Port Blair  Private Catamaran Ferry : Premium  (5Ad. + 2Ch).\r\n\r\n7th Day (24 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair - North Bay (Coral Island) â€“ Ross Island  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nNorth Bay & Ross Island  Boat Charge  (5Ad. + 2Ch).\r\n\r\n8th Day (25 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair Departure - Tour Ends  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 7N/8D accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport & Ferry Terminal Transfers in Air-Conditioned Vehicle.\r\n* All Sightseeing (Entry fess included) as per itinerary in Air-Conditioned Vehicle.\r\n* Inter-Island ferry transfers By Private Catamaran Ferries Makruzz (Preferred)/ Nautika/ Green Ocean/ ITT Majestic etc (Subject to Availability)\r\n* Extra Luggage Vehicle','* The services of vehicles not on disposal basis & finishing the sightseeing tour as per the itinerary\r\n* Any kind of personal expenses or optional tours/extra meals/ Vehicle for Dinner etc.\r\nNOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-01-18','2025-01-25',1,0,0,'2024-12-28 16:03:12','2024-12-28 17:38:57'),(838,1470,15530,5,2,0,0,0,'Andaman Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (18 Jan) :	\r\nPort Blair Arrival - Cellular Jail â€“ Light & Sound Show  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nCellular Jail - Light & Sound Show  Tickets  (5Ad. + 2Ch).\r\n\r\n2nd Day (19 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair to Havelock - Radha Nagar Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nPort Blair To Havelock  Private Catamaran Ferry : Premium  (5Ad. + 2Ch).\r\n\r\n3rd Day (20 Jan)	\r\nHavelock - Elephenta Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nElephanta  Boat Charge  (5Ad. + 2Ch)\r\n\r\n4th Day (21 Jan)	\r\nHavelock to Neil Island - Laxmanpura Beach, Bharatpura Beach & Natural Bridge  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nHavelock To Neil Island  Private Catamaran Ferry : Premium  (5Ad. + 2Ch)\r\n\r\n5th Day (22 Jan)	\r\nNeil Island - Laxmanpura Beach & Sitapur Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\n\r\n6th Day (23 Jan)	\r\nNeil Island to Port Blair - Chidiya Tapu Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nNeil Island To Port Blair  Private Catamaran Ferry : Premium   (5Ad. + 2Ch).\r\n\r\n7th Day (24 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair - Jolly Buoy / Red Skin Island  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nJolly Bouy / Red skin Boat Charge  (5Ad. + 2Ch.)\r\n\r\n8th Day (25 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair Departure - Tour Ends  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\n1-SUV Vehicle\r\n','','* 7N/8D accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport & Ferry Terminal Transfers in Air-Conditioned Vehicle.\r\n* All Sightseeing (Entry fess included) as per itinerary in Air-Conditioned Vehicle.\r\n* Inter-Island ferry transfers By Private Catamaran Ferries Makruzz (Preferred)/ Nautika/ Green Ocean/ ITT Majestic etc (Subject to Availability)\r\n* Extra Luggage Vehicle','* The services of vehicles not on disposal basis & finishing the sightseeing tour as per the itinerary\r\n* Any kind of personal expenses or optional tours/extra meals/ Vehicle for Dinner etc.\r\nNOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-01-18','2025-01-25',1,0,0,'2024-12-30 13:55:13','2024-12-30 17:28:41'),(839,1474,419,5,2,0,0,0,'Kashmir Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (Tue 21st January) : Arrival Srinagar - Sightseeing\r\nUpon your arrival at Srinagar International Airport, our team will extend a warm welcome and assist in transferring you to your chosen accommodation, whether it\'s a hotel or a houseboat. The journey to your lodging will encompass a 35-minute drive, offering an initial glimpse of Srinagar city. En route, you\'ll cross the Abdullah Bridge, connecting the banks of the Jhelum River, and pass by the bustling Dal Lake market, known locally as Dal Gate, leading towards the renowned Dal Lake. After a brief period of relaxation, you\'ll embark on a local sightseeing tour, exploring the famed Mughal gardens of Nishat, Shalimar, and Chashme Shahi. These gardens offer an exquisite experience amidst the natural beauty and captivating views of the valley surrounded by majestic mountains.Following the sightseeing tour, you\'ll be escorted to your hotel or houseboat for an overnight stay, providing a chance to unwind and reflect on the day\'s experiences.\r\n\r\n2nd Day (Wed 22nd January) : Srinagar to Gulmarg - Day Trip\r\nAfter Breakfast , we will drive to Gulmarg (Meadow of Flowers ) which will take us 2 hours to reach there. You can also enjoy the attractive sceneries of Khilanmarg via Gondola ride (Phase I & II) at your own cost. The Gulmarg Gondola is the highest and longest cable car rope-way of the world and one of the best experiences in Kashmir. This cable car ride is divided into 2 stages and takes you to and from Kongdoori Mountain, which is close to Apharwat Peak. The views from the top are mesmerizing. There are various other adventure activities awaiting you like rock climbing, skiing and trekking. You can try your hands in golfing at one of the worldâ€™s largest golf courses, The Royal Spring Golf Course with 18 holes. You can partake in the activities of your interest. Return to your hotel by evening and stay overnight in Srinagar.\r\n\r\n3rd Day (Thu 23rd January) : Srinagar to Sonamarg - Day Trip\r\nPost the breakfast, we will depart from our hotel and lead our drive to Sonamarg. Sonamarg (meadows of gold) is a hill station in Ganderbal district which is situated 90kms north-east of Srinagar. You can hire a ( horse or pony/ Union Cab ) at additional cost to reach Thajiwas Glacier that is carpeted with snow all year round. Indulge in fun activities with your loved ones here. A pony ride offers an incredible experience if you want to explore Baltal Valley or Zero Point. Do not miss to click memorable photographs capturing the mesmerizing scenery. After the tour to Sonamarg, we will take our way back to Srinagar to the hotel for overnight stay.\r\n\r\n4th Day (Fri 24th January) : Srinagar to Pahalgam - Day Trip\r\nAfter breakfast, we\'ll embark on our tour to Pahalgam. Along the way, you\'ll have the chance to enjoy sightseeing at Awantipora ruins & Saffron Fields. Once in Pahalgam, you can explore places such as Aru, Betaab Valley, and Chandanwari using Union Cabs at your own expense, each boasting its natural allure. While in Pahalgam, indulge in activities that interest you, including skiing, golfing, visiting the Lidder Amusement Park, trekking, or experiencing thrilling whitewater rafting at your own cost  After the sightseeing tour, we\'ll return to the hotel in Srinagar for an overnight stay.\r\n\r\n5th Day (Sat 25th January) : Srinagar to Doodhpathri - Day Trip\r\nAfter Breakfast , we will proceed towards Doodhpathri. There are quite a few peaceful and less popular places in Kashmir and one of them is Doodhpathri also known as valley of milk. It has eye-catching meadows spread over a massive land and you can also explore the place on a pony. This place is more favorable for the elderly and children as this place is not at the altitude. It is just 42 kms away from the heart of the city Srinagar. After spending quality time in THE VALLEY OF MILK we will head back towards Srinagar for overnight stay.\r\n\r\n6th Day (Sun 26th January) : Srinagar - Departure\r\nTour Conclusion: We ensure a punctual transfer for your convenience. Our driver will escort you to the airport, railway station, or bus station for your onward journey to your next destination.\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Accommodation on a twin/double/triple sharing basis (as per the package).\r\n* Meals as per the package.\r\n* Transportation - Innova\r\n* Sightseeing by assigned vehicle (as per the package).\r\n* Complimentary 60-minute Shikara Ride.\r\n* Driver allowances.\r\n* Toll tax & Parking','* Any Air/Train/Bus fare or travel insurance.\r\n* Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n* Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonmarg, Doodhpathri, Yusmarg ( If You Have Not Included it )  Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n* Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\n* Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n* Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc.\r\n* Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\n* The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg and vice versa, or to other destinations like Sonamarg, Pahalgam, and Doodhpathri in the event of heavy snow, is not included in your package.\r\n* Anything not in inclusions is Excluded\r\n\r\n\r\n','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.','2025-01-21','2025-01-26',1,0,0,'2024-12-31 15:59:06','2024-12-31 16:28:02'),(840,1475,15530,5,2,0,0,0,'Andaman Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (18 Jan) :	\r\nPort Blair Arrival - Cellular Jail â€“ Light & Sound Show  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nCellular Jail - Light & Sound Show  Tickets  (5Ad. + 2Ch).\r\n\r\n2nd Day (19 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair to Havelock - Radha Nagar Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nPort Blair To Havelock  Private Catamaran Ferry : Premium  (5Ad. + 2Ch).\r\n\r\n3rd Day (20 Jan)	\r\nHavelock - Elephenta Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nElephanta  Boat Charge  (5Ad. + 2Ch)\r\n\r\n4th Day (21 Jan)	\r\nHavelock to Neil Island - Laxmanpura Beach, Bharatpura Beach & Natural Bridge  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nHavelock To Neil Island  Private Catamaran Ferry : Premium  (5Ad. + 2Ch)\r\n\r\n5th Day (22 Jan)	\r\nNeil Island - Laxmanpura Beach & Sitapur Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\n\r\n6th Day (23 Jan)	\r\nNeil Island to Port Blair - Chidiya Tapu Beach  (1-SUV Vehicle)\r\nNeil Island To Port Blair  Private Catamaran Ferry : Premium   (5Ad. + 2Ch).\r\n\r\n7th Day (24 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair - Jolly Buoy 