om hotel and transfer to the Airport for your onwards journey.\r\n\r\nVehicle\r\n\r\n1-Dzire as per itinerary & timing only.\r\nKolkata Railway Station / Airport to Hotel, \r\nGangasagar, \r\n\r\n\r\n1-SUMO / Similar as per itinerary & timing only.\r\nKachuberia Excursion \r\n','','â€¢	Economy Class airfare.\r\nâ€¢	Accommodation on twin Sharing Basis. \r\nâ€¢	Meal Plan (as per mentioned above). \r\nâ€¢	Exclusive AC Vehicle for transfers & sightseeing as per Itinerary. \r\nâ€¢	All permit fees & hotel taxes (as per itinerary). \r\nâ€¢	GST \r\n','â€¢	Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary. \r\nâ€¢	Entrance Fees & Guide charges. \r\nâ€¢	Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc. (to be borne by the client, which is directly payable on the spot). \r\nâ€¢	Insurance. \r\nâ€¢	NOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded \r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability.','2025-02-18','2025-02-20',1,0,0,'2025-01-03 11:25:05','2025-01-27 19:46:31'),(843,1478,349,5,0,0,93000,25000,'Dubai Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: \r\n- Arrival: Transfer from SHJ Airport to Hotel (Deira, Bur Dubai, SZR) - Private.  \r\n- Evening: Marina Dhow Cruise with Dinner - SIC transfer.  \r\n\r\nDay 2:\r\n- Afternoon: Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner - SIC transfer.  \r\n\r\nDay 3:  \r\n- Morning: Half-Day City Tour - SIC transfer.  \r\n- Evening: Burj Khalifa Tour - Private transfer.  \r\n\r\nDay 4: \r\n- Morning: Visit Dubai Frame - Private transfer.  \r\n- Afternoon: Museum of the Future - Private transfer.  \r\n\r\nDay 5: \r\n- Departure: Transfer to DXB Airport - Private.  ','','â€¢	Economy Class Airfare \r\nâ€¢	Daily Breakfast\r\nâ€¢	Marina Dhow Cruise With Dinner (SIC Basis)(05-Adults)\r\nâ€¢	Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner (SIC Basis)(05-Adults)\r\nâ€¢	Half Day City Tour (SIC Basis)(05-Adults)\r\nâ€¢	Burj Khalifa Tour ( Burj Khalifa 124th + 125th Floo