land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure \r\nâ€¢ Room Heater Charges \r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nNOTE: AC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicles will be on Point-to-Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place, that will be on your own by walk or local transportation','2025-02-21','2025-02-25',1,0,0,'2025-02-13 18:16:37','2025-02-13 18:29:30'),(874,1521,195,6,0,0,18000,3000,'Baku Diaries','SUGGESTED ITINERARY\r\n \r\nDAY 1: ARRIVAL\r\nâ— Arrival: Touchdown at Hyder Aliyev International Airport. Transfer to your cozy hotel. Freshen up and relax.\r\nTransfer to Baku hotel\r\n\r\n \r\nDay 2: SHAHDAG FULL DAY TOUR.(7-8 Hrs Vehicle) / Tour Starts at 9 AM\r\nâ— Embark on a trip to witness the splendor of Azerbaijan\'s mountainous greater caucasus region. Prepare for a spectacular mountain expedition through Azerbaijan\'s most awe-inspiring landscapes. Be awed by the vivid red and white rock formations of the range which create a surreal, dreamlike setting.  Complete your trip with a visit to the Shahdag Mountain Resort. Enjoy exhilarating roller coaster rides or take in the incredible landscapes from cable cars. Transfer back to your Hotel. On the way, you will also be able to see the Red Village, a 100% Jewish settlement, the biggest outside Israel, and the USA. After the village, we will head to our Hotel in Baku\r\nRelaxation: Overnight in the heart of bustling Baku.\r\n\r\nDAY 03: ABSHERON TOUR + PANORAMIC CITY TOUR (2-3 Hrs)  \r\nâ— Arrival: Touchdown at Hyder Aliyev International Airport. Transfer to your cozy hotel. Freshen up and relax.\r\nâ— Evening Delight: Get enchanted with the Baku Night City Tour â€“ Highland Park,\r\nFunicular Ride, Martyr Alleys, Flame Tower, Little Venice, Baku Boulevard, Carpet Museum, Deniz Mall, and the vibrant Nizami Street.\r\n\r\nâ— Absheron Excursion: Venture into the Absheron Area to explore the Fire Temple, The Ateshgah Fire Temple, also known as the Fire Temple of Baku, is a historic religious site located in Surakhani, a suburb of Baku\r\nFire Mountain â€“ Yanardag, and capture stunning photos at the iconic HEYDER ALIYEV CENTER.\r\n \r\n\r\nDAY 04: QOBUSTAN TOUR  + BAKU CITY TOUR\r\nâ— Qobustan Area Exploration-Mud Volcano, & Gobustan : Embark on an adventure to the Qobustan Area,\r\ndiscovering the Mud Volcano, Gobustan State Preserve\'s archaeological treasures, and the striking Bibi Heybat Mosque. The State Preserve is full of archaeological monuments. Largest known concentrations of petroglyphs in the world | Later on, Visit 28 Mall, named after the nearby  metro station â€œ28 Mayâ€ and located in one of the most vibrant districts of Baku. Find a good mix of international and local brands and visit some of the mall\'s 16 coffee shops and restaurants. \r\nOld City Gems: Discover the historical wonders of Baku Old City, including Icharishahar, Maiden Tower, Palace of Shirvanshah, and the charming Museum of Miniature Books.\r\nâ— Stay: Another captivating night in Baku.\r\n \r\n\r\nDAY 05: GABALA TOUR \r\nAfter Breakfast, today breathtaking landscapes and thrilling activities await. Our first destination is the Tufandag Mountain Resort, a haven nestled amidst the majestic Caucasus Mountains. Here, you\'ll experience the scenic beauty and invigorating breeze as you take a ride on the rope way of the \r\nTufandag summer-winter tourist complex. Marvel at the panoramic views of the city below and immerse yourself in the serenity of the mountains.\r\nâ— Later we\'ll head to the Gabala Shooting Centre for an adrenaline-pumping experience of rifle\r\nshooting. Test your marksmanship skills as you take aim and fire (please note that the cost of 10 bullets is not included in the tour package).\r\nVisit to Gabala Land, an amusement Park (Ticket Extra)\r\nâ— See Nohur Lake (boating Extra), Seven Beauty waterfall, Alpaca Animal Pak(Entrance Extra).\r\nSpend some quality time at the River.\r\nDrive back to Baku for overnight stay\r\n \r\n\r\nDAY 06:. TRANSFER TO BAKU AIRPORT\r\n \r\nâ— Check Out .\r\nâ— Farewell: Transfer to Baku Airport. Bid adieu to Baku, carrying cherished memories of an unforgettable journey.\r\n\r\nTour Ends\r\n','','â— Economy class airfare.\r\nâ— Daily Breakfast\r\nâ— Meet & Greet at Hyder Aliyev International Airport Baku, Azerbaijan\r\nâ— Transportation in Air Conditioned Vehicle with professional driver \r\nâ— Panoramic City Tour with Photo Stop (Flame Tower, Boulevard Park, Nizami street, Crystal Hall, Carpet Museum, Little Venice, Hyder Aliyev)\r\nâ— Old City Tour (Ichari Seher, Maiden Tower, Shirvanshah Palace)\r\nâ— Qobustan Tour (Mud Volcano, Rock Petro Glyph)\r\nâ— Ateshgah Tour (Fire Temple, Fire Mountain)\r\nâ— Shahdag Day Tour with Candy Mountain, Red Village & Cable Car.\r\nâ— Gabala tour with cable car seven beauty waterfall, Nohur Lake\r\nâ— Entrances Included: Funicula Ride, Fire Temple & Fire Mountain, Cable car at Shahdag, & Mud Volcano safari by Lada Car \r\nâ— Visa\r\nâ— GST\r\n \r\n','Any type of personal expense\r\nAdditional sightseeing or other than mentioned in the itinerary \r\nTCS','Airafare is dynamic.\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2025-03-04','2025-03-09',1,0,0,'2025-02-14 14:55:44','2025-02-14 16:25:37'),(875,1526,15512,4,0,0,241000,24100,'Vietnam Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrive Ho Chi Minh City (PVT)\r\nArrive in Ho Chi Minh, transfer downtown, and check in at your hotel (14:00). Enjoy the rest of the day at leisure. Overnight in Ho Chi Minh.\r\nInclusion : Transfer, pick upâ€™s airport guide, water, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : HCMC â€“ Mekong Delta (PVT) (B)\r\nDepart at 7:30 AM (time varies by hotel) for a scenic boat ride to a historic floating market on the Tien River. Enjoy fresh fruits, folk music, and visit local businesses crafting coconut candy and rice popcorn. Explore a village by foot and bike, and admire an ancient houseâ€™s traditional architecture. Overnight in Ho Chi Minh.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, guide, entrance fee, local boat, breakfast, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Ho Chi Minh City fly to Danang â€“ Hoi An Ancient Town Half Day (B) (PRIVATE)\r\nArrive in Da Nang and transfer to Hoi An, a historic 16th-century trading port. Check in at the hotel (14:00), then explore top attractions, including the Japanese Covered Bridge, Fujian Assembly Hall, Tan Ky Old House, Hoi An Market, and enjoy a lantern boat excursion. Overnight in Da Nang.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, guide, entrance fee, lantern boat, breakfast, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : Ba Na hill â€“ Golden Bridge full day (PVT)(B)\r\nAfter breakfast, depart at 8:00 AM for Ba Na Hills (35km from Da Nang). Take the Sunworld Cable Car to visit Vong Nguyet Hills, Linh Ung Pagoda, and French Old Villas. Continue to Nui Chua Mountain to explore Nghinh Phong Top, Le Nim Villas, and Orchid Garden. Experience the hill-climbing train, Le Jardin Dâ€™Amour, and walk across the famous Golden Bridge for panoramic views. Enjoy lunch at your own expense, then explore Fantasy Park with various indoor games. Overnight in Da Nang.\r\nEntrance fares exclude WOW Pass, 10D Movie, Alpine Coaster, Wax Museum, Debay Wine Cellar, Teddy bear grips, coin games and Fantasy Park indoor sports.\r\nInclusion :  Private transfer, sharing guide, entrance fee, breakfast, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Da Nang â€“ Fly to Hanoi Vietnam â€“ City Tour half day (B)\r\nAfter breakfast and hotel check-out, transfer to the airport for a flight to Hanoi. Upon arrival, transfer to the city center and check in at the hotel. In the afternoon, visit the Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum (outside), One Pillar Pagoda, and Hanoi Train Street. Explore Hoan Kiem Lake, stroll through the Old Quarterâ€™s \"36 Streets,\" and shop at Dong Xuan Market. Overnight in Hanoi.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, water, guide, breakfast, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Hanoi â€“ Ha Long, welcome on the boat (SIC) (B/L/D) \r\nDepart at 8:00 AM for Ha Long Bay (4-hour drive). Arrive at the port by noon, board the cruise, and check into your cabin. Enjoy a fresh seafood lunch while cruising through the bay. Stop for a swim, visit a cave, and relax on a secluded beach. Return to the boat for a sunset view before a seafood dinner. Overnight on the cruise.\r\nNote: The itinerary may vary by cruise.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, sharing cruise, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, all meals, permits. \r\n\r\nDay 7 : Explore Bay â€“ Hanoi Departure (B/Brunch)\r\nWake up early to enjoy the stunning sunrise over Ha Long Bay. After breakfast at 8:00 AM, take a local rowboat ride. Enjoy brunch while cruising back to the pier, then return to Hanoi. Transfer to the airport (without a guide) for your flight home. \r\nNote: The cruise itinerary may vary.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer for the cruise journey, sharing cruise, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, breakfast, brunch on boat.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Internal sector flights included\r\n* 6N accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Private air-conditioned vehicle with private driver as mentioned itinerary\r\n* Local English speaking guide as mentioned itinerary\r\n* Meals as mentioned (B = breakfast; L = lunch with set menu; D = dinner with set menu)\r\n* SIC tours as mentioned\r\n* Entrance fee to the mentioned itinerary\r\n* Bottled water for the touring day (500ml/bottle/pax/day) \r\n* Insurance \r\n* Visa\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Tipping Policy: $US 3/pax/day (Mandatory)\r\n* TCS ','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nMeals on boat are local food.\r\nTOUR TIME & ACTIVITIES	(PRIVATE TOUR)\r\nWith half day tour: 4 hours (AM: 8:30 am - 12:30 am or  PM: 1:30 pm - 5:30 pm)\r\nDaily working hours: We work for 8 hours a day starting from 8:30 am to 5:30 pm. \r\nAny activities out of this time frame must be informed to us 1 day before and will occur surcharges.\r\n\r\n','2025-05-30','2025-06-05',1,0,0,'2025-02-15 14:36:04','2025-03-01 18:39:33'),(876,1524,2690,4,0,0,103600,29000,'Thailand Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :  \r\n\r\n1st Day (2nd Dec)\r\nTRANSFERS : EX PHUKET APT - Krabi Hotel ( Ao-Anang Area )  (1-PRIVATE VAN HKT Max 9 + Luggage) \r\n\r\n2nd Day (3rd Dec)\r\nSIC TOURS - KRABI \r\nKrabi 4 Island Tour By Long Tailed Boat + Lunch Box ( Exclude National Park Fee THB 200 ) On SIC\r\n\r\n3rd Day (4th Dec)\r\nTRANSFERS : EX KRABI HOTEL - Phuket Hotel ( Patong Area)  (1-PRIVATE VAN KBV Max 9 + Luggage) \r\n\r\n4th Day (5th Dec)\r\nSIC TOURS - PHUKET \r\nPhuket Half Day City Tour - Big Buddha on SIC \r\n\r\n5th Day (6th Dec)\r\nSIC TOURS - PHUKET \r\nPhi Phi Island Tour By Speed Boat + Khai Island + Lunch + Transfer ( Excl. National Park Fee) on SIC \r\n\r\n6th Day (7th Dec)\r\nTRANSFERS : EX PHUKET HOTEL - Phuket APT  (1-PRIVATE VAN HKT(Max 9 + Luggage) \r\nTRANSFERS: EX BKK APT - Pattaya Hotel ( Central Pattaya )   (1-PRIVATE SUV BKK Max 4 + Luggage) \r\n\r\n7th Day (8th Dec)\r\nSIC TOURS - PATTAYA \r\nCoral Island Tour By Speedboat With Indian Buffet Lunch on SIC \r\n\r\n8th Day (9th Dec)\r\nTRANSFERS : EX PTY HOTEL - Bangkok Hotel (Pratunam & Sukhumvit Soi 1-24)  (1-PRIVATE SUV BKK (Max 4 + Luggage)\r\n\r\n9th Day (10th Dec)\r\nSIC TOURS - BANGKOK \r\nFull Day Safari World + Marine Park with Lunch on SIC \r\n\r\n10th Day (11th Dec)\r\nSIC TOURS - BANGKOK \r\nHalf Day BKK Temple & Tour (2 Temple ) on SIC \r\n\r\n11th Day (12th Dec)\r\nTRANSFERS : EX BKK HTL - Bangkok BKK APT  (1-PRIVATE SUV BKK Max 4 + Luggage) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare (DEL-HKT)\r\n* Internal Flight (HKT-BKK)\r\n* BKK-YVR (BKK-TPE 17:40-22:10) (TPE-YCR 23:55-18:35)  1hr 45m layover at TPE\r\n* 10N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport Transfers on PVT\r