e. You continue to discover the French Square, visit and play some games in Fantasy Park â€“ one of the largest indoor amusement parks in Vietnam with a series of interesting games.\r\n\r\nAt 15:30: Back to the cabin down the mountain.\r\n\r\nBack to the hotel in Da nang/ Hoi an. Arrive in Da nang at about 17:00. Overnight in Da Nang. \r\n\r\nDay 6 - 25 May: Danang Departure (B)\r\n\r\nDepending on your flight you may have some more time for shopping on your own. Then we will transfer you without a guide to Hanoi airport for your flight home. Goodbye, and hope to see you again soon!\r\n\r\n\r\n','','- DEL-SGN and HAN-DEL economy class airfare included\r\n- One internal flight from Ho Chi Minh to Da Nang is included\r\n- Accommodation based on double/twin/triple sharing room \r\n- Private air-conditioned vehicle with private driver as mentioned itinerary \r\n- Local English speaking guide as mentioned itinerary \r\n- Meals as mentioned (B = breakfast; L = lunch with set menu; D = dinner with set menu) \r\n- SIC tours as mentioned \r\n- Entrance fee to the mentioned itinerary \r\n- Bottled water for the touring day (500ml/bottle/pax/day) \r\n- Travel Insurance\r\n- Visa','- Early check in/Late check out \r\n- Beverages \r\n- Personal expenses \r\n- Tips (Tipping Policy: $US 3/pax/day (Mandatory))\r\n- Surcharge in peak season (Christmas, New Year, Lunar New Year, etc.) \r\n- Others not mentioned in the written details above. ','Kindly note: Entrance fares exclude WOW Pass, 10D Movie, Alpine Coaster, Wax Museum, Debay Wine Cellar, Teddy bear grips, coin games and Fantasy Park indoor sports.\r\nPlease see inclusive items listed after each day. \r\nAirfare is dynamic\r\nRooms are subject to availability. \r\n','2025-06-10','2025-06-15',1,0,0,'2025-04-25 19:02:09','2025-04-25 19:02:09'),(949,1622,3052,10,1,0,0,0,'Sri Lanka ','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival - Kandy	\r\nTransfer to Kandy\r\nEnroute visit Pinnawala Elephant Orphange\r\nVisit Mawanella Spice Garden\r\nCheck into the Hotel\r\nLeisure\r\nDinner & stay overnight at hotel.\r\n	\r\nDay 02 : Kandy	\r\nBreakfast\r\nVisit Temple of the tooth relic\r\nOn completion visit Royal Botanical Garden\r\nEvening visit to Gem Museum\r\nWitness to the cultural dance\r\nDinner & stay overnight at hotel\r\n	\r\nDay 03 : Kandy - Bentota	\r\nBreakfast\r\nTransfer to Bentota\r\nCheck into the hotel\r\nLeisure\r\nDinner & stay overnight at hotel\r\n	\r\nDay 04 : Bentota/ Wadduwa â€“ Galle Excursion	\r\nBreakfast\r\nTransfer to Galle for a Day Excursion\r\nVisit Jungle Beach & Galle Fort\r\nOn completion Unwatuna Beach\r\nEvening enjoy Galle City Tour\r\nTransfer back to the hotel.\r\nDinner & stay overnight at hotel\r\n	\r\nDay 05 : Bentota-Wadduwa// Bentota City Tour	\r\nBreakfast\r\nVisit to Turtle Hatchery in Kosgoda\r\nVisit Kande Viharaya\r\nOn completion enjoy boat safari in Madu River\r\nDinner & stay overnight\r\n	\r\nDay 06 : Bentota - Leisure\r\nBreakfast\r\nFull Day Leisure @Bentota\r\nDinner & stay overnight in Bentota\r\n	\r\nDay 07 : Bentota - Colombo	\r\nBreakfast\r\nStay Until Checkout\r\nTransfer to Colombo\r\nCheck into the hotel & Relax\r\nDinner & stay overnight in Colombo\r\nEvening shopping tour\r\n\r\nDay 08 : Colombo City Tour	\r\nBreakfast\r\nVisit Independence Squre/ Lotus Tower/ Viharamahadevi Park/ Colombo National Museum & Galle face Green.\r\nOn completion visit to Anjaneyar Temple & Vibeeshana Temple which is related to the Ramayanaya.\r\nEvening go for a shopping tour in Colombo.\r\nDinner & stay overnight in Colombo\r\n	\r\nDay 09 : Departure\r\nBreakfast\r\nCheckout from the hotel and transfer to the Airport for the homebound journey\r\n\r\n	\r\n\r\n','','* DEL-CMB-DEL Economy class airfare\r\n* Accommodation at the hotels mentioned or similar on Half Board basis\r\n* Transportation in a Pvt Air-conditioned Vehicle. (Toyota Mini Coaster)\r\n* Service of an English-speaking National Guide.\r\n* City tours in Kandy, Bentota & Colombo.\r\n* 02*500ml Bottles per person per Day                            \r\n* Welcome at the airport with Garlands                         \r\n* Express way charges wherever applicable\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n','* Entrance Fee to any sites which is not mentioned above.                    \r\n* Early check in or late checkout charges.                                                          \r\n* Tips to Guides / Chauffeurs                                         \r\n* Any fluctuations in the dollar component will affect the costing.       \r\n* Lunch or any extra meal not mentioned on the above program during the tour.       \r\n* Camera or Video permits.                                             \r\n* Expenses of a personal nature.                         \r\n* Any service not specifically mentioned in the inclusion.                     \r\n* Any increase of cost due to political disturbance / bandh or increase in tax or fuel cost, leading to increase in surface transportation and land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure or while touring\r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n\r\n ','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability\r\nTurtle Hatchery, Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage, Madu River Boat Ride and Gangaramaya Temple tours can be done at supplementary cost. ','2025-06-13','2025-06-21',1,0,0,'2025-04-28 15:19:26','2025-04-28 15:19:26'),(950,1623,195,2,1,1,12800,2400,'Baku Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (22nd May) : Arrival at the Airport and transfer to the booked hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax. In the evening proceed for Panoramic Tour.\r\n\r\nDay 02 (23rd May) : Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nBaku City Tour\r\n\r\nDay 03 (24th May) : Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nDaily Shahdag Tour\r\n\r\nDay 04 (25th May) : Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nAbsheron Tour & Shopping Day\r\n\r\nDay 05 (26th May) : After having breakfast, check-out from the hotel and transfer to the airport for your homebound Journey.\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on pvt.\r\n* Tours as mentioned\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Entrance Tickets\r\n* Guide\r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.','2025-05-22','2025-05-26',1,0,0,'2025-04-30 17:38:26','2025-05-01 19:05:10'),(951,1624,26,5,0,0,374300,48000,'London Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrive into London, the capital of England and the United Kingdom.\r\nFly to London, a city of rich culture and history. On arrival, meet your Tour Manager and check into your hotel. Relax and enjoy your evening.\r\nOvernight in London. (Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Guided city tour of London with Changing of Guards. Visit the legendary Lordâ€™s Cricket Ground. Ride the London Eye. \r\nAfter breakfast, enjoy a guided London city tour covering landmarks like Big Ben, Buckingham Palace (with Changing of the Guards, subject to operation), Tower Bridge, and more. Visit the iconic Lordâ€™s Cricket Ground for a behind-the-scenes tour and lunch. Later, enjoy stunning views from the London Eye.\r\nOvernight in London. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Visit to the famous Madame Tussauds Wax Museum. Stratford-upon-Avon. Onto Manchester\r\nCheck out and visit Madame Tussauds. Then head to Stratford-upon-Avon, Shakespeareâ€™s birthplace, before continuing to Manchester for check-in and relaxation.\r\nOvernight in Manchester/Lancaster. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 4 : Lake Windermere. Enjoy Cruise on Lake Windermere. Enjoy Scottish Distillery tour. Drive to Glasgow\r\nCheck out and visit the scenic Lake District for a Windermere Lake Cruise. Then head to the Scottish Highlands for a whisky distillery tour. Continue to Glasgow, check in, and relax.\r\nOvernight in Glasgow. (Breakfast, Local Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Guided city tour of Edinburgh. Visit the Edinburgh Castle. Cruise on Lake Loch Lomond\r\nEnjoy a guided Edinburgh city tour with key sights like the Royal Mile and Edinburgh Castle. Later, cruise on scenic Loch Lomond before returning to Glasgow.\r\nOvernight in Glasgow. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Orientation tour of Manchester. Onto Birmingham\r\nStart your day with breakfast at the hotel and check out before driving to Manchester for a city orientation tour. Then, continue to Birmingham for hotel check-in and an overnight stay. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 7 : Drive to London, enroute visit Oxford â€“ the University Town for an orientation tour. Visit Windsor Castle. After breakfast, drive to London with stops at Oxford for an orientation tour and Windsor Castle (or Stonehenge, if closed). Arrive in London and check in.\r\nOvernight in London. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 8 : Fly back home\r\nCheck out and transfer to the airport, bidding farewell to your tour companions and taking home cherished memories.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 7N Accommodation with daily Continental Buffet Breakfast\r\n* 6 Indian/ Local Jain/Vegetarian/Non-Vegetarian Lunches.\r\n* 7 Indian Jain/Vegetarian/Non-Vegetarian Dinners.\r\n* Tips to coach drivers for the duration of the tour is included.\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary on SIC\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* City Tax/Tourist Tax (If Applicable)\r\n* Van tours Tips (4-5 EUR per person per day)\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nVisa charges are dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nSIC Tour pick up is not from the hotel , clients has to make their own arrangement for transfers to & for to the pick up point exact pick up point will come to know once booking is confirmed\r\n \r\n','2025-08-26','2025-08-31',0,0,0,'2025-05-01 10:49:20','2025-05-01 11:54:56'),(952,1625,3052,10,1,0,0,0,'Sri Lanka ','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival - Kandy	\r\nTransfer to Kandy\r\nEnroute visit Pinnawala Elephant Orphange\r\nVisit Mawanella Spice Garden\r\nCheck into the Hotel\r\nLeisure\r\nDinner & stay overnight at hotel.\r\n	\r\nDay 02 : Kandy	\r\nBreakfast\r\nVisit Temple of the tooth relic\r\nOn completion visit Royal Botanical Garden\r\nEvening visit to Gem Museum\r\nWitness to the cultural dance\r\nDinner & stay overnight at hotel\r\n	\r\nDay 03 : Kandy - Bentota	\r\nBreakfast\r\nTransfer to Bentota\r\nCheck into the hotel\r\nLeisure\r\nDinner & stay overnight at hotel\r\n	\r\nDay 04 : Bentota/ Wadduwa â€“ Galle Excursion	\r\nBreakfast\r\nTransfer to Galle for a Day Excursion\r\nVisit Jungle Beach & Galle Fort\r\nOn completion Unwatuna Beach\r\nEvening enjoy Galle City Tour\r\nTransfer back to the hotel.\r\nDinner & stay overnight at hotel\r\n	\r\nDay 05 : Bentota-Wadduwa// Bentota City Tour	\r\nBreakfast\r\nVisit to Turtle Hatchery in Kosgoda\r\nVisit Kande Viharaya\r\nOn completion enjoy boat safari in Madu River\r\nDinner & stay overnight\r\n	\r\nDay 06 : Bentota - Leisure\r\nBreakfast\r\nFull Day Leisure @Bentota\r\nDinner & stay overnight in Bentota\r\n	\r\nDay 07 : Bentota - Colombo	\r\nBreakfast\r\nStay Until Checkout\r\nTransfer to Colombo\r\nCheck into the hotel & Relax\r\nDinner & stay overnight in Colombo\r\nEvening shopping tour\r\n\r\nDay 08 : Colombo City Tour	\r\nBreakfast\r\nVisit Independence Squre/ Lotus Tower/ Viharamahadevi Park/ Colombo National Museum & Galle face Green.\r\nOn completion visit to Anjaneyar Temple & Vibeeshana Temple which is related to the Ramayanaya.\r\nEvening go for a shopping tour in Colombo.\r\nDinner & stay overnight in Colombo\r\n	\r\nDay 09 : Departure\r\nBreakfast\r\nCheckout from the hotel and transfer to the Airport for the homebound journey\r\n\r\n	\r\n