is â€“ 16th Jun \r\nâ€¢ One way transfer from Miami hotel to Miami airport on private basis â€“ 17th Jun \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare \r\n* 4N Accommodation in Orlando with daily breakfast for 2\r\n* 3N Accommodation in Miami with daily breakfast for 2\r\n* Airport transfers on Pvt\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n','* Visaâ€™s and Taxes, Baggage Charges\r\nâ€¢ Resort Fee / City Tax / Utility Charges wherever applicable must be paid directly\r\nâ€¢ Any Meals like Lunch / Dinner unless specified in inclusions\r\nâ€¢ Bottled Water on coaches and in hotel rooms\r\nâ€¢ Tips to drivers and Gratuities as expected by Bell Staff, Tour Coach Drivers, Guides etc  \r\nâ€¢ Telephone calls, Laundry, and other expenses\r\nâ€¢ Travel Insurance \r\nâ€¢ Any items not mentioned in Package inclusions column  \r\n* TCS\r\n \r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nWhere only tickets are mentioned, clients will need to arrive / depart on their own.\r\nAs per standard hotel policy in USA, breakfast is usually for 2pax in a room irrespective of number of occupants whether 3 or 4. Sometimes the hotel does provide breakfast for all occupants; but if not included guest will have to pay for breakfast directly.\r\nEverglades national park fee USD 8 per person is to be paid direct. \r\nTourist/local/city taxes/resort fees/utility charges which generally include the use of local hotel services needs to be paid at the hotel directly by the guest.\r\n\r\n','2025-06-10','2025-06-17',1,0,0,'2025-05-19 12:29:47','2025-05-19 13:50:00'),(967,1646,33,2,1,1,158000,32000,'Hong Kong Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 (02nd Oct) : Private Airport to HK Ferry terminal transfer( 8am-10 pm). Vehicle capacity-6px\r\nFerry ticket 1 way, Eco class, Day sailing, Hong Kong to Macau \r\nPrivate Macau Ferry Pier to hotel transfer. Service hours 8 am-10 pm. Vehicle capacity upto 9 pax\r\n\r\nDay 2 (03rd Oct) : Dazzling Macau half day