0,170300,25000,'China Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival in Beijing at PEK airport , one way transfer to check in by driver with placard only \r\nDay 2 : Tian\'anmen Square, Temple of Heaven, Qianmen Walking street\r\nDay 3 :  Greatwall at Juyongguan pass, Summer palace, Olympic theme park as photo stop\r\nDay 4 : One way drop at railway station by driver with placard only, 2nd class bullet train for Shanghai, arrival,  one way transfer to check in by driver with placard only \r\nDay 5 : City tour incl Yu Market, Chenghuangmiao, People\'s Square, Old French Concession, XinTiandi, Bund area \r\nDay 6 : Free till check out before 12:00, one way drop at PVG airport by driver with placard only \r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 3N Accommodation in Beijing with breakfast\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Shanghai with breakfast\r\n* Airport Transfers on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Entrance Fee\r\n* 2nd class bullet train ticket, \r\n* English speaking tour guide service\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned\r\n* Tipping usd 30/daily\r\n* Full day landing service max daily 12hours \r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-07-26','2025-07-31',1,0,0,'2025-05-21 18:49:13','2025-05-21 19:18:31'),(970,1650,15494,3,2,0,17800,9000,'Goa Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the GOX Airport and transfer to the booked hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 02 : After having breakfast proceed for the North Goa Tour.\r\n\r\nDay 03 : Explore on your own\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Explore on your own\r\n\r\nDay 05 : After having breakfast, check-out from the hotel and transfer to the booked South-Goa hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 06 : After having breakfast proceed for the South Goa Tour\r\n\r\nDay 07 : After having breakfast check-out from the hotel and transfer to the airport for your homebound journey.','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation in North Goa with breakfast and dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in South Goa with breakfast and dinner\r\n* Airport Transfers on PVT\r\n* North Goa Tour on PVT\r\n* South Goa Tour on PVT','Any type of personal expense\r\nAny meal other than the mentioned above\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nExtra kms and hrs will be calculated afterwards','2025-06-28','2025-07-02',1,0,0,'2025-05-22 14:54:26','2025-05-23 09:49:35'),(971,1651,54,4,0,0,112300,20800,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Evening Mandai [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Evening Mandai to the booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 2\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Half Day City Tour with Guide (Drop off Little India) (3Hrs) [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 3\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Universal Studios [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Universal Studios to the booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 4\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Full Day Sentosa Island Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Full Day Sentosa Island Tour to the booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 5\r\n  MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Flower Dome + Jurassic World : The Exhibition at Cloud Forest ( Valid from 29th May) )\r\n\r\nDay 6\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Vehicle disposal for 3 hours [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Cruise Terminal [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 7\r\n Cruise Sailing\r\n\r\nDay 8\r\n  Transfer from Cruise Terminal to Airport Terminal [with Private transport]\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N Accommodation with Daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on PVT\r\nâ€¢ Evening Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Half Day City Tour with Guide (Drop off Little India) (3Hrs) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Universal Studios ( Universal Studio ( Monday -Friday ) ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Full Day Sentosa Island Tour( Cable Car + Wings Of Time 1st Show + Skyhelix ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Flower Dome + Jurassic World : The Exhibition at Cloud Forest ( Valid from 29th May) ) (Only Ticket)(04-Adults)\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-05-28','2025-06-02',1,0,0,'2025-05-23 14:31:56','2025-05-23 21:54:40'),(972,1652,15595,16,0,0,0,0,'Sri Lanka Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival in Bentota \r\nUpon your arrival at the airport, youâ€™ll be warmly welcomed by your driver for a scenic transfer to the coastal town \r\nof Bentota. Upon arrival, check into your hotel and spend the rest of the day at leisure, relaxing by the beach or \r\nexploring the local area. Enjoy an overnight stay in Bentota.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Exploring Bentota \r\nBegin your day with a visit to the Kande Viharaya, home to one of the tallest sitting Buddha statues in Sri Lanka. \r\nNext, visit the Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery, where you can learn about turtle conservation efforts and see baby turtles. \r\nIn the afternoon, enjoy a scenic boat ride on the Madu River, navigating through mangroves and spotting wildlife. \r\nFor thrill-seekers, optional water sports activities like jet skiing, banana boat rides, and tube rides await. End your \r\nadventurous day with an overnight stay in Bentota.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Transfer from Bentota to Kandy \r\nAfter breakfast proceed to Kandy. En route, visit the heartwarming Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage, where you \r\ncan observe these gentle giants in their natural habitat. Continue to the Mawanella Spice Garden, where the \r\nfragrant spices of Sri Lanka await. After checking into your hotel, unwind and prepare for an exciting adventure. \r\nEnjoy your first night in Kandy, surrounded by the island\'s natural beauty. \r\n\r\nDay 4 : Discovering Kandy \r\nAfter a delightful breakfast, immerse yourself in spirituality at the Temple of the Tooth Relic, a UNESCO World \r\nHeritage site. Next, explore the lush trails of Udawattakelle Forest Reserve, where nature flourishes. Following \r\nyour nature retreat, visit the Royal Botanical Garden, home to a stunning array of flora. In the evening, be \r\ncaptivated by the exquisite gems at the Gem Museum, followed by an enchanting Cultural Dance performance \r\nthat showcases Sri Lankaâ€™s rich heritage. Enjoy your second overnight stay in Kandy.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Transfer to Colombo // Colombo City Tour  \r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Colombo, Sri Lanka\'s bustling commercial capital. Check into your hotel and set out for \r\na city tour, visiting landmarks such as the Gangaramaya Temple, Independence Square, Port City, and Galle Face \r\nGreen. In the evening, embark on a guided shopping tour to explore Colomboâ€™s vibrant markets and chic \r\nboutiques. Conclude your day with an overnight stay in Colombo.\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Departure from Colombo to Airport \r\nAfter breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport to catch your departure flight, taking with you unforgettable \r\nmemories of your Sri Lankan adventure. If time permits enjoy a shopping tour before you leave. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Bentota with breakfast\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Kandy with breakfast\r\n* 1N Accommodation in Colombo with breakfast\r\n* 02*500ml Bottles per person per Day\r\n* Free Cultural Show Tickets (Clients should visit a Gem shop which will be direct by us) at Kandy.  \r\nâ€¢ Free Gem Factory visit and explanation about the gem progress at Kandy. \r\n* Transportation in a Pvt Air-conditioned vehicle. (Mini Coaster)\r\nâ€¢ Service of an English-speaking National Guide  \r\nâ€¢ City tours in Kandy, Bentota & Colombo \r\nâ€¢ All applicable Government Taxes\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Entrance Fee to any sites. \r\nâ€¢ Early check in or late checkout charges\r\n* Tips to Guides / Chauffeurs\r\n* Lunch or any extra meal not mentioned on the above program during the tour. \r\nâ€¢ Camera or Video permits. \r\nâ€¢ Expenses of a personal nature. \r\nâ€¢ Any service not specifically mentioned in the inclusion\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nTurtle Hatchery, Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage, Madu River Boat Ride, Temple of the Tooth Relic, Royale Botanical Garden, Lotus Tower and Gangaramaya Temple tours can be done at supplementary cost. \r\n','2025-06-12','2025-06-17',1,0,0,'2025-05-23 16:01:09','2025-05-23 17:11:10'),(973,1654,15725,16,0,0,0,0,'Meghalaya Adventure','\r\n1st Day - (Thursday 12th June) : Guwahati Airport / Rly Station to Shillong - Transfer\r\nApprox Distance: 100 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hours\r\nOn arrival at Guwahati Airport / Railway Station & transfer to Shillong, which is also called the \'Scotland of the East\". On the way visit a majestic placid lake with its surrounding sylvan hills Umium Lake (Barapani). You may do the water sports here (Optional). On arrival at Shillong, check in at your hotel. Evening you can visit Police Bazaar which is the biggest local market. Overnight stay at Shillong.\r\n \r\n2nd Day - (Friday 13th June) : Shillong - Local Sightseeing\r\nAfter breakfast visit Don Bosco Museum (Sunday closed), Wardâ€™s Lake, Botanical Garden (Closed on Sunday) and Lady Hydari Park (Closed on Monday). Evening is free for personal activities. Overnight stay at Shillong.\r\n \r\n3rd Day - (Saturday 14th June) : Shillong to Cherrapunjee - Transfer via Mawlynong and Dawki\r\nApprox Distance: 200 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 7 hours\r\nAfter breakfast visit Mawlynnong Village the cleanest village in Asia. This cute and colorful little village is known for its cleanliness. It is situated 90 kms. From Shillong and besides the picturesque village, offers many interesting sights such as the Living Root Bridge and the strange natural phenomenon of a boulder balancing on another rock. After that proceed to Dawki, Dawki is along the Indo-Bangladesh border. You can enjoy boating in the crystal clear waters of the Umgnot River. Evening proceed to Cherrapunjee. On arrival check in to hotel. Overnight at Cherrapunjee.\r\nNote: Sohra (Cherrapunjee) & Dawki are rich by their own unique beauty & full of natural elegance. The places are paradise of nature lovers, explorers & travel enthusiastic. But these destinations are equipped with very limited options, facilities & basic amenities. Even best hotels are equivalent to basic 3*. That too without Fan (at few places), AC & Lift. Standard Accommodations over there are available; just with clean rooms, hygienic bathroom & basic non vegetarian food (very limited options are there for vegetarian guests).\r\n \r\n4th Day - (Sunday 15th June) : Cherrapunjee - Local Sightseeing\r\nGet up early to enjoy the mesmerizing mornings of Cherrapunjee. Visit Eco Park, Dainthlen Falls, Nohkalikai Falls, Nohsngithiang Falls (Seven Sisters Falls), Mawsmai Cave, Thangkharang Park. Overnight stay at Cherrapunjee. Optional Activity- Proceed for a full day trekking to the Double Decker Living Root Bridge (Closed on Sunday) at Nongriat Village. Need to trek approx. 3200 steps each way to the Double Decker Living Root Bridge (Closed on Sunday). We can further trek down to the Rainbow Falls which take about 60 to 90 minutes from the Double Decker Living Root Bridge (Closed on Sunday).\r\n \r\n5th Day - (Monday 16th June) : Cherrapunjee to Guwahati - Transfer\r\nApprox Distance: 160 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 6 hours\r\nAfter breakfast check out from hotel and drive to Guwahati, enroute visit Elephanta falls. Arrive and check in at hotel. In the Evening visit â€˜Kalakshetraâ€™, a place depicting Assamese history and culture. Return to hotel. Overnight stay at Guwahati.\r\n \r\n6th Day - (Tuesday 17th June) : Guwahati Hotel to Guwahati Airport / Rly Station - Transfer\r\nAfter breakfast visit Kamakhya Temple (Notes -Timing 08:00 A.M till 01:00 P.M & 3:00 P.M till its gets dark). Transfer to Guwahati Airport / Railway Station for your onward journey. Note: Temple visit will depend on your departure time. It May be done on previous day.','','Delhi-Guwahati-Delhi economy class airfare\r\nAccommodation as mentioned in hotel section\r\nMeal Plan (as mentioned above)\r\n1-26 Seater tempo traveler as per itinerary and timing only\r\nExclusive AC vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. (AC will not run in hill area)\r\nAll hotel taxes (as per itinerary)\r\nRates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only','Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, porterage\r\nAdditional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary\r\nGuide charges, Entry Fees & Camera Charges if any\r\nVIP Darshan in Kamakhya Temple\r\nAny cost arising due to natural calamities like cyclone, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client and directly payable on the spot)\r\nAny increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure\r\nInsurance\r\nAnything which is not mentioned in Inclusions','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability.','2025-06-12','2025-06-17',1,0,0,'2025-05-23 21:42:22','2025-05-23 21:42:22'),(974,1655,15539,3,0,0,0,0,'Ooty Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : (14 Jun 2025 - Saturday) Bangalore Arrival to Mysore\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival at Bangalore Airport and transfer to Mysore. Mysore, the royal city of Karnataka . Visit Chemarajendra Art Gallery, Mysore Zoo, Maharajaâ€™s Palace, Brindavan Garden etc. Overnight stay at the hotel. Note: Mysore Zoo will be Closed on all Tuesdays\r\nOvernight stay at Mysore.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : (15 Jun 2025 - Sunday) Mysore Sightseeing \r\nMorning after breakfast drive to Mysore. Mysore (or Mysuru), a city in India\'s southwestern Karnataka state, was the capital of the Kingdom of Mysore from 1399 to 1947. In its center is opulent Mysore Palace, seat of the former ruling Wodeyar dynasty. The palace blends Hindu, Islamic, Gothic and Rajput styles. visit Chamundeshwari temple, Lalitha Mahal Palace, Mysore Zoo, Melody World Wax Museum, Jaganmohan Palace Art and Gallery, Mysore Rail Museum, St. Philomena\'s Church, Sri Ranganathaswamy Temple, Chamundi Hills & Brindavan Gardens.\r\nOvernight stay at Mysore.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : (16 Jun 2025 - Monday) Mysore to Ooty\r\nAfter morning breakfast checkout and proceed to Ooty, on arrival check in to hotel. Ooty lake, Botanical Garden. Overnight stay at Ooty.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : (17 Jun 2025 - Tuesday) Ooty Sightseeing \r\nAfter breakfast proceed to Coonoor. Coonoor Sightseeing(Sim\'s Park, Lam\'s Rock, Dolphin Nose and Tea factory) and Doddabetta Peak. Overnight stay at Ooty. \r\n\r\nDay 5 : (18 Jun 2025 - Wednesday) Coimbatore Departure Transfer\r\nAfter Breakfast Check out from hotel and proceed to Coimbatore for Departure.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Mysore with breakfast\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Ooty with breakfast\r\n* All Inclusion and sightseeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense  \r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Entry Fees \r\n* Porterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\n* Any Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\n* Any Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\n* Ayurveda Charges\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.','2025-06-14','2025-06-18',1,0,0,'2025-05-24 13:34:53','2025-05-24 16:30:08'),(975,1653,54,2,2,0,100700,23000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1\r\n  Transfer from Changi International Airport to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to Evening Mandai [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Evening Mandai to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 2\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to Half Day City Tour with Guide (Drop off Little India) (3Hrs) [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 3\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to Universal Studios [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Universal Studios to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 4\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 5\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to Full Day Sentosa Island Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Full Day Sentosa Island Tour to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 6\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to Changi International Airport [with Private transport]\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Evening Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis) (02-Adults, 01-CWB, 01-CNB)\r\nâ€¢ Half Day City Tour with Guide (Drop off Little India) (3Hrs) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-CWB, 01-CNB)\r\nâ€¢ Universal Studios ( Universal Studio ( Monday -Friday ) ) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-CWB, 01-CNB)\r\nâ€¢ MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Flower Dome + Jurassic World : The Exhibition at Cloud Forest ( Valid from 29th May) ) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-CWB, 01-CNB)\r\nâ€¢ Full Day Sentosa Island Tour ( Cable Car + Wings Of Time 1st Show + Trick Eye Museum ) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-CWB, 01-CNB)\r\n* Transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nMid-night Surcharge applicable from 11pm - 07am on Private Transfers\r\n','2025-06-29','2025-07-04',1,0,0,'2025-05-24 14:07:53','2025-05-24 16:11:48'),(976,1656,398,2,1,0,76100,17000,'Almaty Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :  \r\n\r\nDAY 1 - ALMATY - WELCOMES YOU\r\nArrival in Almaty \r\nPickup from Airport and transfer to hotel and check-in.\r\nOvernight at the Hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 2 - FULL DAY ALMATY CITY TOUR + KOK TOBE\r\nBreakfast at hotel\r\nYou will know more about the history and development of the southern capital of Kazakhstan and see its major attractions: Palace of President, Republic Square and Monument of Independence, and Astana Square, Panfilov Park, Abai Square and Palace of Republic, Presidential Park.\r\nProceed to KOK Tobe by Cable car. Kok- Tobe hill where the tallest TV tower in the world is located (if you count from the sea level) and where you will get by the picturesque winding mountain road. You can stroll along the magnificent panorama of the city from the special observation deck and visit the shop to \"The Beatles\" (the only one in CIS countries), visit the shop of national souvenirs and many other interesting things.\r\nTransfer to Hotel and overnight\r\n\r\nDAY 3 ALMATY- MEDEU & SHYMBULAK SKI RESORT\r\nBreakfast at a hotel.\r\nThis tour provides you the best opportunity to see the beautiful mountain surroundings of Almaty city. The first stop of the tour awaits you in the Medeo Gorge, where in the wonderful mountains of Trans-Ili Ala-Tau the largest high mountain skating rink in the world is located, view the huge dam, protecting the city from destructive mudflows formed on the tops of the western Tien Shan. \r\nNext destination is Shymbulak ski resort. You will board the Cable Car (Fee Included till 3rd Level), to the ski resort with 3 Level, highest level located at an altitude of 2230 meters above sea level, also known as Talgar Pass. It is very popular for its mild climate, large quantity of sunny days and snow through the winter and remarkable scenery of mountain ranges.\r\nOvernight is at hotel\r\n \r\nDAY 4  ALMATY â€“GORKY PARK- SHOPPING TOUR\r\nBreakfast at hotel\r\nVisit Gorky Central Park of Almaty in Medeu district of Almaty. It was founded in 1856 and is spread\r\nin 100 Hectares of land. The park was a place for walking and officers of the garrison Verny. In 1934\r\nthe park was renovated, in-depth on the banks of the pond were placed recreation of the working\r\npeople of Almaty, equipped with attractions. Today it offers attractions of rides for children, Aqua\r\nPark, Lake with boating, Dino-Park Zoo and its latest addition Dolphinarium.\r\n\r\nDAY 5 ALMATY DEPARTURE\r\nBreakfast at hotel\r\nCheck-Out from Hotel and transfer to airport.\r\nDrop to Almaty International Airport to board a flight to Homeland. \r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\nâ€¢ Medeu and Shymbulak tour with Cable car tickets\r\nâ€¢ Almaty City tour + KOK Tobe with cable car tickets\r\nâ€¢ Gorky Park + Shopping tour\r\nâ€¢ All tours & transfers on private basis \r\n\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\nâ€¢ English Speaking Guide (@ Usd 70 per day)\r\nâ€¢ Entrance fees Dolphinarium, Zoo, Aqua Park, Lake with boating\r\nâ€¢ Bed Tax(Payable directly at the hotel, Usd 3.8 per room/per night)\r\nâ€¢.Early Morning/Late Night arrival or Departure supplement (If arrival is from 9.30 Pm till 7 AM)\r\n* City tax, if applicable\r\n* Visa Charges\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-05','2025-06-09',1,0,0,'2025-05-24 15:41:29','2025-05-25 13:43:09'),(977,1657,349,2,1,0,62400,10000,'Dubai Diaries','Suggested itinerary :\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner \r\nâ€¢ Half day Dubai City tour\r\nâ€¢ Marina dhow cruise \r\nâ€¢ Burj Khalifa 124th & 125th Floor - (Non-prime Time) + Dubai Mall \r\nâ€¢ Abu Dhabi city tour + Ferrari world \r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\nâ€¢ Two -way Dubai Airport transfer PVT basis \r\nâ€¢ Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner \r\nâ€¢ Half day Dubai City tour\r\nâ€¢ Marina dhow cruise \r\nâ€¢ Burj Khalifa 124th & 125th Floor - (Non-prime Time) + Dubai Mall \r\nâ€¢ Abu Dhabi city tour + Ferrari world \r\nâ€¢ All transfer Sightseeing on SIC basis\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa \r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* City tax where aplicable\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-10-02','2025-10-07',1,0,0,'2025-05-24 16:46:31','2025-05-25 12:46:47'),(978,1658,3511,7,0,0,160900,28000,'Gangtok Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : IXB Airport - Gangtok (128 Kms. / 5 Hrs)\r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at the Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure. Overnight stay at Gangtok.\r\n\r\nDay 02: Excursion to Tsomgo Lake and Baba Mandir (53 Kms. / 3 Hrs. one-way)\r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok.  \r\nNote: \r\nâ€¢ Documents for Tsomgo Lake & New Baba Mandir â€“ 02 Passport Size Photo along with Photo Copy of Photo ID Proof (Passport or Driving License or Voter ID (Pan Card & Adhaar Card is not accepted). For Children below 18 years, Birth Certificate / School Id / College Id are must. Original needs to carry while travelling. \r\nâ€¢ In case of Land slide or any other reason, if Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provide alternate sightseeing.\r\n\r\nDay 03 : Gangtok - Darjeeling (100 Kms. / 4 Hrs.)\r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to hotel and rest of the day at leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\r\nEarly morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit / Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n\r\nDay 05: Darjeeling - IXB Airport (75 Kms. / 3 Hrs.)\r\nAfter breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to the  Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Gangtok with breakfast/lunch or dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Darjeeling with breakfast/lunch or dinner\r\n* Exclusive Non-a/c vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. The vehicle will not be at disposal it will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis).\r\n* Vehicle : Innova/Xylo or similar\r\n* All permit fees & hotel taxes (as per itinerary).  ','â€¢ Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), Ropeway, porterage.\r\nâ€¢ Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary. \r\nâ€¢ Entrance Fees & Guide charges. \r\nâ€¢ Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, is directly payable on the spot). \r\nâ€¢ Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure. \r\nâ€¢ Room Heater Charges.\r\nâ€¢ Anything which is not included in the inclusion.\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-05','2025-06-09',1,0,0,'2025-05-24 18:18:13','2025-05-24 20:33:56'),(979,1659,54,4,0,0,112300,20800,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Evening Mandai [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Evening Mandai to the booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 2\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Half Day City Tour with Guide (Drop off Little India) (3Hrs) [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 3\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Universal Studios [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Universal Studios to the booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 4\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Full Day Sentosa Island Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Full Day Sentosa Island Tour to the booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 5\r\n  MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Flower Dome + Jurassic World : The Exhibition at Cloud Forest ( Valid from 29th May) )\r\n\r\nDay 6\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Vehicle disposal for 3 hours [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from the booked Hotel to Cruise Terminal [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 7\r\n Cruise Sailing\r\n\r\nDay 8\r\n  Transfer from Cruise Terminal to Airport Terminal [with Private transport]\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N Accommodation with Daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on PVT\r\nâ€¢ Evening Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Half Day City Tour with Guide (Drop off Little India) (3Hrs) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Universal Studios ( Universal Studio ( Monday -Friday ) ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Full Day Sentosa Island Tour( Cable Car + Wings Of Time 1st Show + Skyhelix ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Flower Dome + Jurassic World : The Exhibition at Cloud Forest ( Valid from 29th May) ) (Only Ticket)(04-Adults)\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-05-28','2025-06-02',1,0,0,'2025-05-25 13:06:03','2025-05-25 13:06:03'),(980,1660,3511,7,0,0,211600,30000,'Gangtok Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : IXB Airport - Darjeeling (75 Kms. / 3 Hrs.) \r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\r\nEarly morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit / Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n\r\nDay 03 : Darjeeling - Kalimpong - Local Sightseeing (77 Kms. / 6Â½ Hrs.) \r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Kalimpong (4,091 Ft. / 55 Kms. / 2Â½ Hrs.). On arrival check-in to your hotel. Afternoon enjoy half day tour of Kalimpong visiting Mangal Dham, Deolo Hill, Golf Course, Durpin Dara Hills and Pine View Nursery (Sunday closed). Overnight stay at Kalimpong.\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Kalimpong - Gangtok - Half Day Local Sightseeing (108 Kms. / 7 Hrs.)\r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft. / 78 Kms. / 3 Hrs.). On arrival, check-in to your hotel. After that half day Gangtok city tour visiting Flower show, Cottage Industry and Handicraft Centre (Closed on Sunday and 1st and 3rd Saturday of the month), Institute of Tibetology (Closed on Sunday), Dro-dul Chorten, Gonjang Monastery and Banjakhri Falls (maximum 3-4 hours). Overnight stay at Gangtok.  \r\n\r\nDay 05 : Excursion to Tsomgo Lake and Baba Mandir (53 Kms. / 3 Hrs. one-way)\r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok.  \r\nNote: \r\nâ€¢ Documents for Tsomgo Lake & New Baba Mandir â€“ 02 Passport Size Photo along with Photo Copy of Photo ID Proof (Passport or Driving License or Voter ID (Pan Card & Adhaar Card is not accepted). For Children below 18 years, Birth Certificate / School Id / College Id are must. Original needs to carry while travelling. \r\nâ€¢ In case of Land slide or any other reason, if Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provide alternate sightseeing.\r\n\r\nDay 06 : Gangtok - IXB Airport (128 Kms. / 5 Hrs.)\r\nAfter breakfast, checkout from the hotel and take the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Gangtok with breakfast/lunch or dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Darjeeling with breakfast/lunch or dinner\r\n* Exclusive Non-a/c vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. The vehicle will not be at disposal it will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis).\r\n* Vehicle : Innova/Xylo or similar\r\n* All permit fees & hotel taxes (as per itinerary).  ','â€¢ Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), Ropeway, porterage.\r\nâ€¢ Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary. \r\nâ€¢ Entrance Fees & Guide charges. \r\nâ€¢ Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, is directly payable on the spot). \r\nâ€¢ Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure. \r\nâ€¢ Room Heater Charges.\r\nâ€¢ Anything which is not included in the inclusion.\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-05','2025-06-10',1,0,0,'2025-05-26 11:09:25','2025-05-26 12:20:43'),(981,1661,830,15,0,0,1980000,140000,'Do Dham Yatra','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : On arrival at Dehradun check in at Hotel. \r\nOvernight stay in hotel with Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 2 : 07:45 - 08:30- DDN-Guptkashi\r\nAfter breakfast transfer you by road to Helipad . On arrival at Sahastradhara Helipad, we fly to Guptkashi Helipad then again fly to Kedarnath from same Helipad. Temple is approx. 500 meters away from helipad and will take approx. 15 min to reach. Ground Staff will accompany the group and lead us to the VIP darshan in Kedarnath temple. After darshan and Poojan, the group will fly back to Guptkashi helipad. We will have lunch & Overnight stay at hotel in Guptkashi located at the bank of river Mandakini or Kedarnath dham.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : 08:30-09:00 - Guptkashi-Badrinath\r\nThe group is headed towards the Helipad at Guptkashi Helipad. From the Helipad we proceed to Badrinath. On arrival at Badrinath Helipad,\r\nThe group will be Check-In to the hotel. After Lunch, we will be going to Mana village, the first Village of India after China border for sightseeing. Our ground staff will assist the guests in taking darshan at the temple. Dinner and   stay at Badrinath.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : 7:45-8:45 - Badrinath-Dehradun\r\nAfter the breakfast, while we are heading back to Dehradun, see the beautiful overview of the Region, especially the picturesque view of the confluences, which is an eye-candy for nature lovers. We will fly between the beautiful valleys of thick forest and over five confluences like Vishnu Prayag, Nanda Prayag, Karna Prayag, Rudra Prayag and Dev Prayag. We will come back and drop Guests to Dehradun Airport or Railway Station.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Exclusive Helicopter services from Dehradun (Sahastradhara Helipad) to the Do Dham shrines & back.\r\n* 2 Night Accommodation at Do Dham\'s on double sharing basis only with all meals.\r\n* 1 Night Accommodation on double sharing basis with breakfast and Dinner at Dehradun.\r\n* VIP Darshans.\r\n* Shri Kedarnath ji helicopter shuttle services: Guptkashiâ€“ Kedar Guptkashi.\r\n* Helicopter handling charges.\r\n* Pick up and drop from Dehradun airport or Railway Station.\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Maha Abhishek Puja at Badrinath Ji / Rudra Abhishek Puja at Kedarnath Ji (at an extra cost)\r\n','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nExcess weight (over 75 kg) is charged at INR 1800/kg. Any extra amount will be collected at the hotel or helipad before the flight.\r\nNote : Exact Schedule can be advised before a day of departure. Above mentioned schedule is tentative just for understanding the operational system & timing. Things can be changed last moment due to any operational or weather changes.\r\nBaggage is limited to 3 kg per passenger. Please avoid large suitcases due to limited space in the helicopter. Extra baggage may not be allowed. Duffle bags are provided during the briefing.\r\nThis tour runs on fixed daily departure times. Passengers must follow the scheduled ETDs or risk being marked as NO-SHOW.','2025-06-08','2025-06-11',1,0,0,'2025-05-26 19:09:23','2025-05-26 22:55:50'),(982,1662,21504,2,1,0,94400,19000,'Seychelles Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :  \r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the Airport and transfer to the booked hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax.\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Full day glass bottom boat include lunch , Snorkelling , visit Moyenne island\r\n \r\nDay 03 : Full day Mahe island tour include lunch\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Sun Set Cruise include Sparkling Wine, Canapes, & return transfer (04 Hours) \r\n\r\nDay 05 : Day at Leisure or explore nearby places on your own.\r\n\r\nDay 06 : Check-out from the hotel and transfer to the Airport for homebound journey.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-05','2025-06-10',1,0,0,'2025-05-27 15:03:21','2025-05-27 18:30:15'),(983,1663,15540,2,0,0,0,0,'Mauritius Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival and transfer from Airport to Hotel (SIC)\r\nCheck-in at the hotel. Evening at Leisure.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Full Day North Island Tour (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Day at Leisure\r\n\r\nDay 4 : Full-Day South Island\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Day at Leisure\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Full Day Ile Aux Cerf Tour with speed boat transfer\r\n\r\nDay 7 : Check-out from the hotel and transfer to Airport for the homebound journey (SIC)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 6N Accommodation with breakfast/ lunch or dinner\r\n* Airport Transfers and tours as mentioned (SIC)\r\n    Added Values : Radisson Blu\r\nâ€¢ Free breakfast upon arrival (Radisson)\r\nâ€¢ One free lunch offered upon arrival or departure (Radisson)\r\nâ€¢ Water offered during mealtime (Radisson)\r\n* Insurance\r\n\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n    Optional Tours/Services \r\n* Catamaran Coral Queen - Dolphin encounter in west coast on shared basis including Hotel â€“ Jetty â€“ Hotel private transfers (at supplement cost)\r\nDescription: Catamaran cruise to the west departs the Tamarin jetty , direction south to encounter the dolphins, the crystal rock