ing Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Half Day City Tour with Guide (Drop off Little India) (3Hrs) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Universal Studios ( Universal Studio ( Monday -Friday ) ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ Full Day Sentosa Island Tour( Cable Car + Wings Of Time 1st Show + Skyhelix ) (PVT Basis)(04-Adults)\r\nâ€¢ MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Flower Dome + Jurassic World : The Exhibition at Cloud Forest ( Valid from 29th May) ) (Only Ticket)(04-Adults)\r\n* 2N Cruise\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-30','2025-07-07',1,0,0,'2025-05-31 18:26:03','2025-05-31 19:33:20'),(990,1670,329,3,1,0,55900,0,'Kuala Lumpur Diaries','Day Wise Itinerary\r\n\r\nDay 1\r\n  Transfer from KLIA-Airport to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 2\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to KUL Half Day City Tour (03 Hours) [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from KUL Half Day City Tour (03 Hours) to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 3\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to Genting Day Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Genting Day Tour to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 4\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to Sunway Lagoon Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Sunway Lagoon Tour to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 5\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to Half Day Putrajaya Tour (04 Hours) [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Half Day Putrajaya Tour (04 Hours) to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 6\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to KLIA-Airport [with Private transport]\r\n,Day Wise Itinerary\r\n\r\nDay 1 :\r\n  Transfer from KLIA-Airport to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 2 :\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to KUL Half Day City Tour (03 Hours) [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from KUL Half Day City Tour (03 Hours) to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 3 :\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to Genting Day Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Genting Day Tour to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 4 :\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to Sunway Lagoon Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Sunway Lagoon Tour to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 5 :\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to Half Day Putrajaya Tour (04 Hours) [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Half Day Putrajaya Tour (04 Hours) to Self-Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 6 :\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Hotel to KLIA-Airport [with Private transport]\r\n','','','','','2025-06-25','2025-06-29',0,0,0,'2025-05-31 21:45:05','2025-05-31 21:45:05'),(991,1672,16179,8,0,0,36000,5000,'McLeod Ganj Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n6th June : \r\nDepart from Delhi via Tempo Traveller (Night)\r\n\r\n7th June : \r\nReach Hotel check -in\r\nVisit Bhagshu waterfall,Bhagshu Temple, Mcleodganj market and Nam dayal Monestry.\r\nDinner at Hotel .\r\n\r\n8th June :\r\nHave Breakfast leave for Bir, to Chamundi devi temple, Baijnath temple Bangoru waterfall and sunset point. \r\nEvening at Sunset point.\r\nBack to hotel have Dinner. (McLeod Ganj)\r\n\r\n9th June : \r\nHave Breakfast leave for Delhi in between visit dharmshala tea garden and Stadium\r\n','','* 2N Accommodation in McLeod Ganj with Breakfast/ Lunch or Dinner\r\n* Tempo Traveller\r\n* Tours as mentioned','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-06','2025-06-09',0,0,0,'2025-06-02 12:33:36','2025-06-02 12:36:31'),(992,1673,15540,2,0,0,0,0,'Mauritius Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival and transfer from Airport to Hotel (SIC)\r\nCheck-in at the hotel. Evening at Leisure.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Full Day North Island Tour (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Day at Leisure\r\n\r\nDay 4 : Transfer from One hotel to the other. Check-in and relax\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Full Day South Island Tour (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Full Day Ile Aux Cerf Tour with speed boat transfer (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 7 : Check-out from the hotel and transfer to Airport for the homebound journey (SIC)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 6N Accommodation with breakfast/ lunch or dinner\r\n* Airport Transfers and tours as mentioned (SIC)\r\n* Insurance\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n    Optional Tours/Services \r\n* Catamaran Coral Queen - Dolphin encounter in west coast on shared basis including Hotel â€“ Jetty â€“ Hotel private transfers (at supplement cost)\r\nDescription: Catamaran cruise to the west departs the Tamarin jetty , direction south to encounter the dolphins, the crystal rock and back .Grilled BBQ lunch with local alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks are served\r\n* Casela Nature Parks Entrance fee Including Private transfers (at supplement cost)\r\nDescription: Included in the TOURIST ADMISSION package: African Safari to see zebras, ostriches, white rhinoceros, impalas, antelopes, kudus, wildebeest | Walk-Thru-Aviary | Viewing of giraffe, pygmy hippo, camels and llamas | Petting Farm |Children\'s playground \r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-29','2025-07-05',1,0,0,'2025-06-02 16:45:24','2025-06-02 16:45:24'),(993,1675,15512,14,0,0,0,0,'Vietnam Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival Hanoi Vietnam â€“ City highlights (4hours tour)\r\nArrival in Noi Bai airport, meet our guide and transfer to city to visit: beautiful Tran Quoc Pagoda located on the shores of West Lake and visit including Ho Chi Minhâ€™s Mausoleum  ( only opens in the morning â€“ look from outside). The next place to move to is One Pillar Pagoda â€“ a group of structures consisting of a pagoda and a tower built in the middle of a square lake.\r\nBack to downtown for refreshment by Hoan Kiem Lake, visit Hoan Kiem Lake (Restored Sword Lake) before taking walking tour through the Old Quarter, also known as the 36 streets, this bustling area of narrow streets is home to literally thousands of small businesses and shopkeepers. Itâ€™s a great place to explore with plenty of photo opportunities.\r\nCheck in and Overnight in Hanoi.\r\nCheck in time: 14:00\r\nInclusion: Private transfer, guide, entrance fee, water\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Hanoi â€“ Ha Long, welcome on the boat (SIC) (L/D) â€“ With guide on bus\r\nDeparture for Ha Long Bay is around 8:00 AM in a private car (about 4 hours) from your hotel. Arrive at the port around noon. Welcomed on board, you are taken to your cabin before the trip briefing. You enjoy a fresh and local seafood lunch while cruising to explore the magic Bay. Stop for a swim and visit the mysterious cave. Relax at our secluded island-beach. Later you return back to the boat just in time to watch the beautiful sunset from the top deck before enjoying the bayâ€™s freshest seafood dinner. Overnight on the cruise.\r\nNote : The final cruise itinerary is subject to change based on each cruiseâ€™s program.\r\nNote : Our driver doesnâ€™t speak English.\r\nInclusion : Private transfer, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, lunch, dinner, permits.\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Explore Bay â€“ Hanoi â€“ Fly to Da Nang (B) â€“ With guide on bus in Ha Noi\r\nEarly risers can enjoy the sunrise and the quiet breath-taking beauty of Bayâ€™s landscape with towering limestone. You have breakfast at around 8:00 AM before our short rowboat by the locals of the bay. Have brunch on the boat as we slowly cruise back to boat pier. Hit the road back to Ha Noi. \r\nNote : The final cruise itinerary is subject to change based on each cruiseâ€™s program.\r\nNote : Our driver doesnâ€™t speak English.\r\nTransfer to airport for Da Nang flight. Upon Arrival, pick up by our driver ( No tour guide). Check in hotel.\r\nNeed a late flight after 5:30pm\r\nInclusion: Private transfer for the cruise journey, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, breakfast.\r\n\r\nDay 4: Coconut Village  - Hoi An Ancient Town â€“ Drop Flower Lantern \r\nThen visit Hoi An which is a most vibrant and lovely city in Vietnam, especially at night. When the sun goes down, the lights ignite and the old town turns into a romantic backdrop. Throughout this tour, you can enjoy local speciality, drink Vietnamese coffee and watch the beautiful sunset from the horizon. Next up on your experience, you will take a boat trip on the Hoai River. You will have a great chance to see the Hoi An town, with gorgeous views of landscapes on small boats. Then, walking around the streets, you will be able to note that the atmosphere becomes completely different. You can later head to the Hoi An night market, where you can admire the beauty of more than a thousand lanterns and varying delicious street food. Joining a Hoi An by-night tour truly enables you to enjoy this city in one of the most memorable and remarkable ways possible!\r\nOvernight in Da Nang.\r\nInclusion : Transfer, guide, entrance fee, lantern drop activities\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Ba Na Hill â€“ Golden Bridge full day \r\nHave breakfast at your hotel. 8:00AM Transfer to Ba Na hills (35km from Danang center) and get on the Sunworld Cable Car which gains 5 world scores to Ba Na hills station. Stop at By Night station to visit Vong Nguyet hills, Linh Ung Pagoda, The Old Villas of French. Continue moving up by cable car to the Nui Chua Mountain â€“ the top of Ba Na range, visiting Nghinh Phong top, Le Nim Villas, Orchid Gardenâ€¦ Experience hill climbing train (first and unique funicular in Vietnam), flower garden Le Jardin Dâ€™amour and Linh Ung Pagoda. Enjoy a walk across the famous Golden Bridge and admire the panoramic view over the area of mountain and lush trees. Have lunch by your own choices. After lunch, free for joining games in Fantasy Park â€“ the third biggest indoor games zone in Vietnam with a series of interesting games: 4 â€“ 5D film, skiver, the death race, dinosaur parkâ€¦ Back to Da Nang hotel.\r\nEntrance fares exclude WOW Pass, 10D Movie, Alpine Coaster, Wax Museum, Debay Wine Cellar, Teddy bear grips, coin games and Fantasy Park indoor sports.\r\nInclusion :  Transfer, guide, entrance fee, water\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','','','','2025-06-24','2025-07-02',1,0,0,'2025-06-03 11:04:28','2025-06-03 11:36:08'),(994,1676,15543,4,0,0,90730,9000,'Lakshadweep  Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival Agatti (by Flight) - Welcome to Agatti! Our representative will receive and escort you to your hotel after arrival at the Agatti airport. After the check in procedures, enjoy lunch and relax. Afternoon, proceed for sightseeing on the island which includes attractions such as Public Library, Anthropological Museum, South Beach, Eastern Jetty (ship embarkation and disembarkation point) and Lagoon Beach. In the evening you can explore the nearby beach and enjoy the sunset. Back to hotel for dinner. \r\nOvernight stay at Agatti. Meal Plan: Breakfast -Lunch-Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Agatti â€“ Day free for leisure and water sports & Kalpetti Island Trip: After breakfast, proceeds to enjoy water sports activities like diving, snorkeling, kayaking, fishing, reef watch etc.., all the water sports are directly payable at the Resort. Lunch will be served at the resort. \r\nLater journey towards the uninhabited island Kalpetti for another marvelous sightseeing. On the way to Kalpetti, you can watch beautiful coral gardens, fish species, turtles. After enjoying the nature in its true form at the Kalpetti, return back to Agatti Island. \r\nOvernight stay at Agatti.   Meal Plan: Breakfast-Lunch-Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 03 & Day 04 :  Agatti â€“ Days free for leisure & water sports: After breakfast, day completely free for leisure and for water sport activities like diving, snorkeling proceeds, kayaking, fishing, reef watch etc.., all the water sports are SUBJECT TO WEATHER CONDITIONS & directly payable at the Resort. Overnight stay at Agatti.   \r\nMeal Plan: Breakfast-Lunch-Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 05 : Departure from Agatti - After breakfast, proceeds to Agatti airport. Hope you had a great time in Lakshadweep!\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation \r\n* All meals included in this plan - Lunch, Dinner & Breakfast\r\n* Agatti airport Pick up & drop\r\n* Agatti land Excursion by car\r\n* Snorkelling at Agatti\r\n* Kayaking\r\n* Kalpetti island trip by Gloss bottom boating\r\n* Entry permit of Agatti\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Nature expenses, water sports, dive, all water sports and extra activities are directly payable at the resort only \r\n* Anything that is not mentioned under inclusions\r\n* TCS\r\n\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-25','2025-06-29',1,0,0,'2025-06-03 14:09:41','2025-06-03 16:27:21'),(995,1678,15512,2,1,0,126800,30500,'Vietnam Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival Hanoi Vietnam â€“ City highlights half day (1:30PM â€“ 5:30PM) (PRIVATE) \r\nWelcome to Ha Noi capital. Our guide will meet and welcome you at Noi Bai international airport. \r\nWe begin our afternoon by visiting Uncle Ho at the Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum (from outside), One Pillar Pagoda, Ba Dinh Square.\r\nThen we visit Dong Xuan market, We then take trip around HoanKiem Lake and HanoiÂ´s fascinating Old Quarter. This is your chance to be in the midst of typical Hanoian life and Vietnamese culture. Overnight in Ha Noi.\r\nTransfer to the hotel for check in. Check in time is 14:00.\r\nOvernight in Ha Noi\r\nNOTE: Our driver doesnâ€™t speak English.\r\nInclusion: Transfer, guide, water, entrance fee, hotel \r\n\r\nDay 2 : Hanoi â€“ Ninh Binh: Hoa Lu â€“ Tam Coc (SIC) (B/L) â€“ SHARED TRANSFER\r\nAfter breakfast, our guide will meet you at your hotel and start 110km (2 hours) journey through verdant landscape of country side. Start to visit Hoa Lu, an ancient capital of Vietnam. Visit Dinh king Temple and Le king Temple from the 10th century, and hear about the heroic histories of the two Kings during the Chinese Wars. \r\nContinue to Tam Coc and take the boat (traditional river boat) along the Ngo Dong river to visit Tam Coc\'s three caves.\r\nOptional: Mua Cave - an amazing trek up ( 500 steps) to the top of Ngoa Long mountain for watching the spectacular rice valley with a precious view of nature. If you would like to visit this place, please pay the extra fee directly to the tour guide; if not, feel free to wandering around the area or get on your own some nice cold drinks on a summer day until our guide and driver gather with you to be back to Hanoi.\r\nThen come back to Ha Noi in the afternoon. Overnight in Hanoi.\r\nNOTE: Our driver doesnâ€™t speak English.\r\nInclusion: SHARED transfer, guide, entrance fee, boat trip, breakfast, local lunch, hotel\r\n\r\nDay 3 : Hanoi â€“ Ha Long, welcome on the boat (SIC)(B/L/D) â€“ SHARED CRUISE\r\nDeparture for Ha Long Bay is around 8:00 AM in a shared bus (about 4 hours) from your hotel. Arrive at the port around noon. Welcomed on board, you are taken to your cabin before the trip briefing. You enjoy a fresh and local seafood lunch while cruising to explore the magic Bay. Stop for a swim and visit the mysterious cave. Relax at our secluded island-beach. Later you return back to the boat just in time to watch the beautiful sunset from the top deck before enjoying the bayâ€™s freshest seafood dinner. Overnight on the cruise.\r\nNOTE: The final itinerary will depend on the cruiseâ€™s program and the weather.\r\nOur driver doesnâ€™t speak English.\r\nInclusion: SHARED Transfer, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, all meals, permits.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : Explore Bay â€“ Hanoi â€“ Flight to Ho Chi Minh (B/Br) â€“ SHARED CRUISE\r\nEarly risers can enjoy the sunrise and the quiet breath-taking beauty of Bayâ€™s landscape with towering limestone. You have breakfast at around 8:00 AM before our short rowboat by the locals of the bay. Have brunch on the boat as we slowly cruise back to boat pier. Hit the road back to Ha Noi.\r\nUpon arrival Ha Noi center, our driver picks up and transfers to Hanoi airport for flight to Ho Chi Minh. On arrival, pick up and transfer to your hotel in Ho Chi Minh for check in. Stay overnight in Ho Chi Minh\r\nNeed a late flight after 6pm.\r\nNOTE: The final itinerary will depend on the cruiseâ€™s program and the weather.\r\nOur driver doesnâ€™t speak English.\r\nInclusion: SHARED Transfer, guide on boat, entrance fee, boat / junk, breakfast, brunch on boat, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : HCMC â€“Mekong Delta (B/L) (SIC) â€“ SHARED TRANSFER\r\nGroup size: 4-12 people \r\nPick up: 06:45 â€“ 07:00\r\nDrop off: 18:00\r\nRoute: HCMC â€“ Mekong Delta â€“ HCMC\r\nAt 7:00, visit My Tho city. With boat trip on Tien River, you will be excited by the light breeze from the river and the natural beauty of four beautiful islands such as Dragon, Unicorn, Phoenix and Tortoise along the riverside. \r\nCruise through the small canal by sampan, treating yourself to the beauty of the countryside, and taking a short cycling around the village which will certainly be an unforgettable experience when participating in the Mekong Delta tour. Visit the coconut candy workshop, and enjoy seasonal delicious fruits & honey tea. Get a chance to listen to the Southern Vietnamese folk music which is performed by local people. \r\nReturn to Ho Chi Minh City. Trip ends.\r\nOvernight in Ho Chi Minh.\r\nInclusion: Shared transfer, guide, entrance fee, breakfast, local lunch, hotel\r\n\r\nDay 6: Ho Chi Minh departure (B)\r\nBreakfast at hotel. Then we transfer you without guide to the airport for your flight home. Goodbye and hope to see you again soon!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare (Delhi-Hanoi) (Ho Chi Minh-Delhi)\r\n* Internal flights (Hanoi-Ho Chi Minh)\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Hanoi\r\n* 1N Accommodation in Halong Cruise\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Ho Chi Minh\r\n* Airport Transfers on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned on SIC\r\nâ€¢ Meals as mentioned (B = breakfast; L = lunch with set menu; D = dinner with set menu)\r\nâ€¢ Entrance fee to the mentioned itinerary\r\nâ€¢ Bottled water for the touring day (500ml/bottle/pax/day) \r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\nâ€¢ Early check in/Late check out\r\nâ€¢ Beverages\r\nâ€¢ Tips (3$ per person/ day (Mandatory))\r\nâ€¢ Surcharge in peak season (Christmas, New Year, Lunar New Year, etc.)\r\nâ€¢ Others not mentioned in the written details above\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nMeals on boat are local food.\r\nTOUR TIME & ACTIVITIES	(PRIVATE TOUR)\r\nWith half day tour: 4 hours (AM: 8:30 am - 12:30 am or  PM: 1:30 pm - 5:30 pm)\r\nDaily working hours: We work for 8 hours a day starting from 8:30 am to 5:30 pm. \r\nAny activities out of this time frame must be informed to us 1 day before and will occur surcharges.\r\n','2025-06-23','2025-06-28',1,0,0,'2025-06-03 18:16:03','2025-06-03 22:00:14'),(996,1679,329,2,1,0,36300,10000,'Malaysia Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 :\r\n  Transfer from KLIA-Airport to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to KUL Half Day City Tour (03 Hours) [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from KUL Half Day City Tour (03 Hours) to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 2 :\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to Genting Day Tour [with SIC transport]\r\n  Transfer from Genting Day Tour to the Booked Hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n\r\nDay 3 :\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Hotel to Sunway Lagoon Tour [with SIC transport]\r\n  Transfer from Sunway Lagoon Tour to the Booked Hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n\r\nDay 4 :\r\n  Day at Leisure or you can explore nearby places on your own.\r\n\r\nDay 5 :\r\n  Transfer from Hotel to KLIA-Airport [with Private transport]\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned on SIC basis\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.','2025-06-20','2025-06-24',1,0,0,'2025-06-03 18:33:54','2025-06-03 18:51:17'),(997,1677,15510,2,1,0,58000,14000,'Phuket-Krabi','Day-wise Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Transfers from Phuket airport to Krabi hotel PVT basis\r\n\r\nDay 2: Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat+ Picnic Lunch (Exclude the National Park Admission Fee) SIC basis\r\n\r\nDay 3: Transfers from Krabi hotel to Phuket hotel PVT basis. Check-in at hotel. \r\nPhuket Fantasia show with transfers SIC basis\r\n\r\nDay 4: Phi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat + Khai Island + Lunch + Transfer on SIC ( Excl.Mandatory National Park Fee THB 400 PP) (PU/07:00)\r\n\r\nDay 5: Phuket Half Day City Tour on SIC basis (Big Buddha is not operational till further notice)\r\nEvening at leisure. \r\n\r\nDay 6: Transfers from Phuket hotel to Phuket airport PVT basis\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','DEL-HKT-DEL return economy class airfare\r\n2 nights accommodation in Krabi\r\n3 nights accommodation in Phuket\r\nTransfers from Phuket airport to Krabi hotel PVT basis\r\nTransfers from Krabi hotel to Phuket hotel PVT basis\r\nTransfers from Phuket hotel to Phuket airport PVT basis\r\nKrabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat+ Picnic Lunch (Exclude the National Park Admission Fee) SIC basis\r\nPhuket Half Day City Tour on SIC basis (Big Buddha is not operational till further notice)\r\nPhi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat + Khai Island + Lunch + Transfer on SIC ( Excl.Mandatory National Park Fee THB 400 PP) (PU/07:00)\r\nPhuket Fantasia show with transfers SIC basis\r\nTravel Insurance','Any type of personal expenses\r\nAny meal other than mentioned above\r\nVisa Charges\r\nTCS\r\nAnything that is not mentioned under inclusions','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability. ','2025-06-25','2025-06-30',1,0,0,'2025-06-03 18:47:46','2025-06-03 18:56:25'),(998,1680,15543,4,0,0,90730,16000,'Lakshadweep  Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival Agatti (by Flight) - Welcome to Agatti! Our representative will receive and escort you to your hotel after arrival at the Agatti airport. After the check in procedures, enjoy lunch and relax. Afternoon, proceed for sightseeing on the island which includes attractions such as Public Library, Anthropological Museum, South Beach, Eastern Jetty (ship embarkation and disembarkation point) and Lagoon Beach. In the evening you can explore the nearby beach and enjoy the sunset. Back to hotel for dinner. \r\nOvernight stay at Agatti. Meal Plan: Breakfast -Lunch-Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Agatti â€“ Day free for leisure and water sports & Kalpetti Island Trip: After breakfast, proceeds to enjoy water sports activities like diving, snorkeling, kayaking, fishing, reef watch etc.., all the water sports are directly payable at the Resort. Lunch will be served at the resort. \r\nLater journey towards the uninhabited island Kalpetti for another marvelous sightseeing. On the way to Kalpetti, you can watch beautiful coral gardens, fish species, turtles. After enjoying the nature in its true form at the Kalpetti, return back to Agatti Island. \r\nOvernight stay at Agatti.   Meal Plan: Breakfast-Lunch-Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 03 & Day 04 :  Agatti â€“ Days free for leisure & water sports: After breakfast, day completely free for leisure and for water sport activities like diving, snorkeling proceeds, kayaking, fishing, reef watch etc.., all the water sports are SUBJECT TO WEATHER CONDITIONS & directly payable at the Resort. Overnight stay at Agatti.   \r\nMeal Plan: Breakfast-Lunch-Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 05 : Departure from Agatti - After breakfast, proceeds to Agatti airport. Hope you had a great time in Lakshadweep!\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation \r\n* All meals included in this plan - Lunch, Dinner & Breakfast\r\n* Agatti airport Pick up & drop\r\n* Agatti land Excursion by car\r\n* Snorkelling at Agatti\r\n* Kayaking\r\n* Kalpetti island trip by Gloss bottom boating\r\n* Entry permit of Agatti\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Nature expenses, water sports, dive, all water sports and extra activities are directly payable at the resort only \r\n* Anything that is not mentioned under inclusions\r\n* TCS\r\n\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-07-11','2025-07-15',1,0,0,'2025-06-04 14:26:48','2025-06-04 15:08:21'),(999,1681,15510,2,1,0,58000,14000,'Phuket-Krabi','Day-wise Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Transfers from Phuket airport to Krabi hotel PVT basis\r\n\r\nDay 2: Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat+ Picnic Lunch (Exclude the National Park Admission Fee) SIC basis\r\n\r\nDay 3: Transfers from Krabi hotel to Phuket hotel PVT basis. Check-in at hotel. \r\nPhuket Tiger Kingdom on PVT basis. \r\n\r\nDay 4: Phi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat + Khai Island + Lunch + Transfer on SIC ( Excl.Mandatory National Park Fee THB 400 PP) (PU/07:00)\r\n\r\nDay 5: Phuket Half Day City Tour on SIC basis (Big Buddha is not operational till further notice)\r\nEvening at leisure. \r\n\r\nDay 6: Transfers from Phuket hotel to Phuket airport PVT basis\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','DEL-HKT-DEL return economy class airfare\r\n2 nights accommodation in Krabi\r\n3 nights accommodation in Phuket\r\nTransfers from Phuket airport to Krabi hotel PVT basis\r\nTransfers from Krabi hotel to Phuket hotel PVT basis\r\nTransfers from Phuket hotel to Phuket airport PVT basis\r\nKrabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat+ Picnic Lunch (Exclude the National Park Admission Fee) SIC basis\r\nPhuket Half Day City Tour on SIC basis (Big Buddha is not operational till further notice)\r\nPhi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat + Khai Island + Lunch + Transfer on SIC ( Excl.Mandatory National Park Fee THB 400 PP) (PU/07:00)\r\nPhuket Tiger Kingdom on Private Basis\r\nTravel Insurance','Any type of personal expenses\r\nAny meal other than mentioned above\r\nVisa Charges\r\nTCS\r\nAnything that is not mentioned under inclusions','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability. ','2025-06-25','2025-06-30',1,0,0,'2025-06-04 17:35:10','2025-06-05 16:24:57'),(1000,1683,15512,2,1,0,114400,30500,'Vietnam Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Arrival Hanoi Vietnam â€“ City highlights half day (1:30PM â€“ 5:30PM) (PRIVATE)\r\nWelcome to Ha Noi capital. Our guide will meet and welcome you at Noi Bai international airport.\r\nWe begin our afternoon by visiting Uncle Ho at the Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum (from outside), One Pillar Pagoda, Ba Dinh Square.\r\nThen we visit Dong Xuan market, We then take trip around HoanKiem Lake and HanoiÂ´s fascinating Old Quarter. This is your chance to be in the midst of typical Hanoian life and Vietnamese culture. Overnight in Ha Noi.\r\nTransfer to the hotel for check in. Check in time is 14:00.\r\nOvernight in Ha Noi\r\nNOTE: Our driver doesnâ€™t speak English.\r\nInclusion: Transfer, guide, water, entrance fee, hotel\r\n\r\nDay 2: Hanoi â€“ Ninh Binh: Hoa Lu â€“ Tam Coc (SIC) (B/L) â€“ SHARED TRANSFER\r\nAfter breakfast, our guide will meet you at your hotel and start 110km (2 hours) journey through verdant landscape of country side. Start to visit Hoa Lu, an ancient capital of Vietnam. Visit Dinh king Temple and Le king Temple from the 10th century, and hear about the heroic histories of the two Kings during the Chinese Wars. \r\nContinue to Tam Coc and take the boat (traditional river boat) along the Ngo Dong river to visit Tam Coc\'s three caves.\r\nOptional: Mua Cave - an amazing trek up ( 500 steps) to the top of Ngoa Long mountain for watching the spectacular rice valley with a precious view of nature. If you would like to visit this place, please pay the extra fee directly to the tour guide; if not, feel free to wandering around the area or get on your own some nice cold drinks on a summer day until our guide and driver gather with you to be back to Hanoi.\r\n\r\nThen come back to Ha Noi in the afternoon. Overnight in Hanoi.\r\nNOTE: Our driver doesnâ€™t speak English.\r\nInclusion: SHARED transfer, guide, entrance fee, boat trip, breakfast, local lunch, hotel\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 3: Quang Phu Cau Village (Incense Village) half day â€“ Free in the afternoon (B) \r\n\r\n8h00: Pick up at your hotel for half day tour to Quang Phu Cau Incense village\r\n9h15- 9h30: Arrive in Quang Phu Cau village, we will start the walking tour around the village, see how the local people making the incense including bamboo chopping, dipping the sticks in dye, creation of incense paste and dry the incense in the sun... talk to the locals to know about the history of making incense of the villag e. You are free to walk around the village to take photos of incense bundles, incense making process...\r\n11h00: Drive back to Hanoi, arrive at your hotel around 12h15. \r\n\r\nInclusion: Transfer, guide, entrance fee, water, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 4: Ha Noi â€“ Fly to Ho Chi Minh City, city highlights half day\r\nGood morning!\r\nWelcome to Viet Nam. Welcome to Ho Chi Minh. Upon arrival, our driver will pick you up and take you to the hotel. \r\n\r\nThen local guide picks up and escort to visit the Ben Thanh Market, the big local market. Continue to visit outside of Saigon Notre-Dame Basilica (is renovating until 2022), a neo-Roman cathedral built by the colonial French with materials entirely imported from Marseilles, Saigon Central Post Office, which was designed and constructed in the early 20th Century by the famous.\r\nHead to your hotel to check in and spend rest of the day at your own leisure.\r\nNote: Check in time 14:00\r\nOvernight in Ho Chi Minh.\r\nInclusion: Transfer, guide, entrance fee, water, hotel.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5: HCMC â€“Mekong Delta (B/L) (SIC) â€“ SHARED TRANSFER\r\nGroup size: 4-12 people \r\nPick up: 06:45 â€“ 07:00\r\nDrop off: 18:00\r\nRoute: HCMC â€“ Mekong Delta â€“ HCMC\r\n\r\nAt 7:00, visit My Tho city. With boat trip on Tien River, you will be excited by the light breeze from the river and the natural beauty of four beautiful islands such as Dragon, Unicorn, Phoenix and Tortoise along the riverside. \r\nCruise through the small canal by sampan, treating yourself to the beauty of the countryside, and taking a short cycling around the village which will certainly be an unforgettable experience when participating in the Mekong Delta tour. Visit the coconut candy workshop, and enjoy seasonal delicious fruits & honey tea. Get a chance to listen to the Southern Vietnamese folk music which is performed by local people. \r\nReturn to Ho Chi Minh City. Trip ends.\r\n\r\nOvernight in Ho Chi Minh.\r\n\r\nInclusion: Shared transfer, guide, entrance fee, breakfast, local lunch, hotel\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6: Ho Chi Minh departure (B)\r\nBreakfast at hotel. Then we transfer you without guide to the airport for your flight home. Goodbye and hope to see you again soon!\r\n\r\nInclusion: Transfer, breakfast.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare (Delhi-Hanoi) (Ho Chi Minh-Delhi)\r\n* Internal flights (Hanoi-Ho Chi Minh)\r\n* 3N Accommodation in Hanoi\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Ho Chi Minh\r\n* Airport Transfers on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned on SIC\r\nâ€¢ Meals as mentioned (B = breakfast; L = lunch with set menu; D = dinner with set menu)\r\nâ€¢ Entrance fee to the mentioned itinerary\r\nâ€¢ Bottled water for the touring day (500ml/bottle/pax/day) \r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\nâ€¢ Early check in/Late check out\r\nâ€¢ Beverages\r\nâ€¢ Tips (3$ per person/ day (Mandatory))\r\nâ€¢ Surcharge in peak season (Christmas, New Year, Lunar New Year, etc.)\r\nâ€¢ Others not mentioned in the written details above\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nMeals on boat are local food.\r\nTOUR TIME & ACTIVITIES	(PRIVATE TOUR)\r\nWith half day tour: 4 hours (AM: 8:30 am - 12:30 am or  PM: 1:30 pm - 5:30 pm)\r\nDaily working hours: We work for 8 hours a day starting from 8:30 am to 5:30 pm. \r\nAny activities out of this time frame must be informed to us 1 day before and will occur surcharges.\r\n','2025-06-23','2025-06-28',1,0,0,'2025-06-05 16:35:33','2025-06-05 17:33:45'),(1001,1684,355,5,0,0,63000,17000,'Varanasi Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 (13 Jun) : Arrival at Varanasi airport and transfer to hotel. \r\n\r\nDay 2 (14 Jun) : After having breakfast visit temple/ghat on your own.\r\n\r\nDay 3 (15 Jun) : After having breakfast check-out from the hotel. Varanasi hotel to Ayodhya hotel drop. \r\n\r\nDay 4 (16 Jun ) â€“ After having breakfast check-out from the hotel. Ayodhya hotel to Ayodhya Airport drop. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Varanasi \r\n* 1N Accommodation in Ayodhya\r\n* Breakfast and Dinner at hotel\r\n* Transfers & sightseeing by Ac XL6(No Sightseeing  )\r\n* Toll, Parking, Driver Allowance.\r\n\r\n ','* Entrances fees\r\n* Expenses of personal nature such as drinks, telephone, and laundry bills etc\r\n* Tips and porter charges\r\n* Any additional expenses incurred due to any flight delay or cancellation, weather conditions, political closures, technical faults etc\r\n* Any other service/s not specified above\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-06-13','2025-06-16',1,0,0,'2025-06-06 11:42:42','2025-06-06 15:29:10'),(1002,1685,33,2,1,1,158000,35000,'Hong Kong Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 (02nd Oct) : Private Airport to HK Ferry terminal transfer( 8am-10 pm). Vehicle capacity-6px\r\nFerry ticket 1 way, Eco class, Day sailing, Hong Kong to Macau \r\nPrivate Macau Ferry Pier to hotel transfer. Service hours 8 am-10 pm. Vehicle capacity upto 9 pax\r\n\r\nDay 2 (03rd Oct) : Dazzling Macau half day morning tour (Private) Pick up- 12 noon from Hotel lobby. Venetian- West Lobby near ATM. Galaxy- Diamond lobby Tour includes: A Ma temple, Ruins of St Paul cathedral, Kun Lam Statue, Lotus Square & Macau Tower photo stop\r\n\r\nDay 3 (04th Oct) : Private Macau Ferry Pier to hotel transfer or Vise versa . Service hours 8 am-10 pm. Vehicle capacity upto 9 pax\r\nFerry ticket 1 way, Eco class, Day sailing, Macau to Hong Kong. \r\nPick up from ferry Pier & Private Classic Hong Kong half day night tour.1 way Peak tram, Victoria peak, Bahunia Sq , Harbour cruise on Star Ferry, Bruce Lee special Avenue of Star, Old Clock tower. Tour finale with Symphony of light laser show . Duration upto 5 hours. Start time 4 pm. Vehicle capasity-6px (Luggage will be inside the vehicle) (Kowloon Side Hotels)\r\n\r\nDay 4 (05th Oct) : Private Magical Disneyland tour with Tier 4 entry ticket. Pick up: 9:30 am Return:9:30 pm Location- Kowloon side Hotel\r\n\r\nDay 5 (06th Oct) : Private Amazing Ocean park tour, standard entry ticket. Pick up : 09:30 am. Return : 7 pm Hotel Located in Kowloon or Hong Kong Island\r\n\r\nDay 6 (07th Oct) : Private Hotel Kowloon side - Airport Transfer, 1 way (8am-9 pm). Vehicle capacity-6px\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Macau with daily breakfast\r\n* 3N Accommodation in Hong Kong with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport Transfers and tours on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfar