y type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-07-01','2025-07-06',1,0,0,'2025-06-17 13:08:02','2025-06-18 14:37:08'),(1019,1702,1105,3,1,0,19500,7000,'Udaipur Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival in Udaipur &  Transfer to Mount Abu\r\nArrive in Mount Abu and check into your hotel.\r\nIn the afternoon, visit Sunset Point for panoramic views. (if time allows)\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Mount Abu Temples & Nakki Lake\r\nHave breakfast, Visit the Dilwara Jain Temples, known for their intricate marble carvings.\r\nExplore Nakki Lake, enjoying boating or a stroll along the banks.\r\nVisit Achalgarh Fort and the Adhar Devi Temple. \r\n\r\nDay 3 : Mount Abu to Udaipur & Lake Pichola\r\nAfter breakfast, check out and travel to Udaipur (approx. 3 hours by road).\r\nCheck into your Udaipur hotel and relax.\r\nIn the evening, experience a boat ride on Lake Pichola, enjoying views of the City Palace and surrounding areas. \r\n\r\nDay 4 : Udaipur City Tour\r\nAfter having breakfast, Visit the City Palace, a grand complex showcasing Rajput architecture.\r\nExplore Jagdish Temple, a well-known temple dedicated to Lord Vishnu.\r\nVisit Saheliyon-ki-Bari, a beautiful garden with fountains and kiosks.\r\nEnjoy a sunset view from Sajjangarh (Monsoon Palace). \r\n\r\nDay 5 : Udaipur Exploration \r\nVisit Fateh Sagar Lake, enjoying boating and the scenic surroundings.\r\nIn the afternoon visit Kumbhalgarh fort a historical fort with stunning views\r\n\r\nDay 6 : After breakfast, checkout from the hotel\r\nTransfer to the airport for your onward journey.','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Mount Abu with breakfast\r\n* 3N Accommodation in Udaipur with breakfast\r\n* Vehicle : Sedan car\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Entry ticket to any temple or tourist spot.\