INSERT INTO `udn_pkg_manual_quotation` VALUES (1024,1708,410,2,0,0,12900,4000,'Prague Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the PRG Airport and transfer (on your own) to the booked hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax. Prague Boat Party Cruise + Epic Club After Party (Prague Boat Party Cruise + Epic Club After Party 20:00), Prague (Duration: 2 hrs)\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Have breakfast at the hotel and proceed for Prague Ghosts, Legends, Medieval Underground and Dungeon Tour (ENGLISH english 19:15), Prague (Duration: 1hr 10m to 1hr 25m) (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 03 : After having breakfast, proceed for Mystery Tour at Charles Bridge and Prague Castle: Alchemy & Magic (Tour in English 18:00), Prague (Duration: 2 hrs) (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 04 : After having breakfast, enjoy the leisure time as per your own choice. (Day at leisure)\r\n\r\nDay 5: After having breakfast, check-out from the hotel and transfer (on your own) to the Airport for your home bound journey.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 4N Accommodation in Prague with Breakfast\r\n* Tours as mentioned on SIC basis','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Airport to hotel transfer and Vice Versa\r\n* The client has to reach to the pick-up point on their own\r\n* Visa\r\n* insurance','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2025-06-27','2025-07-01',1,0,0,'2025-06-22 14:59:19','2025-06-22 16:14:26'),(1025,1709,410,2,0,0,16871,4029,'Prague Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the PRG Airport and transfer (on your own) to the booked hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax. \r\nPrague Boats 1-hour Cruise (1hr-20:00) Duration : 55 mins (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Have breakfast at the hotel and relax. Day at leisure or you can explore nearby places on your own.\r\n\r\nDay 03 : After having breakfast, proceed for Small-Group Tour of Prague Castle with Visit to Interiors 13:30 Duration : 2hrs 30mins (SIC)\r\nPrague Ghosts, Legends, Medieval Underground and Dungeon Tour (ENGLISH english 20:45), Prague (Duration: 1hr 10m to 1hr 25m) (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Have breakfast at the hotel. Day at Leisure.\r\n\r\nDay 5: After having breakfast, check-out from the hotel and transfer (on your own) to the Airport for your home bound journey.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n,\r\n','','* 4N Accommodation in Prague with Breakfast\r\n* Tours as mentioned on SIC basis','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Airport to hotel transfer and Vice Versa\r\n* The client has to reach to the pick-up point on their own\r\n* Visa\r\n* insurance','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2025-06-27','2025-07-01',1,0,0,'2025-06-23 11:24:43','2025-06-25 13:04:11'),(1026,1711,3511,4,1,0,0,0,'Gangtok Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n1st Day - (Friday 27th June) : Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok - Pickup \r\nApprox Distance : 125 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 5 hours \r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Gangtok\r\n \r\n2nd Day - (Saturday 28th June) : Gangtok to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir - Excursion \r\nApprox Distance : 120 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hours \r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to New Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok. Note : In case of Land slide or any other reason Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provided alternate sightseeing. Due to winter season (heavy snow) vehicle will be able to drive till Snow point on the way to Tsomgo Lake and New Baba Mandir.\r\n \r\n3rd Day - (Sunday 29th June) : Gangtok to Darjeeling - Transfer \r\nApprox Distance : 110 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 4 hours \r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to hotel. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n \r\n4th Day - (Monday 30th June) : Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill \r\nApprox Distance : 130 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hours \r\nEarly morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\nNote : Darjeeling ropeway will be on direct payment basis. It has limited cabins (Approx. 8 and per cabin 4 persons can be accommodated), resulting in long queues due to high tourist volume. Be patient with potential delays. It could also impact your schedule for other sightseeing activities due to time constraints.\r\n \r\n5th Day - (Tuesday 1st July) : Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop \r\nApprox Distance : 70 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hours \r\nAfter breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Accommodation as mentioned in hotel section \r\nâ€¢ Meal Plan (as per mentioned above) \r\n* 1-Innova / Xylo / Similar as per itinerary & timing only\r\nâ€¢ Exclusive vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. Please note that vehicle will not be at disposal it will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis) \r\nâ€¢ All permit fees & hotel taxes (as per itinerary) \r\n\r\n','â€¢ Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), porterage \r\nâ€¢ Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary \r\nâ€¢ Entrance Fees & Guide charges \r\nâ€¢ Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, should be is directly payable on the spot) \r\nâ€¢ Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure \r\nâ€¢ Room Heater Charges \r\nâ€¢ Insurance \r\nâ€¢ NOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded \r\n','Airfare Is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nNOTE: AC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicles will be on Point-to-Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place, that will be on your own by walk or local transportation.\r\n\r\n','2025-06-27','2025-07-01',1,0,0,'2025-06-24 15:05:20','2025-06-24 16:38:26'),(1027,1712,3511,4,1,0,0,0,'Gangtok Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n1st Day - (Friday 27th June) : Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok - Pickup \r\nApprox Distance : 125 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 5 hours \r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Gangtok\r\n \r\n2nd Day - (Saturday 28th June) : Gangtok to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir - Excursion \r\nApprox Distance : 120 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hours \r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to New Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok. Note : In case of Land slide or any other reason Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provided alternate sightseeing. Due to winter season (heavy snow) vehicle will be able to drive till Snow point on the way to Tsomgo Lake and New Baba Mandir.\r\n \r\n3rd Day - (Sunday 29th June) : Gangtok to Darjeeling - Transfer \r\nApprox Distance : 110 Km â€¢