n Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Flower Dome + Jurassic World : The Exhibition at Cloud Forest ) (SIC Basis)\r\nâ€¢ Ice Cream Museum (PVT Basis)\r\n* Visa\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any taxes if applicable\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nMarina Bay Sands rates are dynamic.\r\nMid-night Surcharge applicable from 11pm - 07am on Private Transfers.\r\n','2025-11-02','2025-11-06',1,0,0,'2025-08-20 13:21:19','2025-08-20 16:43:32'),(1076,1784,3511,4,0,0,0,0,'Gangtok Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day - (Sunday 24th August) : Bagdogra Airport to Darjeeling - Pickup\r\nApprox Distance: 70 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hrs\r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n \r\n2nd Day - (Monday 25th August) : Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\r\nApprox Distance: 130 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hrs\r\nEarly morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then way back to hotel visit Ghoom Monastery & Batasia Loop. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\nNote: Darjeeling ropeway will be on direct payment basis. It has limited cabins (Approx. 8 and per cabin 4 persons can be accommodated), resulting in long queues due to high tourist volume. Be patient with potential delays. It could also impact your schedule for other sightseeing activities due to time constraints.\r\n \r\n3rd Day - (Tuesday 26th August) : Darjeeling to Gangtok - Transfer\r\nApprox Distance: 110 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 4 hrs\r\nAfter breakfast check out from hotel & transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to hotel. Overnight stay at Gangtok.\r\n \r\n4th Day - (Wednesday 27th August) : Gangtok to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir - Excursion\r\nApprox Distance: 120 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hrs\r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to New Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok. Note: In case of Land slide or any other reason Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provided alternate sightseeing. Due to winter season (heavy snow) vehicle will be able to drive till Snow point on the way to Tsomgo Lake and New Baba Mandir.\r\n \r\n5th Day - (Thursday 28th August) : Gangtok to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\r\nApprox Distance: 125 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 5 hrs\r\nAfter breakfast, checkout from the hotel and take departure transfer to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\nâ€¢ Accommodation as mentioned in hotel section\r\nâ€¢ Meal plan as mentioned\r\n* 1-Innova / Xylo / Similar as per itinerary & timing only.\r\nâ€¢ Exclusive vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. Please brief to guest that vehicle will not be at disposal it will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis)\r\nâ€¢ All permit fees & hotel taxes (as per itinerary)\r\n\r\n','â€¢ Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), porterage\r\nâ€¢ Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary\r\nâ€¢ Entrance Fees & Guide charges\r\nâ€¢ Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, should be is directly payable on the spot)\r\nâ€¢ Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure\r\nâ€¢ Room Heater Charges\r\nâ€¢ NOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nAC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicles will be on Point-to-Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place, that will be on your own by walk or local transportation','2025-08-24','2025-08-28',1,0,0,'2025-08-20 13:52:20','2025-08-20 13:58:33'),(1077,1786,3511,4,0,0,70800,14000,'Gangtok Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day - (Sunday 24th August) : Bagdogra Airport to Darjeeling - Pickup\r\nApprox Distance: 70 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hrs\r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n \r\n2nd Day - (Monday 25th August) : Darjeeling to Gangtok - Fullday Sightseeing and Transfer\r\nApprox Distance: 230 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 10 hrs\r\nEarly morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit / Token) back to hotel. After breakfast at 8:30 AM check out from hotel (with luggage) and visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Afternoon proceed to Gangtok (5,500 Ft. / 91 Kms. / 4 Hrs.). On arrival Check-in to your hotel. Overnight stay at Gangtok.\r\nNote: Darjeeling ropeway will be on direct payment basis. It has limited cabins (Approx. 8 and per cabin 4 persons can be accommodated), resulting in long queues due to high tourist volume. Be patient with potential delays. It could also impact your schedule for other sightseeing activities due to time constraints.\r\n \r\n3rd Day - (Tuesday 26th August) : Gangtok to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir - Excursion\r\nApprox Distance: 120 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hrs\r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to New Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok. Note: In case of Land slide or any other reason Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provided alternate sightseeing. Due to winter season (heavy snow) vehicle will be able to drive till Snow point on the way to Tsomgo Lake and New Baba Mandir.\r\n \r\n4th Day - (Wednesday 27th August) : Gangtok to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\r\nApprox Distance: 125 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 5 hrs\r\nAfter breakfast, checkout from the hotel and take departure transfer to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\nâ€¢ Accommodation as mentioned in hotel section\r\nâ€¢ Meal plan as mentioned\r\n* 1-Innova / Xylo / Similar as per itinerary & timing only.\r\nâ€¢ Exclusive vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. Please brief to guest that vehicle will not be at disposal it will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis)\r\nâ€¢ All permit fees & hotel taxes (as per itinerary)\r\n\r\n','â€¢ Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), porterage\r\nâ€¢ Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary\r\nâ€¢ Entrance Fees & Guide charges\r\nâ€¢ Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, should be is directly payable on the spot)\r\nâ€¢ Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure\r\nâ€¢ Room Heater Charges\r\nâ€¢ NOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nAC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicles will be on Point-to-Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place, that will be on your own by walk or local transportation','2025-08-24','2025-08-27',1,0,0,'2025-08-20 19:03:27','2025-08-20 19:18:19'),(1078,1787,349,4,0,0,0,0,'Dubai Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the DXB Airport and transfer to the booked hotel on PVT Basis\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Have Breakfast at the hotel\r\n                Desert Safari BBQ Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 03 : Have breakfast at the hotel\r\n                Dubai City Tour\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Have breakfast at the hotel\r\n                Marina Cruise Dinner\r\n\r\nDay 05 : Have breakfast at the hotel\r\n                Day free at Leisure or self exploration\r\n\r\nDay 06 : Have breakfast at the hotel\r\n                Day free at Leisure or self exploration\r\n\r\nDay 07 : Have breakfast at the hotel and check-out from the hotel\r\n                Transfer to DXB Airport on PVT Basis\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 6N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary on PVT\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any taxes if applicable\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-09-07','2025-09-13',1,0,0,'2025-08-21 15:27:47','2025-08-21 15:32:00'),(1079,1788,3511,4,0,0,0,0,'Gangtok Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day - (Thursday 2nd October) : Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok - Pickup \r\nApprox Distance: 125 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 5 hrs \r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Gangtok\r\n \r\n2nd Day - (Friday 3rd October) : Gangtok to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir - Excursion \r\nApprox Distance: 120 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hrs \r\nAfter breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. / 37 Kms. / 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to New Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. / 16 Kms. / 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok. Note: In case of Land slide or any other reason Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provided alternate sightseeing. Due to winter season (heavy snow) vehicle will be able to drive till Snow point on the way to Tsomgo Lake and New Baba Mandir.\r\n \r\n3rd Day - (Saturday 4th October) : Gangtok to Darjeeling - Transfer \r\nApprox Distance: 110 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 4 hrs \r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to hotel . Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n \r\n4th Day - (Sunday 5th October) : Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill \r\nApprox Distance: 130 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hrs \r\nEarly morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then way back to hotel visit Ghoom Monastery & Batasia Loop. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\nNote: Darjeeling ropeway will be on direct payment basis. It has limited cabins (Approx. 8 and per cabin 4 persons can be accommodated), resulting in long queues due to high tourist volume. Be patient with potential delays. It could also impact your schedule for other sightseeing activities due to time constraints.\r\n \r\n5th Day - (Monday 6th October) : Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop \r\nApprox Distance: 70 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hrs \r\nAfter breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\nâ€¢ Accommodation as mentioned in hotel section\r\nâ€¢ Meal plan as mentioned\r\n* 1-Innova / Xylo / Similar as per itinerary & timing only.\r\nâ€¢ Exclusive vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. Please brief to guest that vehicle will not be at disposal it will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis)\r\nâ€¢ All permit fees & hotel taxes (as per itinerary)\r\n\r\n','â€¢ Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), porterage\r\nâ€¢ Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary\r\nâ€¢ Entrance Fees & Guide charges\r\nâ€¢ Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, should be is directly payable on the spot)\r\nâ€¢ Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure\r\nâ€¢ Room Heater Charges\r\nâ€¢ NOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nAC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicles will be on Point-to-Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place, that will be on your own by walk or local transportation','2025-10-02','2025-10-06',1,0,0,'2025-08-22 12:07:39','2025-08-22 12:44:58'),(1080,1789,16002,4,0,0,133000,25000,'Bali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (6 Oct) : Denpasar Airport to Kuta Hotel - Arrival and Transfer 	1-APV/Avanza/Xenia \r\nWelcome with Garland 	Ticket 4 Adults \r\nMineral 