and Drop\r\nAfter breakfast check out from the hotel and visit to Gandhi Ashram, and admire the architecture of Siddi Syed Mosque, Adalaj Stepwell, a Later drop at Airport or Railway Station for your onward journey.\r\n\r\n','Cancellation Policy:\r\n- Prior to 45 days or more - 30% of tour cost\r\n- Between 44-31 days of departure - 60% of tour cost\r\n- Between 30-11 days of departure - 80% of the tour cost\r\n- 10 days to the date of departure - 100%\r\n- In case of no show - 100%\r\n- For any further clarification please feel free to contact us at any time','+ Ac accommodation in the above-mentioned hotels\r\n+ Meal Plan: As mentioned in column on buffet menu (Pure Veg.)\r\n+ Ac Vehicle as per the above-mentioned itinerary\r\n+ Driver Allowance, Toll Tax Parking.\r\n+ Pick up and drop from Railway station or Airport\r\n+ All applicable luxury taxes of hotels','- Meals are not mentioned in the itinerary\r\n- 05% GST Extra\r\n- Entry fees to monuments and sightseeing places\r\n- Anything not mentioned in the package â€œINCLUDESâ€\r\n- Statue of unity tickets booked directly by guest own on the website: www.soutickets.in  (Closed  on Monday)\r\n- Gir Jungle safari permit book directly by guest own on the website: www.girlion.gujarat.gov.in (remains closed from 16th June to 15thOct every year)\r\n- Porter-age charges at hotels and airports, tips, insurance, laundry, liquors, wine, extra room services, phone calls (STD, ISD)\r\n- All items of personal nature\r\nNOTE: Anything not in inclusions is excluded','- Tourist himself is responsible for carrying, shifting and taking care of their own luggage\r\n- All Prices are in Indian Rupees and valid for Indian National.\r\n - In case of non-availability of the mentioned hotels, similar kind/quality of hotels will be provided, which can change the above package cost.\r\n','2025-09-06','2025-09-10',0,0,0,'2025-08-30 17:31:05','2025-08-30 17:31:05'),(1088,1801,329,4,0,0,53400,10000,'Kuala Lumpur Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1\r\n  Transfer from KLIA-Airport to the Booked KL Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from the Booked KL Hotel to KUL Half Day City Tour + KL Tower (04 Hours) [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from KUL Half Day City Tour + KL Tower (04 Hours) to the Booked KL Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 2\r\n  Transfer from the Booked KL Hotel to Genting Day Tour (8 Hours) [with SIC transport]\r\n  Transfer from Genting Day Tour (8 Hours) to the Booked KL Hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n\r\nDay 3\r\n  Transfer from the Booked KL Hotel to KLIA-Airport [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from LGK Airport to the Booked Langkawi hotel [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Langkawi hotel to Half Day Langkawi Island Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Half Day Langkawi Island Tour to the Booked Langkawi hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 4\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Langkawi hotel to Island Hopping Tour (Shared Boat) - Ex Beach & City Hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n  Transfer from Island Hopping Tour (Shared Boat) - Ex Beach & City Hotel to the Booked Langkawi hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n\r\nDay 5\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Langkawi hotel to LGK Airport [with Private transport]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Internal flights (KUL-LGK, LGK-KUL)\r\n* 4N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport transfers on PVT Basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any taxes if applicable are to be paid by the guest directly\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2025-11-05','2025-11-09',1,0,0,'2025-09-01 13:24:04','2025-09-01 15:05:47'),(1089,1802,329,4,0,0,53400,10000,'Kuala Lumpur Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1\r\n  Transfer from KLIA-Airport to the Booked KL Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from the Booked KL Hotel to KUL Half Day City Tour + KL Tower (04 Hours) [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from KUL Half Day City Tour + KL Tower (04 Hours) to the Booked KL Hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 2\r\n  Transfer from the Booked KL Hotel to Genting Day Tour (8 Hours) [with SIC transport]\r\n  Transfer from Genting Day Tour (8 Hours) to the Booked KL Hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n\r\nDay 3\r\n  Transfer from the Booked KL Hotel to KLIA-Airport [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from LGK Airport to the Booked Langkawi hotel [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Langkawi hotel to Half Day Langkawi Island Tour [with Private transport]\r\n  Transfer from Half Day Langkawi Island Tour to the Booked Langkawi hotel [with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 4\r\n  Transfer from the Booked Langkawi hotel to Island Hopping Tour (Shared Boat) - Ex Beach & City Hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n  Transfer from Island Hopping Tour (Shared Boat) - Ex Beach & City Hotel to the Booked Langkawi hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n\r\nDay 5\r\n  Transfer from Self-Booked Langkawi hotel to LGK Airport [with Private transport]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Internal flights (KUL-LGK, LGK-KUL)\r\n* 4N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport transfers on PVT Basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any taxes if applicable are to be paid by the guest directly\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2025-11-05','2025-11-09',1,0,0,'2025-09-02 14:22:59','2025-09-02 14:22:59'),(1090,1803,15595,2,0,0,0,0,'Sri Lanka Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival in Sri Lanka - Kandy \r\nUpon arrival at the airport, you will be warmly welcomed by your driver and transferred to the cultural capital, \r\nKandy. En route, visit the fascinating Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage, where you can witness baby elephants \r\nbeing fed and bathed. Continue your journey with a stop at the Mawanella spice garden, exploring Sri Lankaâ€™s \r\nrich spice heritage. Once in Kandy, check into your hotel and unwind. In the evening, visit the Gem Museum to \r\nmarvel at Sri Lanka\'s precious stones and enjoy a vibrant cultural dance performance. Conclude your day with an \r\novernight stay in Kandy.\r\n\r\nDay 2 : Kandy to Nuwara Eliya \r\nStart your day with a visit to the Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic, a UNESCO World Heritage site that houses a \r\nrevered tooth relic of Buddha. After soaking in the spiritual ambiance, transfer to the picturesque town of \r\nNuwara Eliya. Along the way, visit the Ambuluwawa Tower for panoramic views, marvel at the cascading \r\nRamboda Falls, pay your respects at the Hanuman Temple, and tour a tea factory to learn about Sri Lanka\'s \r\nfamed tea production. In the evening, enjoy a relaxing boat ride on Gregory Lake before checking into your hotel \r\nfor an overnight stay in Nuwara Eliya. \r\n\r\nDay 3 : Nuwara Eliya to Bentota \r\nAfter breakfast, visit the Sita Amman Temple, a significant site from the Ramayana epic, and explore the \r\nenchanting Hakgala Botanical Garden. Later, embark on a scenic drive to the coastal town of Bentota. Upon \r\narrival, check into your hotel and spend the rest of the day at leisure, relaxing by the beach or exploring the local \r\narea. Enjoy an overnight stay in Bentota.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : Exploring Bentota \r\nBegin your day with a visit to the Kande Viharaya, home to one of the tallest sitting Buddha statues in Sri Lanka. \r\nNext, visit the Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery, where you can learn about turtle conservation efforts and see baby \r\nturtles. In the afternoon, enjoy a scenic boat ride on the Madu River, navigating through mangroves and spotting \r\nwildlife. For thrill-seekers, optional water sports activities like jet skiing, banana boat rides, and tube rides await. \r\nEnd your adventurous day with an overnight stay in Bentota.\r\n\r\nDay 5 : Bentota to Colombo \r\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Colombo, Sri Lanka\'s bustling commercial capital. Check into your hotel and set out \r\nfor a city tour, visiting landmarks such as the Gangaramaya Temple, Independence Square, Port City, and Galle \r\nFace Green. In the evening, embark on a guided shopping tour to explore Colomboâ€™s vibrant markets and chic \r\nboutiques. Conclude your day with an overnight stay in Colombo.\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Departure from Colombo \r\nIf time permits, enjoy a final shopping spree after breakfast. Afterwards, you will be transferred to the airport to \r\ncatch your departure flight, taking with you unforgettable memories of your Sri Lankan adventure.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Accommodation at the hotels mentioned or similar on BB\r\n* Free Cultural Show Tickets (Clients should visit a Gem shop which will be direct by us) at Kandy.\r\n* 02*500ml Bottles per person per Day\r\n* Welcome at the airport with Garlands\r\n* Free Gem Factory visit and explanation about the gem progress at Kandy.\r\n* Express way charges wherever applicable\r\n* Transportation in a Pvt Air-conditioned vehicle. (Sedan)\r\n* Service of an English-speaking driver\r\n* City tours in Kandy, Nuwara Eliya, Bentota & Colombo\r\n* All applicable Government Taxes\r\n* Insurance\r\n \r\n','* Early check in or late checkout charges.\r\n* Entrance Fee to any sites.\r\n* Tips to Guides / Chauffeurs\r\n* Any fluctuations in the dollar component will affect the costing.\r\n* Lunch or any extra meal not mentioned on the above program during the tour.\r\n* Camera or Video permits.\r\n* Expenses of a personal nature.\r\n* Any service not specifically mentioned in the inclusion.\r\n* Any increase of cost due to political disturbance / bandh or increase in tax or fuel cost, leading to increase in surface transportation and land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure or while touring\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nSupplement cost applicable on Pinnawala elephant orphanage, Temple of the tooth relic, Royale botanical garden, Turtle hatchery, Madu river boat ride, Haggala botanical garden, Gangaramaya temple, Lotus tower \r\n','2025-11-28','2025-12-03',1,0,0,'2025-09-05 16:16:27','2025-09-05 16:38:43'),(1091,1804,99,3,1,0,499700,100000,'Europe Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (14th Oct): Arrival at the FCO Airport and transfer to the booked hotel (PVT). Check-in at the hotel.\r\nSkip the line : Vatican Museums, Sistine Chapel & St Peters Tour (English Tour without Basilica 15:30) SIC\r\n\r\nDay 02 (15th Oct): Have breakfast at the hotel and check-out from the hotel. Proceed for Rome train station to catch the train for your onward journey to Florence (on your own). On reaching Florence proceed towards the booked hotel (on your own). Check-in at the hotel.\r\nMuseum of Illusions Florence Entrance Ticket (16:20) SIC Duration : 1 hour to 1 hour and 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nDay 03 (16th Oct): After having breakfast check-out from the hotel and proceed for the Florence train station (on your own) for your onward journey towards Venice. On reaching Venice train station proceed towards the booked hotel (on your own). Check-in at the hotel.\r\nSkip the Line : Doge\'s Palace Guided Tour in Venice (English 15:45) SIC Duration : 1 hour and 15 minutes\r\n\r\nDay 04 (17th Oct): Have breakfast at the hotel and check-out. Proceed towards the Venice train station (on your own) for your onward journey to Zurich. On reaching Zurich train station proceed towards the booked hotel (on your own). Check-in at the hotel and relax.\r\n\r\nDay 05 (18th Oct): Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nMount Titlis Cable Car with Ice Flyer and Lucerne from Zurich 08:00, SIC Duration : 10 hours\r\n\r\nDay 06 (19th Oct) : Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nJungfraujoch: Top of Europe Day Trip from Zurich 08:30, SIC Duration 11 hours and 30 minutes \r\n\r\nDay 07 (20th Oct) : Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nVisit to Rhine Falls (free with swiss pass)\r\n\r\nDay 08 (21st Oct) : Have breakfast at the hotel and check-out. Proceed for the Zurich train station (on your own) for your onward journey to Paris. On reaching the Paris train station proceed towards the booked hotel (on your own). Check-in at the hotel and relax.\r\n\r\nDay 09 (22nd Oct) : Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nSkip the Line : Eiffel tower tour and Seine river cruise-Access ticket to the 2nd floor with Cruise-4 pm SIC\r\n\r\nDay 10 (23rd Oct) : After having breakfast check-out from the hotel and Transfer to the CDG Airport for your homebound flight (PVT)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 9 nights accommodation as mentioned with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport transfer from FCO (Rome) to the booked hotel on PVT\r\n* Airport transfer from CDG (Paris) to the booked hotel on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary on SIC basis\r\n* Train fare from Rome to Florence (Italo Italo 9924, 10:40-12:17, Duration : 1h 37m)\r\n* Train fare from Florence to Venice (Italo Italo 8904, 09:39-11:55, Duration 02h:16m)\r\n* Train fare from Venice to Zurich (Trenitalia Frecciarossa 9718-Eurocity Eurocity 16, 1 change, 09:00-16:27, Duration : 07h 27m)\r\n* Train fare from Zurich to Paris (Lyria Lyria 9218, 11:34-15:55, Duration : 04h 21m)\r\n* Swiss pass included\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nNote : The client has to reach to the pick-up points on their own for the tours mentioned\r\n','2025-10-14','2025-10-23',1,0,0,'2025-09-06 15:35:39','2025-09-06 18:29:33'),(1092,1805,15494,3,1,0,18700,5000,'Goa Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the GOX Airport and transfer to the booked hotel