eals other than the mentioned.\r\n* Any other services not mentioned in the inclusions.\r\n* Taxes applicable (if any)\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n ','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nTHAI ARRIVAL CARD IS MANDATORY TO TRAVEL FOR THAILAND FILL IT BY 3 DAY PRIOR TRAVEL ','2026-01-29','2026-02-03',1,0,0,'2025-11-06 17:58:56','2025-11-06 18:08:57'),(1137,1854,1105,4,1,0,25000,15000,'Rajasthan Diaries','Suggested Itinerary \r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the Udaipur Airport and transfer to the booked hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax. In the evening visit the Bagore Ki Haveli. Take a sunset boat ride on Lake Pinchola (at your own cost).\r\n\r\nDay 02 : After having breakfast, explore the majestic City Palace and visit the nearby Jagdish Temple. Stroll through the beautiful Saheliyon Ki Bari and enjoy the views from Fateh Sagar Lake.\r\n\r\nDay 03 : After having breakfast check-out from the hotel and travel to Jodhpur (5-6 hrs approx). If the time permits explore the markets and head to sunset point to see the city lights.\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Have breakfast and start your day at the Mehrangarh Fort. Visit the Umaid Bhawan palace and explore the local markets.\r\n\r\nDay 05 : After having breakfast check-out from the hotel and transfer to the Jodhpur Airport for your homebound flight.','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Udaipur with breakfast\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Jodhpur with breakfast\r\n* Airport transfers\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle Innova\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Entrance fees to any of the monuments\r\n* Anything not mentioned in the inclusions','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-11-28','2025-12-02',1,0,0,'2025-11-08 15:30:06','2025-11-08 21:04:55'),(1138,1855,18875,5,0,0,64100,12000,'Uttarakhand Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day - Sun, 21st Dec\'25\r\n* Jaspur to Almora - Transfer & Sightseeing (1-Ertiga)\r\n\r\n2nd Day - Mon, 22nd Dec\'25\r\n* Almora to Nainital - Lake Tour & Transfer (1-Ertiga)\r\n\r\n3rd Day - Tue, 23rd Dec\'25\r\n* Nainital to Jim Corbett - Transfer & Sightseeing (1-Ertiga)\r\n\r\n4th Day - Wed, 24th Dec\'25\r\n* Jim Corbett to Jaspur - Departure (1-Ertiga)','','* 3N Accommodation\r\n* Meals as mentioned\r\n* Vehicle : Ertiga\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-12-21','2025-12-24',0,0,0,'2025-11-10 16:33:51','2025-11-10 16:43:59'),(1140,1856,15518,4,1,0,57100,20000,'Kerala Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 (28 Nov 2025 - Friday) Cochin - Munnar(Arrival)\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Cochin - Munnar(Arrival)\r\nOn arrival at the Cochin airport, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and afterwards to transfer you to your already booked hotel in Munnar Proceed to Munnar. Visit Cheeyapara and Valara water falls on the way to Munnar. Throughout the journey enjoy beautiful streams small waterfalls, Rubber, Pepper cardamom and Tea plantations and thick forests; God has blessed his own country with incomparable beauty on arrival at Munnar check in to Hotel. At leisure. Overnight stay in Hotel/resort.\r\n\r\nDay 2 (29 Nov 2025 - Saturday) Munnar Sightseeing DAY 02\r\nMorning after breakfast proceed to enjoy full day sightseeing tour of Munnar. Rose Garden, Photo Point, Mattupetty Dam/Lake, Echo Point & Kundala Dam/Lake. Overnight stay at hotel/resort.\r\n\r\nDay 3 (30 Nov 2025 - Sunday) Munnar - Thekkady\r\nTransfers - Munnar - Thekkady\r\nMorning after breakfast check out from the hotel and transfer to Thekkady. Thekkady is a world famous wildlife sanctuary and it is also called as Periyar. On arrival check in at Hotel. Afternoon visit wildlife sanctuary & enjoy the boating ( tickets charges are extra and subject to availability ). Visit elephant junction, spice plantations. Evening will be free for Cultural show ( Kathakali & Kalaripayattu on direct payment ) & local shopping. Overnight stay at Thekkady.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : (01 Dec 2025 - Monday) Thekkady to Alleppey\r\nTransfers - Thekkady to Alleppey\r\nMorning after breakfast leave for Alleppey, Allappuza famous for its backwaters. Visit Alleppey beach, sunset and enjoy shopping if staying in Alleppey. Visit Alleppey Beach and Backwaters. Enjoy all the amenities of this hotel/resort for a day which includes fishing in the backwaters (depends on the hotel/resort selected) Overnight stay at Alleppey.\r\n\r\nDay 5 (02 Dec 2025 - Tuesday) Alleppey to Cochin\r\nTransfers - Alleppey to Cochin\r\nMorning after breakfast Checkout from Hotel and Transferred to Cochin. Check in to the hotel. Proceed for Cochin sightseeing. Visit the Dutch Palace-built by the Portuguese in 1557 and subsequently renovated by the Dutch after 1663. The murals are perhaps the best in India. Jewish Synagogue - built in 1568 and the oldest Synagogue in the Commonwealth are at Mattancherry. St. Francis Church - built in 1510 and the oldest European church in India, Chinese Fishing Nets- introduced by the court of Kublai Khan can be seen in Fort Cochin. Fort Cochin Beach etc. Overnight stay at Cochin\r\n\r\nDay 6 (03 Dec 2025 - Wednesday) Cochin to Cochin Departure\r\nDeparture Transfer - Cochin to Cochin Departure\r\nMorning have breakfast at resort later check out from the Hotel and drive to Airport Station for departure.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N Accommodation\r\n* Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\n* All Inclusion and sightseeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM (Innova)\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n\r\n','* All those which are not mentioned above\r\n* Entry Fees \r\n* Porterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\n* All Items Of Personal Nature\r\n* Any Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\n* Any Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\n* Ayurveda Charges\r\n\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nPLEASE NOTE STANDARD CHECK IN TIME IS 1300 HRS & CHECK OUT TIME IS 1000 HRS.\r\nNIGHT DRIVE - AFTER 1900 HRS WILL BE CHARGED EXTRA\r\nTransportation Vehicle KM allowed on the basis of Garage to Garage (Timing 08 AM -07 PM).\r\nIn Hill station & Forest station, room & vehicle will not be air conditioned\r\nUsage Of Ac During Idle Time ( Vehicle Not Running Time ) Is Restricted\r\nAny Type of Alcohol Or Smoking Inside The Vehicle Is Strictly Prohibited.\r\nSightseeing Missed Subject To Weather, Political & Traffic Conditions Is Non-Refundable.\r\nAs Time Permits All Sightseeing Can Be Covered Nor The Company Is Not Responsible.\r\nVomiting On Seats & Floor Are Subject To Additional Cleaning Charges Payable At Nearby Centres Directly By The Passengers. Kindly Carry Plastic Bag For Sudden Vomiting.\r\nAny change in the Property / Room category or transfers after confirmation will be extra payable.\r\nEntry fees, boat rides are chargeable and to be paid directly by the guest. Few monuments and sightseeing points are closed on every Monday and on national holidays. Itinerary can be revised without any prior notice. Sightseeing points may be excluded due to closer of the place or due to weather/travelling conditions.\r\n\r\n\r\n','2025-11-28','2025-12-03',1,0,0,'2025-11-10 18:11:04','2025-11-10 20:26:15'),(1141,1858,15496,4,1,0,22500,3000,'Manali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (13th Nov) : In the night proceed from Delhi to Manali (Cab)\r\n\r\nDay 02 (14th Nov) : Arrival in Manali. Check-in at the hotel and relax. Visit to Hadimba Temple and local sightseeing, mall road (if the time permits)\r\n\r\nDay 03 (15th Nov) : After having breakfast proceed for Rohtang Pass. \r\n\r\nDay 04 (16th Nov) : Have breakfast and proceed for Solang Valley and Atal Tunnel.\r\n\r\nDay 05 (17th Nov) : After having breakfast check-out from the hotel and drive back to Delhi.','','* 3N Accommodation with Daily breakfast\r\n* Delhi to Manali (Ertiga)\r\n* Tours as mentioned\r\n* Vehicle (Ertiga) \r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Permit to Rohtang Pass\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-11-14','2025-11-17',1,0,0,'2025-11-11 12:49:19','2025-11-11 13:54:49'),(1142,1859,15496,4,1,0,6000,2000,'Manali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (14th Nov) : Pick up from the Bus stop and drop to hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax. Visit to Hadimba Temple and local sightseeing, mall road (if the time permits)\r\n\r\nDay 02 (15th Nov) : After having breakfast proceed for Rohtang Pass.\r\n\r\nDay 03 (16th Nov) : Have breakfast and proceed for Solang Valley and Atal Tunnel.\r\n\r\nDay 04 (17th Nov) : After having breakfast check-out from the hotel and drop to the bus stop.','','* 3N Accommodation with Daily breakfast\r\n* Tours as mentioned\r\n* Vehicle (Ertiga) \r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Permit to Rohtang Pass\r\n* Bus tickets\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2025-11-14','2025-11-17',1,0,0,'2025-11-11 12:55:22','2025-11-11 13:59:54'),(1143,1860,54,3,0,0,280000,70000,'Singapore-Hong Kong Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (1st Jun) : Arrival at the SIN Airport and transfer to the booked hotel (PVT). Check-in at the hotel and relax.\r\nEvening Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis)(03-Adults)\r\n\r\nDay 02 (2nd Jun) : City Orientation Drive - Drop off Little India (3Hrs) (PVT Basis)(03-Adults)\r\nAfternoon Sentosa Island Tour ( Madame Tussauds 5in1 + Cable Car + Wings Of Time 1st Show ) (PVT Basis)(03-Adults)\r\n\r\nDay 03 (3rd Jun)