ch.\r\n\r\nDay 03 (22nd Jan) : Check-out from the hotel and transfer to Krabi Hotel (PVT). Check-in and relax. Evening explore nearby places on your own.\r\n\r\nDay 04 (23rd Jan) : 4 island tour with lunch** Local Thai Food ** By Long tail Boat ( Ex. National Park fee 200 Thai baht  ) on Seat in coach \r\n\r\nDay 05 (24th Jan) : Check-out from the Krabi Hotel and transfer to the Krabi Airport for your journey towards Bangkok (PVT)\r\nArrive at the BKK Airport and transfer to the booked hotel (PVT)\r\nBKK City tour ( Golden buddha  , Marble , Gems Gallery ) on Pvt \r\n\r\nDay 06 : Safari World & Marine Park with lunch  Pvt \r\n\r\nDay 07 : Check-out from the hotel and transfer to the DMK Airport for your return journey towards hometown.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare (DEL-HKT, DMK-DEL)\r\n* Internal Flight (KBV-BKK)\r\n* 6N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Airport transfers on PVT\r\n* Phuket to Krabi Transfers on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned\r\n* Camera/video camera fee at monuments, medical expenses, airport departure tax, any insurance etc.\r\n*  Porterage at all hotels, railway station & airports.\r\n*  National Park Fees on Island Tours\r\n* Taxes Applicable (if any)\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.','2026-01-20','2026-01-26',1,0,0,'2025-12-23 13:08:05','2025-12-23 16:30:26'),(1147,1864,1105,3,1,0,0,0,'Rajasthan Diaries','1st Day (Sat 3rd January) : Udaipur - Arrival\r\nApprox Distance: 100 Km\r\nUpon arrival, meet our representative and take a transfer to the hotel,Complete your check-in process,Get Relaxed,Evening is free for leisure, you can head out to explore the little markets,You can spend time here shopping and enjoying the beautifully lit streets of Udaipur,(ON YOUR OWN) Or you can partake in the boat ride on the tranquil waters of Lake Pichola / Fateh Sagar Lake,(Ticket not included) Head back to the hotel for the night, Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\n\r\n2nd Day (Sun 4th January) : Udaipur - Sightseeing\r\nApprox Distance: 50 Km\r\nBegin your day with breakfast at the hotel and then start your city tour,Visit the City Palace which is the biggest castle complex in Rajasthan,Partake in the boat ride on the tranquil waters of Lake Pichola,Also visit Sahelion ki Bari or Garden of the Maids of Honor, Jagdish Temple,Local Market Visit,Later in the evening Fateh Sagar Lake, Shilpgram,Once sightseeing is over, head back to the hotel,Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\n\r\n3rd Day (Mon 5th January) : Udaipur to Jodhpur - Transfer via Ranakpur\r\nApprox Distance: 350 Km\r\nAfter Breakfast check-out from the Hotel and Drive to Jodhpur, Enroute visit Ranakpur jain temple Jodhpur is a beautiful city that displays the rich crafts and culture of Rajasthan, Overnight stay at Jodhpur Hotel.\r\n\r\n\r\n4th Day (Tue 6th January) : Jodhpur to Jaisalmer - Sightseeing and Transfer\r\nApprox Distance: 300 Km\r\nAfter breakfast at a hotel,Check out from Hotel,Ummed Bhawan Palace,visit Jaswant Thada & Mehrangarh Fort, Later transferred to Jaisalmer,Arrival then Check in to your hotel.Evening is free for leisure,Dinner & Overnight stay in Jaisalmer.\r\n\r\n\r\n5th Day (Wed 7th January) : Jaisalmer to Sam Sand Dunes - Sightseeing and Evening at Sand Dunes\r\nApprox Distance: 45 Km\r\nAfter Breakfast at the Hotel, Visit Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon ki Haveli, Gadisar Lake , Later take a transfer to the Sam Sand Dunes â€“ 45 km away, Arrival & check into tents, Sam Dunes is known for its sand rises and is the scene for the Desert celebration, Get the genuine feel of the desert by getting a charge out of a camel ride on the sand rises and witness a brilliant nightfall, After enjoying the rides, enjoy the cultural programme, Dinner & Overnight stay in Tents.\r\n\r\n\r\n6th Day (Thu 8th January) : Sam Sand Dunes to Jaisalmer - Departure\r\nApprox Distance: 45 Km\r\nAfter breakfast & check out process, you will be heading back to your home with the memory of the trip. ','','DEL-UDR and JSA-DEL Economy class airfareWelcome Drink on Arrival\r\nAccommodation in a well-appointed room as mentioned\r\nMeals as Mentioned in Hotel Section (Breakfast and Dinner)\r\nHotel checks in & check out time as per the hotel policy\r\nAll transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary\r\nAll Toll taxes, One time Parking of Each Destination , State Tax & Driver allowance\r\nVehicle will be provided 8:00 am to 6:00pm \r\nCamel Ride and Dinner With Cultural Evening Show At Sam Sand Dunes','All personal expenses, optional tours and extra meal\r\nAny monument or sight-seeing Entry fee / Charges\r\nExtra bed/mattress as per the hotel policy for the additional guest\r\nChild above 11 years to consider as an adult\r\nAnything not in inclusions is excluded\r\nNOTE: Anything not mentioned in the inclusions is excluded.','The airfare is dynamic\r\nThe room/s are subject to availability\r\nThe carrier is not available in the cab/s','2026-01-03','2026-01-08',1,0,0,'2025-12-26 00:47:17','2025-12-26 00:47:17'),(1148,1868,54,8,0,0,254000,50000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the SIN Airport and transfer to the Cruise terminal (PVT)\r\nDepart the Cruise (11 pm)\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Enjoy the Cruise with all meals\r\n\r\nDay 03 : Check-out from the Cruise and transfer to the booked hotel (PVT)\r\nEvening Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis)\r\n\r\nDay 04 : City Orientation Drive - Drop off Little India (3Hrs) (PVT Basis)\r\nAfternoon Sentosa Island Tour ( Madame Tussauds 5in1 + Cable Car + Wings Of Time 1st Show ) (PVT Basis)\r\n\r\nDay 05 : MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Gardens by the Bay: Flower Dome & Cloud Forest featuring Jurassic World:TheExperience ) (PVT Basis)\r\n\r\nDay 06 : Universal Studios Tour ( Universal Studio Ticket ) (PVT Basis)\r\