 availability at the time of booking\r\nAs per standard norms, 01 Medium Suitcase + 01 Cabin luggage is allowed per pax in vehicles for private transfers. If there is extra luggage please book a bigger vehicle at extra cost.\r\nIf client is carrying stroller, need to inform in advance. As no space for strollers in Vehicle.','2025-12-21','2025-12-27',1,0,0,'2025-12-30 12:33:34','2026-01-07 16:20:50'),(1150,1872,2841,2,1,0,0,0,'Andaman Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (Mon, 19 Jan)	: Port Blair Arrival - Cellular Jail â€“ Enroute Tiranga Park - Corbyn\'s Cove Beach (No L&S Show)\r\n1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\n\r\n2nd Day (Tue, 20 Jan) : Port Blair to Baratang - Visit Limestone caves & Mud Volcano & Back, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nBoat Tickets (2Ad. + 1Ch.)\r\n\r\n3rd Day (Wed, 21 Jan) : Port Blair to Havelock - Day at Leisure, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nPort Blair To Havelock\r\nPrivate Catamaran Ferry (Shared Basis) : Premium (2Ad. + 1Ch.)\r\n\r\n4th Day (Thu, 22 Jan)	\r\nHavelock - Elephenta Beach, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nElephanta Boat Charge 2Ad. + 1Ch\r\n\r\n5th Day (Fri, 23 Jan)	\r\nHavelock to Neil Island - Laxmanpura Beach, Bharatpura Beach & Natural Bridge, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nHavelock To Neil Island\r\nPrivate Catamaran Ferry (Shared Basis) : Premium (2Ad. + 1Ch.)\r\n\r\n6th Day (Sat, 24 Jan)	\r\nNeil Island to Port Blair - L&S Show at Cellular Jail, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nNeil Island To Port Blair\r\nPrivate Catamaran Ferry (Shared Basis) : Premium 2Ad. + 1Ch.\r\nCellular Jail - Light & Sound Show, Tickets 2Ad. + 1Ch.\r\n\r\n7th Day (Sun, 25 Jan)	\r\nPort Blair Departure - Transfer to the Airport for Departure\r\n1-MUV (7 Seater)','','* Meet & Greet services by our local representatives at Airport & Jetty.\r\n* Meal Plan â€“ As mentioned above.\r\n* Airport & Ferry Terminal Transfers in Air-Conditioned Vehicle.\r\n* All Sightseeing (Entry fess included) as per itinerary in Air-Conditioned Vehicle.\r\n* Inter-Island ferry transfers By Private Catamaran Ferries Makruzz (Pr