n the itinerary on SIC\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Train station transfers (to be managed on your own)\r\n* City Tax/Tourist Tax to be paid directly by the client at the hotel\r\n* Any other taxes (if applicable)\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nTrain fares are subject to change at the time of booking\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nSIC Tour pick up is not from the hotel , clients has to make their own arrangement for transfers to & fro to the pick up point exact pick up point will come to know once booking is confirmed\r\nSIC tours has fix timings request you to kindly reconfirm the services atleast 24 hrs prior to departure','2026-05-10','2026-05-20',0,0,0,'2026-01-29 18:30:06','2026-01-30 15:08:32'),(1177,1897,54,9,4,0,296000,54000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the SIN Airport and transfer to the booked hotel (PVT)\r\nEvening Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis)(09-Adults, 04-Child)\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nMBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Supertree Observatory + Gardens by the Bay: Flower Dome & Cloud Forest featuring Jurassic World: The Experience ) (PVT Basis)(09-Adults, 04-Child)\r\n\r\nDay 03 : After having breakfast check-out from the hotel and transfer to Sentosa Island (Pvt)\r\nAfternoon Sentosa Island Tour( Wings Of Time 2nd show) (Only Ticket)(09-Adults, 04-Child)\r\nAfternoon Sentosa Island Tour ( Luge & Skyride 03 Ride Combo Flexi (Peak) ) (Only Ticket)(05-Adults, 04-Child)\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Have breakfast at the hotel.\r\nUniversal Studios Tour ( Universal Studio Ticket ) (Only Ticket)(09-Adults, 04-Child)\r\n\r\nDay 05 : Have breakfast and check-out from the hotel. Car at disposal for 5 hrs.\r\nTransfer to the SIN Airport for your homebound journey (PVT)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare (7 Adults 4 Children)\r\n* Business Class Airfare (2 Adults)\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Singapore with daily breakfast\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Sentosa with daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on PVT\r\n* Inter Hotel Transfers on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary on Pvt\r\n* Evening Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis)(09-Adults, 04-Child)\r\n* MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Supertree Observatory + Gardens by the Bay: Flower Dome & Cloud Forest featuring Jurassic World: The Experience ) (PVT Basis)(09-Adults, 04-Child) Car at disposal for 3 hrs\r\n* Afternoon Sentosa Island Tour( Wings Of Time 2nd Show) (Only Ticket)(09-Adults, 04-Child)\r\n* Afternoon Sentosa Island Tour ( Luge & Skyride 03 Ride Combo Flexi (Peak) ) (Only Ticket)(05-Adults, 04-Child)\r\n* Universal Studios Tour ( Universal Studio Ticket ) (Only Ticket)(09-Adults, 04-Child)\r\n* Car at disposal for 5 hrs approx on the day of your transfer to the Airport\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nMid-night Surcharge applicable from 11pm - 07am on Private Transfers.\r\nHotels are non-refundable\r\nWheel Chair is available at an extra cost 90 SGD per day cost and 280 SGD Security Deposit','2026-04-18','2026-04-22',1,0,0,'2026-01-30 12:01:39','2026-01-30 12:53:39'),(1178,1899,19,4,0,0,102000,18000,'Istanbul Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Istanbul - Arrival \r\nWelcome to Istanbul! Meet our team at the airport and transfer to your hotel. Check in and have a leisure day.\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Dinner Cruise on Bosphorus, SIC Basis\r\nEvening transfer to cruise port for Night Show on Bosphorus. Set Menu dinner + soft drinks.\r\n\r\nDay 03 : SIC Istanbul City Tour with Lunch\r\nHead back in time and discover the old world of the Sultanahmet area during this full-day small-group guided walking tour in Istanbul. This tour explores the amazing UNESCO World Heritage-listed Blue Mosque which exemplifies why Istanbul is the city where east meets west. Enjoy a walk through the famous Topkapi Palace where Sultan\'s roamed and harems flourished. Plus, spend time observing Hagia Ireneâ€™s Byzantine architecture and stroll through the Grand Bazaar to witness handicrafts created by local artists.\r\n\r\nTopkapi Palace closed on Tuesdays / Grand Bazaar closed on Sundays / Blue Mosque outside visit on Fridays!\r\n\r\nDay 04: SIC Princess Island Tour with Lunch\r\nIt is one of the most popular sightseeing spots in Istanbul. It is an island that attracts a lot of attention from domestic and foreign tourists. Enjoy the idyllic, car-free environment as you travel by Electric Car wagon. You will start this tour with a ferry trip. Then there is a lunch full of fresh, seasonal specialties. You will also enjoy free time on the island to swim and shop for souvenirs or admire the Ottoman mansions. You can admire the most popular places of Istanbul such as Topkapi Palace and Maiden\'s Tower with a boat trip from Istanbul to Buyukada.\r\n\r\nDay 05: Istanbul - Day at leisure\r\n\r\nDay 06:   Departure        \r\nAccording to your flight time transfer to Airport. End of our service.','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 3N Accommodation in Istanbul\r\n* Return Airport transfers in Istanbul, PVT Basis\r\n* Interhotel transfer, PVT Basis\r\n* Dinner Cruise on Bosphorus, SIC Basis\r\n* Istanbul City Tour with Lunch, SIC Basis\r\n* Istanbul Princess Island Tour with Lunch, SIC Basis\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Tips to the local guide and driver (Suggested tipping: 3 US$/pp per day to guide, 2 US$/pp per day to driver).\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nCity tax is directly payable by client to the Hotel. \r\nSIC pick up and drop will not be from the Hotel. SIC tour will start and end from specific city centre location and clients need to reach that location on own and come back from that location on own\r\nSIC Tours are operated on Sharing basis in Coaches. Pick up and drop time is fixed and the coach will not wait for more than 5 min. \r\nClients need to call the supplier 01 day prior to recheck meeting point and time, failure of call may result in missing of service with no refund.\r\nAs per standard norms, 01 Medium Suitcase + 01 Cabin luggage is allowed per pax in vehicles for private transfers. If there is extra luggage please book a bigger vehicle at extra cost.\r\n','2026-06-11','2026-06-16',1,0,0,'2026-02-02 11:01:50','2026-02-02 11:01:50'),(1179,1900,17600,2,0,0,0,0,'Bali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival in Kuta + Welcome with Garland  Day at Leisure  \r\nDay 2 : Nusa Penida West tour - Kelingking Beach, Angel Bilabong, Broken Bay, Bubu Beach ( B ) \r\nDay 3 : Water sports (Para sailing, Jet Ski, Banana Boat) (B)\r\nDay 4 : Inter Hotel transfers Ubud Hotel + Kintamani Volcano Tour + Coffee Plantation + Tregenna \r\nWaterfall + Bali swing Package  (B) \r\nDay 5 : Ulun Danu (Bedugul) Temple + Tanah Lot Sunset tour (B)\r\nDay 6 : Departure Transfers  (B)','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 05 Nightsâ€™ Accommodation as per above hotel With Breakfast\r\n* Tours and transfers as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Tourism Levy IDR 150.000/ pax\r\n* Any other taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2026-03-12','2026-03-17',0,0,0,'2026-02-02 16:07:50','2026-02-02 16:08:10'),(1180,1901,17600,2,0,0,0,0,'Bali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : Arrival in Kuta + Welcome with Garland  Day at Leisure  \r\n\r\nDay 2 : Nusa Penida West tour - Kelingking Beach, Angel Bilabong, Broken Bay, Bubu Beach ( B ) \r\n\r\nDay 3 : Water sports (Para sailing, Jet Ski, Banana Boat) (B)\r\n\r\nDay 4 : ATV ride Tandem (couple sharing ) with transfers  \r\n\r\nDay 5 : Inter Hotel transfers Ubud Hotel + Kintamani Volcano Tour + Coffee Plantation + Tregenna \r\n\r\nWaterfall + Bali swing Package  (B)\r\n\r\nDay 6 : Ulun Danu (Bedugul) Temple + Tanah Lot Sunset tour (B)\r\n\r\nDay 7 : Departure Transfers  (B)\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 06 Nightsâ€™ Accommodation as per above hotel With Breakfast\r\n* Tours and transfers as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Tourism Levy IDR 150.000/ pax\r\n* Any other taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2026-03-14','2026-03-20',1,0,0,'2026-02-03 12:23:07','2026-02-03 13:14:20'),(1181,1898,68,5,2,0,0,0,'Vietnam Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 (12-Mar-2026) : Arrival Hanoi Vietnam (Private with guide)\r\n\r\nDay 2 (13-Mar-2026) : Hanoi â€“ Ninh Binh â€“ Hoa Tu Temple & Tam CocBoat Ride (B) (Private Tour)\r\n\r\nDay 3 (14-Mar-2026) : Hanoi â€“ Ha Long â€“ welcome on the boat (B/L/D)(Shared cruise, Shared transfer)\r\n\r\nDay 4 (15-Mar-2026) : Explore Lan Ha Bay - Halong â€“ Hanoi (B, Brunch)(Shared cruise, Shared transfer)\r\n\r\nDay 5 (16-Mar-2026) : Ha Noiâ€“ Departure (B) (Private)\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Accommodation based on twin/doublesharing room\r\n* Private air-conditioned vehicle with private driver as mentioned itinerary (Driver cannot speak English)\r\n* Local English speaking guide as mentioned itinerary\r\n* Meals as mentioned (B = breakfast; L =lunch with set menu; D = dinner with set menu) with food only, drinks are not included.\r\n* SIC tours as mentioned\r\n* Entrance fee to the mentioned itinerary \r\n* Bottled water for the touring day(500ml/bottle/pax/day) provide on the car/coach\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Beverages/water or any other drinks during meals and on the cruise\r\n* Tipping Policy 3 USD/pax/day mandatory\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nPlease see inclusive items listed after each day\r\nFOOD : If you have any allergies, special requests or if you are on a special diet please let us know well before hand, we can not cancel / amend the booking within a day.\r\nPRIVATE TRANSFERS :The private transfer on tours for your own group and not shared with others, but is limited to pre determined routes and adhering to specified time slots as agreed upon in theitinerary. This means that although you will have a private transfer, you won\'t have the freedom to deviate from the planned routes or make unscheduled stops. Instead, you will need to follow the designated itinerary and adhere to the agreed-upon schedule,otherwise surcharge will be applied.\r\nLate arrival / flight delayed : If your flight is delayed or changed, please PHONE your travel consultant in charge of your booking (mobile phone) as soon as you have this newsfrom the airlines so that we can adjust the pickup as well as other services accordingly. If you inform us late and we can not change the services for you, you will have to pay for allthe extra services such as the extra pick up.\r\n\r\n\r\n','2026-03-12','2026-03-16',0,0,0,'2026-02-04 11:54:31','2026-02-04 12:55:27'),(1182,1902,2841,2,0,0,0,0,'Andaman Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (Wed, 18 Mar)	\r\nPort Blair Arrival - Cellular Jail â€“ enroute Tiranga Park - Corbyn\'s Cove Beach (No L&S Show), 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\n\r\n2nd Day (Thu, 19 Mar)	\r\nPort Blair to Havelock - Radha Nagar Beach, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nPort Blair To Havelock\r\nPrivate Catamaran Ferry (Shared Basis) : Premium, 2 Adults\r\n\r\n3rd Day (Fri, 20 Mar)	\r\nHavelock - Elephenta Beach, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nElephanta Boat Charge, 2 Adults\r\n\r\n4th Day (Sat, 21 Mar)	\r\nHavelock to Neil Island - Laxmanpura Beach, Bharatpura Beach & Natural Bridge, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nHavelock To Neil Island\r\nPrivate Catamaran Ferry (Shared Basis) : Premium,  2 Adults\r\nNeil Island - Laxmanpura Beach & Sitapur Beach, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\n\r\n5th Day (Sun, 22 Mar)	\r\nNeil Island to Port Blair - Shopping Tour, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\nNeil Island To Port Blair\r\nPrivate Catamaran Ferry (Shared Basis) : Premium, 2 Adults\r\n\r\n6th Day (Mon, 23 Mar)	\r\nPort Blair Departure - Transfer to the Airport for Departure, 1-MUV (7 Seater)\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N Accommodation as mentioned with breakfast\r\n* Meet & Greet services by our local representatives at Airport & Jetty.\r\n* Meal Plan â€“ As mentioned above.\r\n* Airport & Ferry Terminal Transfers in Air-Conditioned Vehicle.\r\n* All Sightseeing (Entry fess included) as per itinerary in Air-Conditioned Vehicle.\r\n* Inter-Island ferry transfers By Private Catamaran Ferries Makruzz (Preferred)/ Nautika/ Green Ocean/ ITT Majestic etc (Subject to Availability)','* The services of vehicles not on disposal basis & finishing the sightseeing tour as per the itinerary\r\n* Any kind of personal expenses or optional tours/extra meals/ Vehicle for Dinner etc.\r\nNOTE: Anything not mentioned in the inclusions is excluded.','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2026-03-18','2026-03-23',1,0,0,'2026-02-04 16:54:01','2026-02-04 17:02:30'),(1184,1903,54,3,1,0,107000,21000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Transfer from KLIA-Airport to Hotel [with Private transport]\r\nTransfer from Hotel to KL By Night Tour ( 4 Hrs ) [with Private transport]\r\nTransfer from KL By Night Tour ( 4 Hrs ) to Hotel[with Private transport]\r\n\r\nDay 02 : Transfer from Hotel to Genting Day Tour (8 Hours) [with SIC transport]\r\nTransfer from Genting Day Tour (8 Hours) to Hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n\r\nDay 03 : Transfer from KLIA-Airport to Hotel [with Private transport]\r\nFlight from KUL-SIN\r\nTransfer from Changi International Airport to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\nTransfer from the Booked Hotel to Evening Mandai (SIC)\r\n\r\nDay 04 : Transfer from the Booked Hotel to City Orientation Drive - Drop off Little India (3Hrs) [with SIC transport]\r\nAfternoon Sentosa Island Tour ( Madame Tussauds 4in1 + Cable Car + Wings Of Time 1st Show )\r\n\r\nDay 05 : Transfer from the Booked Hotel to Universal Studios Tour [with SIC transport]\r\nTransfer from Universal Studios Tour to the Booked Hotel [with SIC transport]\r\n\r\nDay 06 :  Transfer from Booked Hotel to Changi International Airport [with Private transport]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare (DEL-KUL, SIN-DEL)\r\n* Internal Flights (KUL-SIN)\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Kuala Lumpur with Daily Breakfast\r\n* 3N accommodation in Singapore with Daily Breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on PVT\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary on SIC\r\n* Visa (for Singapore)\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Malaysia Visa\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nMid-night Surcharge applicable from 11pm - 07am on Private Transfers','2026-03-14','2026-03-19',1,0,0,'2026-02-09 13:23:31','2026-02-09 16:22:53'),(1185,1904,1,12,0,0,4226800,250000,'Japan Highlights','Day 01 (17th May) : Arrival at Tokyo Airport.\r\nPrivate Drop to Hotel.\r\nOvernight in Tokyo. \r\n\r\nDay 02 (18th May) : Tokyo city tour (Vehicle on disposal basis 10 hours)\r\nImperial Palace, Nijubashi Bridge, Team lab Planets, Rainbow bridge, Tsukiji Market, Tokyo tower (Photo stop) Shibuya Sky, Shibuya Crossings, Shibuya shopping.\r\nEntry tickets Included: Tokyo Sky Tree (350M), TeamLab Planet or Borderless (Any 1) \r\nOvernight in Tokyo\r\n\r\nDay 03 (19th May) : DisneySea or DisneyLand. \r\nEntry Ticket: Standard Included.\r\nRound Trip Private Transfers Point to Point \r\nOvernight in Tokyo\r\n\r\nDay 04 (20th May) : Nikko World Heritage Tour :(Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nToshogu Shrine, Shinkyo Bridge, Tamozawa Imperial Villa, Lake Chuzenji & Kegon Falls. \r\nOvernight in Tokyo\r\n\r\nDay 05 (21st May) : Day trip to Mt. Fuji & Hakone :(Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nMt fuji-5th station, Lake kawaguchi, Mt fuji panoramic ropeway or Hakone ropeway (subject to weather and availability), hakone shrine, lake ashi pirates cruise (if mt.fuji 5th station close due to weather we will redirect to oshino hakai with Hannoki Bayashi Shiryokan admission)\r\nEntry tickets (Lake Ashi cruise, Rope way)\r\n\r\nDay 06 (22nd May) : Tokyo to Nagoya by Bullet Train\r\nCheck out and Private Transfer to Station. 2nd Class Bullet train to Nagoya\r\nOn arrival at Nagoya, Transfer to Hotel\r\nOvernight at Nagoya\r\n\r\nDay 07 (23rd May) : Private Tour for Hida Takayama & Shirakawa-go Gassho Village): (Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nVisit: Hida Takayama | Shirakawa-go Village | Gasyomura Tour\r\nOvernight at Nagoya\r\n\r\nDay 08 (24th May) : Nagoya Tour : (Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nFull day Private Tour of Nagoya visiting  Toyota Automobile Museum and Railway park\r\nOvernight at Nagoya\r\n\r\nDay 09 (25th May) : Nagoya to Horoshima by Bullet Train\r\nPrivate Drop to Train Station, Bullet Train to Hiroshima \r\nArrival Transfer at Hiroshima\r\nOvernight stay in Hiroshima\r\n\r\nDay 10 (26th May) : Hiroshima & Miyajima Tour.: (Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nHiroshima & Miyajima Island (Vehicle on disposal basis 10 hours)\r\nItsukushima Jinja Otorii (Grand Torii Gate), Atomic Bomb Dome, Peace Memorial Park.\r\nLater proceed to Miyajima Island by ferry (Ferry Tickets Included)\r\nEntry Ticket Included; Miyajima Ferry\r\n\r\nDay 11 (27th May) : On to Kyoto. Kyoto City Tour: (Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nTransfer from Hotel to Hiroshima Train station\r\n2nd Class Bullet train to Kyoto\r\nOn arrival proceed  for a Half day City tour of Kyoto including Kinkaju Temple visit. \r\nVisit: Fushimi Inari Taisha (Kyoto), Samurai Ninja Museum, Sannenzaka & Ninenzaka Streets\r\nEntry Ticket Included: Ordinary Class Bullet Train Ticket to Kyoto.Kinkakuji Temple,Samurai Ninja Museum\r\nOvernight in Kyoto\r\n\r\nDay 12 (28th May) : Day trip to Kyoto &  Arashiyama Bamboo Grove ((Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nFushimi-Inari Shrine-Higashiyama Ward-Philosopher\'s Path-Gion (geisha district), Kyoto Imperial Palace - Arashiyama Bamboo Grove-Kinkakuji temple.\r\nOvernight in Kyoto\r\n\r\nDay 13 (29th May) : Private Nara Tour & Drop to Osaka Hotel.(Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nCheck Out. \r\nVisit Nara Park & TÅdai-ji Temple, Todai-ji Temple\r\nEntry Ticket:  Toda-Ji Temple \r\nOvernight in Osaka\r\n\r\nDay 14 (30th May) : Private Tour of Osaka (Strictly for 10 Hours)\r\nOsaka Castle, Sakuranomiya Park, Okawa River, Settsukyo Park, Kuromon Market, Dotonbori & Shinsaibashi.\r\nEntry Ticket: Osaka Castle & Umeda Sky. \r\nOvernight in Osaka\r\n\r\nDay 15 (1st June) : Universal Studios\r\nEntry Ticket: Standard Included\r\nRound Trip Private Transfers Point to Point \r\nOvernight in Osaka\r\n\r\nDay 16 (2nd June) : Private Drop to Osaka Airport.\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare (Delhi-Tokya, Osaka-Delhi)\r\n* 15 nights accommodation as mentioned with daily breakfast\r\n* Internal train fares included in the itinerary and subject to change at the time of confirmation\r\n* Tours on private as specified in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle Used : 17 Seater Coaster\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* City taxes are the responsibility of the guest and payable directly to the hotel\r\n* Any other taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Optional (Recommended) English Speaking Guide on Min 12 Pax: Usd 320 per Full day\r\n* A tip of USD 4 per person per day is mandatory and should be given directly to the driver and the guide (if hiring) at the conclusion of daily services\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nPlease be advised that the size of rooms in hotels throughout Japan, particularly in 3-star and 4-star establishments, tends to be considerably small. It is advisable to verify the room dimensions on the hotelâ€™s website prior to finalizing your booking\r\n Local drivers typically do not speak English, and as a matter of policy, they refrain from engaging in conversation with guests unless absolutely necessary. \r\nAll vehicles are reserved for specific hours as outlined in the proposal. Should there be any additional usage due to traffic conditions, roadblocks, slow movement during sightseeing, or any unforeseen circumstances, the driver will charge for extra time \r\nNight charges are applicable additional from 9 PM to 7 AM.\r\nIt is highly recommended to engage an English-speaking guide to mitigate potential communication issues with drivers. Should budget constraints prevent the hiring of a guide, we will not accommodate complaints related to communication between clients and drivers. Drivers solely provide transportation services and do not assist with explanations, conversations, or aiding clients in activating or purchasing entrance tickets.\r\nOptional (Recommended) English Speaking Guide on Min 12 Pax : Usd 320 per Full day (Supplement Cost)\r\n\r\n','2026-05-17','2026-06-02',1,0,0,'2026-02-09 19:01:29','2026-02-10 19:00:43'),(1186,1905,54,3,1,0,150900,21000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Transfer from KLIA-Airport to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\nTransfer from the Booked Hotel to KUL Half Day City Tour + KL Tower (04 Hours) [with Private transport]\r\nTransfer from KUL Half Day City Tour + KL Tower (04 Hours) to the Booked Hotel [with Private transport]\r\nTransfer from the Booked Hotel to Aquaria KLCC [wi