an early breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to Cherrapunjee (4,400 ft.), renowned as one of the wettest places on earth. En route, stop to admire the cascading Elephanta Falls, soak in the breathtaking vistas from Mawdokâ€“Dympep Valley Viewpoint, and explore the unique Garden of Caves. On arrival, witness some of Cherrapunjeeâ€™s most spectacular natural wonders including the majestic Nohkalikai Falls (the tallest plunge waterfall in India), the enchanting Nohsngithiang Falls (Seven Sisters Falls), and the fascinating limestone formations inside the Mawsmai Caves. In the evening, drive back to Shillong for an overnight stay at Shillong.\r\n\r\n4th Day - (Wednesday 11th March) : Shillong to Guwahati Airport - Sightseeing and Transfer\r\nApprox Distance: 100 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hrs\r\nAfter breakfast check out from hotel and visit Don Bosco Museum (Sunday Closed) & Wardâ€™s Lake. Later transfer to Guwahati Airport for your onward journey.\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 3N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* 1-Ertiga as per itinerary & timing only.\r\n* Exclusive AC vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. (AC will not run in hill area)\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* All hotel taxes (as per itinerary)\r\n\r\n','* Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, porterage\r\n* Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Guide charges, Entry Fees & Camera Charges if any\r\n* Any cost arising due to natural calamities like cyclone, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client and directly payable on the spot)\r\n* Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure\r\nNOTE: Anything not mentioned in the inclusions is excluded.\r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nAC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicles will be on Point-to-Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place, that will be on your own by walk or local transportation.','2026-04-03','2026-04-06',1,0,0,'2026-02-26 10:43:55','2026-02-26 11:59:02'),(1202,1931,17600,8,0,0,135000,30000,'Bali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:-\r\n\r\nDay 1 - Arrival in Kuta |  Leisure day\r\n\r\nDay 2 â€“ Water sports - Banana Boat Ride + Jet Ski+ Parasailing\r\n\r\nDay 3 â€“ Full Day Nusa Penida Island Trip with Local Lunch-(west Tour)\r\n\r\nDay 4 â€“ Bali safari and Marine Park- Jungle Hopper Pass\r\n\r\nDay 5 â€“Kintamani Tour and bali Swing at tegalalng village (Aloha Swing), tegalalang Rice Terrace, Tegernungan waterfall and 1, Goa Gajah\r\n\r\nDay 6 â€“ ATV Quad Bike Adventure - Tandem Ride+ rafting at Ayung River with Indonesian Buffet Lunch\r\n\r\nDay 7 â€“ Departure\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 6N Accommodation with daily breakfast.\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on Pvt. \r\n* Tours as mentioned in itinerary.\r\n* Insurance ','* Any type of personal expense.\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above. \r\n* Tourism Levy IDR 150.000/ pax\r\n* Any taxes ( if applicable)\r\n* Visa \r\n* TCS','* Airfare is Dynamic.\r\n* Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2026-03-26','2026-04-01',1,0,0,'2026-02-26 13:31:09','2026-02-26 16:26:52'),(1203,1933,519,1,0,0,147200,30000,'Oman Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (28th March) : Arrival at the MCT Airport and transfer to the hotel (Pvt : Sedan)\r\n\r\nDay 02 (29th March) : Full Day â€“ Muscat City Tour (Pvt : Sedan)  \r\n\r\nDay 03 (30th March) : Full Day â€“ Nizwa City & Jabel Akhder (Vehicle : 4WD)\r\n\r\nDay 04 (31st March) : Full Day â€“ Coastal tour Bimmah Sinkhole, Wadi Sahab/Tiwi and Fins beach (Pvt : Sedan)\r\n\r\nDay 05 (01st April) : Full Day â€“ Wadi bani Khalid & wahiba Sands (Vehicle : 4WD)\r\n\r\nDay 06 (02n