, and explore the scenic Kaudia Forest. You can also engage in adventure activities like zip-lining and trekking (at your own cost). Later, visit the local eco parks and enjoy leisure time amidst nature. Return to your hotel by evening. Overnight stay in Kanatal.\r\n\r\n* Day 3rd (Tue 2nd June) : Kanatal to Tehri - Transfer & Sightseeing\r\nApprox Distance: 26 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 55 mins\r\nAfter breakfast, Check out from hotel drive to Tehri Lake , Tehri lake Tehri lake provides a hundred opportunities to the adventure lovers who throw caution to the winds by engaging in activities like Scuba Diving, Angling, Canoeing, Rowing , Boating, Water scooter, speed Boating, Rafting, Kayaking, House Boat, Cruise boating (at your own cost) and later evening return to hotel, enjoy evening and overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\n* Day 4th (Wed 3rd June) : Tehri - Day Visit Mussoorie\r\nAfter breakfast at your hotel in Tehri, proceed for a scenic day excursion to Mussoorie, popularly known as the â€œQueen of Hills.â€ Enjoy a beautiful drive through winding hill roads and lush green surroundings. Upon arrival, begin your sightseeing with a visit to Kempty Falls, one of the most famous waterfalls in the region. Continue to Gun Hill for panoramic views of the Himalayas and the Doon Valley, followed by a leisurely walk along Mall Road Mussoorie for shopping and local experiences. Later, visit Camel\'s Back Road for a peaceful stroll and scenic sunset views. After completing the sightseeing, proceed back to Tehri. Upon arrival, you will be dropped at your hotel for an overnight stay.\r\n\r\n* Day 5th (Thu 4th June) : Drop To - Gurgaon\r\nAfter breakfast checkout from hotel . Drop to Gurgaon.','','* 2N Accommodation in Kanatal  with Daily Breakfast.\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Tehri with Daily Breakfast.\r\n* All transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary.\r\n* Vehicle will be provided from 8:00 am to 8:00pm\r\n* Vehicle : 12 seater Urbania Traveler \r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* A/C room will not be provided in hill area.\r\n* A/C will not work on hills.\r\n* Entry fee for any monument will be paid directly by the client\r\n* Vehicle is as per itinerary and not on disposal. Additional sightseeing or transfer which are not mentioned in itinerary is payable to the driver directly.','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking. \r\nIn Mussoorie , Vehicle will not go to Landour due to government restrictions. It will only go up to Landour Parking or can be parked in Mussoorie. Guests will need to proceed to Landour by a local union vehicle on a direct basis.\r\n\r\n','2026-05-31','2026-06-04',1,0,0,'2026-04-23 17:27:23','2026-04-23 18:28:24'),(1234,1970,419,1,0,0,25700,4000,'Amarnath Diaries ','Suggested  Itinerary : \r\n* Day 01 : \r\nArrival Srinagar Airport & Srinagar local sightseeing.\r\n\r\n* Day 02: \r\nSrinagar to Balthal & Night stay in camp.\r\n\r\n* Day 03: \r\nEarly morning proceeds for Amarnath Darshan by Pony & return to Balthal and overnight stay in Camp.\r\n\r\n* Day 04:\r\n Balthal to Srinagar via Sri Kheer Bhawani Durga Temple.\r\n\r\n* Day 05: \r\nSrinagar Airport drop.','','* 2 Nightâ€™s accommodation in Balthal Camp sharing basis (Langar)\r\n* 2 Nightâ€™s accommodation in Srinagar hotel with Breakfast and Dinner.\r\n* 1 Hours Shikara ride.\r\n* Pony from Baltal to Holicave & Holicave to Baltal.\r\n* All Tour by AC Cab\r\n* Vehicle - Sedan \r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2026-07-03','2026-07-07',0,0,0,'2026-04-23 18:06:25','2026-04-23 18:39:48'),(1235,1971,15531,10,0,0,203700,20000,'Kanatal Dairies ','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\n* Day 1st (Sun 31st May) : Gurgaon to Tehri - Transfer\r\nPickup from Gurugram and proceed for a scenic transfer to Tehri. Upon arrival, transfer to your hotel and