bject to availability at the time of booking\r\nTransfer on pvt Basis in minivan(01 small & 01 medium luggage PP)\r\n','2026-06-11','2026-06-22',1,0,0,'2026-05-07 13:27:04','2026-05-07 13:27:04'),(1249,1988,15539,3,0,0,75600,10000,'Ooty Dairies','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\n* Day 1 (06 Jun 2026 - Saturday) Coimbatore Arrival - Ooty\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Coimbatore Arrival - Ooty\r\nArrive at Coimbatore and proceed to Ooty ,Check in to hotel, relax for a while before proceeding on a local sightseeing trip to Town Hall heritage building,Sengupathi Falls ,Marudamalai Murugan temple and Artifacts Museum. Overnight Stay at Hotel Mango Hill Shola \r\n\r\n* Day 2 (07 Jun 2026 - Sunday) Ooty Sightseeing \r\nPost breakfast; embark on a full day sightseeing tour of Ooty covering Botanical Garden, Ooty Lake, Doddabetta Peak, Nilgiri Mountain Railway(Toy Train), Shooting Point, Ootacamund Gymkhana Golf Club, Emerald lake, Government Museum etc. Return to the hotel for overnight stay. Overnight Stay at Hotel Mango Hill Shola \r\n\r\n* Day 3  (08 Jun 2026 - Monday) Coimbatore Departure Transfer\r\nAfter Breakfast Check out from hotel and proceed to Coimbatore for Departure\r\nArrival Transfer - Banglore Arrival to Tirupati\r\nOn arrival at the Banglore airport, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and afterwards to transfer you to your already booked hotel in Tirupati. Check in at the hotel and the rest of the day is free at leisure. Overnight stay at hotel/resort.\r\n\r\n* Day 4 (09 Jun 2026 - Tuesday) Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing \r\nBreakfast at the Hotel \r\nSightseeing Day 04 - Tirupati to Tirupathi \r\nMorning after breakfast local sightseeing of temples in Tirupati including Sri Govindarajaswami Temple, Kapila Theertham, Padmavati Temple, Trimala (Tirupati Balaji) Temple Akash Ganga & Paap Vinashni Temple. Overnight at the Resort/hotel.\r\n\r\n* Day 5 Tirupati to BANGALORE - DEPARTURE\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel \r\nDeparture Transfer - Tirupati to BANGALORE - DEPARTURE\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Bangalore international Airport. Tour ends with happy memories.\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 2 Nightâ€™s accommodation in Ooty with breakfast\r\n* 3 Night\'s accommodation in Tirupati with breakfast \r\n* All  Inclusion and sight seeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\n* Vehicle: Sedan \r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Entry Fees To Monuments And Palace\r\n* Any Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\n* Any Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n\r\n','2026-06-06','2026-06-11',0,0,0,'2026-05-07 17:09:58','2026-05-08 17:48:32'),(1250,1990,22910,2,0,0,0,0,'Darjeeling Dairies','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\n* Day 1 (Wednesday 20th May) : Bagdogra Airport to Darjeeling - Pickup\r\nApprox Distance: 70 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hrs\r\nMeet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\n\r\n* Day 2 (Thursday 21st May) : Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\r\nApprox Distance: 130 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 8 hrs\r\nEarly morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.\r\nNote: Darjeeling ropeway will be on direct payment basis. It has limited cabins (Approx. 8 and per cabin 4 persons can be accommodated), resulting in long queues due to high tourist volume. Be patient with potential delays. It could also impact your schedule for other sightseeing activities due to time constraints.\r\n\r\n* Day 3  (Friday 22nd May) : Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\r\nApprox Distance: 70 Km â€¢ Est. Travel Time: 3 hrs\r\nAfter breakfast Checkout from hotel and take the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.\r\n\r\n ','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* 2N accommodation with the breakfast \r\n* Vehicle: Wagon R/ Similar\r\n* Exclusive Non AC vehicle for transfers & sightseeing. Please brief to guest that vehicle will not be at disposal it will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis)','* Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips & gratuity, mineral water, soft & hard drinks, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), porterage\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Entrance Fees & Guide charges\r\n* Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, should be is directly payable on the spot)\r\n* Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation & land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Room Heater Charges','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nAC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicles will be on Point-to-Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place, which will be on your own by walk or local transportation.\r\nTransfer from Bagdogra will be provided from 06:00 hrs. To 17:00 hrs.\r\n ','2026-05-20','2026-05-22',0,0,0,'2026-05-08 10:45:28','2026-05-08 17:25:18'),(1251,1991,557,2,0,0,0,0,'Sri Lanka Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (1st Jun) : Airport â Kandy\r\n\r\nDay 02 (2nd Jun) : Kandy â Nuwara Eliya\r\n\r\nDay 03 (3rd Jun) : Nuwara Eliya Sightseeing\r\n\r\nDay 04 (4th Jun) : Nuwara Eliya â Ella â Yala\r\n\r\nDay 05 (5th Jun) : Yala â Bentota\r\n\r\nDay 06 (6th Jun) : Bentota Nature Experience\r\n\r\nDay 07 (7th Jun) : Bentota â Colombo\r\n\r\nDay 08 (8th Jun) :  Colombo â Airport\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 7N Accommodation as mentioned with Daily Breakfast\r\n* Transportation in a Pvt Air-conditioned vehicle (Sedan)\r\n* Service of an English-speaking Chauffeur Driver\r\n* City tours in Kandy, Nuwara Eliya, Ella, Yala, Bentota & Colombo\r\n* Free Cultural Show Tickets (Clients should visit a Gem shop which will be direct by us) at Kandy.\r\n* 02*500ml Bottles per person per Day\r\n* Free Gem Factory visit and explanation about the gem progress at Kandy.\r\n* Insurance','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Entrance Fee to any sites.\r\n* Tips to Guides / Chauffeurs\r\n* Camera or Video permits.\r\n* Any service not specifically mentioned in the inclusion.\r\n* Any increase of cost due to political disturbance / bandh or increase in tax or fuel cost, leading to increase in surface transportation and land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure or while touring. \r\n* Visa\r\n* TCS\r\n\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nNote: Entrance fees are not included in the package price and will be payable directly by the guests at each site.\r\nGangarama Temple, Colombo Lotus Tower, Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage, Hakgala Botanical Garden, Victoria Park, Gregory Lake (Park), Temple of the Tooth Relic, Yala Jeep Safari, Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery, Madu River boat Safari are at supplement cost.\r\n','2026-06-01','2026-06-08',0,0,0,'2026-05-08 18:34:39','2026-05-11 13:21:47'),(1252,1992,15542,4,0,0,34000,4000,'Rishikesh Diaries','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\n* Day 1 - Sunday 10th May, 2026\r\nDelhi to Rishikesh - Transfer\r\nOn Arrival at Delhi pickup  towards Rishikesh, On arrival Rishikesh check into hotel and In evening take a part of Ganga Aarti and enjoy Dinner & overnight stay in Rishikesh .\r\n- Est. Travel Time: 5 hrs\r\n\r\n* Day 2  - Monday 11th May, 2026\r\nRishikesh - Fullday Sightseeing\r\nAfter breakfast, Proceed for a full-day sightseeing tour of Rishikesh. Visit the famous Laxman Jhula and Ram Jhula, followed by Triveni Ghat, where the sacred Ganga Aarti takes place in the evening. Explore the ashrams such as Parmarth Niketan Ashram and Sivananda Ashram to experience the spiritual vibes of the city. In the evening, enjoy the spiritual Ganga Aarti at Triveni Ghat. Return to the hotel for dinner and overnight stay at Rishikesh.\r\nNote:\r\nVehicle will not go inside crowded market areas; guests may explore such places on foot or by local transport at their own cost.\r\n\r\n* Day 3 - Tuesday 12th May, 2026\r\nDrop to - Delhi\r\nAfter breakfast , Check -out from hotel , Drive to Delhi , Tour end with sweet memories','','* 2N  accommodation in Rishikesh with Breakfast.\r\n* Vehicle will be provided 8:00 am to 8:00pm.\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle : Ertiga ','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* A/C room will not be provided in hill area.\r\n* Camera fees, Any entry fee for Monument , alcoholic/non alcoholic beverages and starters','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nLift/Elevator Note:\r\nGuests are kindly requested to inform any specific requirements, such as lift/elevator facilities, at the time of quotation and c