icle : Sedan\r\n* Volvo bus Delhi to Manali (Volvo Multi-Axle A/C Semi Sleeper (2+2) ) Timings : 21:30-09:10 31st May Laxmi Holidays\r\n* Volvo bus Manali to Delhi (Volvo Multi-Axle A/C Semi Sleeper (2+2) ) Timings : 20:30-06:30 3rd June Laxmi Holidays\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Vehicle on point to point basis\r\n* Anything not mentioned in the inclusions','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.','2026-06-01','2026-06-03',0,0,0,'2026-05-26 14:43:25','2026-05-26 15:32:04'),(1272,2014,6,3,0,0,25000,5000,'Manali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\n* Day 1 (12 June ): Arrival in Shimla : Check-in at the hotel\r\nEvening sightseeing covering:\r\nMall Road\r\nRidge\r\nChrist Church\r\nLakkar Bazaar\r\nOvernight stay in Shimla\r\n\r\n* Day 2 (13 June) : Shimla to Manali\r\nProceed to Manali by road. En route enjoy scenic views of mountains and valleys. Check-in at the hotel in Manali Leisure evening. . Overnight stay in Manali\r\n\r\n* Day 3 ( 14 june )  : Manali Local Sightseeing\r\nHadimba Devi Temple\r\nVashisht Temple & Hot Springs\r\nClub House\r\nTibetan Monastery\r\nMall Road\r\nOvernight stay in Manali\r\n\r\n* Day 4 (15th June) :  Solang Valley / Atal Tunnel  / Sissu / Gramphu \r\n\r\n* Day 5 (16th June)  : Day trip to  Kullu Sightseeing\r\nBreakfast at the hotel\r\nVisit to :\r\nKullu Valley\r\nRiver Rafting Point\r\nShawl Factory\r\nVaishno Devi Temple\r\nReturn to Manali\r\nOvernight stay in Manali\r\n\r\nDay 6: 17th June : Departure\r\nBreakfast at the hotel\r\nCheck-out from hotel\r\nDeparture with beautiful memories of Himachal Pradesh tour.\r\n\r\n','','* 1 Nightâ€™s accommodation in Shimla hotel with Breakfast and Dinner. \r\n* 4 Nightâ€™s accommodation in Manali hotel with Breakfast and Dinner.\r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis. \r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle : Sedan\r\n','*Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Vehicle will be point to point basis.\r\n','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2026-06-12','2026-06-17',0,0,0,'2026-05-28 16:30:50','2026-05-28 16:38:41'),(1273,2009,419,2,0,0,250000,57000,'India Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (15 Jun): Arrival at Delhi Airport. Transfer on your own to the booked hotel.\r\nDay 02 (16 Jun) : Delhi\r\nDay 03 : (17 Jun) Delhi Hotel to Delhi Airport on your own for the flight to Dharamshala.\r\nArrival at the Dharamshala Airport and transfer to the booked Hotel and Sightseeing \r\nDay 04 (18 Jun) : Dharamshala Sightseeing \r\nDay 05 (19 Jun) : Check-out from Dharamshala Airport and transfer to McLeod Ganj and sightseeing \r\nDay 06 (20 Jun) : Transfer from McLeod Ganj Hotel to Dharamshala Airport for your flight to Leh. Arrival at the Leh Airport and transfer to the booked Hotel. \r\nDay 08 (21 Jun) : Leh Sightseeing \r\nDay 09 (22 Jun) : Leh to Nubra valley and sightseeing \r\nDay 10 (23 Jun) : Nubra Sightseeing \r\nDay 11 (24 Jun) : Nubra to Pangong \r\nDay 12 (25 Jun) : Pangong \r\nDay 13 (26 Jun) : Pangong To Leh \r\nDay 14 (27 Jun) : LEH - KARGIL - SRINAGAR\r\nDay 15 (28 Jun) : Srinagar Local Sightseeing \r\nDay 16 (29 Jun) : Doodhpathri Day Trip from Srinagar \r\nDay 17 (30 Jun) : Srinagar - Gulmarg and Sightseeing \r\nDay 18 (1st Jul) : Gulmarg to Pahalgam and Sightseeing\r\nDay 19 (2nd Jul) : Pahalgam Sightseeing \r\nDay 20 (3rd Jul) : Pahalgam to Srinagar Airport\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Delhi with Breakfast\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Dharamshala with Breakfast\r\n* 1N Accomodation in McLeod Ganj with Breakfast\r\n* 3N Accomodation in Leh with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Nubra Valley with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Pangong with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 3N Accommodation In Srinagar with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 1N Accommodation In Gulmarg with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Pahalgam with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 01 Non AC Innova as per programme (Leh to Srinagar)\r\n* Shikara Ride on Dal Lake for 01 hour\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n \r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Horse Riding upto Baisaran Valley (Mini Switzerland) in Pahalgam to be done at own cost. Approximate charges - Rs. 700-1200 Per Pax. (Bargain is a must)\r\n* SNOW JEEP FROM TANGMARG - GULMARG - TANGMARG @ RS.3000 to 3500 /- PER CAR FOR RETURN JOURNEY\r\n* Only local union vehicle is allowed to do sightseeing of inner bowl in Gulmarg. It can be done on Ponies , ATV vehicles or Local Taxi\'s. Guest needs to book local union vehicle for transfers inside Gulmarg.\r\nâ€¢ Bargaining in everything is must as at most places rates are not fixed by the government and if any rates are fixed, they are widely published.\r\nâ€¢ Any other activities not mentioned in inclusions like horse riding/tips/ extra food ordered / entry fees / liquor etc.\r\nâ€¢ Local Union Car in Pahalgam for covering Aru Valley Betab Valley & Chandanwari (03 Places in 03 hours) costs from INR.2200 (Van) / INR.2600 (Etios) / INR. 2700 (Tavera/Sumo/ EECO) / INR.3000 (Innova ) / INR.4000 (Innova Crysta).\r\n* Gondola cable Ride Phase 01 ticket cost INR. 810/- Per Person and Phase 02 INR.1050/- Per Person can be booked directly by guest from https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com Booking will be opened on timely basis, please check and follow the website.\r\n\r\n ','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2026-06-15','2026-07-03',0,0,0,'2026-05-28 16:36:49','2026-05-28 18:26:03'),(1275,2015,15520,3,1,0,24000,5000,'Nainital Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n* 31st May : Volvo bus from Delhi to Nainital \r\n\r\n* 1st June : Pick up from Bus stop Nainital and transfer to the booked hotel. After Breakfast , Drive to Nainital. On arrival Check in to the hotel. Proceed for the sightseeing tour, beginning with boating at the famous Naini Lake and a visit to the holy Naina Devi Temple. After that, visit famous picnic spots like Naina Peak, Snow View, Lands End etc enjoy day at leisure and overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\n* 2nd June : Nainital - Local Sightseeing & Bhimtal Sightseeing\r\nAfter breakfast, proceed for local sightseeing in Nainital, starting with a visit to Naini Lake for a relaxing boat ride, followed by Naina Devi Temple for à¤¦à¤°à¥à¤¶à¤¨. Continue to Snow View Point (via ropeway) to enjoy panoramic Himalayan views, and later visit Tiffin Top for scenic surroundings. Spend some leisure time exploring Mall Road. In the afternoon, drive to Bhimtal for sightseeing, where you will visit the serene Bhimtal Lake, famous for its island aquarium, and enjoy the peaceful ambiance. You may also explore nearby attractions like Victoria Dam. After sightseeing, return back to Nainital for an overnight stay.\r\n\r\n*  3rd June : Drop To - Nainital\r\nAfter breakfast , Check -out from hotel , Drop to Nainital Bus stand, Tour end with sweet memories.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 2N Accommodation with breakfast\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle : Sedan\r\n* Vehicle will be provided 8:00 am to 8:00pm.\r\n* Bharat Benz A/C bus Delhi to Nainital ( A/C Seater/ Sleeper (2+1) ) Timings : 23:55-08:00 31st May Laxmi Holidays\r\n* Bharat Benz A/C bus Nainital to Delhi ( A/C Seater/ Sleeper (2+1) ) Timings : 17:00-01:20 3rd June Laxmi Holidays\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Vehicle on point to point basis\r\n* A/C room will not be provided in hill area.\r\n* A/C will not work on hills.\r\n* Entry fee for any monument will pay by client directly.\r\n* Vehicle is as per itinerary and not on disposal. Additional sightseeing or transfer which are not mentioned in itinerary is payable to the driver directly.\r\n* Parking charges in Nainital are â‚¹500 per parking and Toll charges are â‚¹300 per Toll . The first parking and Toll will be complimentary, from the second parking onwards â‚¹500 per parking and â‚¹300 per Toll will be applicable and payable directly by the client.','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.\r\n\r\n','2026-06-01','2026-06-03',0,0,0,'2026-05-28 16:51:17','2026-05-28 18:47:14'),(1276,2013,6,3,0,0,23000,2500,'Mumbai Diaries','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\n* Day 1 (6th June) : Pick up from Mumbai Airport and drop to hotel and  local sightseeing. \r\n\r\n* Day 2 (7th June) :  Mumbai Local Sightseeing\r\n\r\n* Day 3 (8th June) : Transfer Mumbai to Shirdi Hotel and sightseeing\r\n\r\n*  Day 4 (9th June ) : Transfer Shirdi Hotel to Shirdi Airport. ','','* Economy Class Airfare . \r\n* 2 Nightâ€™s accommodation in Mumbai hotel with Breakfast. \r\n* 1 Night  accommodation in Shirdi hotel with Breakfast. \r\n* Vehicle : Sedan\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Parking Charges','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2026-07-06','2026-07-09',0,0,0,'2026-05-28 17:30:25','2026-05-28 17:35:29'),(1277,2018,419,4,0,0,172500,30000,'Srinagar Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :-\r\n\r\n* Day 1 (2nd June) â€“ Arrival & Srinagar Local Sightseeing Upon arrival at Srinagar Airport, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. After check-in and relaxation, proceed for local sightseeing covering the beautiful Mughal Gardens including Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden and Chashme Shahi. Visit the famous Shankaracharya Temple for panoramic views of Srinagar city and Dal Lake. In the evening enjoy a relaxing Shikara ride on Dal Lake before returning to the hotel for dinner and overnight stay in Srinagar. \r\n\r\n* Day 2 ( 3rd June) â€“ Srinagar â€“ Doodhpathri â€“ Srinagar After breakfast, drive to Doodhpathri, a breathtaking meadow known for its lush green landscapes, pine forests and crystal-clear streams. Spend quality time exploring the scenic surroundings and enjoying the natural beauty of this hidden gem of Kashmir. Later return to Srinagar and enjoy the evening at leisure. Dinner and overnight stay in Srinagar. \r\n\r\n* Day 3 ( 4th June) â€“ Srinagar to Sonmarg After breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive to Sonmarg, the â€˜Meadow of Goldâ€™. Surrounded by majestic mountains and glaciers, Sonmarg offers spectacular views and a refreshing atmosphere. Guests may enjoy optional pony rides to nearby attractions. Check in to the hotel, relax and enjoy the serene surroundings. Dinner and overnight stay in Sonmarg. \r\n\r\n* Day 4 (5th June) â€“ Sonmarg to Gulmarg After breakfast, proceed towards Gulmarg, one of Kashmirâ€™s most famous hill stations. Known for its scenic meadows and mountain vistas, Gulmarg is a paradise for nature lovers. Explore the local surroundings and enjoy the beauty of this world-renowned destination. Check in to the hotel, enjoy dinner and overnight stay in Gulmarg. \r\n\r\n* Day 5 (6th June) â€“ Gulmarg to Pahalgam After breakfast, drive to Pahalgam, the Valley of Shepherds. En route witness beautiful countryside views, saffron fields and charming villages. Upon arrival, check in to the resort and spend the rest of the day exploring the picturesque surroundings. Dinner and overnight stay in Pahalgam. \r\n\r\n* Day 6 (7th June)â€“ Pahalgam Sightseeing After breakfast, enjoy a full day in Pahalgam. Explore the natural beauty of the region and spend time amidst rivers, valleys and lush greenery. Guests can enjoy local sightseeing and leisure activities at their own pace. Return to the hotel in the evening for dinner and overnight stay in Pahalgam. \r\n\r\n* Day 7 (8th June)â€“ Pahalgam to Srinagar Airport Drop After breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive back to Srinagar Airport for your onward journey with unforgettable memories of Kashmir. ','','* Economy Clas