rinagar Airport, you will be received by our representative and transferred to your deluxe houseboat on Dal Lake. After check-in, relax and enjoy the peaceful atmosphere of the lake. Spend the evening admiring the scenic surroundings and traditional Kashmiri lifestyle. Overnight stay in the deluxe houseboat. \r\n\r\n* Day 2 (6th June) - Srinagar Local Sightseeing After breakfast, proceed for local sightseeing in Srinagar. Visit the famous Mughal Gardens including Nishat Bagh, Shalimar Bagh and Chashme Shahi. Explore Pari Mahal and enjoy beautiful views of Dal Lake and the Zabarwan Mountains. Return to the houseboat in the evening and enjoy a relaxing overnight stay. \r\n\r\n* Day 3 (7th June) -Srinagar to Sonmarg to Srinagar After breakfast, leave for a full-day excursion to Sonmarg, known as the Meadow of Gold. Enjoy breathtaking mountain views, lush valleys and the flowing Sindh River. You can enjoy optional pony rides to Thajiwas Glacier. Later return to Srinagar and spend the night in the deluxe houseboat. \r\n\r\n* Day 4 (8th June)-  Srinagar to Gulmarg to Srinagar After breakfast, proceed towards Gulmarg, one of Kashmirâ€™s most famous tourist destinations. Explore the beautiful meadows, pine forests and scenic landscapes. You may enjoy optional Gondola rides and other activities. Return to Srinagar in the evening and enjoy an overnight stay in the houseboat. \r\n\r\n* Day 5 (9th June) -  Srinagar to Pahalgam to Srinagar After breakfast, proceed for a day excursion to Pahalgam, the Valley of Shepherds. Enjoy the scenic beauty of saffron fields, apple orchards and the Lidder River. Explore the peaceful surroundings before returning to Srinagar for an overnight stay in the deluxe houseboat. \r\n\r\n* Day 6 ( 10th June)-  Srinagar to Doodhpathri to Srinagar After breakfast, visit Doodhpathri, a picturesque meadow surrounded by rolling hills and lush greenery. Enjoy the serenity of the destination and spend quality time amidst nature. Later return to Srinagar and 