idst nature, return to Srinagar in the evening for dinner and overnight stay. \r\n\r\n\r\n* Day 3 (7th June) : Srinagar to Gulmarg \r\nAfter breakfast, drive to Gulmarg, one of Kashmirâ€™s most beautiful hill resorts. Surrounded by lush meadows and majestic mountains, Gulmarg offers spectacular natural beauty throughout the year. Spend the day exploring the destination and enjoying optional activities including the Gondola cable car ride. Check in at the hotel and enjoy dinner and overnight stay in Gulmarg. \r\n\r\n* Day 4 (8th June)  â€“ Gulmarg to Pahalgam \r\nAfter breakfast, depart for Pahalgam, the Valley of Shepherds. En route enjoy the picturesque landscapes of Kashmir. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and spend the remaining day exploring the beautiful surroundings of Pahalgam. Enjoy the fresh mountain air and scenic beauty before returning to the hotel for dinner and overnight stay. \r\n\r\n* Day 5 (9th June) â€“ Pahalgam Sightseeing \r\nAfter breakfast, enjoy a full day in Pahalgam. Explore the charming valleys and scenic attractions around the region. Optional visits to Aru Valley, Betaab Valley and Chandanwari can be arranged through local transport. Spend the day amidst breathtaking natural beauty and return to the hotel for dinner and overnight stay. \r\n\r\n* Day 6 (10th June)  â€“ Pahalgam to Srinagar Houseboat \r\nStay After breakfast, drive back to Srinagar and check in to a deluxe houseboat on Dal Lake. In the evening, enjoy the complimentary Shikara ride while admiring the serene beauty of the lake, floating gardens and surrounding mountains. Experience the unique charm of traditional Kashmiri hospitality with dinner and overnight stay on the houseboat. \r\n\r\n* Day 7 (11th June)  â€“ Airport Drop After breakfast\r\n check out from the houseboat and proceed to Srinagar Airport for your onward journey with beautiful memories of Kashmir. \r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 3N  accommodation in Srinagar hotel with Breakfast and Dinner.\r\n* 1N accommodation in Gulmarg hotel with Breakfast and Dinner.\r\n* 1N accommodation in Pahalgam hotel with Breakfast and Dinner.\r\n* 1N accommodation in Dal Lake hotel with Breakfast and Dinner.\r\n* Complimentary Shikara ride on Dal Lake','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Gondola tickets in Gulmarg \r\n* Pony rides and local union vehicles \r\n* Entry tickets to gardens and monuments ','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2026-06-05','2026-06-11',0,0,0,'2026-05-29 15:34:47','2026-05-29 15:37:57'),(1283,2024,419,2,0,0,192000,42300,'Srinagar Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 (20 Jun) : Arrival at the Leh Airport and transfer to the booked hotel\r\nDay 08 (21 Jun) : Leh Sightseeing \r\nDay 09 (22 Jun) : Leh to Nubra valley and sightseeing \r\nDay 10 (23 Jun) : Nubra Sightseeing \r\nDay 11 (24 Jun) : Nubra to Pangong \r\nDay 12 (25 Jun) : Pangong \r\nDay 13 (26 Jun) : Pangong To Leh \r\nDay 14 (27 Jun) : LEH - KARGIL - SRINAGAR\r\nDay 15 (28 Jun) : Srinagar Local Sightseeing \r\nDay 16 (29 Jun) : Doodhpathri Day Trip from Srinagar \r\nDay 17 (30 Jun) : Srinagar - Gulmarg and Sightseeing \r\nDay 18 (1st Jul) : Gulmarg to Pahalgam and Sightseeing\r\nDay 19 (2nd Jul) : Pahalgam Sightseeing \r\nDay 20 (3rd Jul) : Pahalgam to Srinagar Airport\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 3N Accomodation in Leh with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Nubra Valley with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Pangong with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 3N Accommodation In Srinagar with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 1N Accommodation In Gulmarg with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Pahalgam with Breakfast and Dinner\r\n* 01 Non AC Innova as per programme (Leh to Srinagar)\r\n* Shikara Ride on Dal Lake for 01 hour\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n \r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Horse Riding upto Baisaran Valley (Mini Switzerland) in Pahalgam to be done at own cost. Approximate charges - Rs. 700-1200 Per Pax. (Bargain is a must)\r\n* SNOW JEEP FROM TANGMARG - GULMARG - TANGMARG @ RS.3000 to 3500 /- PER CAR FOR RETURN JOURNEY\r\n* Only local union vehicle is allowed to do sightseeing of inner bowl in Gulmarg. It can be done on Ponies , ATV vehicles or Local Taxi\'s. Guest needs to book local union vehicle for transfers inside Gulmarg.\r\nâ€¢ Bargaining in everything is must as at most places rates are not fixed by the government and if any rates are fixed, they are widely published.\r\nâ€¢ Any other activities not mentioned in inclusions like horse riding/tips/ extra food ordered / entry fees / liquor etc.\r\nâ€¢ Local Union Car in Pahalgam for covering Aru Valley Betab Valley & Chandanwari (03 Places in 03 hours) costs from INR.2200 (Van) / INR.2600 (Etios) / INR. 2700 (Tavera/Sumo/ EECO) / INR.3000 (Innova ) / INR.4000 (Innova Crysta).\r\n* Gondola cable Ride Phase 01 ticket cost INR. 810/- Per Person and Phase 02 INR.1050/- Per Person can be booked directly by guest from https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com Booking will be opened on timely basis, please check and follow the website.\r\n\r\n ','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2026-06-20','2026-07-03',0,0,0,'2026-05-29 16:17:27','2026-05-29 16:17:27'),(1284,2025,15520,3,1,0,24000,5000,'Nainital Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n* 31st May : Volvo bus from Delhi to Nainital \r\n\r\n* 1st June : Pick up from Bus stop Nainital and transfer to the booked hotel. After Breakfast , Drive to Nainital. On arrival Check in to the hotel. Proceed for the sightseeing tour, beginning with boating at the famous Naini Lake and a visit to the holy Naina Devi Temple. After that, visit famous picnic spots like Naina Peak, Snow View, Lands End etc enjoy day at leisure and overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\n* 2nd June : Nainital - Local Sightseeing & Bhimtal Sightseeing\r\nAfter breakfast, proceed for local sightseeing in Nainital, starting with a visit to Naini Lake for a relaxing boat ride, followed by Naina Devi Temple for à¤¦à¤°à¥à¤¶à¤¨. Continue to Snow View Point (via ropeway) to enjoy panoramic Himalayan views, and later visit Tiffin Top for scenic surroundings. Spend some leisure time exploring Mall Road. In the afternoon, drive to Bhimtal for sightseeing, where you will visit the serene Bhimtal Lake, famous for its island aquarium, and enjoy the peaceful ambiance. You may also explore nearby attractions like Victoria Dam. After sightseeing, return back to Nainital for an overnight stay.\r\n\r\n*  3rd June : Drop To - Nainital\r\nAfter breakfast , Check -out from hotel , Drop to Nainital Bus stand, Tour end with sweet memories.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 2N Accommodation with breakfast\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle : Sedan\r\n* Vehicle will be provided 8:00 am to 8:00pm.\r\n* Bharat Benz A/C bus Delhi to Nainital ( A/C Seater/ Sleeper (2+1) ) Timings : 23:55-08:00 31st May Laxmi Holidays\r\n* Bharat Benz A/C bus Nainital to Delhi ( A/C Seater/ Sleeper (2+1) ) Timings : 17:00-01:20 3rd June Laxmi Holidays\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Vehicle on point to point basis\r\n* A/C room will not be provided in hill area.\r\n* A/C will not work on hills.\r\n* Entry fee for any monument will pay by client directly.\r\n* Vehicle is as per itinerary and not on disposal. Additional sightseeing or transfer which are not mentioned in itinerary is payable to the driver directly.\r\n* Parking charges in Nainital are â‚¹500 per parking and Toll charges are â‚¹300 per Toll . The first parking and Toll will be complimentary, from the second parking onwards â‚¹500 per parking and â‚¹300 per Toll will be applicable and payable directly by the client.','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking.\r\n\r\n','2026-06-01','2026-06-03',0,0,0,'2026-05-30 16:06:42','2026-05-30 16:06:42'),(1286,2027,54,2,0,0,95000,22000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 01 : Arrival at the SIN Airport\r\nDay 02 : City Orientation Drive, MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours, Gardens By The Bay\r\nDay 03 : Full Day Sentosa Island Tour\r\nDay 04 : Universal Studios Tour\r\nDay 05 : Evening Mandai\r\nDay 06 : Departure\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 5N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers on PVT\r\n* City Orientation Drive - Drop off Little India (3Hrs) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-Child)\r\n* MBS Skypark Non Peak Hours + Gardens By The Bay ( MBS Non Peak (Before 4 PM) + Gardens by the Bay: Flower Dome & Cloud Forest featuring Jurassic World: The Experience ) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-Child)\r\n* Full Day Sentosa Island Tour ( Cable Car + Madame Tussauds 4in1 + Wings Of Time 1st Show ) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-Child)\r\n* Universal Studios Tour ( Universal Studio Ticket ) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-Child)\r\n* Evening Mandai ( Night Safari ) (PVT Basis)(02-Adults, 01-Child)\r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa \r\n\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Hotels may charge a security deposit at the time of check-in, which will be refundable if unutilized\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)/ city tax directly payable at the property\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nMid-night Surcharge applicable from 11pm - 07am on Private Transfers.','2026-06-10','2026-06-15',0,0,0,'2026-06-01 13:14:48','2026-06-02 12:06:36'),(1287,2039,6,2,0,0,0,0,'Manali Diaries','Suggested Itinerary : \r\n\r\n* Day 01: Delhi - Manali. In the evening board the Manali bound A/c Volvo Coach. (580 Kms. / 12-13 Hrs.). Overnight on board.\r\n\r\n* Day 02: Manali On arrival in Manali check into the hotel. Rest Day at leisure on your own, Dinner & Overnight in the Reso