15526,3,0,0,0,0,'Kashmir Diaries ','Suggested Itinerary :- \r\n\r\n* 1st Day ( 25th  Jan) : ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING\r\n\r\n* 2nd Day ( 26th  Jan) : GULMARG DAY TRIP FROM SRINAGAR\r\n\r\n* 3rd Day (27th Jan)  : SRINAGAR - PAHALGAM\r\n\r\n* 4th Day ( 28th Jan) : PAHALGAM\r\n\r\n* 5th Day ( 29th Jan ) : PAHALGAM â€“ CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n\r\n* 6th Day ( 30th Jan ) : CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 2 Nightâ€™s accommodation in Srinagar with Breakfast.\r\n* 2 Nightâ€™s accommodation in Pahalgam Hotel with Breakfast. \r\n* I Night\'s accommodation in Srinagar House Boat with Breakfast. \r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Shikara Ride on Dal Lake for 01 hour\r\n* Mughal gardens sightseeing \r\n* Vehicle :  Non Ac Sedan\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n\r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nHorse Riding upto Baisaran Valley (Mini Switzerland) in Pahalgam to be done at own cost. Approximate charges - Rs. 700-1200 Per Pax. (Bargain is a must)\r\nSNOW JEEP FROM TANGMARG - GULMARG - TANGMARG @ RS.3000 to 3500 /- PER CAR FOR RETURN JOURNEY\r\nOnly local union vehicle is allowed to do sightseeing of inner bowl in Gulmarg. It can be done on Ponies , ATV vehicles or Local Taxi\'s. Guest needs to book local union vehicle for transfers inside Gulmarg.\r\nLocal Union Car in Pahalgam for covering Aru Valley Betab Valley & Chandanwari (03 Places in 03 hours) costs from INR.2200 (Van) / INR.2600 (Etios) / INR. 2700 (Tavera/Sumo/ EECO) / INR.3000 (Innova ) / INR.4000 (Innova Crysta).\r\nGondola cable Ride Phase 01 ticket cost INR. 810/- Per Person and Phase 02 INR.1050/- Per Person can be booked directly by guest from https://www.jammukashmircablecar.com Booking will be opened on timely basis, please check and follow the website.\r\n\r\nPlease note: In case of any natural calamity resulting in rerouting transportation charges or any accommodation not mentioned in inclusion will be additional and change in itinerary will be subject to availability.\r\n\r\n ','2027-01-25','2027-01-30',1,0,0,'2026-07-07 16:28:07','2026-07-07 18:42:30'),(1317,2087,18382,2,0,0,0,0,'Somnath Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\n1st Day (Thu, 3 Dec) : Rajkot to Dwarka - Arrival & Transfer via Jamnagar Sightseeing \r\n2nd Day (Fri, 4 Dec) : Dwarka - Sightseeing \r\n3rd Day (Sat, 5 Dec) : Dwarka to Somnath - Transfer via Porbandar & Sightseeing \r\n4th Day (Sun, 6 Dec) : Somnath to Diu - Day Trip \r\n5th Day (Mon, 7 Dec)	: Somnath to Rajkot - Transfer & Departure \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation with breakfast\r\n* Complimentary two bottles of mineral water per room per day (replenished at the hotel)\r\n* Vehicle : Sedan\r\n+ All transfers and sightseeing as per the planned itinerary\r\n+ Services of a professional and experienced driver (available from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM)\r\n+ Dedicated driver with mobile phone for smooth coordination\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Entry fees to monuments, parks, museums, and sightseeing places\r\n* Any additional sightseeing or usage of vehicle not mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Statue of Unity Ticket Charges are extra - Subject to available (Book in advance - https://www.soutickets.in/#/dashboard)**\r\n* Expenses arising due to natural calamities, strikes, roadblocks, political disturbances, or any unforeseen circumstances\r\n* Any increase in taxes, fuel prices, or government levies leading to cost escalation\r\n* Anything not specifically mentioned under the â€œInclusionsâ€ section\r\n\r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking','2026-12-03','2026-12-07',1,0,0,'2026-07-07 16:36:57','2026-07-07 18:0