ood model vehicles) â€“ PRIVATE \r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa \r\n\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nIn shared transfer services, if the vehicle does not reach your hotel location or if the hotel is in an outer area, a nearby meeting point will be shared with you. You will need to reach the meeting point by yourself at your own expense.','2026-09-16','2026-09-22',0,0,0,'2026-07-20 13:31:58','2026-07-20 15:07:36'),(1329,2102,50003,4,1,0,573400,112700,'Japan Diaries ','Suggested  Itinerary :- \r\n\r\n* Day 1 :- - TRANSFER FROM AIRPORT TO HOTEL. REST AND EVENING TOKYO SKYTREE TICKET AND TOKYO ORIENTATION TOUR \r\n \r\n* Day 2 :- TEAMLAB PLANETS TICKET AND EVENING SUMO SHOW TOKYO TICKET  \r\n\r\n* Day 3 :- DAY TRIP TO MT FUJI HAKONE WITH ROPEWAY TICKET AND LAKE ASHI CRUISE TICKET\r\n  \r\n* Day 4 :-  TOKYO HOTEL TO TRAIN STATION TRANSFER  \r\nâ€¢ Day 4 :- TOKYO TO KYOTO 2ND CLASS BULLET TRAIN TICKET \r\nâ€¢ Day 4 :- KYOTO TRAIN STATION TO HOTEL TRANSFER  \r\n\r\n*  Day 5 :- KYOTO TO OSAKA TRANSFER ENROUTE NARA, ARASHIYAMA TOUR  \r\n\r\n* Day 6 :- OSAKA CITY TOUR WITH OSAKA CASTLE & UMEDA SKY BUILDING TICKETS  \r\n\r\n* Day 7:- OSAKA HOTEL TO AIRPORT TRANSFER ON PVT BASIS (ONE WAY)  \r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 3N Accommodation  in Tokyo hotel with daily breakfast. \r\n* 1N Accommodation  in Kyoto hotel with breakfast. \r\n* 2N Accommodation in Osaka hotel with breakfast. \r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Tokyo to  Kyoto 2nd  Class Bullet Train Ticket \r\n* Insurance\r\n* Visa \r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* WATER BOTTLES ARE NOT INCLUDED IN THE ABOVE GIVEN COST AND ARE AVAILABLE ON REQUEST BASIS ONLY WITH ADDITIONAL COST.  \r\n*TCS \r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nFUNCTIONING OF AIRCOOLING / AIR CONDITIONING IN HOTELS IS SUBJECT TO OFFICIAL DECLARATION OF SUMMER BY THE LOCAL AUTHORITY. \r\nTOUR ACTIVITIES ARE SUBJECT TO WEATHER CONDITIONS. IN THE EVENT OF ADVERSE  WEATHER, ACTIVITIES MAY BE RESCHEDULED OR CANCELED TO ENSURE THE SAFETY AND COMFORT OF OUR GUESTS. WE EXPECT YOUR UNDERSTANDING AND COOPERATION IN SUCH SITUATIONS. \r\nFOR TRANSFER (AIRPORT / TRAIN STATION / FERY PORT / BUS STOP), CONSIDER 01  BIG BAG (23 KAG) & 01 SMALL BAG (07 KG) PER PAX  .\r\n','2026-09-15','2026-09-21',0,0,0,'2026-07-21 13:05:33','2026-07-21 14:57:26'),(1330,2101,54,2,1,0,87000,9000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :-\r\n\r\n\r\n* Day 1 : Arrival at Singapore and transfer to the booked Hotel \r\nAfternoon Sentosa Island Tour (Madame Tussauds Standard (4in1) Admission Ticket+Cable Car+Wings Of Time 1st Show) (SIC Basis)\r\n\r\n* Day 2 : Universal Studios Tour (Universal Studio Ticket) (SIC Basis)\r\n\r\n* Day 3 : Transfer from the SIN hotel to SIN Airport (PVT)\r\n                Transfer from  KUL Airport to the KUL booked Hotel ( PVT) \r\n\r\n* Day 4 : Kuala Lampur city tour  \r\nKL By Night tour with KL Tower (4 Hrs) (KL Tower Observation Deck) (PVT Basis)\r\n\r\n* Day 5 : Genting full day  tour \r\nGenting Day Tour (8 Hours) (Enroute Batu Caves (30 mins photostop)) (SIC Basis)\r\n\r\n* Day 6 : Transfer from KUL hotel to  KUL Airport. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 2N Accommodation in Singapore hotel with Breakfast.\r\n* 3N Accommodation in Malaysia hotel with Breakfast \r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n\r\n','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n*Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Insurance\r\n*Visa \r\n*TCS\r\n','Room/s are 