ditions Is Non-Refundable.\r\nAs Time Permits All Sightseeing Can Be Covered Nor The Company Is Not Responsible.\r\nEntry fees, boat rides are chargeable and to be paid directly by the guest. Few monuments and sightseeing points are closed on every Monday and on national holidays. Itinerary can be revised without any prior notice. Sightseeing points may be excluded due to closer of the place or due to weather/travelling conditions.  \r\n\r\n','2026-08-07','2026-08-13',0,0,0,'2026-07-23 18:14:45','2026-07-23 18:18:04'),(1333,2105,23983,3,0,0,19000,5000,'Kainchi Dham Diaries ','Suggested Itinerary :- \r\n\r\n* Day 1 : Dehradun to Kainchi Dham - Transfer\r\nAfter breakfast / as per schedule, pick up from Dehradun (hotel / airport / railway station) and proceed on a scenic road transfer to Kainchi Dham.\r\nOn arrival at Kainchi Dham, drop at the temple / designated location for darshan and sightseeing. End of services.\r\n\r\n\r\n* Day 2 : Drop to - Dehradun\r\nAfter breakfast , Check -out from hotel , Drive to Dehradun , Tour end with sweet memories.','','* 1N Accommodation with  breakfast\r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle :  1-AC Sedan','* Economy Airfare \r\n* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* A/C room will not be provided in hill area.\r\n* A/C will not work on hills.\r\n* Entry fee for any monument will pay by client directly.\r\n* Local Sightseeing Charges Extra In Hill Areas','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nVehicle will be provided 8:00 am to 8:00pm.\r\nDue to heavy rush at Kainchi Dham (Neem Karoli Baba Ashram), local administration is currently restricting all vehicle entry beyond Bhowali (approx. 10 km before the Dham).\r\nVisitors will need to use shuttle services from Bhowali to Kainchi Dham.\r\nPlease note: Shuttle charges are not included and will be borne by the guests.','2026-08-08','2026-08-09',0,0,0,'2026-07-24 16:42:59','2026-07-24 16:47:58'),(1334,2106,329,4,0,0,66400,15000,'Malaysia Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :- \r\n\r\n* Day 1   : Arrival â€“ Putra Jaya-Hotel\r\n\r\n* Day 2   : City Tour-KL Tower- Hotel\r\n\r\n* Day 3   : Batu Caves- Cable Car-Genting- Hotel\r\n\r\n* Day 4   : Sunway Lagoon  - Hotel\r\n\r\n* Day 5   : Airport Departure','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation with daily breakfast\r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary on PVT.\r\n* KL Tower Observation  Deck Ticket Included\r\n* Sunway Lagoon 06 Theme Park Ticket Included\r\n* 01 Service of  English Speaking Driver cum Guide for all Transfers & Tours.\r\n* 02 Way Cable Car\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions\r\n* Any taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Guide tips\r\n* Visa \r\n* TCS\r\n','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n','2026-08-19','2026-08-23',0,0,0,'2026-07-28 10:45:12','2026-07-28 11:10:01'),(1335,2107,351,2,0,0,514400,50000,'New Zealand Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :\r\n\r\nDay 1 : MORNING TO NOON\r\nArrive in Auckland and Transfer to Hotel\r\nEVENING\r\nFree to Explore the City on your own\r\n\r\nDay 2 : FULL DAY\r\nBreakfast at the hotel Drive to Rotorua. En-route Excursion to Hobbiton Movie Set\r\n\r\nDay 3 : MORNING\r\nBreakfast at hotel\r\nEVENING\r\nTe Puia Experience\r\nNOON TO EVENING\r\nVisit Wai-O-Tapu Geothermal Wonderland.\r\n\r\nDay 4 : MORNING\r\nFlight from Rotorua to Christchurch \r\nNOON TO EVENING\r\nEnjoy Christchurch Tram Tour & Punting on the Avon River\r\n\r\nDay 5 : FULL DAY\r\nEnjoy TranzAlpine Scenic Train from Christchurch to Greymouth. Visit Punakaiki Pancake Rocks & Blowholes\r\n\r\nDay 6 : MORNING\r\nExcursion to Shantytown Heritage Park\r\nNOON TO EVENING\r\nTransfer from Greymouth to Franz Josef\r\n\r\nDay 7 : MORNING\r\nTransfer to Queenstown\r\nNOON TO EVENING\r\nEnjoy Skyline Gondola Ride & 3 Luge Rides\r\n\r\nDay 8 : FULL DAY\r\nEnjoy 1 Hr Jet Boat Ride on Shotover & Kawarau River and Explore Optional Activities\r\n\r\nDay 9 : FULL DAY\r\nExcursion to Milford Sound. Enjoy Milford Sound Cruise\r\n\r\nDay 10 : FULL DAY\r\nTransfer to Christchurch with En-route Visit to Mt Cook/Tekapo\r\n\r\nDay 11 : MORNING\r\nBreakfast and Transfer to Christchurch Airport\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Internal Flights\r\n* 10N Accommodation as mentioned with Daily Breakfast\r\n* All Sightseeings Entrance Fees as per itinerary\r\n* Auckland to Rotorua Tour\r\n* Hobbiton Movie Set Tour\r\n* Wai-O-Tapu Geothermal Wonderland\r\n* Te Po - Indigenous Evening Experience\r\n* Christchurch Tram, Punt & Gondola Ride Combo\r\n* Tranzalpine Train from Christchurch to Greymouth\r\n* Excursion to Punakaiki Pancake Rocks & Blowholes\r\n* Entrance to Skyline Gondola with 3 Luge Rides\r\n* 1 Hr Jet Boat Ride on Shotover & Kawarau River\r\n* Milford Sound Tour with Cruise & Lunch\r\n* Queenstown/Mt Cook/Christchurch Tour\r\n* All Transfers & Sightseeings by Coach (Seat In Coach) Basis\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance\r\n','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* All Rooms & Rates are subject to availability at time of confirmation\r\n* Peak / Festival Period Surcharge to be paid extra. Will be notified at time of  booking confirmation\r\n* Early Check-In & Late Check-Out\r\n* Cost of Transfer from Hotel to designated Pick-Up point for Tours\r\n* Any Taxes (if applicable)\r\n* Anything which is not specified in Inclusions\r\n* TCS \r\n','Airfare is Dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nThe client has to reach the meeting point for SIC Tours on their own\r\n','2026-09-17','2026-09-27',1,0,0,'2026-07-29 18:24:18','2026-07-31 15:11:18'),(1336,2108,419,2,0,0,37000,9000,'Srinagar Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :- \r\n\r\n* Day 1 : ARRIVE SRINAGAR - EVENING BOATRIDE \r\n\r\n* Day 2 : DAY TRIP TO SONAMARG Â \r\n\r\n* Day 3 : DAY TRIPÂ  Â TO GULMARGÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 4 : SRINAGAR TO PAHALGAMÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 5 : PAHALGAM TO SRINAGARÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 6 : DEPARTURE FROM SRINAGAR HOTEL TO SRINAGAR AIRPORT\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation in Srinagar with daily breakfast\r\n* 1N Accommodation in Pahalgam with breakfast. \r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle : 1 SEDAN / SUVÂ  ( PVT )Â ','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Mineral water / Soft or hard drinks / Starters.\r\n* Entrance Free\r\n* Room Heating Charges in Houseboats\r\n* Horse Riding\r\n* Sightseeing of Chandanwadi, Aru and Baisaran in Pahalgam.\r\n* Gondola ride in Gulmarg\r\n* Chained Jeep from Tangmarg to Gulmarg not included.\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n\r\nIn Pahalgam:  Sightseeing of Chandanwadi, Betaab Valley, Baisaran Valley and Aru Valley are not included. If one wishes to visit the same, they can hire a taxi directly at Pahalgam taxi on their own. \r\n\r\n In Gulmarg:   The vehicle is allowed to drop at main Gulmarg or at your hotel and from there onwards one has to walk or can go by ponies on direct payment for local sightseeing in Gulmarg.\r\n\r\n In Sonmarg: The vehicle is allowed to drop at main Sonmarg and from there onwards one has to walk up to Thajwas or one can go by ponies on direct payment. (Route is closed during Heavy Snowfall) ','2026-09-22','2026-09-27',0,0,0,'2026-07-30 15:57:00','2026-07-30 16:06:21'),(1337,2109,419,2,0,0,37000,9600,'Srinagar Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :- \r\n\r\n* Day 1 : ARRIVE SRINAGAR - EVENING BOATRIDE \r\n\r\n* Day 2 : DAY TRIP TO SONAMARG Â \r\n\r\n* Day 3 : DAY TRIPÂ  Â TO GULMARGÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 4 : SRINAGAR TO PAHALGAMÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 5 : PAHALGAM TO SRINAGARÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 6 : DEPARTURE FROM SRINAGAR HOTEL TO SRINAGAR AIRPORT\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* 4N Accommodation in Srinagar with daily breakfast\r\n* 1N Accommodation in Pahalgam with breakfast. \r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle : 1 SEDAN / SUVÂ  ( PVT )Â ','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Mineral water / Soft or hard drinks / Starters.\r\n* Entrance Free\r\n* Room Heating Charges in Houseboats\r\n* Horse Riding\r\n* Sightseeing of Chandanwadi, Aru and Baisaran in Pahalgam.\r\n* Gondola ride in Gulmarg\r\n* Chained Jeep from Tangmarg to Gulmarg not included.\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions','Airfare is dynamic\r\nRoom/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\n\r\nIn Pahalgam:  Sightseeing of Chandanwadi, Betaab Valley, Baisaran Valley and Aru Valley are not included. If one wishes to visit the same, they can hire a taxi directly at Pahalgam taxi on their own. \r\n\r\n In Gulmarg:   The vehicle is allowed to drop at main Gulmarg or at your hotel and from there onwards one has to walk or can go by ponies on direct payment for local sightseeing in Gulmarg.\r\n\r\n In Sonmarg: The vehicle is allowed to drop at main Sonmarg and from there onwards one has to walk up to Thajwas or one can go by ponies on direct payment. (Route is closed during Heavy Snowfall) ','2026-09-22','2026-09-27',0,0,0,'2026-07-30 16:10:34','2026-07-30 16:11:06'),(1338,2110,419,2,0,0,49800,14000,'Srinagar Diaries','Suggested Itinerary :- \r\n\r\n* Day 1 : ARRIVE SRINAGAR - PAHALGAM\r\n\r\n* Day 2 : DAY IN PAHALGAMÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 3 : PAHALGAM TO SRINAGARÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 4 : DAY TRIP TO SONAMARG Â \r\n\r\n* Day 5 : DAY TRIPÂ TO GULMARGÂ \r\n\r\n* Day 6 :  DEPARTURE FROM SRINAGAR HOTEL TO SRINAGAR AIRPORT\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 3N Accommodation in Srinagar with daily breakfast and dinner\r\n* 2N Accommodation in Pahalgam with breakfast and dinner\r\n* Return Airport transfers on PVT basis\r\n* Tours as mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Vehicle : 1 SEDAN / SUVÂ  ( PVT )Â \r\n* SHIKARA RIDE 1HR  ','* Any type of personal expense\r\n* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Mineral water / Soft or hard drinks / Starters.\r\n* Entrance Free\r\n* Room Heating Charges in Houseboats\r\n* Horse Riding\r\n* Sightseeing of Chandanwadi, Aru and Baisaran in Pahalgam.\r\n* Gondola ride in Gulmarg\r\n* Chained Jeep from Tangmarg to Gulmarg not included.\r\n* Anything not mentioned in inclusions','Room/s are subject to availability at the time of booking\r\nIn Pahalgam : Sightseeing of Chandanwadi, Betaab Valley, Baisaran Valley and Aru Valley are not included. If one wishes to visit the same, they can hire a taxi directly at Pahalgam taxi on their own. \r\nIn Gulmarg : The vehicle is allowed to drop at main Gulmarg or at your hotel and from there onwards one has to walk or can go by ponies on direct payment for local sightseeing in Gulmarg.\r\nIn Sonmarg : The vehicle is allowed to drop at main Sonmarg and from there onwards one has to walk up to Thajwas or one can go by ponies on direct payment. (Route is closed during Heavy Snowfall) ','2026-09-22','2026-09-27',0,0,0,'2026-07-31 10:47:06','2026-07-31 10:59:54');
